 create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\\nSacrifice a Goblin: Target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'When Springbloom Druid enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice a land. If you do, search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'When Tribute Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with mana value 2, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Urza, Lord High Artificer enters the battlefield, create a 0/0 colorless Construct artifact creature token with "This creature gets +1/+1 for each artifact you control."\\nTap an untapped artifact you control: Add {U}.\\n{5}: Shuffle your library, then exile the top card. Until end of turn, you may play that card without paying its mana cost.', 'Whenever Cordial Vampire or another creature dies, put a +1/+1 counter on each Vampire you control.', "Whenever Marit Lage's Slumber or another snow permanent enters the battlefield under your control, scry 1.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control ten or more snow permanents, sacrifice Marit Lage's Slumber. If you do, create Marit Lage, a legendary 20/20 black Avatar creature token with flying and indestructible.", 'Whenever Pashalik Mons or another Goblin you control dies, Pashalik Mons deals 1 damage to any target.\\n{3}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Whenever Undead Augur or another Zombie you control dies, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', 'Whenever Warteye Witch or another creature you control dies, scry 1.', "Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life. If Answered Prayers isn't a creature, it becomes a 3/3 Angel creature with flying in addition to its other types until end of turn.", "Whenever a creature is exiled from the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on Soulherder.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, you may exile another target creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", "Whenever a creature you control becomes blocked, you may return it to its owner's hand.", "Whenever another Bear enters the battlefield under your control, choose one —\\n• Put two +1/+1 counters on target Bear.\\n• Target Bear you control fights target creature you don't control.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature.', 'Whenever another snow permanent enters the battlefield under your control, you may have target player mill two cards.', "Whenever you cast a permanent spell with a mana cost that contains {X}, double the value of X.\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell or activate an ability, if that spell's mana cost or that ability's activation cost contains {X}, copy that spell or ability. You may choose new targets for the copy.", "Whenever you cycle Astral Drift or cycle another card while Astral Drift is on the battlefield, you may exile target creature. If you do, return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.\\nCycling {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", "You can't spend mana to cast this spell.\\nConvoke, delve (Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color. Each card you exile from your graveyard pays for {1}.)\\nYou may cast Hogaak, Arisen Necropolis from your graveyard.\\nTrample", 'You gain 3 life.\\nStorm (When you cast this spell, copy it for each spell cast before it this turn.)', "You gain shroud until end of turn. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", '[+1]: Return up to one target land card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n[−1]: Wrenn and Six deals 1 damage to any target.\\n[−7]: You get an emblem with "Instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard have retrace." (You may cast instant and sorcery cards from your graveyard by discarding a land card in addition to paying their other costs.)', '[+2]: Creatures you control with flying get +1/+1 until end of turn.\\n[−3]: Create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying and vigilance.\\n[−6]: You get an emblem with "If you control a creature, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead."', '{1}{W}, Exile Trustworthy Scout from your graveyard: Search your library for a card named Trustworthy Scout, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', '{3}{G}{G}, Exile Mother Bear from your graveyard: Create two 2/2 green Bear creature tokens. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{4}, {T}: Create a 2/2 colorless Shapeshifter creature token with changeling. (It has every creature type.)', "{4}{S}{S}: Monstrosity 2. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put two +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous. {S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)\\nAs long as Chillerpillar is monstrous, it has flying.", "{B}: Endling gains menace until end of turn.\\n{B}: Endling gains deathtouch until end of turn.\\n{B}: Endling gains undying until end of turn. (When this creature dies, if it had no +1/+1 counters on it, return it to the battlefield under its owner's control with a +1/+1 counter on it.)\\n{1}: Endling gets +1/-1 or -1/+1 until end of turn.", '{R}: You may put a planeswalker card from your hand onto the battlefield. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.', '{S}: Frostwalla gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn. ({S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)', '{T}, Pay 1 life, Sacrifice Prismatic Vista: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {B} or {G}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Nurturing Peatland: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {G} or {U}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Waterlogged Grove: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {R} or {W}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Sunbaked Canyon: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {U} or {R}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Fiery Islet: Draw a card.', '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add {W} or {B}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice Silent Clearing: Draw a card.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{3}: Fountain of Ichor becomes a 3/3 Dinosaur artifact creature until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Cave of Temptation: Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature. Activate only as a sorcery.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{S}: Until end of turn, Frostwalk Bastion becomes a 2/3 Construct artifact creature. It's still a land. ({S} can be paid with one mana from a snow source.)\\nWhenever Frostwalk Bastion deals combat damage to a creature, tap that creature and it doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{W}, {T}: Put target enchantment card from your graveyard on top of your library.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}. Talisman of Resilience deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}. Talisman of Curiosity deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}. Talisman of Conviction deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Talisman of Creativity deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Talisman of Hierarchy deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G}.', '{T}: Another target creature you control gains protection from colorless or from the color of your choice until end of turn.', '{T}: Tap target creature. Activate only if you had a creature enter the battlefield under your control this turn.', '{T}: Untap another target snow permanent.', '{X}: Crypt Rats deals X damage to each creature and each player. Spend only black mana on X.']
flavor: ['"Always give your foes a choice when they have none."\\n—Ob Nixilis', '"As the sky opened up, we ran for shelter. Halfway there I came to the sudden realization that, already soaked, there might be more to gain from experiencing the rain than running from it."', '"At last, silence."\\n—Tevesh Szat', '"Battle is all about where you stand. Never stand in my way."', '"Be ever loyal to your own best interests."', '"Beauty to the eye does not always translate to the touch."\\n—Naimah, Femeref philosopher', '"Begin with your escape and work backward."\\n—*Way of Secrets*', '"Brilliant! They evolved away from energy-taxing brains and respond only to spinal reflex arcs from the hive mind."\\n—Rukarumel, field journal', '"Don\'t worry. If you lose me I\'ll be right behind you."', '"Every choice is a joy."', '"Every seed holds strength and teaches patience."', '"Fire has always been my most faithful companion."\\n—Jared Carthalion', '"Fools view winter as the season of death because they cannot see the life underneath."', '"For glory! For justice! For our queen!"', '"Glorious, to walk again across the savannah with my beloved."\\n—"Love Song of Night and Day"', '"Good ideas don\'t take time. They take a lot of bad ideas first."\\n—Ral Zarek', '"Good night."', '"He steals power from treasure after treasure, and what does it do for the ouphe? Nothing."\\n—Jhoira', '"I don\'t have time for you right now."\\n—Teferi', '"I hate this! I hate fire! I hate you for taking me on this route!"\\n—Norin the Wary', '"I just felt a drip. It must be about to rain."\\n—Stoneway Market vendor, last words', '"I think someone is stealing from my laboratory. It had better not be you!"\\n—Geralf, letter to Gisa', '"If you think twice, I\'ll cut twice."', '"Is the inevitable any less miraculous?"\\n—Veldka, wandering sage', '"It is not that you will go mad. It is that you will beg for madness."\\n—Volrath', '"It was difficult to tell whether the piles of gore within their warrens were mere trash heaps, sacred altars, or warnings."\\n—*Sarpadian Empires, vol. IV*', '"Llanowar remembers the Ice Age, the Phyrexian Invasion, and the Rift Era. So long as we draw breath, we will ensure such disasters never threaten our world again."', '"Loss has no meaning here. You cannot take from those who have nothing."', '"Never leave the future to fate."', '"Never let them take their eyes off you."\\n—Sidar Jabari', '"New growth applies a healing poultice to wounds long scabbed over."', '"Ninjas can run across water, pull ladders from pockets, kill with a kiss, and slip between bricks. Pack of lies, I say."\\n—Benden, teahouse gossip', '"Plant every sword. Embrace every soul."\\n—Trostani', '"Please, come in! Hors d\'oeuvres are on the table."', '"Quell your ego and anywhere can be as calm as a hurricane\'s eye."', '"Shoo, you little worm tails—go away! My corpses aren\'t your dinner!"\\n—Ghoulcaller Gisa', '"Small outbursts are healthy."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"The continual rise of the downtrodden is as inevitable as vines usurping a forest."\\n—Vraska', '"The embers of our homes still smolder, and already the villages of Kjeldor burn in retaliation. What they have started, we will finish."\\n—Lovisa Coldeyes', '"The lasting effects are invariably fatal."\\n—Phyrexian progress notes', '"The pain of exploring is less than the pain of not knowing."\\n—Tamiyo', '"The patterns of crossing ripples reveal the future to those who know how to read them."', '"The steering horns ain\'t steering!"', '"The sun banishes darkness every morning. I too will rise with such assuredness."\\n—Huatli', '"Their two-tone vocalization contains a whistle and a roar. Both mean get away."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"There\'s more where that came from!"', '"These polearms were supposed to help!"\\n—Merrik Aidar, Benalish patrol', '"This one will need direction. After all, each of its eyes is larger than its brain."\\n—Cyla, Lord of the Aerie', '"Those urbanist cobble-roaches won\'t know what hit them!"', '"To see past the veil of death, cross it."\\n—*The Red Book of Mezdrithalik*', '"Told you I had friends."', '"Try, if you must."', '"What cannot be destroyed will be bound, but do try to destroy it the first time."\\n—Rem Karolus, Blade of the Inquisitors', '"Where divinity leads, victory follows."\\n—Silverblade motto', '"Why throw away a perfectly good identity?"', '"Within minutes, the strange device was indistinguishable from the other upon my workbench."\\n—Tocasia, journal entry', '"You\'ll never get to the top if you don\'t know who\'s already there."\\n—Kaya', "A dragon's loyalty cannot be earned, but it can be bought.", 'A forest-wide network of webs brings a hungry couple to captured prey.', 'A hunger to soar must be sated.', 'A living fossil active after eons of dormancy.', 'A mercurial face sows distrust. Distrust reaps a lonely life.', 'A mother only a child could love.', 'A progenitor of tadpoles and allergies in equal measure.', 'A weapon forged for every hand.', 'A wizard can be outnumbered but never outsmarted.', 'All sounds harmonize with the Worldsoul.', 'Alone in the charred desolation of her kingdom, she regretted many things—most of all not acting sooner.', 'An elephant never forgives.', 'Angels cannot ignore pious pleas.', "Ayula's runic clawmarks ensure her territories are never left defenseless.", 'Born from the oldest red cedar, nursed on the sap of the tallest spruce, coronated under the mightiest pine.', 'Catching even a glimpse of one is the start of eight years of good luck.', "Changelings can't remember where they came from. They just know it wasn't a cradle.", 'Devils love adding injury to injury.', 'During seasonal thaws, the wurms slough their skin against trees to promote growth.', 'Each flower identical, every leaf and petal disturbingly exact.', 'Eight legs carrying endless phobias.', "Even without her, the cubs will always know their mother's love.", 'Every bough, branch, and bramble lashed out in defense of the forest.', 'Every cry lifts her allies toward the thunder.', 'Every path leads to discovery.', 'Eyeballs that portend unpleasant futures become slimy snacks instead.', 'Fail to respect the forest and you will fertilize it.', "Families of the fallen donate the swords of their loved ones to bolster the city's defenses.", 'For each one you see, ten see you.', 'For peace of mind, they mustered for war.', 'Forked tails rustled. Talons clicked. A lone sliver streaked overhead like jagged lightning, and the hive thundered.', "Four walls and a roof won't provide safety from that which is buried.", 'Freshly promoted to "first rock," Zaz was eager to make an impact.', 'From its cocoon, a flurry takes flight.', 'Glare from the snows in the boreal expanse hides its true size.', 'Good strategists seize opportunities. Great strategists make their own.', 'He cursed the wind. He cursed the cold. But by stepping on the ice, he cursed himself.', 'He traded a lamp for a scepter, the scepter for a ruby, and the ruby for a simple rug.', 'Her feathers cut the air, as sharp as they are silent.', 'Horns of hoarfrost grow every night, gleam at dawn, and melt by dusk.', 'In colder climates, ice is more obedient than stone.', 'In the treetops, unseen by many, lurks chittering, skittering death.', "It doesn't contain venom. It is venom.", 'It has no respect for the deeds of martyrs, reducing their legacy to a mouthful of flesh.', 'It manifests at wizard academies to siphon inspiration from young prodigies.', 'It recruits the fresh and tosses the rotten.', 'It strikes like a bolt from a brainstorm.', 'It watches over every absence.', 'Its shell can withstand anything but a thaw.', 'Malice is appropriate when vengeance is called for.', 'New life is born within its shadows.', 'Nine generations of metalworking skill are no match for nine hundred pounds of rage.', 'No amount of salt will save you', 'No matter how deep you bury it, some evil refuses to stay dead.', 'No tongue to chant, yet the forsaken hymn still emanates from its body.', 'Not all monsters fight with teeth and claws.', 'Not dryad, centaur, or avatar but life itself.', 'Not everyone should take joy in their work.', "One thread connected all the travelers' stories: the ferocity of the mongoose.", 'Opening like the maw of a hellion, the earth swallowed the traveler whole.', 'Pricy baubles are no match for cheap tricks.', 'Pure souls shine bright as daybreak.', 'Rigid minds are the first to break.', 'Searching the future for answers often leads to further questions.', 'She provides marks of protection to those she chooses as family.', 'Since the river ran dry, travelers wander where fish once swam.', 'Slivers can turn a last stand into a stunning victory.', 'Spells of madness often require a sacrifice of sanity.', 'Sun Empire priests thought they were digging a well. What they tapped was something different entirely.', 'Telepathy changes minds, necromancy changes lives, but geomancy changes the world.', 'The First Sliver calls. The dead answer.', 'The best presents are impossible to regift.', 'The call of the sea shapes many souls.', "The expedition's end began the marsh's story.", "The first step in any artificer's scheme is to take inventory.", 'The ground cracked and unleashed a thousand years of history at once.', 'The harshest environments offer the greatest opportunities for exploration.', 'The loss of its hunting grounds made it all the more dangerous.', 'The might of an army with the restraint of a child.', 'The most tenacious members of the hive instinctually guard the First Sliver.', 'The night is the greatest ally of all.', 'The only shortcut in a bog is to the bottom.', 'The present is a matter of perspective.', "The question isn't whether slivers will adapt to a world's perils but whether the world's perils will adapt to slivers.", 'The stories of his heroics are inspiring, though none of them are remotely true.', "The stronghold of Theros's light.", 'The thunderhead that leads in the storm.', 'The trees pull water from deep underground, filling the forest for miles.', 'The tribe was as strong as his longing, their territory as vast as his isolation. The changeling knew he had found a home, and a form.', 'The vines overgrew the construct, snapping gears and soaking up aether.', 'There is beauty in the uncertainty of potential.', "There was a time all craven beasts cowered before Avacyn's divine might.", 'Though the Time of Ice has ended, its relics still slumber in New Argive.', 'Time has ground mountains to sand, but the slivers ever remain.', 'Too stupid to survive, too dumb to die.', "Tribal rivalries and petty disputes were laid aside at Eladamri's summons.", "Turg's spawn ruled long after he croaked.", 'Two taken, two judged, one returned.', 'Victories against the hive are tragedies.', 'Volcanic violence made manifest.', 'Warm enough to incubate eggs or incinerate those who would eat them.', "When Worzel summoned Segovian angels to fight Thomil's Gargantikari gnats, the ensuing battle numbered among the Multiverse's least destructive.", "When dealing with goblins, if it isn't nailed down, it's headed your way.", "When it finishes the harvest, you'll have nowhere to hide.", 'When it wriggled closer to a thrum of slivers, their talons hardened and glinted in the sun. One took a playful swipe at a tree trunk, and its new blade cut clean through.', 'Where fickle form meets lasting loyalty.', 'Where water is the canvas and lava the paint.', 'Whether modeled after bear, bird, or baloth, all claws send the same message.', 'While the root remains, the tree yet lives.', 'Whoever survives the first blow lives to land the second.', 'Within each of us lurks the fathomless.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Alayna Danner', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Ben Maier', 'Bram Sels', 'Brom', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Chris Seaman', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Colin Boyer', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Daren Bader', 'Darren Tan', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Gaillet', 'David Palumbo', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Donato Giancola', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Evan Shipard', 'Even Amundsen', 'Filip Burburan', 'Forrest Imel', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Greg Staples', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Heather Hudson', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jakub Kasper', 'James Paick', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jedd Chevrier', 'Jehan Choo', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johan Grenier', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'John Severin Brassell', 'John Stanko', 'Jon J Muth', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jonathan Kuo', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Josh Hass', 'Kari Christensen', 'Kee Lo', 'Kev Walker', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lindsey Look', 'Livia Prima', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Behm', 'Mark Winters', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Micah Epstein', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mila Pesic', 'Milivoj Ćeran', 'Mitchell Malloy', 'Nic Klein', 'Nicholas Gregory', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Paul Scott Canavan', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Ravenna Tran', 'Richard Wright', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sam Burley', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Suzanne Helmigh', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Taylor Ingvarsson', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Titus Lunter', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tommy Arnold', 'Tyler Walpole', 'Uriah Voth', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Winona Nelson', 'Wisnu Tan', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Zack Stella']
