rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\'t have to find the card if you don\'t want to."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If an effect refers to a “[subtype] spell” or “[subtype] card,” it refers only to a spell or card that has that subtype. For example, Goblin War Party is a card that references and creates Goblins, but it isn\'t a Goblin card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Artifact cards not on the battlefield won’t be returned by Rebuild.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-10-01', 'text': 'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'Spells cast from zones other than a player’s hand and spells that were countered are counted by the storm ability.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The copies are put directly onto the stack. They aren’t cast and won’t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The triggered ability that creates the copies can itself be countered by anything that can counter a triggered ability. If it is countered, no copies will be put onto the stack.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'You may choose new targets for any of the copies. You can choose differently for each copy.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target Urza\'s Rage. When that spell or ability resolves, Urza\'s Rage won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of that spell or ability will still happen."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target for Urza\'s Rage becomes an illegal target, the spell won\'t resolve and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard with no effect. This is true even if its damage can\'t be prevented and even though it can\'t be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Abominable Treefolk\'s last ability can target a creature that\'s already tapped. That creature won\'t untap during its controller\'s next untap step."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "As long as Abominable Treefolk is on the battlefield, its first ability will count itself, so it\'ll be at least 1/1."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Abominable Treefolk\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Activating a creature card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting the creature card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the creature card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Cancel) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If a creature returned to the battlefield by the unearth ability would leave it for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the creature to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it. In that case, the spell or ability succeeds at exiling the creature. If the spell or ability later returns the creature card to the battlefield (as Astral Drift might, for example), the creature card will return as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Casting the card again due to rebound\'s delayed triggered ability is optional. If you choose not to cast the card, or if you can\'t (perhaps because there are no legal targets available), the card will stay exiled. You won\'t get another chance to cast it on a future turn. If you do cast the card, it\'s put into its owner\'s graveyard as normal once it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand is countered or doesn\'t resolve (most likely because its targets have become illegal), none of its effects will happen, including rebound. The spell will be put into its owner\'s graveyard and you won\'t get to cast it again on your next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Once the exiled creature returns, it\'s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Either of Ayula\'s modes can target any Bear you control, not just the Bear that entered the battlefield. Ayula can even be the target of its own ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "For Ayula\'s second mode, if either target isn\'t a creature or is otherwise an illegal target as the ability resolves, no creature will deal or be dealt damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Exclude can target a creature spell that can\'t be countered. When Exclude resolves, that spell won\'t be countered, but you\'ll still draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If Undead Augur dies at the same time as one or more other Zombies you control, Undead Augur\'s ability triggers for each of them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If an effect modifies how many +1/+1 counters you put on Nantuko Cultivator, the number of cards you draw isn\'t modified. Likewise, if an effect modifies how many cards you draw, the number of +1/+1 counters you put on Nantuko Cultivator won\'t be modified."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "You discard, put counters, and draw all while Nantuko Cultivator\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the three, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Generous Gift tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No player creates an Elephant. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create an Elephant."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target player\'s library contains fewer cards than the sacrificed creature\'s power, all of those cards are put into that player\'s graveyard. That player won\'t lose the game until they try to draw from the empty library."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'The number of cards the target player puts into their graveyard is equal to the power of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability (most likely because that top card is the card you\'re playing), the new top card won\'t be revealed until you finish doing so."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If the top card of your library is a land, you may play that land only if you have any available land plays.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The top card of your library isn\'t in your hand, so you can\'t suspend it, cycle it, or activate any of its abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the top card of your library and pay its costs. If the card has alternative or additional costs, you may pay those. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when Man-o\'-War enters the battlefield, its ability must target itself."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Storm counts spells cast before the spell with storm was cast. Spells cast after the spell with storm was cast but before the storm ability resolves aren\'t counted."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The copies storm creates are created on the stack, so they\'re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as storm) won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'The storm ability and the copies it creates all resolve before the spell with storm. They resolve even if the spell with storm is countered.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "While resolving Springbloom Druid\'s triggered ability, you can\'t sacrifice multiple lands to search for more than two basic land cards."}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A copy is created even if the spell or ability that caused Unbound Flourishing’s ability to trigger has been countered by the time that ability resolves. The copy resolves before the original spell.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have a colon in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) that ask a player to pay {X} aren’t copied.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'An ability with a cost that includes X, but not the mana symbol {X}, won’t be copied.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a permanent has an ability that triggers when it’s cast and that references the value of X, you choose whether to double the value of X before or after that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the spell or ability that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can’t choose different ones.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the value chosen for X is 0, Unbound Flourishing will double the value to 0 for permanent spells, and copy other spells and abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you control two Unbound Flourishings, the value of X for permanent spells will be multiplied by four. If you control three, it will be multiplied by eight, and so on. On the other hand, spells and abilities that include {X} will only be copied twice if you control two Unbound Flourishings, three times if you control three, and so on.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Spells with additional costs that include {X} won’t be affected by Unbound Flourishing. {X} must be in the spell’s mana cost.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copy that Unbound Flourishing’s ability creates is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast” or “activated.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell or activates an ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell or ability it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Unbound Flourishing raises the value of X for permanent spells, but you don’t pay any more mana.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Unbound Flourishing’s ability will copy any instant spell, sorcery spell, or activated ability whose mana cost or activation cost contains {X}, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for a copied spell. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A creature attacks alone if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step (including creatures controlled by your teammates, if applicable). For example, exalted won’t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, count the number of instances of exalted among permanents you control. After those abilities resolve, that’s how many times the creature will get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A creature attacks alone if it’s the only creature declared as an attacker during the declare attackers step (including creatures controlled by your teammates, if applicable). For example, exalted won’t trigger if you attack with multiple creatures and all but one of them are removed from combat.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A creature dealt combat damage by Frostwalk Bastion won’t untap during its controller’s next untap step, even if it was already tapped and even if Frostwalk Bastion leaves the battlefield before then.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you turn Frostwalk Bastion into a creature but haven’t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won’t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A creature sacrificed for the first mode of Kaya’s Guile will be exiled if it ends up in an opponent’s graveyard and the second mode was also chosen.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'As the first mode is performed, first the opponent whose turn it is (or, if it’s not an opponent’s turn, the next opponent in turn order) chooses a creature they control, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Each chosen mode is performed in the order specified. Abilities that trigger while one mode is being performed won’t be put onto the stack until Kaya’s Guile has finished resolving.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Kaya’s Guile isn’t entwined, you must choose two different modes.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A permanent gaining protection may cause a spell or ability on the stack to have an illegal target. As a spell or ability tries to resolve, if all its targets are illegal, that spell or ability doesn’t resolve. None of its effects happen, including effects unrelated to the target. If at least one target is still legal, the spell or ability does as much as it can to the remaining legal targets, and its other effects still happen.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Protection from a color means that the target creature can’t be blocked by creatures of that color, can’t be the target of spells of that color or abilities from sources of that color, can’t be enchanted or equipped by Auras or Equipment of that color, and all damage that sources of that color would deal to it is prevented. Nothing other than these events is prevented or illegal.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Similarly, protection from colorless means that the target creature can’t be blocked by colorless creatures, can’t be the target of colorless spells or abilities of colorless sources, can’t be enchanted or equipped by colorless Auras or Equipment, and all damage that colorless sources would deal to it is prevented.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A permanent gaining protection may cause a spell or ability on the stack to have an illegal target. As a spell or ability tries to resolve, if all its targets are illegal, that spell or ability doesn’t resolve. None of its effects happen, including effects unrelated to the target. If at least one target is still legal, the spell or ability does as much as it can to the remaining legal targets, and its other effects still happen.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Protection from a color means that the target creature can’t be blocked by creatures of that color, can’t be the target of spells of that color or abilities from sources of that color, can’t be enchanted or equipped by Auras or Equipment of that color, and all damage that sources of that color would deal to it is prevented. Nothing other than these events is prevented or illegal.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The legality of a spell’s targets is checked only as that spell begins to resolve. If Shelter gives the targeted creature protection from white, you’ll still draw a card.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can’t choose “artifact” or “colorless” as Shelter asks you to choose a color, since those are not colors.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Turning a permanent face up doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent still target it, and Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent are still attached to it. If anything now targets or is attached to the creature illegally, the game rules will clean this up as appropriate.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature or share any creature types with any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If an effect tries to return a face-down creature to the battlefield after it leaves (such as Astral Drift’s delayed triggered ability), that effect returns the card face up. If it tries to put an instant or sorcery card onto the battlefield this way, that card remains in its current zone instead.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The face-down characteristics of a permanent are copiable values. If another object becomes a copy of a face-down creature or if a token is created that’s a copy of a face-down creature, that new object is a 2/2 colorless face-up creature with no abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A permanent’s echo ability will trigger during your upkeep if it entered the battlefield since the beginning of your last upkeep, if you gained control of it since the beginning of your last upkeep, or if another player took control of it and it returned to your control since the beginning of your last upkeep.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'A spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for Spell Snuff. The spell won’t be countered when Spell Snuff resolves, but if you have 5 or less life, you’ll still draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keyword abilities (such as equip) are activated abilities and will have a colon in their reminder text. Triggered abilities (starting with “when,” “whenever,” or “at”) are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Collector Ouphe’s ability affects only artifacts on the battlefield. Activated abilities that work in other zones (such as cycling) can still be activated.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you control Collector Ouphe, you can’t activate any abilities of your artifacts, even if you’d sacrifice Collector Ouphe as a cost to activate one of those abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'No abilities of artifacts can be activated, including mana abilities.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Activating a creature card’s unearth ability isn’t the same as casting the creature spell. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the creature card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Cancel) will not.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Dregscape Sliver grants the unearth ability to other Sliver cards only while it’s on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature returned to the battlefield by the unearth ability would leave it for any reason, it’s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that’s causing the creature to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it. In that case, the spell or ability succeeds at exiling the creature. If the spell or ability later returns the creature card to the battlefield (as Astral Drift might, for example), the creature card will return as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effect will no longer apply to it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'All players get to see which cards you chose at random as they’re returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If X is greater than or equal to the number of cards in your graveyard, you simply return your entire graveyard to your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'No player may take actions between the time the cards are chosen at random and the time they’re returned to your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Reap the Past is still on the stack while you return cards to your hand, so it can’t return itself.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Any cards you don\'t cast will remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature. The Ninja isn\'t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won\'t enter the battlefield at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Fallen Shinobi\'s triggered ability doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if a sorcery card is exiled, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If a land card is exiled, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step, even if it has first strike.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The creature with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu; in other cases, when a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking, that creature\'s controller chooses which player or planeswalker it\'s attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. If you wait until after the declare blockers step, because all combat damage is dealt at once, the Ninja won\'t normally deal combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature. The Ninja isn’t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won’t enter the battlefield at all.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Ingenious Infiltrator is dealt lethal combat damage at the same time a Ninja you control deals combat damage to a player, its ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step, even if it has first strike.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The creature with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu; in other cases, when a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking, that creature’s controller chooses which player or planeswalker it’s attacking.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. If you wait until after the declare blockers step, because all combat damage is dealt at once, the Ninja won’t normally deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature. The Ninja isn’t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won’t enter the battlefield at all.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Mist-Syndicate Naga leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the token will still enter the battlefield as a copy of Mist-Syndicate Naga, using Mist-Syndicate Naga’s copiable values from when it was last on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step, even if it has first strike.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The creature with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu; in other cases, when a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking, that creature’s controller chooses which player or planeswalker it’s attacking.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. If you wait until after the declare blockers step, because all combat damage is dealt at once, the Ninja won’t normally deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The token will have Mist-Syndicate Naga’s ability. It will also be able to create copies of itself.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The token won’t copy counters, Auras, or Equipment on Mist-Syndicate Naga, nor will it copy other effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Normally, this means the token will simply be a Mist-Syndicate Naga. But if any copy effects have affected Mist-Syndicate Naga, they’re taken into account.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature. The Ninja isn’t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won’t enter the battlefield at all.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step, even if it has first strike.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The creature with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu; in other cases, when a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking, that creature’s controller chooses which player or planeswalker it’s attacking.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. If you wait until after the declare blockers step, because all combat damage is dealt at once, the Ninja won’t normally deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'An “attacking creature” is one that has been declared as an attacker or put onto the battlefield attacking during a turn’s combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you cast Wing Shards after combat damage has been dealt, only creatures that survived combat can be sacrificed.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Storm counts spells cast before the spell with storm was cast. Spells cast after the spell with storm was cast but before the storm ability resolves aren’t counted.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copies storm creates are created on the stack, so they’re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell (such as storm) won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The storm ability and the copies it creates all resolve before the spell with storm. They resolve even if the spell with storm is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Wing Shards doesn’t target the creature to be sacrificed. The target player chooses the creature as it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability can look at the card exiled with that ability.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Watcher for Tomorrow leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability from hideaway resolves, its leaves-the-battlefield ability resolves and does nothing. Then its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves and you exile a card with no way to return it to your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You don’t reveal the exiled card when you put it into its owner’s hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Aria of Flame’s last ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Aria of Flame leaves the battlefield while its last ability is on the stack, use the number of verse counters it had on it immediately before it left the battlefield to determine how much damage it deals.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the target player or planeswalker is an illegal target by the time Aria of Flame’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. You don’t put a verse counter on Aria of Flame.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Aria of Flame’s first ability causes the opposing team to gain 20 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Astral Drift’s triggered ability resolves before the cycling ability does. You won’t draw until after you choose the target and choose whether to exile the creature.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. Once the exiled creature returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you cycle a card during a player’s end step, the exiled creature will remain exiled until the next turn’s end step.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'At the beginning of the next end step, you’ll sacrifice the planeswalker if it’s still on the battlefield, even if Planebound Accomplice has left the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If On Thin Ice leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target creature won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled permanent will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. Once the exiled permanent returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Blizzard Strix enters the battlefield during a player’s end step, the exiled permanent will remain exiled until the next turn’s end step.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because Conifer Wurm is itself a snow permanent, its ability will usually give it at least +1/+1.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Conifer Wurm’s ability begins to resolve. It won’t change later in the turn if the number of snow permanents you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature is exiled but ends up in another zone (most likely because it’s a player’s commander in the Commander variant), it’s still a “creature exiled this way” for Winds of Abandon.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Effects that modify the affected creatures’ power or toughness (such as the effects of Force of Virtue or Giant Growth) will apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creatures’ power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Scale Up overwrites all previous effects that set the affected creatures’ color, creature types, power, and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set these characteristics to specific values that start to apply after Scale Up resolves will overwrite that part of the effect.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The affected creatures don’t lose any abilities when they become Wurms.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because a spell with overload doesn’t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with protection from the appropriate color.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to other creatures you control of the chosen type may become lethal if Morophon leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Cost reduction effects are applied after other cost modifiers, so Morophon can reduce additional costs or alternative costs of spells of the chosen type.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell has hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost, you choose which half you will be paying before determining the total cost. For example, if a spell of the chosen type costs {2}{W/U}{W/U}, you may choose for the cost to be {2}{W}{U} and then reduce it to {2}.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Morophon’s effect reduces the total cost by up to one mana of each color. For example, if a spell of the chosen type costs {4}{R}{W}{W}, it will cost {4}{W} after applying Morophon’s effect.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You must choose an existing creature type, such as Sliver or Warrior. Card types such as artifact, and supertypes such as legendary or snow, can’t be chosen.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because devour applies as Feaster of Fools enters the battlefield, it can’t devour creatures that enter the battlefield at the same time as it. It can devour creatures that convoked it, and those creatures can reflect upon the wisdom of convoking a demon.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Because it doesn’t modify the characteristics of creatures, Pyrophobia can affect Cowards that enter the battlefield or creatures that become Cowards after the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Coward is a creature type. You won’t see this creature type printed on creatures (perhaps because they’re too good at hiding), but keep in mind that creatures with the changeling ability are Cowards.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Pyrophobia tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. Cowards can block if they’re otherwise allowed to.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Bellowing Elk’s effect applies even if the other creature entered the battlefield under your control before Bellowing Elk entered the battlefield, and it continues to apply even if that creature leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Bellowing Elk’s effect checks each turn whether it applies during that turn. It doesn’t check only during the turn it enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Bogardan Dragonheart doesn’t lose any abilities when it becomes a Dragon.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Bogardan Dragonheart’s ability overwrites all previous effects that set its creature types, power, and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set these characteristics to specific values that start to apply after the ability resolves will overwrite that part of this effect.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Effects that modify Bogardan Dragonheart’s power or toughness (such as the effects of Force of Virtue or Giant Growth) will apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters).'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Casting the card again due to rebound’s delayed triggered ability is optional. If you choose not to cast the card, or if you can’t because an effect prohibits it, the card will stay exiled. You won’t get another chance to cast it on a future turn. If you do cast the card, it’s put into its owner’s graveyard as normal once it resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand is countered for any reason, that spell won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen, including rebound. The spell will be put into its owner’s graveyard and you won’t get to cast it again on your next turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Chillerpillar gaining flying after it becomes blocked won’t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause Chillerpillar to become unblocked.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Monstrous isn’t an ability that a creature has. It’s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature, loses its abilities, or loses its +1/+1 counters, it will continue to be monstrous.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can’t become monstrous again. If the creature is already monstrous when the monstrosity ability resolves, nothing happens.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Damage dealt by the Sliver due to its triggered ability isn’t combat damage, even if it was combat damage that caused that ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a Sliver is dealt damage by multiple sources at once (such as by two creatures blocking it), its ability triggers once and one target is dealt that much damage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ability granted by Spiteful Sliver will trigger even if the Sliver is dealt lethal damage. For example, if a 2/2 Sliver blocks a 7/7 creature, the Sliver’s ability will trigger and it will deal 7 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Dead of Winter affects only creatures that aren’t snow creatures at the time it resolves. Creatures that enter the battlefield later in the turn won’t get -X/-X.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Dead of Winter begins to resolve. It won’t change later in the turn if the number of snow permanents you control changes.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Dredge can replace any card draw, not just the one during your draw step. One card draw can’t be replaced by multiple dredge abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If an effect puts a card into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” you’re not drawing a card. Dredge can’t replace this event.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you’re drawing multiple cards, each draw is performed one at a time. For example, if you’re instructed to draw two cards and you replace the first draw with a dredge ability, another card with a dredge ability (including one that was put into your graveyard by the first dredge ability) may be used to replace the second draw.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once you’ve announced that you’re applying a card’s dredge ability to replace a draw, players can’t take any action until you’ve put that card into your hand and put the top cards of your library into your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can’t attempt to use a dredge ability if you don’t have enough cards in your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Each individual spell you cast this way must have mana value 3 or less. Their total mana value could be greater.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs (such as that of Tormenting Voice), you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You may cast the two sorcery cards in either order. The second is cast before the first resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You must cast any of the exiled cards you wish to cast while Collected Conjuring is resolving. You can’t cast them later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Echo of Eons won’t be put into your graveyard until after it’s finished resolving, which means it won’t be shuffled into your library as part of its own effect.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Effects that modify the enchanted creature’s power or toughness (such as the effects of Force of Virtue or Giant Growth) will apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creature’s power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a noncreature permanent becomes a creature and is enchanted with Reprobation, it will remain a creature thanks to Reprobation’s effect, even when the original effect that made it a creature expires.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature gains an ability after Reprobation becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Reprobation overwrites all previous effects that set the enchanted creature’s creature types, card types, power, and/or toughness to specific values. Other effects that set these characteristics to specific values that start to apply after Reprobation becomes attached will overwrite that portion of the effect.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The enchanted creature retains any supertypes it had, such as legendary or snow.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Effects that modify the target creatures’ power or toughness (such as the effects of Force of Virtue or Giant Growth) will apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change the creatures’ power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Phantasmal Form overwrites all previous effects that set the target creatures’ power and toughness to specific values. Other effects that set their power or toughness to specific values that start to apply after Phantasmal Form resolves will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You may cast Phantasmal Form without choosing any target creatures. You’ll just draw a card. However, if you choose any targets and all of those targets become illegal before the spell tries to resolve, the spell won’t resolve and you won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Eyekite’s effect applies even if you drew two or more cards only before Eyekite entered the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” Eyekite’s effect doesn’t count them.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Force of Despair destroys all permanents that entered the battlefield this turn and are currently creatures. It doesn’t matter whether they were creatures as they entered the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Goat is a creature type. You won’t see this creature type printed on creatures in this set, but keep in mind that creatures with the changeling ability are Goats.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Goatnap can target any creature, even one that’s untapped or one you already control.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'To determine whether the target creature gets +3/+0, look at its creature types after you’ve gained control of it, untapped it, and given it haste. If it’s not a Goat at this time, it won’t get +3/+0, even if it becomes a Goat later in the turn. If it is a Goat, it gets +3/+0, even if it stops being a Goat later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Goblin War Party’s second mode affects only creatures you control at the time the spell resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +1/+1 or gain haste.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Goblin War Party is entwined, its modes are performed in order. The Goblin tokens you create get +1/+1 and gain haste.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Alpine Guide can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under a player’s control that turn), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Answered Prayers becomes a creature but you haven’t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won’t be able to attack with it.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once Answered Prayers becomes a creature, you’ll still gain life whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Cloudshredder Sliver leaves the battlefield during combat, any attacking Slivers that came under your control this turn will continue to attack, even though they will no longer have haste.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If Cordial Vampire dies at the same time as one or more other creatures, its ability triggers for each of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If a Vampire you control is dealt lethal damage at the same time as another creature, they die at the same time. That Vampire can\'t receive a counter from Cordial Vampire\'s ability in time to save it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Endling’s last ability gives it -1/+1 enough times, it may have negative power. Use that negative value if its power is further modified. For example, if Endling’s last ability gives it -1/+1 five times, it’s -2/8. Giving it +1/-1 twice after that makes it 0/6, not 2/6.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Endling’s power is reduced to 0 or less while in combat and it gains deathtouch, it won’t deal damage, so deathtouch won’t apply.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a card leaves the graveyard after it dies but before the undying trigger resolves, it won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, state-based actions remove the same number of each so that it has only one kind of those counters on it. Endling’s undying ability can bring it back again if its +1/+1 counters are removed this way.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature has multiple instances of undying, they’ll each trigger separately, but once one of those abilities returns the card to the battlefield, any others will have no effect. The creature won’t receive multiple +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature with undying that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, undying won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because undying checks the creature as it last existed on the battlefield, and it still had +1/+1 counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you activate Endling’s last ability, you don’t choose whether Endling gets +1/-1 or -1/+1 until that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Multiple instances of menace or deathtouch on the same creature are redundant.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once undying returns the creature, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras that were attached to it won’t return to the battlefield. Equipment that was attached to it will remain unattached. Any counters that were on it won’t be put on the new creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Marit Lage’s Slumber leaves the battlefield before its last ability resolves, you won’t be able to sacrifice it, so you won’t create Marit Lage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you don’t control ten or more snow permanents as your upkeep begins, the last ability won’t trigger. No player may take any actions during a turn before the turn’s upkeep begins.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you don’t control ten snow permanents as the last ability resolves, you can’t sacrifice Marit Lage’s Slumber.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Nether Spirit isn’t the only creature card in your graveyard as its ability resolves, it remains in your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Nether Spirit isn’t the only creature card in your graveyard as your upkeep begins, its ability won’t trigger. You can’t take any actions during your turn before your upkeep begins.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you have two Nether Spirits in your graveyard, they stop each other from returning.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Sisay leaves the battlefield after you’ve activated its last ability but before that ability resolves, use its last known existence on the battlefield to determine what cards you can find.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a card in a library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Spinehorn Minotaur gains double strike only after combat damage has already been dealt (most likely because another creature’s ability caused you to draw a card when it dealt combat damage), Spinehorn Minotaur will deal only normal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” Spinehorn Minotaur’s effect doesn’t count them.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Spinehorn Minotaur’s effect applies even if you drew two or more cards only before Spinehorn Minotaur entered the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Twisted Reflection is entwined, its two modes may each target the same creature, or they may target two different creatures.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Twisted Reflection is always a blue spell. It’s not also black if you paid its entwine cost.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature may become lethal if you switch its power and toughness during that turn.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Effects that switch a creature’s power and toughness apply after all other effects, regardless of when those effects began to apply. For instance, if you target a 1/2 creature then give it +2/+0 later in the turn, it’s a 2/3 creature, not a 4/1 creature.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Switching a creature’s power and toughness twice (or any even number of times) effectively returns the creature to the power and toughness it had before any switches.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Warteye Witch dies at the same time as one or more other creatures you control, Warteye Witch’s ability triggers for each of them.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If multiple creatures you control die simultaneously, you’ll scry 1 that many times. You won’t look at more than one card from your library at once.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If Winter’s Rest is destroyed while its enters-the-battlefield triggered ability is on the stack, the creature that it enchanted is tapped as that ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Winter’s Rest resolves, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you lose control of all of your other snow permanents, then control a new one, the effect of Winter’s Rest will apply to the enchanted creature again.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Your opponents may cast spells in response to the last ability of Ranger-Captain of Eos. The ability won’t affect those spells and it won’t affect spells that those players cast before you activated it. (In other words, the ability can’t be used to counter a spell.)'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a card in your library has X in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a card with persist is removed from the graveyard after it dies but before the ability trigger resolves, it won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, state-based actions remove the same number of each so that it has only one kind of those counters on it. Putrid Goblin’s persist ability can bring it back again if its -1/-1 counters are removed this way.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature as it last existed on the battlefield, and it still had -1/-1 counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once persist returns the creature, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras that were attached to it won’t return to the battlefield. Equipment that was attached to it will remain unattached. Any counters that were on it won’t be put on the new creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a card with persist is removed from the graveyard after it dies but before the ability trigger resolves, it won’t be returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, state-based actions remove the same number of each so that it has only one kind of those of counters on it. Lesser Masticore’s persist ability can bring it back again if its -1/-1 counters are removed this way.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature as it last existed on the battlefield, and it still had -1/-1 counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once persist returns the creature, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras that were attached to it won’t return to the battlefield. Equipment that was attached to it will remain unattached. Any counters that were on it won’t be put on the new creature.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You must discard exactly one card to cast Lesser Masticore; you can’t cast it without discarding a card, and you can’t discard additional cards. If Lesser Masticore enters the battlefield without being cast (perhaps because of its persist ability) you don’t discard a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness), totem armor’s effect will replace all of them and save the creature.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature has indestructible and is enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won’t do anything because it won’t have to.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted creature would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead—but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted creature.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability (such as Force of Vigor) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the creature it’s enchanting at the same time, totem armor’s effect will save the enchanted creature from being destroyed. The spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted creature is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it’s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted creature would be destroyed: because it’s been dealt lethal damage, or because an effect is trying to destroy it (such as Mob). In either case, all damage is removed from the creature and the Aura is destroyed instead.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted creature would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Totem armor’s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor’s effect is applied, the enchanted creature does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted creature can’t be regenerated (as Pillage does) won’t prevent totem armor’s effect from being applied.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Treefolk Umbra’s effect doesn’t actually change the enchanted creature’s power. It changes only the amount of combat damage the creature assigns. All other rules and effects that check power or toughness use the real values. For example, Savage Swipe won’t cause the enchanted creature to fight with its toughness.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature is exiled but ends up in another zone (most likely because it’s a player’s commander in the Commander variant), Soulherder’s first ability triggers.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If any other abilities you control trigger at the beginning of your end step, you choose the targets for all of them as they’re put onto the stack, and you choose the order they’re put onto the stack. For example, this means that you could exile a creature put onto the battlefield by an unearth ability (and then unearth’s delayed triggered ability won’t exile that creature), but you can’t target a creature that will be returned to the battlefield by another ability during your end step (such as Astral Drift’s delayed triggered ability).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once the exiled creature returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a creature with modular receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, modular will put a number of +1/+1 counters on the target artifact creature equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on this creature before it left the battlefield. That’s because modular checks the creature as it last existed on the battlefield, and it still had +1/+1 counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Scrapyard Recombiner to pay the cost of its second ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a permanent or player you choose while proliferating has more than one kind of counter on it, it will get one more of each of those kinds. This means that if you put a +1/+1 counter on a creature you control with a -1/-1 counter on it, then choose that creature while proliferating, you’ll put another of each of those counters on it before state-based actions remove them.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Protection from a color means that the equipped creature can’t be blocked by creatures of that color, can’t be the target of spells of that color or abilities from sources of that color, can’t be enchanted or equipped by Auras or Equipment of that color, and all damage that sources of that color would deal to it is prevented. Nothing other than these events is prevented or illegal.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If a sorcery card is put into your graveyard during your main phase and the stack is empty, you have a chance to cast it before any player may attempt to remove that card from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If a spell cast this way is put into another zone after it resolves (perhaps because it had buyback), it\'s considered a new object. If that card later moves to your graveyard, it won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If you cast a card from your graveyard using another permission (such as that of flashback), Kess\'s effect doesn\'t apply. You can cast another instant or sorcery card from your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If you cast one instant or sorcery card from your graveyard and then have a new Kess come under your control in the same turn, you may cast another instant or sorcery card from your graveyard that turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Once you begin to cast the card, losing control of Kess won\'t affect the spell. You can finish casting it as normal and it will be exiled if it would be put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of the card you cast from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'You must pay the costs to cast that card. If it has an alternative cost, you may cast it for that cost instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If a spell has multiple instances of cascade (for example, if you cast a second The First Sliver), each instance of cascade triggers and resolves separately. The spell you cast due to the first cascade ability will go on the stack on top of the second cascade ability. That spell will resolve before you exile cards for the second cascade ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The First Sliver\'s last ability only applies while it\'s on the battlefield. If The First Sliver\'s own cascade ability lets you cast another Sliver card, that Sliver won\'t have cascade."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell is copied, choices made while casting it are copied, so the copy will have the same abilities spliced onto it as the original.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen, including those from cards spliced onto it.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the spell is countered, any cards you spliced onto it remain in your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The abilities spliced onto the spell happen last, after all of that spell’s other effects. Notably, the Golem won’t be on the battlefield yet if the spell has an effect that affects all creatures, all creatures you control, or similar.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The legality of a spell’s targets is checked only as that spell begins to resolve. If the spell this card is spliced onto causes its targets to become illegal while it’s resolving (for example, by removing them from the battlefield) you’ll still create a Golem.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell, although multiple cards with the same name may be spliced onto one spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell is copied, choices made while casting it are copied, so the copy will have the same abilities spliced onto it as the original.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If all of the spell’s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen, including those from cards spliced onto it.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the spell is countered, any cards you spliced onto it remain in your hand.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The abilities spliced onto the spell happen last, after all of that spell’s other effects.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The legality of a spell’s targets is checked only as that spell begins to resolve. If the spell this card is spliced onto causes its targets to become illegal while it’s resolving (for example, by removing them from the battlefield), you’ll still draw a card.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You reveal all cards you intend to splice at the same time. Each individual card can be spliced only once onto any one spell, although multiple cards with the same name may be spliced onto one spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls targets only you or only one permanent you control, but it targets you or that permanent multiple times, Unsettled Mariner’s ability triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you and a permanent you control each become the targets of the same spell or ability an opponent controls, Unsettled Mariner’s ability will trigger twice. The same is true if two permanents you control each become the targets of the same spell or ability an opponent controls.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word "draw," Fists of Flame\\\'s effect doesn\\\'t count them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Fists of Flame tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The bonus that the target creature receives is locked in as Fists of Flame resolves, counting the card drawn during its first effect. The creature won\'t get an additional +1/+0 if you draw another card later in the turn."}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” Oneirophage’s ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” Thundering Djinn’s effect doesn’t count them.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If a token you control is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Once the exiled creature you control returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creatures will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creatures will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creatures will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If an effect has set Hexdrinker’s power and/or toughness to a specific value after it entered the battlefield, leveling up won’t change that characteristic.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Level abilities count the number of level counters on the creature. Hexdrinker starts with zero level counters. Once it has at least three but no more than seven level counters, it’s 4/4 and has protection from instants. Once it has eight or more level counters, it’s 6/6 and has protection from everything. It always has level up {1}.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Protection from everything means that Hexdrinker can’t be the target of any spells or abilities, it can’t be blocked, nothing can be attached to it, and all damage that would be dealt to it is prevented. It can still be affected in other ways (such as by Winds of Abandon cast for its overload cost, for example).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Protection from instants means that Hexdrinker can’t be the target of instant spells or abilities from instant cards (such as an ability of an instant card that triggers when that card is cycled), and all damage that an instant spell or instant card would deal to it is prevented. Nothing other than these events is prevented or illegal.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If an effect instructs you to draw cards and then discard cards, you can’t take actions in between. For example, if you have no cards in hand and cast Bazaar Trademage, you can’t activate Ayula’s Influence’s ability between the time you draw two cards and discard those cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If an unblocked attacking Ninja you control leaves combat (most likely because the combat phase has ended), it no longer has lifelink.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Throatseeker’s effect applies only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If either target is an illegal target as Savage Swipe tries to resolve, neither creature will deal or be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the creature you control is an illegal target as Savage Swipe tries to resolve, no creature gets +2/+2. If that creature is a legal target but the creature you don’t control isn’t, it still gets +2/+2 until end of turn if its power is 2.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The target creature you control gets +2/+2 only if its power is exactly 2 as Savage Swipe resolves. It’ll still fight if it doesn’t get +2/+2.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can’t cast Savage Swipe unless you choose both a creature you control and a creature you don’t control as targets.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If evolve triggers, the comparison will happen again when the ability tries to resolve. If neither characteristic of the new creature is greater, the ability will do nothing. If the creature that entered the battlefield leaves the battlefield before evolve resolves, use its last known power and toughness to determine whether the creature with evolve gets a +1/+1 counter.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If multiple creatures enter the battlefield at the same time, evolve may trigger multiple times, although the comparison will take place each time one of those abilities tries to resolve. For example, if you control a 0/3 creature with evolve and two 1/1 creatures enter the battlefield, evolve will trigger twice. The first ability will resolve and put a +1/+1 counter on the creature with evolve. When the second ability tries to resolve, neither the power nor the toughness of the new creature is greater than that of the creature with evolve, so that ability does nothing.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'When comparing the characteristics of the two creatures for evolve, you always compare power to power and toughness to toughness.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, check its power and toughness against the power and toughness of the creature with evolve. If neither characteristic of the new creature is greater, evolve won’t trigger at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Smiting Helix tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 3 life.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Smiting Helix is always a black spell. It’s not red and white if you cast it for its flashback cost.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Dismantling Blow tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw two cards if it was kicked. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do draw two cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Elvish Fury tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. If its buyback cost was paid, you won’t return it to your hand.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time String of Disappearances tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. That creature’s controller can’t pay to copy String of Disappearances.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copies String of Disappearances creates are created on the stack, so they’re not cast. Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copy of String of Disappearances has the ability to copy itself. The string can go on or not, as long as players are able and willing to keep paying {U}{U}.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'While resolving String of Disappearances, you can’t pay {U}{U} multiple times to copy it multiple times. It’s a string, not a web.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If the target land is an illegal target by the time Geomancer’s Gambit tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. Its controller doesn’t search for a basic land card and you don’t draw a card. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does search and you do draw.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If there aren’t three or more creature cards in your graveyard as Webweaver Changeling enters the battlefield, its ability doesn’t trigger at all. If there aren’t three or more creature cards in your graveyard as the ability resolves, you don’t gain 5 life. These don’t have the be same creature cards at both times.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you choose the second mode and one of the two cards leaves your graveyard, you’ll still return the other card to your hand as long as it has a creature type that the other card had as it left your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you choose the second mode, the cards must share at least one creature type, such as Sliver or Warrior. Card types such as artifact, and supertypes such as legendary or snow, aren’t creature types.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you control any tapped lands as Martyr’s Soul enters the battlefield, its last ability doesn’t trigger at all. If you control any tapped lands as the ability resolves, you won’t put two +1/+1 counters on Martyr’s Soul.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you don’t pay the overload cost of a spell, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won’t have any targets.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'While most spells with overload affect only permanents you control or only permanents your opponents control, Mind Rake affects all players, including you, if it’s overloaded.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you have fewer than two cards in hand as Seasoned Pyromancer’s first ability resolves, you’ll discard your hand, then draw two cards regardless of how many you discarded.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you have less than 1 life and somehow haven’t lost the game, damage dealt to you reduces your life total further below 0 (as normal).'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, damage dealt to you and/or your teammate that would reduce your team’s life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead, as long as you control a creature. It doesn’t matter whether your teammate controls a creature, even if they’re the player being dealt damage'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'In the Commander variant, combat damage you’re dealt by a commander is still tracked, even if it doesn’t change your life total.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Serra’s emblem doesn’t prevent damage. It only changes the result of damage dealt to you. For example, a creature with lifelink that deals damage to you will still cause its controller to gain life, even if that damage would reduce your life total to less than 1.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Serra’s emblem doesn’t stop loss of life from effects that say that you lose life.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Serra’s first ability affects only creatures you control with flying at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn or that gain flying later in the turn won’t get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you pay the dash cost to cast a creature spell, that card will be returned to its owner’s hand only if it’s still on the battlefield when its triggered ability resolves. If it dies or goes to another zone before then, it will stay where it is.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Treetop Ambusher can be the target of its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you replicate Stream of Thought, the copies resolve before the original spell, so they can’t shuffle Stream of Thought into your library.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Stream of Thought is still on the stack while you choose cards in your graveyard to shuffle into your library. It can’t shuffle itself into your library.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The copies that replicate creates are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You choose which cards to shuffle into your library while Stream of Thought is resolving. If you target yourself with Stream of Thought, you may choose any of the four cards that you put into your graveyard or any cards that were there before.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You’ll copy Stream of Thought for each time you paid its replicate cost, even if it’s countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you somehow control Mirrodin Besieged and no choice was made for it, it has neither of the two triggered abilities.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you support the Mirrans, Mirrodin Besieged’s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you support the Phyrexians, you must choose a target opponent as your end step begins. Whether that player loses the game is determined only as the ability resolves. This means that the card you discard may be the fifteenth artifact card that causes the target player to lose the game, but it also means that if there is no legal target opponent, you won’t draw or discard.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, if one player on a team loses the game, that team loses the game.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'If you turn Fountain of Ichor into a creature but haven’t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won’t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Igneous Elemental costs only {2} less to cast if you have more than one land card in your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Rank Officer’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'While resolving Rank Officer’s triggered ability, you can’t discard multiple cards to create multiple Zombie tokens.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Protection from a color means that the equipped creature can’t be blocked by creatures of that color, can’t be the target of spells of that color or abilities from sources of that color, can’t be enchanted or equipped by Auras or Equipment of that color, and all damage that sources of that color would deal to it is prevented. Nothing other than these events is prevented or illegal.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Saddled Rimestag doesn’t get more than +2/+2 if you had more than one other creature enter the battlefield under your control during a turn.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Saddled Rimestag’s effect applies even if the other creature entered the battlefield under your control before Saddled Rimestag entered the battlefield, and it continues to apply even if that creature leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Saddled Rimestag’s effect checks each turn whether it applies during that turn. It doesn’t check only during the turn it enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The ability that causes you to sacrifice an evoked creature is a triggered ability. Players may respond to this triggered ability while the creature is still on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The choice of creature type is made as Plague Engineer enters the battlefield. Players can’t respond to this choice. The -1/-1 effect starts applying immediately.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You must choose an existing creature type, such as Sliver or Warrior. Card types such as artifact, and supertypes such as legendary or snow, can’t be chosen.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Etchings of the Chosen can target any creature you control, not just one of the chosen type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Sliver or Warrior. Card types such as artifact, and supertypes such as legendary or snow, can\'t be chosen."}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The last ability of Knight of Old Benalia affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +1/+1.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The number of Goblins you control is counted only as Munitions Expert’s ability resolves. If Munitions Expert is still on the battlefield, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'The untap symbol, {Q}, functions the same as the tap symbol, only mirrored. You can’t pay the {Q} cost if Farmstead Gleaner is already untapped, and you must have controlled the creature continuously since your most recent turn began in order to pay {Q}.'}, {'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Untapping an attacking creature doesn’t remove it from combat.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'Throes of Chaos does nothing as it resolves. All of its chaos happens before it resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "When a spell you cast with retrace resolves or is countered, it\'s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Vengeful Devil’s ability can be activated even if a creature died only earlier in the turn before Vengeful Devil entered the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'When a spell you cast with retrace resolves or is countered, it’s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'While resolving Excavating Anurid’s triggered ability, you can’t sacrifice multiple lands to draw multiple cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You can sacrifice any Goblin you control to activate Sling-Gang Lieutenant’s activated ability, not just the ones its triggered ability creates. You can even sacrifice Sling-Gang Lieutenant itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You draw two cards and discard three cards all while Bazaar Trademage’s triggered ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You name the card as Cabal Therapist’s reflexive triggered ability resolves, not as it’s put onto the stack. Then the targeted player reveals their hand and discards if appropriate. No player may choose to take actions between you naming the card and the targeted player revealing and discarding.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'You return the attacking creature to its owner’s hand before the combat damage step. A creature returned this way neither deals nor is dealt combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-06-14', 'text': 'Zhalfirin Decoy’s ability can be activated even if a creature entered the battlefield under your control only before Zhalfirin Decoy entered the battlefield, and even if that creature has left the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A creature with exploit “exploited that creature” if the controller of the creature\'s exploit ability sacrificed a creature as the exploit ability resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If Silumgar Scavenger is dealt lethal damage at the same time as another creature you control, it won\'t receive a counter from its last ability in time to save it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t sacrifice more than one creature to any one exploit ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to sacrifice a creature and which creature to sacrifice as the exploit ability resolves. A creature can exploit itself.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'In a Limited event (usually Booster Draft or Sealed Deck), you can’t add basic snow lands to your card pool as you would other basic lands. You can play with basic snow lands only if you open them in your sealed deck or draft them.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but spells and abilities may refer to it.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Snow isn’t a type of mana. If an effect says you may spend mana as though it were any type, you can’t pay for {S} using mana that wasn’t produced by a snow source.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'Some cards have additional effects for each {S} spent to cast them. You can cast these spells even if you don’t spend any snow mana to cast them; their additional effects simply won’t do anything.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The Kaldheim set doesn’t have any cards with mana costs that include {S}, but some previous sets do. If an effect says such a spell costs {1} less to cast, that reduction doesn’t apply to any {S} costs. This is also true for activated abilities that include {S} in their activation costs and effects that reduce those costs.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'The {S} symbol is a generic mana symbol. It represents a cost that can be paid by one mana that was produced by a snow source. That mana can be any color or colorless.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Protection from Humans refers only to the creature type Human. As far as Yawgmoth is concerned, you, your opponents, and planeswalkers aren\'t Humans."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You may activate Yawgmoth\'s first activated ability without choosing a target creature. You\'ll just draw a card. However, if you choose a target and it becomes illegal before the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and you won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it, they’re removed in pairs as a state-based action until that permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it’s too late for anyone to respond.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can’t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You don’t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since “any number” includes zero, you don’t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don’t have to choose any players at all.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You can tap any untapped white creatures you control to pay for Battle Screech’s flashback cost, even ones you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it’s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you’re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card’s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': '“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise’s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because delve isn’t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Delve doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise’s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can’t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can’t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Because targets are chosen for activated abilities before costs (such as “Sacrifice an artifact”) are paid, Goblin Engineer’s second ability can’t target the artifact that will be sacrificed to pay its cost.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a card in a player’s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'A card with no mana cost can’t be cast normally; you’ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don’t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Exiling a card with suspend isn’t casting that card. This action doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card’s owner’s next upkeep.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can’t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it’s exiled.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you can’t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it’s on the stack).'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn’t paid.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn’t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.'}, {'date': '2021-06-18', 'text': 'You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage’s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You can cycle this card even if there are no legal targets for the triggered ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (because, for example, it has been countered, or all of its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve, and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If Pashalik Mons and one or more other Goblins you control die at the same time, its ability will trigger for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Pashalik Mons to pay the cost of its last ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'If you don’t play the card exiled with Urza’s last ability, it remains in exile.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'The token created by Urza’s first ability will count itself, so it’ll be at least 1/1.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Urza’s last ability doesn’t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining.'}, {'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped artifact you control to pay the cost of the mana ability, including an artifact creature you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn. Tapping an Equipment this way won’t affect its abilities or the equipped creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Piles may be empty.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "A card with no mana cost can\'t be cast normally; you\'ll need a way to cast it for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost, such as by suspending it."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Due to a recent rules change to suspend, you are no longer required to cast the suspended card as the second triggered ability of suspend resolves. Instead, as the second triggered ability resolves, you may cast the card. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored. If you don’t cast the card, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If a card with no mana cost is given an alternative cost equal to its mana cost (by Snapcaster Mage, for example), that cost cannot be paid and the card cannot be cast this way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that gives you the option to cast the card when the last time counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Aasfresser\', \'text\': \'Der Aasfresser kann nicht blocken.\\nOpfere eine Kreatur: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Aasfresser.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Die Taten der Märtyrer kümmern ihn wenig, wenn er sich an ihren Überresten labt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464284&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecccc4b8-e0c7-4cef-9bf6-74ee551eb357\', \'multiverseId\': 464284}, \'multiverseid\': 464284}, {\'name\': \'Comedor de carroña\', \'text\': \'El Comedor de carroña no puede bloquear.\\nSacrificar una criatura: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Comedor de carroña.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'No tiene ningún respeto por las hazañas de los mártires. Para él, sus legados no son más que un puñado de carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8ba7d6c-0cbb-412f-87d3-6fce7899f15f\', \'multiverseId\': 464538}, \'multiverseid\': 464538}, {\'name\': \'Bouffeur de charogne\', \'text\': \'Le Bouffeur de charogne ne peut pas bloquer.\\nSacrifiez une créature : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Bouffeur de charogne.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'a aucun respect pour les actes des martyrs, dont il réduit l\'héritage à une bouchée de chair.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464792&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'417a7c95-9480-4f34-b337-e6f23f106171\', \'multiverseId\': 464792}, \'multiverseid\': 464792}, {\'name\': \'Mangiacarogne\', \'text\': \'Il Mangiacarogne non può bloccare.\\nSacrifica una creatura: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Mangiacarogne.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Non mostra alcun rispetto per le gesta dei martiri, riducendo il loro retaggio a un boccone di carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec78b91-9dc9-47c6-b957-8cdc4d2f54b1\', \'multiverseId\': 465046}, \'multiverseid\': 465046}, {\'name\': \'屍肉喰らい\', \'text\': \'屍肉喰らいではブロックできない。\\nクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：屍肉喰らいの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'殉教者たちの功績には何らの尊敬も払わず、遺産を肉片に変えてゆく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ad0f42-9169-4c36-b73a-d10471d3a99d\', \'multiverseId\': 465300}, \'multiverseid\': 465300}, {\'name\': \'시체포식자\', \'text\': \'시체포식자는 방어할 수 없다.\\n생물 한 개를 희생한다: 시체포식자에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 순교자의 업적에는 관심이 없고, 그들의 유산을 한 줌의 살점으로 만들어 놓을 뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'410df07e-4163-4e21-aad7-bc762014eb03\', \'multiverseId\': 465554}, \'multiverseid\': 465554}, {\'name\': \'Comedor de Podridão\', \'text\': \'Comedor de Podridão não pode bloquear.\\nSacrifique uma criatura: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Comedor de Podridão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Ele não tem respeito pelos feitos dos mártires, reduzindo seus legados a um punhado de carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c0adba5-028e-4e37-a91f-6d9cda62103e\', \'multiverseId\': 465808}, \'multiverseid\': 465808}, {\'name\': \'Пожиратель Падали\', \'text\': \'Пожиратель Падали не может блокировать.\\nПожертвуйте существо: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Пожирателя Падали.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Он нисколько не уважает деяния мучеников, сводя их наследие к перемолотой зубами плоти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6fe509d-785e-44c7-a9cd-4e40860e7093\', \'multiverseId\': 466062}, \'multiverseid\': 466062}, {\'name\': \'腐食怪\', \'text\': \'腐食怪不能进行阻挡。\\n牺牲一个生物：在腐食怪上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'它对烈士事迹毫无敬意，以其残存遗躯大快朵颐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec9980a1-f3fa-4d67-ad3a-2ea06c02f613\', \'multiverseId\': 466316}, \'multiverseid\': 466316}, {\'name\': \'腐食怪\', \'text\': \'腐食怪不能進行阻擋。\\n犧牲一個生物：在腐食怪上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'它對烈士事跡毫無敬意，以其殘存遺軀大快朵頤。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a94abcd-aba3-49ba-8223-6aba79e1d3ff\', \'multiverseId\': 466570}, \'multiverseid\': 466570}]', "[{'name': 'Aaswitwen-Rudel', 'text': 'Reichweite\\n{3}{B}{G}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen 1/2 grünen Spinne-Kreaturenspielstein mit Reichweite, dann verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt für jede Spinne, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Spinne', 'flavor': 'Für jede, die du siehst, sehen dich zehn.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464415&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edd52aa2-3023-423e-adad-36f662e39d4f', 'multiverseId': 464415}, 'multiverseid': 464415}, {'name': 'Nido de viudas pútridas', 'text': 'Alcance.\\n{3}{B}{G}, exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha de criatura Araña verde 1/2 con la habilidad de alcance. Luego, cada oponente pierde 1 vida por cada Araña que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Araña', 'flavor': 'Por cada una que veas, diez te ven a ti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464669&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b11dbda-ea13-4930-8cad-2ebc86b4b51e', 'multiverseId': 464669}, 'multiverseid': 464669}, {'name': 'Meute de veuves de putréfaction', 'text': 'Portée\\n{3}{B}{G}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Créez un jeton de créature 1/2 verte Araignée avec la portée, puis chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie pour chaque araignée que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature : araignée', 'flavor': 'Quand vous en voyez une, il y en a dix qui vous observent.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464923&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19ab7732-d355-4e80-a24f-83c3394008ba', 'multiverseId': 464923}, 'multiverseid': 464923}, {'name': 'Branco di Vedove Putride', 'text': 'Raggiungere\\n{3}{B}{G}, Esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina creatura Ragno 1/2 verde con raggiungere, poi ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita per ogni Ragno che controlli.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ragno', 'flavor': 'Per ognuna che vedi, altre dieci vedono te.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465177&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27189294-8287-4923-9784-ceb194173a72', 'multiverseId': 465177}, 'multiverseid': 465177}, {'name': '腐後家蜘蛛の群れ', 'text': '到達\\n{3}{B}{G}, あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：到達を持つ緑の１/２の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。その後、各対戦相手はそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしている蜘蛛１体につき１点のライフを失う。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛', 'flavor': '一匹見かけたら、十匹に見られている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465431&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce7d3ec9-f7c7-43ec-a3e2-85c4df7d75cb', 'multiverseId': 465431}, 'multiverseid': 465431}, {'name': '썩은과부거미 무리', 'text': '대공\\n{3}{B}{G}, 당신의 무덤에서 생물 카드 한 장을 추방한다: 대공을 가진 1/2 녹색 거미 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든 후, 각 상대는 당신이 조종하는 거미 한 개당 생명 1점을 잃는다.', 'type': '생물 — 거미', 'flavor': '당신이 한 마리를 보고 있을 때, 열 마리가 당신을 보고 있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465685&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0df2344-fa9d-48b9-9174-d4c81ef975c7', 'multiverseId': 465685}, 'multiverseid': 465685}, {'name': 'Bando de Viúvas-pútridas', 'text': 'Alcance\\n{3}{B}{G}, exile um card de criatura de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha de criatura verde 1/2 do tipo Aranha com alcance. Em seguida, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida para cada Aranha que você controla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Aranha', 'flavor': 'Para cada uma que você vê, dez veem você.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465939&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fb7b135-f548-4355-8ae0-dddcbaf96397', 'multiverseId': 465939}, 'multiverseid': 465939}, {'name': 'Стая Гнилостных Вдов', 'text': 'Захват\\n{3}{B}{G}, изгоните карту существа из вашего кладбища: создайте одну фишку существа 1/2 зеленый Паук с Захватом, затем каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь за каждого Паука под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Существо — Паук', 'flavor': 'На каждую, которую ты видишь, приходится десять, наблюдающих за тобой.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466193&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '747ddba5-8771-4016-8d22-45e5dc479b72', 'multiverseId': 466193}, 'multiverseid': 466193}, {'name': '朽寡妇蛛群', 'text': '延势\\n{3}{B}{G}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌：派出一个1/2绿色，具延势异能的蜘蛛衍生生物，然后你每操控一个蜘蛛，每位对手便各失去1点生命。', 'type': '生物 ～蜘蛛', 'flavor': '你看到一只，就有十只盯上你。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466447&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0172bae-570a-4128-ba18-049b98a08a1d', 'multiverseId': 466447}, 'multiverseid': 466447}, {'name': '朽寡婦蛛群', 'text': '延勢\\n{3}{B}{G}，從你的墳墓場放逐一張生物牌：派出一個1/2綠色，具延勢異能的蜘蛛衍生生物，然後你每操控一個蜘蛛，每位對手便各失去1點生命。', 'type': '生物 ～蜘蛛', 'flavor': '你看到一隻，就有十隻盯上你。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466701&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02d9a79e-7a4d-45a3-8705-41a7487b7933', 'multiverseId': 466701}, 'multiverseid': 466701}]", "[{'name': 'Abgelegene Steppe', 'text': 'Die Abgelegene Steppe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}.\\nUmwandlung {W} ({W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464448&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1617d4ed-1e14-48c4-925c-f200e4af99f2', 'multiverseId': 464448}, 'multiverseid': 464448}, {'name': 'Estepa aislada', 'text': 'La Estepa aislada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}.\\nCiclo {W}. ({W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464702&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dba0b49f-60a7-42f4-886a-46e9885b35f1', 'multiverseId': 464702}, 'multiverseid': 464702}, {'name': 'Steppes retirées', 'text': 'Les Steppes retirées arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}.\\nRecyclage {W} ({W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464956&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2566f16a-b1f9-4952-9253-d080ad5e2ebf', 'multiverseId': 464956}, 'multiverseid': 464956}, {'name': 'Steppa Isolata', 'text': 'La Steppa Isolata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}.\\nCiclo {W} ({W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465210&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '903c59b3-89b5-4bf0-9008-935cf6493497', 'multiverseId': 465210}, 'multiverseid': 465210}, {'name': '隔離されたステップ', 'text': '隔離されたステップはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。\\nサイクリング{W}（{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465464&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a1e9283-a9e1-49e6-bb49-8455be7b6f64', 'multiverseId': 465464}, 'multiverseid': 465464}, {'name': '외딴 초원', 'text': '외딴 초원은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {W}를 추가한다.\\n순환 {W} ({W}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465718&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf582a1a-a1ae-41c7-8dd2-394813565743', 'multiverseId': 465718}, 'multiverseid': 465718}, {'name': 'Estepe Remota', 'text': 'Estepe Remota entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}.\\nReciclar {W} ({W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465972&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71da8705-353f-44a6-8b02-931ae2242182', 'multiverseId': 465972}, 'multiverseid': 465972}, {'name': 'Далекая Степь', 'text': 'Далекая Степь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}.\\nЦикл {W} ({W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466226&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8416ffc-9c7e-429f-9fe4-e6f38bc0a40d', 'multiverseId': 466226}, 'multiverseid': 466226}, {'name': '远僻草原', 'text': '远僻草原须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}。\\n循环{W}（{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466480&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f8e06c8-76c7-4bb2-bbb5-8fd3f53608d6', 'multiverseId': 466480}, 'multiverseid': 466480}, {'name': '遠僻草原', 'text': '遠僻草原須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{W}。\\n循環{W}（{W}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466734&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a0465b9-322a-4d84-9eb8-8f91b7beddfb', 'multiverseId': 466734}, 'multiverseid': 466734}]", '[{\'name\': \'Abscheulicher Baumhirte\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nStärke und Widerstandskraft des Abscheulichen Baumhirten sind gleich der Anzahl an verschneiten bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst.\\nWenn der Abscheuliche Baumhirte ins Spiel kommt, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Die Kreatur enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Baumhirte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464397&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3280807c-cb2b-4af8-a182-25354a1cf0e6\', \'multiverseId\': 464397}, \'multiverseid\': 464397}, {\'name\': \'Pueblo arbóreo abominable\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nTanto la fuerza como la resistencia del Pueblo arbóreo abominable son iguales a la cantidad de permanentes nevados que controlas.\\nCuando el Pueblo arbóreo abominable entre al campo de batalla, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente. Esa criatura no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f94e043-0e00-480e-93d1-eb1d479058c2\', \'multiverseId\': 464651}, \'multiverseid\': 464651}, {\'name\': \'Abominable sylvin\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLa force et l\'endurance de l\'Abominable sylvin sont chacune égales au nombre de permanents neigeux que vous contrôlez.\\nQuand l\'Abominable sylvin arrive sur le champ de bataille, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Cette créature ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : sylvin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464905&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61b078b-5b6d-4764-ae2a-56e38a996517\', \'multiverseId\': 464905}, \'multiverseid\': 464905}, {\'name\': \'Silvantropo Abominevole\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nLa forza e la costituzione del Silvantropo Abominevole sono pari al numero di permanenti neve che controlli.\\nQuando il Silvantropo Abominevole entra nel campo di battaglia, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario. Quella creatura non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a289ca59-ecd0-4119-a352-f946349c0adc\', \'multiverseId\': 465159}, \'multiverseid\': 465159}, {\'name\': \'忌まわしきツリーフォーク\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n忌まわしきツリーフォークのパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールしている氷雪パーマネントの総数に等しい。\\n忌まわしきツリーフォークが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。そのクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44f7d2fd-c4d5-4e7b-b366-84ef95c58cb2\', \'multiverseId\': 465413}, \'multiverseid\': 465413}, {\'name\': \'혐오스러운 인목\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n혐오스러운 인목의 공격력과 방어력은 각각 당신이 조종하는 눈 지속물의 개수와 같다.\\n혐오스러운 인목이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다. 그 생물은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'눈 생물 — 인목\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65096fcb-1bb1-464b-bcd4-17229290c2cd\', \'multiverseId\': 465667}, \'multiverseid\': 465667}, {\'name\': \'Ent Abominável\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nO poder e a resistência de Ent Abominável são iguais ao número de permanentes da neve que você controla.\\nQuando Ent Abominável entrar no campo de batalha, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla. Aquela criatura não é desvirada durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Ent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'344b2a04-695b-4d7d-9295-72c0756b2edb\', \'multiverseId\': 465921}, \'multiverseid\': 465921}, {\'name\': \'Мерзкий Лесовик\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nСила и выносливость Мерзкого Лесовика равны количеству снежных перманентов под вашим контролем.\\nКогда Мерзкий Лесовик выходит на поле битвы, поверните целевое существо под контролем оппонента. То существо не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Снежное Существо — Лесовик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abad0b42-150f-48a1-b2e7-1ec90fd206f8\', \'multiverseId\': 466175}, \'multiverseid\': 466175}, {\'name\': \'大无畏树妖\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n大无畏树妖的力量和防御力各等同于由你操控的雪境永久物数量。\\n当大无畏树妖进战场时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。该生物于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～树妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df626fab-a42d-4d4f-8c75-3919a0784931\', \'multiverseId\': 466429}, \'multiverseid\': 466429}, {\'name\': \'大無畏樹妖\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n大無畏樹妖的力量和防禦力各等同於由你操控的雪境永久物數量。\\n當大無畏樹妖進戰場時，橫置目標由對手操控的生物。該生物於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～樹妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'408fa0ce-2c91-4ac5-a658-96870031b0ca\', \'multiverseId\': 466683}, \'multiverseid\': 466683}]', '[{\'name\': \'Agonie des Chaos\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet als dieser Zauberspruch. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nZurückverfolgen (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Länderkarte abwirfst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464353&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'021b9fdd-3211-4067-9ffd-176f9435912a\', \'multiverseId\': 464353}, \'multiverseid\': 464353}, {\'name\': \'Aguijonazos del caos\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\\nDesandar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta de tierra además de pagar sus otros costes.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca83ca2-53d6-485a-8a32-21ce2fbd986a\', \'multiverseId\': 464607}, \'multiverseid\': 464607}, {\'name\': \'Affres du chaos\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nPistage (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte de terrain en plus de payer ses autres coûts.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464861&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49a801b-0c54-4952-8889-a22a62376e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 464861}, \'multiverseid\': 464861}, {\'name\': \'In Preda al Caos\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\\nRievocare (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero scartando una carta terra oltre a pagare gli altri suoi costi.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53447d86-d3f6-4179-bafb-fa3baaff4cae\', \'multiverseId\': 465115}, \'multiverseid\': 465115}, {\'name\': \'混沌の辛苦\', \'text\': \'続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカードが追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ追放する。あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\n回顧（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードを、他のコストの支払いに加えて土地・カード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28c590d1-93be-48ab-8f5d-19ffad85aca4\', \'multiverseId\': 465369}, \'multiverseid\': 465369}, {\'name\': \'혼돈의 고통\', \'text\': \'연쇄 (당신이 이 주문을 발동할 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위에서 비용이 더 적은 대지가 아닌 카드를 추방할 때까지 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 추방된 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.)\\n회고 (당신은 이 카드의 다른 비용들을 지불하는 것에 추가로 대지 카드 한 장을 버리는 것으로 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'806d5f6a-6b7d-4698-b435-5ed0735f4ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 465623}, \'multiverseid\': 465623}, {\'name\': \'Aflição do Caos\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile os cards do topo do seu grimório até exilar um que não seja terreno e que tenha custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\\nRetraçar (Você pode conjurar este card do seu cemitério ao descartar um card de terreno além de pagar seus outros custos.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b1fe516-96e7-4988-87f7-3346e6750d97\', \'multiverseId\': 465877}, \'multiverseid\': 465877}, {\'name\': \'Спазмы Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Каскад (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, изгоняйте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не изгоните не являющуюся землей и стоящую меньше карту. Вы можете разыграть ее без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Положите изгнанные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.)\\nВозвращение (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища, сбросив карту земли в дополнение к оплате других ее стоимостей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e01d92fa-cb6c-408c-b46f-606e5caf74f5\', \'multiverseId\': 466131}, \'multiverseid\': 466131}, {\'name\': \'混沌苦痛\', \'text\': \'倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。）\\n追溯（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，但必须支付其所需费用并额外弃一张地牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f2246b-1238-476d-9657-f3fbf38fa68c\', \'multiverseId\': 466385}, \'multiverseid\': 466385}, {\'name\': \'混沌苦痛\', \'text\': \'傾曳（當你施放此咒語時，從你的牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張費用比此咒語低的非地牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將所放逐的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。）\\n追溯（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，但必須支付其所需費用並額外棄一張地牌。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db179921-31bf-464a-ab4a-eb043db9edaf\', \'multiverseId\': 466639}, \'multiverseid\': 466639}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alle Möglichkeiten ausschöpfen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 2, ziehe dann eine Karte.\\nRückblende {4}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'In der Zukunft nach Antworten zu suchen, wirft oft nur weitere Fragen auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464270&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362de1cf-bc98-4656-9aea-a99cee28309c\', \'multiverseId\': 464270}, \'multiverseid\': 464270}, {\'name\': \'Explorar todas las posibilidades\', \'text\': \'Adivina 2, luego roba una carta.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Buscar respuestas en el futuro a menudo lleva a más preguntas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad546fd5-437c-4c06-b3c7-4ea71a1df972\', \'multiverseId\': 464524}, \'multiverseid\': 464524}, {\'name\': \'Examiner toutes les possibilités\', \'text\': \'Regard 2, puis piochez une carte.\\nFlashback {4}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Chercher des réponses dans l\'avenir mène souvent à davantage de questions.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464778&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c5917d-adec-42e1-8a74-278f4047cede\', \'multiverseId\': 464778}, \'multiverseid\': 464778}, {\'name\': \'Setacciare Ogni Possibilità\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 2, poi pesca una carta.\\nFlashback {4}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Cercare risposte nel futuro spesso conduce a ulteriori domande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e0f07d2-5e02-4f21-b6ec-31b608ad6175\', \'multiverseId\': 465032}, \'multiverseid\': 465032}, {\'name\': \'全可能性の究明\', \'text\': \'占術２を行い、その後カードを１枚引く。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'答えを求めて未来を探ると、大抵は疑問が増える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a728fe-86a3-4eb6-868b-599d4fdcb866\', \'multiverseId\': 465286}, \'multiverseid\': 465286}, {\'name\': \'모든 가능성 탐색\', \'text\': \'점술 2를 한 후, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n회상 {4}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'답을 알아내기 위해 미래를 탐색하는 일은 종종 더 많은 질문으로 이어진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'465cea52-5153-4869-8102-e0829084e697\', \'multiverseId\': 465540}, \'multiverseid\': 465540}, {\'name\': \'Explorar Todas as Possibilidades\', \'text\': \'Use vidência 2, depois compre um card.\\nRecapitular {4}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Buscar respostas no futuro muitas vezes leva a mais perguntas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9096c7f7-367d-4c74-9012-f34d72e0150b\', \'multiverseId\': 465794}, \'multiverseid\': 465794}, {\'name\': \'Проработка Возможностей\', \'text\': \'Предскажите 2, затем возьмите карту.\\nВоспоминание {4}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Поиски ответов в будущем зачастую приводят к новым вопросам.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a018e2c-6bab-47a7-8487-8fb16230ba18\', \'multiverseId\': 466048}, \'multiverseid\': 466048}, {\'name\': \'遍历愿景\', \'text\': \'占卜2，然后抓一张牌。\\n返照{4}{U}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'从未来探寻答案，往往会发现更多问题。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf24a7c3-1b2c-4eaf-8ab0-d06a51fee36c\', \'multiverseId\': 466302}, \'multiverseid\': 466302}, {\'name\': \'遍歷願景\', \'text\': \'占卜2，然後抽一張牌。\\n返照{4}{U}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'從未來中探尋答案，往往會發現更多的問題。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57158abd-1d52-4579-89ad-7292561e4a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 466556}, \'multiverseid\': 466556}]', "[{'name': 'Alpiner Wegefinder', 'text': 'Wenn der Alpine Wegefinder ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Gebirge-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\\nDer Alpine Wegefinder greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nWenn der Alpine Wegefinder das Spiel verlässt, opfere ein Gebirge.', 'type': 'Verschneite Kreatur — Mensch, Späher', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464320&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d06747b-5ff2-4a9c-b4c7-fa2683fc3d1c', 'multiverseId': 464320}, 'multiverseid': 464320}, {'name': 'Guía alpino', 'text': 'Cuando el Guía alpino entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Montaña, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\nEl Guía alpino ataca cada combate si puede.\\nCuando el Guía alpino deje el campo de batalla, sacrifica una Montaña.', 'type': 'Criatura nevada — Explorador humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464574&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc665541-cda7-477a-8dc7-a05e191af3e2', 'multiverseId': 464574}, 'multiverseid': 464574}, {'name': 'Guide alpin', 'text': 'Quand le Guide alpin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de montagne dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\nLe Guide alpin attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\nQuand le Guide alpin quitte le champ de bataille, sacrifiez une montagne.', 'type': 'Créature neigeuse : humain et éclaireur', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464828&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c1a1ce8-42f1-4d62-a2c8-c1d77b35ad75', 'multiverseId': 464828}, 'multiverseid': 464828}, {'name': 'Guida Alpina', 'text': 'Quando la Guida Alpina entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Montagna, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\nLa Guida Alpina attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nQuando la Guida Alpina lascia il campo di battaglia, sacrifica una Montagna.', 'type': 'Creatura Neve — Esploratore Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465082&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '04f6604e-e3f8-474e-9d17-94bea1cf0b29', 'multiverseId': 465082}, 'multiverseid': 465082}, {'name': '高山の案内人', 'text': '高山の案内人が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから山・カード１枚を探し、そのカードをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n各戦闘で、高山の案内人は可能なら攻撃する。\\n高山の案内人が戦場を離れたとき、山１つを生け贄に捧げる。', 'type': '氷雪クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465336&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed4feda0-058e-4fcf-a6ed-7e29a9393ad7', 'multiverseId': 465336}, 'multiverseid': 465336}, {'name': '고산지대 안내인', 'text': '고산지대 안내인이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 산 카드 한 장을 찾아, 탭된 채로 전장에 놓을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n고산지대 안내인은 가능하면 매 전투마다 공격한다.\\n고산지대 안내인이 전장을 떠날 때, 산 한 개를 희생한다.', 'type': '눈 생물 — 인간 정찰병', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465590&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5416f6de-4ae9-483d-b039-827946699377', 'multiverseId': 465590}, 'multiverseid': 465590}, {'name': 'Guia Alpino', 'text': 'Quando Guia Alpino entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de Montanha em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\\nGuia Alpino ataca a cada combate se estiver apto.\\nQuando Guia Alpino deixar o campo de batalha, sacrifique uma Montanha.', 'type': 'Criatura da Neve — Humano Batedor', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465844&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7287430-1bf9-4536-b267-0b62581234e3', 'multiverseId': 465844}, 'multiverseid': 465844}, {'name': 'Горный Проводник', 'text': 'Когда Горный Проводник выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Горы, положить ту карту на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\\nГорный Проводник атакует в каждом бою, если может.\\nКогда Горный Проводник покидает поле битвы, пожертвуйте Гору.', 'type': 'Снежное Существо — Человек Разведчик', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466098&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1daeba7-bf9c-4ceb-8a4f-f5ad5870f33e', 'multiverseId': 466098}, 'multiverseid': 466098}, {'name': '山地向导', 'text': '当山地向导进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张山脉牌，将该牌横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n山地向导每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n当山地向导离开战场时，牺牲一个山脉。', 'type': '雪境生物 ～人类／斥候', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466352&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4b8291e-c2e7-49a6-9036-ceaee36489b1', 'multiverseId': 466352}, 'multiverseid': 466352}, {'name': '山地嚮導', 'text': '當山地嚮導進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張山脈牌，將該牌橫置放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\\n山地嚮導每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\\n當山地嚮導離開戰場時，犧牲一個山脈。', 'type': '雪境生物 ～人類／斥候', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466606&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4171c8d3-f443-4f77-9d64-e4183d535d51', 'multiverseId': 466606}, 'multiverseid': 466606}]", '[{\'name\': \'Altar des Wahnsinns\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl legt so viele Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof, wie die Stärke der geopferten Kreatur beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Es geht nicht darum, dass du wahnsinnig wirst. Es geht darum, dass du darum betteln wirst, wahnsinnig zu werden."\\n—Volrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d0c3a8c-0a42-4148-b8fe-0d8a81fe17c5\', \'multiverseId\': 464421}, \'multiverseid\': 464421}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la demencia\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: El jugador objetivo pone en su cementerio una cantidad de cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"No es que te vuelvas demente. Es que suplicarás la demencia".\\n—Volrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35729d14-3374-49bc-86e3-c065b2e7e051\', \'multiverseId\': 464675}, \'multiverseid\': 464675}, {\'name\': \'Autel de la démence\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez une créature : Le joueur ciblé met dans son cimetière, depuis le dessus de sa bibliothèque, un nombre de cartes égal à la force de la créature sacrifiée.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous ne deviendrez pas fou, mais vous supplierez de le devenir. »\\n—Wöhlrajh\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464929&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e67da51-78f4-40b9-83fc-eca8ec09b925\', \'multiverseId\': 464929}, \'multiverseid\': 464929}, {\'name\': \'Altare della Demenza\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero un numero di carte pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata dalla cima del suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Non voglio dire che impazzirai, ma piuttosto che pregherai di impazzire!"\\n—Volrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3baea268-ed5f-4a9d-b6b8-d34b7f7c7879\', \'multiverseId\': 465183}, \'multiverseid\': 465183}, {\'name\': \'狂気の祭壇\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上から、その生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前が狂気になるわけではない。狂気にしてくれと哀願するようになるのさ。」\\n――ヴォルラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc4c002-2d9b-43b2-b0ad-01009b1537fb\', \'multiverseId\': 465437}, \'multiverseid\': 465437}, {\'name\': \'광기의 제단\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 희생한다: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 희생된 생물의 공격력만큼 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"네가 미칠 것이라는 말이 아니다. 네가 미치게 해 달라고 애걸할 거라는 말이지."\\n—볼래스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43d689dc-4518-42fd-a9dc-91813938bac1\', \'multiverseId\': 465691}, \'multiverseid\': 465691}, {\'name\': \'Altar da Demência\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: O jogador alvo coloca uma quantidade de cards igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Não é que você vá enlouquecer. Você vai implorar pela loucura."\\n— Volrath\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ee1724d-d868-4463-8033-c9b988146c8f\', \'multiverseId\': 465945}, \'multiverseid\': 465945}, {\'name\': \'Алтарь Слабоумия\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте существо: целевой игрок кладет количество карт, равное силе пожертвованного существа, с верха своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Дело не в том, что ты сойдешь с ума. Дело в том, что ты будешь умолять о сумасшествии».\\n— Волрат\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469437b6-b3fb-4b2a-97de-554f476db4ad\', \'multiverseId\': 466199}, \'multiverseid\': 466199}, {\'name\': \'痴呆祭坛\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：目标牌手将其牌库顶若干牌置入其坟墓场，其数量等同于所牺牲之生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「这不是说你将要疯狂，而是你会盼望发狂。」\\n～瓦拉司\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3eab606-1cfb-4524-878a-e5a660302978\', \'multiverseId\': 466453}, \'multiverseid\': 466453}, {\'name\': \'癡呆祭壇\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物：目標玩家將其牌庫頂若干牌置入其墳墓場，其數量等同於所犧牲之生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「這不是說你將要瘋狂，而是你會盼望發狂。」\\n～瓦拉司\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cbbb0b7-5035-415d-8b05-48166bae62a1\', \'multiverseId\': 466707}, \'multiverseid\': 466707}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amorphe Axt\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+0 und hat alle Kreaturentypen.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Waffe, die in jede Hand passt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464422&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cc198a4-b8e9-45fd-a1e8-f8ac97ffd566\', \'multiverseId\': 464422}, \'multiverseid\': 464422}, {\'name\': \'Hacha amorfa\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+0 y es de todos los tipos de criatura.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Un arma forjada para todo tipo de mano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93356151-1825-408b-8560-8278f4cdbf79\', \'multiverseId\': 464676}, \'multiverseid\': 464676}, {\'name\': \'Hache amorphe\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +3/+0 et a tous les types de créature.\\nÉquipement {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Une arme forgée pour toutes les mains.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464930&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af38c2bb-c2b6-4b02-8a98-4d6afb124bd7\', \'multiverseId\': 464930}, \'multiverseid\': 464930}, {\'name\': \'Ascia Amorfa\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+0 e ha tutti i tipi di creatura.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Un\'arma forgiata per qualsiasi mano.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077c066c-99cd-4897-8bb7-f0dc5454ff79\', \'multiverseId\': 465184}, \'multiverseid\': 465184}, {\'name\': \'不定形の斧\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋０の修整を受け、すべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'誰の手にも馴染む武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e79a8722-2407-42a8-bf39-9a028ba95055\', \'multiverseId\': 465438}, \'multiverseid\': 465438}, {\'name\': \'비정형 도끼\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +3/+0을 받고 모든 생물 유형이다.\\n장착 {3}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'모든 손을 위해 주조된 무기.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd3ed2dd-ee9c-42ac-9d0f-61e62d73119c\', \'multiverseId\': 465692}, \'multiverseid\': 465692}, {\'name\': \'Machado Amorfo\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+0 e é de todos os tipos de criatura.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Uma arma forjada para todas as mãos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c7792b-e739-4920-bf9e-ffb3d0b81db2\', \'multiverseId\': 465946}, \'multiverseid\': 465946}, {\'name\': \'Аморфный Топор\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +3/+0 и обладает всеми типами существа.\\nСнарядить {3}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Оружие, выкованное для каждой руки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c23a7b3-30f5-4724-9bbb-3bea4940bf59\', \'multiverseId\': 466200}, \'multiverseid\': 466200}, {\'name\': \'幻形斧\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+0且是所有生物类别。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'一柄为所有人铸造的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a214e0a-1924-4c91-9eb8-bec08677716e\', \'multiverseId\': 466454}, \'multiverseid\': 466454}, {\'name\': \'幻形斧\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+3/+0且是所有生物類別。\\n佩帶{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'一柄為所有人鑄造的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'118bcf5f-1522-4576-ab0c-b311eb1e73dd\', \'multiverseId\': 466708}, \'multiverseid\': 466708}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett des Erzmagiers\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht zwei Karten.\\n• Übernimm die Kontrolle über eine bleibende Nichtland-Karte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 1 oder weniger.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464243&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f898e36-724e-4d68-9da2-95a05ebe660b\', \'multiverseId\': 464243}, \'multiverseid\': 464243}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de archimago\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\\n• El jugador objetivo roba dos cartas.\\n• Gana el control del permanente objetivo que no sea tierra con coste de maná convertido de 1 o menos.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4655e43-293b-447c-8409-40b72071bac3\', \'multiverseId\': 464497}, \'multiverseid\': 464497}, {\'name\': "Charme de l\'archimage", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\\n• Le joueur ciblé pioche deux cartes.\\n• Acquérez le contrôle d\'un permanent non-terrain ciblé avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 1.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464751&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee462063-1916-4bb2-a02a-1d6dbceab16f\', \'multiverseId\': 464751}, \'multiverseid\': 464751}, {\'name\': "Amuleto dell\'Arcimago", \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\\n• Un giocatore bersaglio pesca due carte.\\n• Prendi il controllo di un permanente non terra bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 1.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12640315-302a-4f56-a9e3-1759bb133e2b\', \'multiverseId\': 465005}, \'multiverseid\': 465005}, {\'name\': \'大魔導師の魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカードを２枚引く。\\n• 点数で見たマナ・コストが１以下で土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4f05f2f-2764-4ef2-bd33-cb02756981fb\', \'multiverseId\': 465259}, \'multiverseid\': 465259}, {\'name\': \'대마도사의 부적\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\\n• 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.\\n• 전환마나비용이 1 이하인 대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물의 조종권을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0df4393a-0a80-43c8-b54d-e4aa5ad2544f\', \'multiverseId\': 465513}, \'multiverseid\': 465513}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto do Arquimago\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Anule a mágica alvo.\\n• O jogador alvo compra dois cards.\\n• Ganhe o controle da permanente alvo que não seja um terreno com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 1.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69937193-cb50-4201-91a3-3459b2ca2dd8\', \'multiverseId\': 465767}, \'multiverseid\': 465767}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Архимага\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Отмените целевое заклинание.\\n• Целевой игрок берет две карты.\\n• Получите контроль над целевым не являющимся землей перманентом с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 1.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'955335ab-8cea-4213-90e5-cf36aadb93ba\', \'multiverseId\': 466021}, \'multiverseid\': 466021}, {\'name\': \'大法师的护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•反击目标咒语。\\n•目标牌手抓两张牌。\\n•获得目标总法术力费用等于或小于1的非地永久物之操控权。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b50f6e3-e850-42c5-bec6-77f4df04ada8\', \'multiverseId\': 466275}, \'multiverseid\': 466275}, {\'name\': \'大法師的護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•反擊目標咒語。\\n•目標玩家抽兩張牌。\\n•獲得目標總魔法力費用等於或小於1的非地永久物之操控權。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87bd1519-3732-40dc-b2b6-ad77c8fc14ac\', \'multiverseId\': 466529}, \'multiverseid\': 466529}]', '[{\'name\': \'Antlitz der Gottheit\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2.\\nSolange eine andere Aura an die verzauberte Kreatur angelegt ist, hat sie Erstschlag und Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Reine Seelen strahlen hell wie die Morgendämmerung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464211&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e773c8c0-2b50-44be-ab07-80995c5c88e9\', \'multiverseId\': 464211}, \'multiverseid\': 464211}, {\'name\': \'Rostro de la divinidad\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2.\\nMientras otra Aura esté anexada a la criatura encantada, tiene las habilidades de dañar primero y vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Las almas puras relucen como el amanecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea103375-5a9a-4a42-a76a-2c4ac6fe8fea\', \'multiverseId\': 464465}, \'multiverseid\': 464465}, {\'name\': \'Visage de la divinité\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2.\\nTant qu\'une autre aura est attachée à la créature enchantée, elle a l\'initiative et le lien de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Les âmes pures brillent du même feu que l\'aube.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464719&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6166dd27-7e56-459b-8c02-380313a59dff\', \'multiverseId\': 464719}, \'multiverseid\': 464719}, {\'name\': \'Volto della Divinità\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2.\\nFintanto che un\'altra Aura è assegnata alla creatura incantata, ha attacco improvviso e legame vitale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "Le anime pure risplendono luminose come l\'aurora.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'899d1698-9cfc-44f9-ab8d-f355a53b7b9c\', \'multiverseId\': 464973}, \'multiverseid\': 464973}, {\'name\': \'聖なる顔\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーに他のオーラがつけられているかぎり、それは先制攻撃と絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'純粋な魂は夜明けのように明るく輝く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e5149c2-731b-48e6-a572-7fdb809b9cf0\', \'multiverseId\': 465227}, \'multiverseid\': 465227}, {\'name\': \'신성함의 단면\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +2/+2를 받는다.\\n부여된 생물에게 다른 마법진이 부착되어 있는 한, 부여된 생물은 선제공격과 생명연결을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'순수한 영혼은 동틀 녘처럼 환하게 빛난다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f936c94c-84ec-4905-ab9c-2c79af6af4de\', \'multiverseId\': 465481}, \'multiverseid\': 465481}, {\'name\': \'Face da Divindade\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2.\\nEnquanto outra Aura estiver anexada à criatura encantada, ela terá iniciativa e vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Almas puras brilham como o raiar do dia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce521509-a09d-4e3d-bd0b-6ce7a1228f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 465735}, \'multiverseid\': 465735}, {\'name\': \'Лик Божества\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2.\\nПока другая Аура прикреплена к зачарованному существу, у него есть Первый удар и Цепь жизни.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Чистые души сияют ярко, как заря.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66ffe21e-c34a-4662-b61c-004b8f35b7a3\', \'multiverseId\': 465989}, \'multiverseid\': 465989}, {\'name\': \'神圣威容\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2。\\n只要所结附的生物上结附有另一个灵气，该生物便具有先攻与系命异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'纯洁灵魂如破晓之光照耀世间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'642ecd06-4b17-4126-b6aa-78e73885d44d\', \'multiverseId\': 466243}, \'multiverseid\': 466243}, {\'name\': \'神聖威容\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2。\\n只要所結附的生物上結附有另一個靈氣，該生物便具有先攻與繫命異能。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'純潔靈魂如破曉之光照耀世間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'422ee314-d6a9-455f-a1d0-9fa1fe16af4e\', \'multiverseId\': 466497}, \'multiverseid\': 466497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arcums Astrolabium\', \'text\': \'({S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten bleibenden Karte bezahlt werden.)\\nWenn Arcums Astrolabium ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verschneites Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Auch wenn das Zeitalter des Eises vorbei ist, schlummern seine Relikte noch immer in Neu-Argivia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464423&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fc5ce6c-0f7d-48ed-8224-b16901d0fcf9\', \'multiverseId\': 464423}, \'multiverseid\': 464423}, {\'name\': \'Astrolabio de Arcum\', \'text\': \'({S} puede pagarse con un maná de un permanente nevado.)\\nCuando el Astrolabio de Arcum entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto nevado\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque los Tiempos Gélidos ya pasaron, sus reliquias aún duermen en Nueva Argivia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97bcff9e-3955-4dc0-ab63-bbab86d40232\', \'multiverseId\': 464677}, \'multiverseid\': 464677}, {\'name\': "Astrolabe d\'Arcum", \'text\': "({S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'un permanent neigeux.)\\nQuand l\'Astrolabe d\'Arcum arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact neigeux\', \'flavor\': \'Bien que le Temps des glaces soit révolu, ses reliques sommeillent toujours dans la Nouvelle Argive.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464931&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ebb7881-1e96-44bf-b45f-580a93b5948d\', \'multiverseId\': 464931}, \'multiverseid\': 464931}, {\'name\': \'Astrolabio di Arcum\', \'text\': "({S} può essere pagato con un mana da un permanente neve.)\\nQuando l\'Astrolabio di Arcum entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto Neve\', \'flavor\': \'Il Tempo dei Ghiacci si è concluso, ma le sue reliquie giacciono ancora sopite in Nuova Argivia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb553ffd-6e1b-4310-af99-6c283f91fd76\', \'multiverseId\': 465185}, \'multiverseid\': 465185}, {\'name\': \'アーカムの天測儀\', \'text\': \'（{S}は氷雪パーマネントからのマナ１点で支払える。）\\nアーカムの天測儀が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'氷雪アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'氷河期は去ったが、その遺物は今でも新アルガイヴで眠っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf8ca2b0-b199-4855-8cea-cb63587345a8\', \'multiverseId\': 465439}, \'multiverseid\': 465439}, {\'name\': \'아르쿰의 천문의\', \'text\': \'({S}는 눈 지속물의 마나 한 개로 지불할 수 있다.)\\n아르쿰의 천문의가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n{1}, {T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'눈 마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'얼음의 시대는 끝났지만, 그 유물들은 여전히 신 아르기브에 잠들어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9364f24-45f4-4cab-bcb6-9b7b8d83024d\', \'multiverseId\': 465693}, \'multiverseid\': 465693}, {\'name\': \'Astrolábio de Arcum\', \'text\': \'({S} pode ser pago com um mana de uma permanente da neve.)\\nQuando Astrolábio de Arcum entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato da Neve\', \'flavor\': \'Embora o Tempo de Gelo tenha terminado, suas relíquias ainda hibernam no Novo Argivo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1112e0f3-b28e-4ecf-8ffd-e0f08470d469\', \'multiverseId\': 465947}, \'multiverseid\': 465947}, {\'name\': \'Астролябия Аркума\', \'text\': \'({S} можно оплатить одной маной от снежного перманента.)\\nКогда Астролябия Аркума выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\n{1}, {T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Снежный Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Эпоха Льда закончилась, но ее реликвии до сих пор дремлют в Новом Аргиве.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d28c561a-aa41-4c26-bc6f-fa98632746cc\', \'multiverseId\': 466201}, \'multiverseid\': 466201}, {\'name\': \'阿肯的星盘\', \'text\': \'（{S}能以产自雪境永久物的一点法术力来支付。）\\n当阿肯的星盘进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'雪境神器\', \'flavor\': \'虽然冰雪时代已经结束，其遗宝依旧沉睡于新阿基夫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'765aff62-7027-4852-9684-4ebe37e000de\', \'multiverseId\': 466455}, \'multiverseid\': 466455}, {\'name\': \'阿肯的星盤\', \'text\': \'（{S}能以產自雪境永久物的一點魔法力來支付。）\\n當阿肯的星盤進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n{1}，{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'雪境神器\', \'flavor\': \'雖然冰雪時代已經結束，其遺寶依舊沉睡於新阿基夫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86ad8990-5bfd-4ed7-81f9-5e631c09d46b\', \'multiverseId\': 466709}, \'multiverseid\': 466709}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arie der Flammen\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Arie der Flammen ins Spiel kommt, erhält jeder Gegner 10 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, lege eine Lyrikmarke auf die Arie der Flammen, dann fügt sie einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie Lyrikmarken auf ihr liegen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464321&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7daf0153-a975-4f31-80e6-541eb4dddb36\', \'multiverseId\': 464321}, \'multiverseid\': 464321}, {\'name\': \'Aria de la llama\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Aria de la llama entre al campo de batalla, cada oponente gana 10 vidas.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, pon un contador de estrofa sobre el Aria de la llama. Luego, hace una cantidad de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo igual a la cantidad de contadores de estrofa sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31ce4810-dfcb-4b8c-bee7-145b7172dd7a\', \'multiverseId\': 464575}, \'multiverseid\': 464575}, {\'name\': \'Aria de flammes\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Aria de flammes arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque adversaire gagne 10 points de vie.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, mettez un marqueur « verset » sur l\'Aria de flammes, puis il inflige un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de marqueurs « verset » sur lui à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464829&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99941fd4-d275-4662-b398-6f8e234b736d\', \'multiverseId\': 464829}, \'multiverseid\': 464829}, {\'name\': \'Assolo di Fiamme\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Assolo di Fiamme entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni avversario guadagna 10 punti vita.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, metti un segnalino versetto sull\'Assolo di Fiamme, poi l\'Assolo di Fiamme infligge a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio danno pari al numero di segnalini versetto su di esso.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ec9823-fff9-465f-84bb-6ff2cd143788\', \'multiverseId\': 465083}, \'multiverseid\': 465083}, {\'name\': \'炎のアリア\', \'text\': \'炎のアリアが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手はそれぞれ10点のライフを得る。\\nあなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。炎のアリアの上に詩句カウンターを１個置く。その後、これはそれに、これの上にある詩句カウンターの数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c4c4605-f1c5-4503-9d12-5a6c9be1c381\', \'multiverseId\': 465337}, \'multiverseid\': 465337}, {\'name\': \'불길의 아리아\', \'text\': \'불길의 아리아가 전장에 들어올 때, 각 상대는 생명 10점을 얻는다.\\n당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 불길의 아리아에 운문 카운터 한 개를 올려놓은 후, 불길의 아리아는 그 목표에게 불길의 아리아 위에 놓인 운문 카운터 수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5cc7f7a-057a-4721-b4a1-7aa2566893f6\', \'multiverseId\': 465591}, \'multiverseid\': 465591}, {\'name\': \'Ária de Chamas\', \'text\': \'Quando Ária de Chamas entra no campo de batalha, cada oponente ganha 10 pontos de vida.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, coloque um marcador de verso em Ária de Chamas. Em seguida, ela causa ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo uma quantidade de pontos de dano igual ao número de marcadores de verso.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d26d57d8-76d9-4a50-b513-366597bd9808\', \'multiverseId\': 465845}, \'multiverseid\': 465845}, {\'name\': \'Ария Пламени\', \'text\': \'Когда Ария Пламени выходит на поле битвы, каждый оппонент получает 10 жизней.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, положите один жетон стиха на Арию Пламени, затем она наносит целевому игроку или planeswalker-у повреждения, равные количеству жетонов стиха на ней.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bc64202-d809-48c4-84a7-b2b50bc0a2aa\', \'multiverseId\': 466099}, \'multiverseid\': 466099}, {\'name\': \'烈火咏叹\', \'text\': \'当烈火咏叹进战场时，每位对手各获得10点生命。\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，在烈火咏叹上放置一个词句指示物，然后它对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于其上词句指示物的数量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ab33db-37f9-4f06-b6c9-b28494564ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 466353}, \'multiverseid\': 466353}, {\'name\': \'烈火詠歎\', \'text\': \'當烈火詠歎進戰場時，每位對手各獲得10點生命。\\n每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，在烈火詠歎上放置一個詞句指示物，然後它對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於其上詞句指示物的數量。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1894ae-bd19-4848-8fe0-9758786c8a10\', \'multiverseId\': 466607}, \'multiverseid\': 466607}]', '[{\'name\': \'Astrale Wanderung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du die Astrale Wanderung umwandelst oder eine andere Karte umwandelst, während sich die Astrale Wanderung im Spiel befindet, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\\nUmwandlung {2}{W} ({2}{W}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464206&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e1d9db-7b1e-471e-b50f-537deddf7d14\', \'multiverseId\': 464206}, \'multiverseid\': 464206}, {\'name\': \'Deriva astral\', \'text\': \'Siempre que actives la habilidad de ciclo de la Deriva astral o de otra carta mientras la Deriva astral está en el campo de batalla, puedes exiliar la criatura objetivo. Si lo haces, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\\nCiclo {2}{W}. ({2}{W}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e147677b-df11-46ea-9ce9-a701f371f5dd\', \'multiverseId\': 464460}, \'multiverseid\': 464460}, {\'name\': \'Dérive astrale\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous recyclez la Dérive astrale ou que vous recyclez une autre carte pendant que la Dérive astrale est sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler la créature ciblée. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\\nRecyclage {2}{W} ({2}{W}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464714&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7feb7a78-69fc-4d7a-8c44-a7d8493a756f\', \'multiverseId\': 464714}, \'multiverseid\': 464714}, {\'name\': \'Deriva Astrale\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta cicli la Deriva Astrale o cicli un\'altra carta mentre la Deriva Astrale è sul campo di battaglia, puoi esiliare una creatura bersaglio. Se lo fai, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.\\nCiclo {2}{W} ({2}{W}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34c37826-b669-4b87-b297-c4ad22472877\', \'multiverseId\': 464968}, \'multiverseid\': 464968}, {\'name\': \'霊体の横滑り\', \'text\': \'あなたが霊体の横滑りをサイクリングするか、霊体の横滑りが戦場にある間に他のカードを１枚サイクリングするたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\nサイクリング{2}{W}（{2}{W}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6830f7ad-3bf8-4af7-9ab4-93c2998ed37d\', \'multiverseId\': 465222}, \'multiverseid\': 465222}, {\'name\': \'영체의 표류\', \'text\': \'당신이 영체의 표류를 순환하거나 영체의 표류가 전장에 있는 동안 다른 카드를 순환할 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 추방할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 다음 종료단 시작에 그 카드를 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n순환 {2}{W} ({2}{W}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d1ff2a-c8b3-4edb-a9ef-a1123da26ffe\', \'multiverseId\': 465476}, \'multiverseid\': 465476}, {\'name\': \'Deriva Astral\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você reciclar Deriva Astral ou reciclar qualquer outro card enquanto Deriva Astral estiver no campo de batalha, você poderá exilar a criatura alvo. Se fizer isso, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\\nReciclar {2}{W} ({2}{W}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03e10dc6-75cd-40d6-becc-f8c27952f8c4\', \'multiverseId\': 465730}, \'multiverseid\': 465730}, {\'name\': \'Астральный Полет\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл Астрального Полета или совершаете Цикл другой карты, пока Астральный Полет находится на поле битвы, вы можете изгнать целевое существо. Если вы это делаете, верните ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\\nЦикл {2}{W} ({2}{W}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abdb1895-c9db-4eec-8974-7f2729037a19\', \'multiverseId\': 465984}, \'multiverseid\': 465984}, {\'name\': \'星幽漂移\', \'text\': \'每当你循环星幽漂移，或于星幽漂移在战场上时循环另一张牌，你可以放逐目标生物。若你如此作，在下一个结束步骤开始时，将所放逐的牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\\n循环{2}{W}（{2}{W}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06fd6294-3bbf-499b-9db0-55a8b88bfeca\', \'multiverseId\': 466238}, \'multiverseid\': 466238}, {\'name\': \'星幽漂移\', \'text\': \'每當你循環星幽漂移，或於星幽漂移在戰場上時循環另一張牌，你可以放逐目標生物。若你如此作，在下一個結束步驟開始時，將所放逐的牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\\n循環{2}{W}（{2}{W}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'145343d1-6ff2-4f9e-80bd-ad31becf3409\', \'multiverseId\': 466492}, \'multiverseid\': 466492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auf dünnem Eis\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein verschneites Land, das du kontrollierst\\nWenn Auf dünnem Eis ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis Auf dünnem Eis das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Er verfluchte den Wind. Er verfluchte die Kälte. Doch als er das Eis betrat, verfluchte er sich selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464223&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0c7480e-486f-4b74-bc7a-fac8be80ddf2\', \'multiverseId\': 464223}, \'multiverseid\': 464223}, {\'name\': \'Situación delicada\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra nevada que controlas.\\nCuando la Situación delicada entre al campo de batalla, exilia la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente hasta que la Situación delicada deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento nevado — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Maldijo el viento. Maldijo el frío. Pero, al verse en esa situación, se maldijo a sí mismo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61514992-10fb-4d6d-add4-174bb0b030b2\', \'multiverseId\': 464477}, \'multiverseid\': 464477}, {\'name\': \'En terrain glissant\', \'text\': "Enchanter : un terrain neigeux que vous contrôlez\\nQuand En terrain glissant arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce qu\'En terrain glissant quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Enchantement neigeux : aura\', \'flavor\': "Il maudissait le vent. Il maudissait le froid. Mais en s\'aventurant sur la glace, il s\'était maudit lui-même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464731&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f6d0b5-0a76-4424-a077-4139360e6850\', \'multiverseId\': 464731}, \'multiverseid\': 464731}, {\'name\': \'Ghiaccio Sottile\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra neve che controlli\\nQuando il Ghiaccio Sottile entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario finché il Ghiaccio Sottile non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo Neve — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Malediva il vento, malediva il freddo, ma quando si avventurò sul ghiaccio, maledì se stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6999fa3-3840-48fe-8eb3-89bcef216af3\', \'multiverseId\': 464985}, \'multiverseid\': 464985}, {\'name\': \'薄氷の上\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールしている氷雪土地）\\n薄氷の上が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、薄氷の上が戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'氷雪エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'風を呪った。寒さを呪った。だが、氷を踏んでしまったときは、自分を呪った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'488bad0e-af4d-4cb3-9e1b-0e17611b41ca\', \'multiverseId\': 465239}, \'multiverseid\': 465239}, {\'name\': \'살얼음 위\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 눈 대지에 부여\\n살얼음 위가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 살얼음 위가 전장을 떠날 때까지 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'눈 부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'그는 바람을 저주했다. 그는 추위를 저주했다. 하지만 얼음 위에 발을 올려놓자, 그는 자신을 저주했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b71b489-e2e7-4e80-91c0-a79b84291b3c\', \'multiverseId\': 465493}, \'multiverseid\': 465493}, {\'name\': \'Numa Fria\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno da neve que você controla\\nQuando Numa Fria entrar no campo de batalha, exile a criatura alvo que um oponente controla até que Numa Fria deixe o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento da Neve — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Ele amaldiçoou o vento. Ele amaldiçoou o frio. Mas, ao pisar no gelo, ele amaldiçoou a si mesmo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e7a0742-8d8a-4feb-a6bf-94de2ffadeb4\', \'multiverseId\': 465747}, \'multiverseid\': 465747}, {\'name\': \'По Тонкому Льду\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать снежную землю под вашим контролем\\nКогда По Тонкому Льду выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевое существо под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока По Тонкому Льду не покинет поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Снежные Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Он проклинал ветер. Он проклинал холод. Но ступив на лед, он проклял сам себя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29d92146-1428-43dd-a026-670e4d6e6e8d\', \'multiverseId\': 466001}, \'multiverseid\': 466001}, {\'name\': \'孤囚悬冰\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的雪境地\\n当孤囚悬冰进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的生物，直到孤囚悬冰离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'雪境结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'他抱怨凛风。他抱怨寒冬。但踏上冰面后，他抱怨自己。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0541b093-21e5-4c2c-a9fd-3f58a4e5cb2a\', \'multiverseId\': 466255}, \'multiverseid\': 466255}, {\'name\': \'孤囚懸冰\', \'text\': \'結附於由你操控的雪境地\\n當孤囚懸冰進戰場時，放逐目標由對手操控的生物，直到孤囚懸冰離開戰場為止。\', \'type\': \'雪境結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'他抱怨凜風。他抱怨寒冬。但踏上冰面後，他抱怨自己。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75817a2d-6f30-418f-a6dc-beb3027694ae\', \'multiverseId\': 466509}, \'multiverseid\': 466509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auserwählter des Ersten Remasuris\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Edelmut. (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält sie für jedes Vorkommen von Edelmut auf bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Die beharrlichsten Mitglieder des Schwarms beschützen instinktiv den Ersten Remasuri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464212&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc8ac9d9-4e3f-440a-9fe3-864b3c61c055\', \'multiverseId\': 464212}, \'multiverseid\': 464212}, {\'name\': \'Elegido del Primer Fragmentado\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen la habilidad de exaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada mención de la habilidad de exaltado entre los permanentes que controlas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'Los miembros más tenaces de la colmena protegen instintivamente al Primer Fragmentado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cbc3005-bac7-450d-9ea4-337fcd503c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 464466}, \'multiverseid\': 464466}, {\'name\': \'Élu du Premier slivoïde\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont l\'exaltation. (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque occurrence d\'exaltation parmi les permanents que vous contrôlez.)", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Les membres les plus acharnés de l\'essaim protègent instinctivement le Premier slivoïde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464720&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8547f10-c099-48df-a10b-3964bd397eec\', \'multiverseId\': 464720}, \'multiverseid\': 464720}, {\'name\': \'Prescelto del Primo Tramutante\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno esaltato. (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni istanza di esaltato tra i permanenti che controlli.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': "I membri più tenaci dell\'alveare difendono istintivamente il Primo Tramutante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51ff87fe-42d0-4f1f-8a7a-c119d182f4d6\', \'multiverseId\': 464974}, \'multiverseid\': 464974}, {\'name\': \'初祖スリヴァーに選ばれしもの\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは賛美を持つ。（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは、あなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの中の賛美能力１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'巣で最も頑強なものが本能的に初祖スリヴァーを守る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'340c04ad-17ee-47d2-ab57-477c3f33e613\', \'multiverseId\': 465228}, \'multiverseid\': 465228}, {\'name\': \'최초의 슬리버의 정예병\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 고귀를 가진다. (당신이 조종하는 생물이 혼자 공격할 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 당신이 조종하는 지속물들 중 고귀를 가지고 있는 지속물 한 개당 +1/+1을 받는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'둥지에 있는 슬리버들 중 가장 끈질긴 구성원들이 본능적으로 최초의 슬리버를 지킨다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45c71685-448d-446a-94f3-29943d31e51c\', \'multiverseId\': 465482}, \'multiverseid\': 465482}, {\'name\': \'Escolhido do Primeiro Fractius\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm exaltado. (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada ocorrência de exaltado entre as permanentes que você controla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'Os membros mais tenazes da colônia instintivamente protegem o Primeiro Fractius.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c2fb1d-5644-46d7-99c8-d2d9c463c78d\', \'multiverseId\': 465736}, \'multiverseid\': 465736}, {\'name\': \'Избранная Первой Щепки\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют Повышение. (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, оно получает +1/+1 до конца хода за каждую способность Повышения среди перманентов под вашим контролем.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'Самые стойкие особи улья инстинктивно охраняют Первую Щепку.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee0a822-e6d4-46ac-85bb-cf6d16113b39\', \'multiverseId\': 465990}, \'multiverseid\': 465990}, {\'name\': \'原初裂片妖的爱民\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有颂威异能。（每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，由你操控的永久物上每有一个颂威异能，进行攻击的生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'在母巢中，最强健的成员会自发地去守卫原初裂片妖。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69889f0d-fd36-4e75-a6e5-c30c2918f842\', \'multiverseId\': 466244}, \'multiverseid\': 466244}, {\'name\': \'原初裂片妖的愛民\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有頌威異能。（每當一個由你操控的生物單獨攻擊時，由你操控的永久物上每有一個頌威異能，進行攻擊的生物便得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'在母巢中，最強健的成員會自發地去守衛原初裂片妖。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0a98189-c06d-40b5-956f-af9928981813\', \'multiverseId\': 466498}, \'multiverseid\': 466498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgedörrte Schlucht\', \'text\': \'{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere die Ausgedörrte Schlucht: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Seit der Fluss ausgetrocknet ist, wandern Reisende dort entlang, wo einst Fische schwammen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464450&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bcce4fd-12ac-478d-b251-b9b1390acd2b\', \'multiverseId\': 464450}, \'multiverseid\': 464450}, {\'name\': \'Cañón soleado\', \'text\': \'{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {R} o {W}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Cañón soleado: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Desde que el río se secó, los viajeros peregrinan por donde antes nadaban los peces.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ae61e3-e2e4-4b5f-88a7-240f75aef7a0\', \'multiverseId\': 464704}, \'multiverseid\': 464704}, {\'name\': \'Canyon séché par le soleil\', \'text\': \'{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez le Canyon séché par le soleil : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Depuis l\'assèchement de la rivière, les voyageurs passent où les poissons nageaient autrefois.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464958&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f03d79f7-0f10-492c-80af-6d08c5bacb1a\', \'multiverseId\': 464958}, \'multiverseid\': 464958}, {\'name\': \'Canyon Riarso\', \'text\': \'{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {R} o {W}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica il Canyon Riarso: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Da quando il fiume si è prosciugato, dove un tempo nuotavano pesci ora camminano viaggiatori.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34e8e038-8ba4-45ff-a850-eac9f4c101a9\', \'multiverseId\': 465212}, \'multiverseid\': 465212}, {\'name\': \'灼陽大峡谷\', \'text\': \'{T}, １点のライフを支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに{R}か{W}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 灼陽大峡谷を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'川は完全に干上がり、旅人には、かつて魚が泳いだ場所とは分からない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2275604b-11d8-4503-8da4-23b7ed2b70e9\', \'multiverseId\': 465466}, \'multiverseid\': 465466}, {\'name\': \'바짝 마른 협곡\', \'text\': \'{T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: {R} 또는 {W}를 추가한다.\\n{1}, {T}, 바짝 마른 협곡을 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'강물이 말라붙었기에, 여행자들은 한때 물고기가 헤엄치던 곳을 돌아다닌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e898105e-49a8-426d-8696-1cfe8ba1e22b\', \'multiverseId\': 465720}, \'multiverseid\': 465720}, {\'name\': \'Desfiladeiro Calcinado pelo Sol\', \'text\': \'{T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione {R} ou {W}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Desfiladeiro Calcinado pelo Sol: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Desde que o rio secou, viajantes vagam onde outrora nadavam peixes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2a951b6-ccd9-409b-b8e7-ffaa7f0ee1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 465974}, \'multiverseid\': 465974}, {\'name\': \'Выжженный Каньон\', \'text\': \'{T}, заплатите 1 жизнь: добавьте {R} или {W}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Выжженный Каньон: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'С тех пор как река пересохла, путники проходят там, где когда-то плавали рыбы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83ceeb88-0cc7-4fd2-af1c-1e5c673efc97\', \'multiverseId\': 466228}, \'multiverseid\': 466228}, {\'name\': \'日灼峡谷\', \'text\': \'{T}，支付1点生命：加{R}或{W}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲日灼峡谷：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'此地河流早已干涸，原本鱼类生息之所已成旅人脚下道路。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4707a837-c968-460b-95f1-58268a6997ce\', \'multiverseId\': 466482}, \'multiverseid\': 466482}, {\'name\': \'日灼峽谷\', \'text\': \'{T}，支付1點生命：加{R}或{W}。\\n{1}，{T}，犧牲日灼峽谷：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'此地河流早已乾涸，原本魚類生息之所已成旅人腳下道路。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e932391-b27e-4d97-864c-e114bba75e93\', \'multiverseId\': 466736}, \'multiverseid\': 466736}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungerter Riese\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments fügt dir der Ausgehungerte Riese 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Die Macht einer Armee und die Zurückhaltung eines Kindes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464346&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48ce5366-bab0-42e0-bc9e-cb7d681194e4\', \'multiverseId\': 464346}, \'multiverseid\': 464346}, {\'name\': \'Gigante voraz\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, el Gigante voraz te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'La fuerza de un ejército con la contención de un niño pequeño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3b56249-39e1-47ea-913b-a7db30b290b6\', \'multiverseId\': 464600}, \'multiverseid\': 464600}, {\'name\': \'Géant vorace\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, le Géant vorace vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': "La puissance d\'une armée et la retenue d\'un enfant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464854&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'599589d3-3749-43e4-a6af-eed11fa55f90\', \'multiverseId\': 464854}, \'multiverseid\': 464854}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Famelico\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, il Gigante Famelico ti infligge 1 danno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'La potenza di un esercito e il contegno di un bambino.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'157b8b0d-c467-4b83-bfbf-61ad01316cbf\', \'multiverseId\': 465108}, \'multiverseid\': 465108}, {\'name\': \'貪欲な巨人\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、貪欲な巨人はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'戦力は軍隊一つぶん、自制心は子どもなみ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05e6beb3-5817-41f3-a554-1a22d1ff70b3\', \'multiverseId\': 465362}, \'multiverseid\': 465362}, {\'name\': \'탐욕스러운 거인\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 탐욕스러운 거인은 당신에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': \'힘은 군대와 맞먹지만 참을성은 아이보다 못하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9f5b994-a1f7-4d05-a506-217945b98ff3\', \'multiverseId\': 465616}, \'multiverseid\': 465616}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Voraz\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, Gigante Voraz causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'A força de um exército com a moderação de uma criança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2305d57-dd11-4f58-8100-6cba4485b0c5\', \'multiverseId\': 465870}, \'multiverseid\': 465870}, {\'name\': \'Ненасытный Гигант\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки Ненасытный Гигант наносит вам 1 повреждение.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Могущество целой армии и самоконтроль, как у ребенка.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc3e7365-e087-4278-bb70-532bb9555f76\', \'multiverseId\': 466124}, \'multiverseid\': 466124}, {\'name\': \'贪食巨人\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，贪食巨人对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'军队的力量，孩童的脾气。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a29b45-b33f-4861-bb27-5eeeb9912349\', \'multiverseId\': 466378}, \'multiverseid\': 466378}, {\'name\': \'貪食巨人\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，貪食巨人對你造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'軍隊的力量，孩童的脾氣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0553d586-bc2a-40ce-b02f-6674f72807a2\', \'multiverseId\': 466632}, \'multiverseid\': 466632}]', "[{'name': 'Ausgestoßener Wandelwicht', 'text': 'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nDer Ausgestoßene Wandelwicht kann nicht blocken und nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler', 'flavor': 'Ein wechselhaftes Gesicht sät Misstrauen und erntet ein Leben in Einsamkeit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464285&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1755f753-0e50-4830-98ee-dcfd535412e6', 'multiverseId': 464285}, 'multiverseid': 464285}, {'name': 'Cambiaformas desterrado', 'text': 'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nEl Cambiaformas desterrado no puede bloquear y no puede ser bloqueado.', 'type': 'Criatura — Metamorfo', 'flavor': 'Un rostro volátil siembra desconfianza, y la desconfianza conlleva una vida solitaria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464539&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a40ab35-97f4-42ac-b8d9-ed430a67831e', 'multiverseId': 464539}, 'multiverseid': 464539}, {'name': 'Proscrit changelin', 'text': 'Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nLe Proscrit changelin ne peut pas bloquer et ne peut pas être bloqué.', 'type': 'Créature : changeforme', 'flavor': 'Un visage changeant inspire la méfiance. La méfiance suscite la solitude.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464793&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b9d51cf9-2def-4096-9399-17637012fb3a', 'multiverseId': 464793}, 'multiverseid': 464793}, {'name': 'Cangiante Reietto', 'text': 'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nIl Cangiante Reietto non può bloccare e non può essere bloccato.', 'type': 'Creatura — Polimorfo', 'flavor': 'Un volto mutevole semina diffidenza, che a sua volta raccoglie una vita solitaria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465047&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb8a2ac1-e052-4364-9056-5f36d5e9e408', 'multiverseId': 465047}, 'multiverseid': 465047}, {'name': '変わり身ののけ者', 'text': '多相（このカードは常にすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n変わり身ののけ者ではブロックできず、変わり身ののけ者はブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': '移り気な表情が不信を蒔く。不信は孤独な命を刈り取る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465301&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '836f6e7f-0f0a-4bbf-aae1-b6fd4ac107d5', 'multiverseId': 465301}, 'multiverseid': 465301}, {'name': '체인질링 추방자', 'text': '체인질링 (이 카드는 모든 생물 유형이다.)\\n체인질링 추방자는 방어할 수 없으며 방어될 수 없다.', 'type': '생물 — 변신괴물', 'flavor': '변덕스러운 얼굴은 불신을 낳는다. 불신은 쓸쓸한 삶으로 귀결된다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465555&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4748afa-68a7-439b-976d-af130c2cca62', 'multiverseId': 465555}, 'multiverseid': 465555}, {'name': 'Pária Morfoloide', 'text': 'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nPária Morfoloide não pode bloquear e não pode ser bloqueado.', 'type': 'Criatura — Metamorfo', 'flavor': 'Um rosto inconstante semeia desconfiança, cujo fruto a colher é uma vida solitária.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465809&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d72802e-8260-48d8-8da5-86a63b28a469', 'multiverseId': 465809}, 'multiverseid': 465809}, {'name': 'Перевертыш-Изгой', 'text': 'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nПеревертыш-Изгой не может блокировать и не может быть заблокирован.', 'type': 'Существо — Имитатор', 'flavor': 'Переменчивое лицо порождает недоверие. Недоверие оборачивается одинокой жизнью.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466063&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49effb05-0ffc-444d-abf6-a3febd1d04bd', 'multiverseId': 466063}, 'multiverseid': 466063}, {'name': '化形黜人', 'text': '化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n化形黜人不能进行阻挡，也不能被阻挡。', 'type': '生物 ～变形兽', 'flavor': '变幻面容埋下猜疑祸根。猜疑祸根长出孤独人生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466317&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61ab21aa-28d3-41b7-8ec6-d904b2b25917', 'multiverseId': 466317}, 'multiverseid': 466317}, {'name': '化形黜人', 'text': '化形（此牌是所有生物類別。）\\n化形黜人不能進行阻擋，也不能被阻擋。', 'type': '生物 ～變形獸', 'flavor': '變幻面容埋下猜疑禍根。猜疑禍根長出孤獨人生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466571&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b7a34d1-67f6-4149-9be5-61c38c073c8b', 'multiverseId': 466571}, 'multiverseid': 466571}]", "[{'name': 'Ausheben', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Egal wie tief man es vergräbt, manches Übel will einfach nicht unter der Erde bleiben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464316&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c77127c3-3bbd-4ab5-849f-4dfc3bfdeccc', 'multiverseId': 464316}, 'multiverseid': 464316}, {'name': 'Desenterrar', 'text': 'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Por muy hondo que los entierren, algunos males rehúsan permanecer muertos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464570&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdd6c282-8db8-4b03-84a0-086f2e455e28', 'multiverseId': 464570}, 'multiverseid': 464570}, {'name': 'Sortir de terre', 'text': 'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Quelle que soit la profondeur à laquelle vous les enterrez, certains maux refusent de rester morts.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464824&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1f76a61-f1ba-4b1b-990c-566f55a3bf23', 'multiverseId': 464824}, 'multiverseid': 464824}, {'name': 'Disseppellire', 'text': 'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Per quanto siano sepolte in profondità, alcune forze malvagie si rifiutano di restare tra i morti.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465078&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a0b8437-db2c-406a-98c4-290d9a511e06', 'multiverseId': 465078}, 'multiverseid': 465078}, {'name': '発掘', 'text': 'あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'どれほど深く埋葬しようと死を拒む邪悪が存在する。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465332&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a322d10f-d665-4d61-8fe4-0dccc8244608', 'multiverseId': 465332}, 'multiverseid': 465332}, {'name': '발굴', 'text': '당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 3 이하인 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': '얼마나 깊게 파묻든 간에, 죽은 채로 남아 있는 것을 거부하는 사악함도 있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465586&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ea9e200-faa0-4f2b-8eb5-44c587aab393', 'multiverseId': 465586}, 'multiverseid': 465586}, {'name': 'Desenterrar', 'text': 'Devolva o card de criatura alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Não importa quão fundo você enterre. Alguns males se recusam a permanecer mortos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465840&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '612e1e59-b123-46a3-a325-9a387ac7a2a1', 'multiverseId': 465840}, 'multiverseid': 465840}, {'name': 'Откопать', 'text': 'Верните целевую карту существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Как бы глубоко его не похоронили, некоторое зло просто отказывается оставаться мертвым.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466094&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b91e0005-c952-409f-a7cd-1a98433b7075', 'multiverseId': 466094}, 'multiverseid': 466094}, {'name': '出土回生', 'text': '将目标总法术力费用等于或小于3的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '无论埋得多深，有些邪物就是不会瞑目。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466348&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a376649-073b-44a8-932f-133252305bc1', 'multiverseId': 466348}, 'multiverseid': 466348}, {'name': '出土回生', 'text': '將目標總魔法力費用等於或小於3的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '無論埋得多深，有些邪物就是不會瞑目。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466602&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90e79fd0-b4a4-46a5-b444-6c50c585d60c', 'multiverseId': 466602}, 'multiverseid': 466602}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ausschließen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe gerade keine Zeit für dich."\\n—Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464251&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ebc2a7c-0a74-4889-94d9-6b88176393f0\', \'multiverseId\': 464251}, \'multiverseid\': 464251}, {\'name\': \'Excluir\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo de criatura objetivo.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ahora no tengo tiempo para ti".\\n—Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'971f1a19-8bef-4824-8ab2-0a111c5544a0\', \'multiverseId\': 464505}, \'multiverseid\': 464505}, {\'name\': \'Exclusion\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort de créature ciblé.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'ai pas de temps à te consacrer. »\\n—Téfeiri", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464759&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24cb6f22-c00f-46da-8195-cf47b9afee24\', \'multiverseId\': 464759}, \'multiverseid\': 464759}, {\'name\': \'Escludere\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia creatura bersaglio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ho tempo per te in questo momento."\\n—Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dc7a7b7-6a83-4204-a030-5ae2c227749c\', \'multiverseId\': 465013}, \'multiverseid\': 465013}, {\'name\': \'除外\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「今忙しいんだ。」\\n――テフェリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d025296-541b-4010-b93a-4c51fdcc33ec\', \'multiverseId\': 465267}, \'multiverseid\': 465267}, {\'name\': \'배제\', \'text\': \'생물 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"지금은 자네를 상대할 시간이 없군."\\n—테페리\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cad2d940-a2d4-43eb-afcc-886414bd5a26\', \'multiverseId\': 465521}, \'multiverseid\': 465521}, {\'name\': \'Excluir\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica de criatura alvo.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não tenho tempo para você agora."\\n— Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c198e3c4-1707-4e67-8e1b-9f35f11837ff\', \'multiverseId\': 465775}, \'multiverseid\': 465775}, {\'name\': \'Исключение\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание существа.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Сейчас у меня на тебя нет времени».\\n— Тефери\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e22d409b-1975-42ed-acca-07c5e67dd7b3\', \'multiverseId\': 466029}, \'multiverseid\': 466029}, {\'name\': \'排拒\', \'text\': \'反击目标生物咒语。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「现在没空和你闲耗。」\\n～泰菲力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec7a533-198e-4ca3-908f-5078cefeb27b\', \'multiverseId\': 466283}, \'multiverseid\': 466283}, {\'name\': \'排拒\', \'text\': \'反擊目標生物咒語。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「現在沒空和你閒耗。」\\n～泰菲力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b955d811-e74a-4024-857a-44fc8e293fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 466537}, \'multiverseid\': 466537}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ayula, Königin der Bären\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein anderer Bär unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf einen Bären deiner Wahl.\\n• Ein Bär deiner Wahl, den du kontrollierst, kämpft gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Bär\', \'flavor\': \'Geboren aus der ältesten Rotzeder, großgezogen mit dem Saft der höchsten Fichte, gekrönt unter der mächtigsten Kiefer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464358&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab24ca2a-20be-4491-9283-ad943219f591\', \'multiverseId\': 464358}, \'multiverseid\': 464358}, {\'name\': \'Ayula, reina de los osos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro Oso entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, elige uno:\\n• Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Oso objetivo.\\n• El Oso objetivo que controlas lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Oso\', \'flavor\': \'Nacida del cedro rojo más antiguo, nutrida con la savia del abeto más alto, coronada bajo el pino más poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a1304fc-33c5-448a-924d-238a19ffaa3c\', \'multiverseId\': 464612}, \'multiverseid\': 464612}, {\'name\': \'Ayula, reine parmi les ours\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre ours arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'ours ciblé.\\n• L\'ours ciblé que vous contrôlez se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ours\', \'flavor\': \'Enfantée par le plus vieux cèdre rouge, allaitée avec la sève du plus grand épicéa, couronnée sous le pin le plus puissant.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464866&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea417246-c517-48f5-b1df-ab78ffa68347\', \'multiverseId\': 464866}, \'multiverseid\': 464866}, {\'name\': \'Ayula, Regina tra gli Orsi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro Orso entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, scegli uno —\\n• Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su un Orso bersaglio.\\n• Un Orso bersaglio che controlli lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orso\', \'flavor\': "Nata dal cedro rosso più antico, nutrita dalla linfa dell\'abete più alto, incoronata sotto il pino più potente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb74f0e-ed31-43c6-9b82-c0a294c5d76c\', \'multiverseId\': 465120}, \'multiverseid\': 465120}, {\'name\': \'熊の女王、アイユーラ\', \'text\': \'他の熊が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 熊１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\\n• あなたがコントロールしている熊１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'森で最も古い木から生まれ、最も背の高い木の樹液で育ち、最も力強い木の下で戴冠した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c45fc656-d011-4343-8323-dc08e0a1af54\', \'multiverseId\': 465374}, \'multiverseid\': 465374}, {\'name\': \'곰의 여왕, 아이율라\', \'text\': \'다른 곰이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 곰을 목표로 정한다. 그 곰에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\\n• 당신이 조종하는 곰과 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 두 생물은 서로 싸운다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 곰\', \'flavor\': \'가장 오래된 붉은 삼나무에서 태어나, 가장 큰 가문비나무의 수액으로 자라, 가장 강한 소나무 아래에서 우두머리가 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'414768ff-90f4-4965-8946-d98e82c4d900\', \'multiverseId\': 465628}, \'multiverseid\': 465628}, {\'name\': \'Ayula, Rainha entre os Ursos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outro Urso entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, escolha um —\\n• Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 no Urso alvo.\\n• O Urso alvo que você controla luta contra a criatura alvo que você não controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Urso\', \'flavor\': \'Nascida do mais velho cedro, criada com a seiva do mais alto abeto, coroada sob o mais poderoso pinheiro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42fcb831-db9b-4751-a685-c7d528de3b62\', \'multiverseId\': 465882}, \'multiverseid\': 465882}, {\'name\': \'Аюла, Королева Среди Медведей\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другой Медведь выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, выберите одно —\\n• Положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевого Медведя.\\n• Целевой Медведь под вашим контролем дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Медведь\', \'flavor\': \'Рожденная из старейшего красного кедра, вскормленная соком высочайшей из елей, коронованная под самой могучей сосной.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05ee9b2c-2ba7-436c-9650-7a5892c0d45c\', \'multiverseId\': 466136}, \'multiverseid\': 466136}, {\'name\': \'百熊女王阿育拉\', \'text\': \'每当另一个熊在你的操控下进战场时，选择一项～\\n•在目标熊上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n•目标由你操控的熊与目标不由你操控的生物互斗。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～熊\', \'flavor\': \'于上古红杉林中诞生，以参天云杉树汁育养，在至高松木树下登基。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67833242-ff51-44f5-af2c-cd7fa5f6fa07\', \'multiverseId\': 466390}, \'multiverseid\': 466390}, {\'name\': \'百熊女王阿育拉\', \'text\': \'每當另一個熊在你的操控下進戰場時，選擇一項～\\n•在目標熊上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n•目標由你操控的熊與目標不由你操控的生物互鬥。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～熊\', \'flavor\': \'於上古紅杉林中誕生，以參天雲杉樹汁育養，在至高松木樹下登基。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e866223-dccf-4004-a218-027c95642022\', \'multiverseId\': 466644}, \'multiverseid\': 466644}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ayulas Einfluss\', \'text\': \'Wirf eine Länderkarte ab: Erzeuge einen 2/2 grünen Bär-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Markierungen von Ayulas Runenklauen sorgen dafür, dass ihr Territorium niemals schutzlos ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464359&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20dc2c6f-0c48-482a-9eda-3963e53e4424\', \'multiverseId\': 464359}, \'multiverseid\': 464359}, {\'name\': \'Influencia de Ayula\', \'text\': \'Descartar una carta de tierra: Crea una ficha de criatura Oso verde 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Ayula deja marcas rúnicas de sus garras para que sus territorios nunca se queden sin defensas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e02485ff-c345-4098-9e27-9041962cea41\', \'multiverseId\': 464613}, \'multiverseid\': 464613}, {\'name\': "Influence d\'Ayula", \'text\': "Défaussez-vous d\'une carte de terrain : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Ours.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Les marques de griffes runiques d\'Ayula assurent que son territoire n\'est jamais sans défense.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464867&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e385db24-7fb1-4208-8ca2-4dac183bdbea\', \'multiverseId\': 464867}, \'multiverseid\': 464867}, {\'name\': \'Influenza di Ayula\', \'text\': \'Scarta una carta terra: Crea una pedina creatura Orso 2/2 verde.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Le artigliate runiche di Ayula garantiscono che i suoi territori non siano mai incustoditi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e03b60e-bb4d-4df3-b6b0-e8f3e4b8e35f\', \'multiverseId\': 465121}, \'multiverseid\': 465121}, {\'name\': \'アイユーラの影響\', \'text\': \'土地・カード１枚を捨てる：緑の２/２の熊・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'アイユーラの秘紋の爪痕により、彼女の版図が無防備になることはない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d4a904-7db0-40a7-9003-604737d28184\', \'multiverseId\': 465375}, \'multiverseid\': 465375}, {\'name\': \'아이율라의 영향력\', \'text\': \'대지 카드 한 장을 버린다: 2/2 녹색 곰 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'아이율라의 룬이 깃든 발톱 표식은 그녀의 영역을 무방비하게 두는 일이 없다는 것을 의미한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7947a991-beee-450a-8299-b91b0999476d\', \'multiverseId\': 465629}, \'multiverseid\': 465629}, {\'name\': \'Influência de Ayula\', \'text\': \'Descarte um card de terreno: Crie uma ficha de criatura verde 2/2 do tipo Urso.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Ayula deixa marcas rúnicas com suas garras para garantir que seu território jamais fique indefeso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32bc14e9-457a-487d-8778-cebebbd2b993\', \'multiverseId\': 465883}, \'multiverseid\': 465883}, {\'name\': \'Влияние Аюлы\', \'text\': \'Сбросьте карту земли: создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 зеленый Медведь.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Рунные отметины лап Аюлы — залог того, что ее угодья никогда не остаются без защиты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe8f8d51-8e3c-4ebe-9747-1f6a42011ec2\', \'multiverseId\': 466137}, \'multiverseid\': 466137}, {\'name\': \'阿育拉的威能\', \'text\': \'弃一张地牌：派出一个2/2绿色的熊衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'阿育拉的符爪印确保自己的地盘永远戒备森严。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2972a38f-c263-46b1-bbf7-b78c70be5a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 466391}, \'multiverseid\': 466391}, {\'name\': \'阿育拉的威能\', \'text\': \'棄一張地牌：派出一個2/2綠色的熊衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'阿育拉的符爪印確保自己的地盤永遠戒備森嚴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6637def1-696b-469a-8b7e-da124712274f\', \'multiverseId\': 466645}, \'multiverseid\': 466645}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azra-Rauchformer\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{B} ({1}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nWenn der Azra-Rauchformer ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Azra, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464282&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'386d477f-d951-4dd1-9c41-1da1ddf21d8b\', \'multiverseId\': 464282}, \'multiverseid\': 464282}, {\'name\': \'Moldeahumo azra\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{B}. ({1}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nCuando el Moldeahumo azra entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja azra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53a7f88a-4ae6-4ee2-88f8-ceed51ed6611\', \'multiverseId\': 464536}, \'multiverseid\': 464536}, {\'name\': \'Modeleur de fumée azra\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {1}{B} ({1}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nQuand le Modeleur de fumée azra arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : azra et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464790&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62b53a33-736a-4fe6-ac29-9b148a780c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 464790}, \'multiverseid\': 464790}, {\'name\': \'Azra Plasmafumo\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {1}{B} ({1}{B}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nQuando l\'Azra Plasmafumo entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio che controlli ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Azra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abaf1927-53c2-4dd4-a89a-8e0a0154df24\', \'multiverseId\': 465044}, \'multiverseid\': 465044}, {\'name\': \'アズラの煙纏い\', \'text\': \'忍術{1}{B}（{1}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\nアズラの煙纏いが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アズラ・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1f51c39-9cc4-49e3-9f6c-89e4da6266a3\', \'multiverseId\': 465298}, \'multiverseid\': 465298}, {\'name\': \'아즈라 연기조작자\', \'text\': \'인술 {1}{B} ({1}{B}, 당신이 조종하는 공격 중인 생물 중 방어당하지 않은 생물 한 개를 손으로 되돌린다: 당신의 손에서 이 카드를 탭되어 공격 중인 상태로 전장에 놓는다.)\\n아즈라 연기조작자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 아즈라 닌자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'191f93e2-2c03-449d-b859-e044fde07fb3\', \'multiverseId\': 465552}, \'multiverseid\': 465552}, {\'name\': \'Moldafumo Azra\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {1}{B} ({1}{B}, devolva para a mão um atacante que você controla que não tenha sido bloqueado: Coloque este card no campo de batalha de sua mão, virado e atacando.)\\nQuando Moldafumo Azra entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo que você controla ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Azra Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9a917a2-4edc-4595-8b16-89fd7892cee7\', \'multiverseId\': 465806}, \'multiverseid\': 465806}, {\'name\': \'Азра-Заклинатель Дыма\', \'text\': \'Ниндзюцу {1}{B} ({1}{B}, верните незаблокированного атакующего под вашим контролем в руку: положите эту карту на поле битвы из вашей руки повернутой и атакующей.)\\nКогда Азра-Заклинатель Дыма выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо под вашим контролем получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Азра Ниндзя\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9195b078-8289-4b81-8f6d-4033c0e2d7fa\', \'multiverseId\': 466060}, \'multiverseid\': 466060}, {\'name\': \'烟遁亚札人\', \'text\': \'忍术{1}{B}（{1}{B}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物移回其拥有者手上：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n当烟遁亚札人进战场时，目标由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～亚札人／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'600bd586-e494-4a62-b198-fac94927e7dc\', \'multiverseId\': 466314}, \'multiverseid\': 466314}, {\'name\': \'煙遁亞札人\', \'text\': \'忍術{1}{B}（{1}{B}，將一個由你操控且未受阻擋的攻擊生物移回其擁有者手上：將此牌從你手上橫置放進戰場，且正進行攻擊。）\\n當煙遁亞札人進戰場時，目標由你操控的生物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～亞札人／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5327dc4a-f73a-42d2-a75d-ea5257b9392b\', \'multiverseId\': 466568}, \'multiverseid\': 466568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumwipfellauerin\', \'text\': \'Sturmangriff {1}{G} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Sturmangriff-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, erhält die Kreatur Eile und kehrt zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments aus dem Spiel auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.)\\nImmer wenn die Baumwipfellauerin angreift, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464389&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'846f9d96-6ee9-434a-a234-58cb7adb751e\', \'multiverseId\': 464389}, \'multiverseid\': 464389}, {\'name\': \'Emboscadora de las copas\', \'text\': \'Rapidez {1}{G}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de rapidez. Si lo haces, gana la habilidad de prisa y regresa del campo de batalla a la mano de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.)\\nSiempre que la Emboscadora de las copas ataque, la criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7705236f-b976-435a-bd32-343a796c22f0\', \'multiverseId\': 464643}, \'multiverseid\': 464643}, {\'name\': \'Embusqueuse arboricole\', \'text\': "Précipitation {1}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de précipitation. Si vous faites ainsi, il acquiert la célérité et revient dans la main de son propriétaire depuis le champ de bataille au début de la prochaine étape de fin.)\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Embusqueuse arboricole attaque, une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et berserker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464897&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a8b8ce-9b69-4f55-8c5c-339875bb557f\', \'multiverseId\': 464897}, \'multiverseid\': 464897}, {\'name\': \'Assalitrice Arboricola\', \'text\': "Accelerare {1}{G} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di accelerare. Se lo fai, ha rapidità e torna in mano al suo proprietario dal campo di battaglia all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.)\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Assalitrice Arboricola attacca, una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf64a03-abbc-4e63-a0f5-91a15efd5e5c\', \'multiverseId\': 465151}, \'multiverseid\': 465151}, {\'name\': \'樹上の伏兵\', \'text\': \'疾駆{1}{G}（あなたはこの呪文を、これの疾駆コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これは速攻を得て、次の終了ステップの開始時に、これを戦場からオーナーの手札に戻す。）\\n樹上の伏兵が攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edae4f10-0997-4a48-a3ca-2dae63d4c8c3\', \'multiverseId\': 465405}, \'multiverseid\': 465405}, {\'name\': \'나무꼭대기 매복조\', \'text\': \'질주 {1}{G} (당신은 질주 비용을 지불해서 이 주문을 발동할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 이 생물은 신속을 얻고, 다음 종료단 시작에 전장에서 소유자의 손으로 돌아간다.)\\n나무꼭대기 매복조가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 광전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d3ec0b3-421e-4d90-8ace-a82aacb27153\', \'multiverseId\': 465659}, \'multiverseid\': 465659}, {\'name\': \'Emboscadora do Dossel\', \'text\': \'Investida {1}{G} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de investida. Se fizer isso, ela ganha ímpeto e é devolvida do campo de batalha para a mão de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.)\\nToda vez que Emboscadora do Dossel ataca, a criatura alvo que você controla recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Amoque\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ddde9b4-2eac-4f2f-924c-36610ece9891\', \'multiverseId\': 465913}, \'multiverseid\': 465913}, {\'name\': \'Засадный Боец Крон\', \'text\': \'Рывок {1}{G} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Рывка. Если вы это делаете, оно получает Ускорение и возвращается с поля битвы в руку его владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Засадный Боец Крон атакует, целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Берсерк\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e5fe105-8610-4ee3-9780-08d9b6f67719\', \'multiverseId\': 466167}, \'multiverseid\': 466167}, {\'name\': \'树顶伏击人\', \'text\': \'掩袭{1}{G}（你可以支付此咒语的掩袭费用来施放它。如果你如此作，则它获得敏捷异能，且在下个结束步骤开始时便需从战场移回其拥有者手上。）\\n每当树顶伏击人攻击时，目标由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／狂战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'052509e7-63e0-498c-b53f-3ebd5cc4e8d3\', \'multiverseId\': 466421}, \'multiverseid\': 466421}, {\'name\': \'樹頂伏擊人\', \'text\': \'掩襲{1}{G}（你可以支付此咒語的掩襲費用來施放它。如果你如此作，則它獲得敏捷異能，且在下個結束步驟開始時便需從戰場移回其擁有者手上。）\\n每當樹頂伏擊人攻擊時，目標由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／狂戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5773653f-04e0-40ac-bc7a-26549629370d\', \'multiverseId\': 466675}, \'multiverseid\': 466675}]', '[{\'name\': \'Betrachtender Magier\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Betrachtende Magier ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege sie in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück. Du kannst deine Bibliothek mischen. Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Überlasse die Zukunft niemals dem Schicksal."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464266&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bac11539-1d3a-4546-a19c-f13bbb18f74f\', \'multiverseId\': 464266}, \'multiverseid\': 464266}, {\'name\': \'Mago en reflexión\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Mago en reflexión entre al campo de batalla, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca y regrésalas en cualquier orden. Puedes barajar tu biblioteca. Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nunca dejes el futuro en manos de los hados".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c30f8a97-56d6-4cde-bdd2-84e52713caec\', \'multiverseId\': 464520}, \'multiverseid\': 464520}, {\'name\': \'Mage cogitant\', \'text\': "Quand le Mage cogitant arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix. Vous pouvez mélanger votre bibliothèque. Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« N\'abandonnez jamais le futur au destin. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464774&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83333932-6ba4-4e61-bf0e-8d06e226a5d9\', \'multiverseId\': 464774}, \'multiverseid\': 464774}, {\'name\': \'Mago Ponderante\', \'text\': \'Quando il Mago Ponderante entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi rimettile a posto in qualsiasi ordine. Puoi rimescolare il tuo grimorio. Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare mai il futuro al fato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40aebae-0094-4aa4-906c-af47f7f1a258\', \'multiverseId\': 465028}, \'multiverseid\': 465028}, {\'name\': \'思案する魔道士\', \'text\': \'思案する魔道士が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見て、それらを望む順番で戻す。あなたはあなたのライブラリーを切り直してもよい。カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「未来を運命に委ねてはならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5efa8b08-97bf-45b5-95ce-842a946cb3a6\', \'multiverseId\': 465282}, \'multiverseid\': 465282}, {\'name\': \'숙고하는 마법사\', \'text\': \'숙고하는 마법사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본 후, 그 카드들을 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 위에 올려놓는다. 당신은 당신의 서고를 섞을 수 있다. 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"절대로 미래를 운명에게 맡겨 두지 마라."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf7c848d-e28c-4cde-bf57-ff5faac81fd8\', \'multiverseId\': 465536}, \'multiverseid\': 465536}, {\'name\': \'Mago Ponderado\', \'text\': \'Quando Mago Ponderado entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório e depois os coloque de volta em qualquer ordem. Você pode embaralhar seu grimório. Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Jamais deixe o futuro a cargo do destino."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'985e94b3-d057-4a19-bfa4-34d32b15ec41\', \'multiverseId\': 465790}, \'multiverseid\': 465790}, {\'name\': \'Задумчивый Маг\', \'text\': \'Когда Задумчивый Маг выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите их обратно в любом порядке. Вы можете перетасовать вашу библиотеку. Возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Не оставляй будущее на милость судьбы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f95c233d-9f52-4cba-bcc2-c92d88d99156\', \'multiverseId\': 466044}, \'multiverseid\': 466044}, {\'name\': \'沉思法师\', \'text\': \'当沉思法师进战场时，检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将它们以任意顺序放回。你可以将你的牌库洗牌。抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「未来绝非听天由命。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5fb2165-ebd0-481a-a333-39f2084cd624\', \'multiverseId\': 466298}, \'multiverseid\': 466298}, {\'name\': \'沉思法師\', \'text\': \'當沉思法師進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌，然後將它們以任意順序放回。你可以將你的牌庫洗牌。抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「未來絕非聽天由命。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10991e90-c50c-40fe-b36d-f42789ab00e4\', \'multiverseId\': 466552}, \'multiverseid\': 466552}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewahrerin des Raureifs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Enttappe eine andere verschneite bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur Narren halten den Winter für die Jahreszeit des Todes, weil sie das Leben unter dem Kleid aus Schnee nicht sehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464379&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23fa3b39-fb4c-4fa6-bb9d-ab2414806ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 464379}, \'multiverseid\': 464379}, {\'name\': \'Cuidadora de la escarcha\', \'text\': \'{T}: Endereza otro permanente nevado objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Los necios identifican el invierno con la estación de la muerte porque no ven la vida que late debajo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad07fb3-11ad-4ff9-8fae-e71fa8e10ac2\', \'multiverseId\': 464633}, \'multiverseid\': 464633}, {\'name\': \'Marraine des frimas\', \'text\': \'{T} : Dégagez un autre permanent neigeux ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Les imbéciles pensent que l\'hiver est la saison de la mort car ils ne voient pas la vie qui se cache en dessous. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464887&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a43745-edad-47f1-b41d-36472f16cc9f\', \'multiverseId\': 464887}, \'multiverseid\': 464887}, {\'name\': \'Protettrice della Brina\', \'text\': \'{T}: STAPpa un altro permanente neve bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Per gli stolti l\\\'inverno è la stagione della morte perché non sanno vedere la vita che si cela sotto la superficie."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9502eed3-c804-442d-a457-f7ce4cb387b7\', \'multiverseId\': 465141}, \'multiverseid\': 465141}, {\'name\': \'霧氷守り\', \'text\': \'{T}：他の氷雪パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「冬を死の季節だと思う愚か者は、その下に隠れた生命を見ていないのです。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29921bd7-7e01-4a8f-b3b2-525c779ac852\', \'multiverseId\': 465395}, \'multiverseid\': 465395}, {\'name\': \'서리 관리인\', \'text\': \'{T}: 다른 눈 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'눈 생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"눈 속에서 자라는 생명을 볼 수 없는 바보들이나 겨울을 죽음의 계절이라고 부를 뿐이지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dbb9998-4875-40c4-894b-c9b005c91cdf\', \'multiverseId\': 465649}, \'multiverseid\': 465649}, {\'name\': \'Protetora da Geada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Desvire outra permanente da neve alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Os tolos veem o inverno como a estação da morte porque não conseguem ver a vida sob a superfície."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'072b7ef7-a702-4a5f-bb74-299551fe1691\', \'multiverseId\': 465903}, \'multiverseid\': 465903}, {\'name\': \'Инеевая Хранительница\', \'text\': \'{T}: разверните другой целевой снежный перманент.\', \'type\': \'Снежное Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Глупцы считают зиму временем смерти, потому что не способны увидеть жизнь, что скрывается под поверхностью».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92003f57-011b-4d3d-b55e-7d9079eaac77\', \'multiverseId\': 466157}, \'multiverseid\': 466157}, {\'name\': \'护霜师\', \'text\': \'{T}：重置另一个目标雪境永久物。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「愚者将冬天视为死亡的季节，全因他们看不见蕴含其间的生机。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'813c41a7-6106-45e8-a462-be1c16b047c7\', \'multiverseId\': 466411}, \'multiverseid\': 466411}, {\'name\': \'護霜師\', \'text\': \'{T}：重置另一個目標雪境永久物。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「愚者將冬天視為死亡的季節，全因他們看不見蘊含其間的生機。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3238c1f-37c3-41be-91aa-17ae8fcaca99\', \'multiverseId\': 466665}, \'multiverseid\': 466665}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blick in die Zukunft\', \'text\': \'Die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ist offen.\\nDu kannst die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek spielen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ist das Unvermeidliche denn weniger wundersam?"\\n—Veldka, wandernder Weiser\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464256&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49287415-6c21-44ff-be0a-f6ed84e5f8ee\', \'multiverseId\': 464256}, \'multiverseid\': 464256}, {\'name\': \'Visión del futuro\', \'text\': \'Juega mostrando la primera carta de tu biblioteca.\\nPuedes jugar la primera carta de tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Acaso lo inevitable es menos milagroso?".\\n—Veldka, sabia errante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be660b0a-3594-4f59-aa32-d454f85f2e94\', \'multiverseId\': 464510}, \'multiverseid\': 464510}, {\'name\': "Vision de l\'avenir", \'text\': \'Jouez avec la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque révélée.\\nVous pouvez jouer la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« L\'inévitable n\'en est-il pas moins miraculeux ? »\\n—Veldka, sage errant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464764&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcd162aa-af34-4e5f-941d-c56e54db58a8\', \'multiverseId\': 464764}, \'multiverseid\': 464764}, {\'name\': \'Visione Futura\', \'text\': \'Gioca con la prima carta del tuo grimorio rivelata.\\nPuoi giocare la prima carta del tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'inevitabile è forse meno miracoloso?"\\n—Veldka, saggia errante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1a2f14d-419a-4ca6-a09a-90a01d774759\', \'multiverseId\': 465018}, \'multiverseid\': 465018}, {\'name\': \'未来予知\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開したままプレイする。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「必然とは、それ自体が奇跡ではないのか？」\\n――放浪の賢者、ヴェルドカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd0d4ad1-8ef5-4183-9079-aa7619d788c6\', \'multiverseId\': 465272}, \'multiverseid\': 465272}, {\'name\': \'미래를 보는 눈\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 공개한 채로 게임을 진행한다.\\n당신은 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"필연적인 일이 이렇게 놀랍지 않을 수도 있나?"\\n—방랑 현자, 벨드카\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e93644-3863-4d31-8af8-c22d57f83eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 465526}, \'multiverseid\': 465526}, {\'name\': \'Visão do Futuro\', \'text\': \'Jogue com o card do topo de seu grimório revelado.\\nVocê pode jogar o card do topo de seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"E o inevitável por acaso é menos milagroso?"\\n— Veldka, sábia errante\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b469d39d-c999-4768-bc83-458b20f1ba10\', \'multiverseId\': 465780}, \'multiverseid\': 465780}, {\'name\': \'Взгляд в Будущее\', \'text\': \'Играйте с открытой верхней картой вашей библиотеки.\\nВы можете разыграть верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Разве неизбежное становится от этого менее чудесным?»\\n— Вельдка, странствующий мудрец\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c9f481-6523-42ff-918e-19d34d2c29bc\', \'multiverseId\': 466034}, \'multiverseid\': 466034}, {\'name\': \'预知将来\', \'text\': \'你以展示牌库顶牌的方式进行游戏。\\n你可以使用你的牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「事情若能早知道，惊喜可会少半分？」\\n～云游智者维特加\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24d38e95-7874-4ca3-ab1c-1d283898ca65\', \'multiverseId\': 466288}, \'multiverseid\': 466288}, {\'name\': \'預知將來\', \'text\': \'你以展示牌庫頂牌的方式進行遊戲。\\n你可以使用你的牌庫頂牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「事情若能早知道，驚喜可會少半分？」\\n～雲遊智者維特加\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61367770-0334-455f-8de6-803486e79a96\', \'multiverseId\': 466542}, \'multiverseid\': 466542}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitz-Skelementar\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden, Eile\\nImmer wenn das Blitz-Skelementar einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, wirft der Spieler zwei Karten ab.\\nOpfere das Blitz-Skelementar zu Beginn des Endsegments.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Skelett\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464411&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b3f93d-5985-4e1f-a2e0-a95f83e1c229\', \'multiverseId\': 464411}, \'multiverseid\': 464411}, {\'name\': \'Esquelemental del relámpago\', \'text\': \'Arrolla, prisa.\\nSiempre que el Esquelemental del relámpago haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador descarta dos cartas.\\nAl comienzo del paso final, sacrifica el Esquelemental del relámpago.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esqueleto elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14cbc58f-6a70-4a9f-898c-c3419874920f\', \'multiverseId\': 464665}, \'multiverseid\': 464665}, {\'name\': "Squelémental d\'éclair", \'text\': "Piétinement, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que le Squelémental d\'éclair inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur se défausse de deux cartes.\\nAu début de l\'étape de fin, sacrifiez le Squelémental d\'éclair.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et squelette\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464919&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a405a5b5-0e10-49e5-b903-783cb18ff20a\', \'multiverseId\': 464919}, \'multiverseid\': 464919}, {\'name\': \'Schelementale dei Fulmini\', \'text\': "Travolgere, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta lo Schelementale dei Fulmini infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore scarta due carte.\\nAll\'inizio della sottofase finale, sacrifica lo Schelementale dei Fulmini.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Scheletro Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04c1823c-faff-4b2e-bbfa-9d1cdf39004d\', \'multiverseId\': 465173}, \'multiverseid\': 465173}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の骨精霊\', \'text\': \'トランプル、速攻\\n稲妻の骨精霊がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を捨てる。\\n終了ステップの開始時に、稲妻の骨精霊を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・スケルトン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fadb413-7a94-4790-90e6-b6d45da616d7\', \'multiverseId\': 465427}, \'multiverseid\': 465427}, {\'name\': \'벼락 해골정령\', \'text\': \'돌진, 신속\\n벼락 해골정령이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 카드 두 장을 버린다.\\n종료단 시작에, 벼락 해골정령을 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령 해골\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7ed9f5f-7c8c-48b6-b103-31f7a60c19d9\', \'multiverseId\': 465681}, \'multiverseid\': 465681}, {\'name\': \'Esquelemental Relampejante\', \'text\': \'Atropelar, ímpeto\\nToda vez que Esquelemental Relampejante causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador descarta dois cards.\\nNo início da etapa final, sacrifique Esquelemental Relampejante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Esqueleto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f3be455-81bb-4982-ba68-dae9e1740b14\', \'multiverseId\': 465935}, \'multiverseid\': 465935}, {\'name\': \'Скелементаль Молний\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар, Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда Скелементаль Молний наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок сбрасывает две карты.\\nВ начале заключительного шага пожертвуйте Скелементаля Молний.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Скелет\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'285e0a2a-7502-44ab-a7c5-528495190fac\', \'multiverseId\': 466189}, \'multiverseid\': 466189}, {\'name\': \'爆雷骸灵\', \'text\': \'践踏，敏捷\\n每当爆雷骸灵对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手弃两张牌。\\n在结束步骤开始时，牺牲爆雷骸灵。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／骷髅妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cd0206a-a28b-43d4-87fc-e303d351b1bf\', \'multiverseId\': 466443}, \'multiverseid\': 466443}, {\'name\': \'爆雷骸靈\', \'text\': \'踐踏，敏捷\\n每當爆雷骸靈對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家棄兩張牌。\\n在結束步驟開始時，犧牲爆雷骸靈。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／骷髏妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6770e3b-af11-4662-bef1-aae6c0a05183\', \'multiverseId\': 466697}, \'multiverseid\': 466697}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blizzardkauz\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Blizzardkauz ins Spiel kommt und falls du eine andere verschneite bleibende Karte kontrollierst, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl außer dem Blizzardkauz ins Exil. Bringe sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464245&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'170150be-96e8-4230-b715-176a208e5b68\', \'multiverseId\': 464245}, \'multiverseid\': 464245}, {\'name\': \'Strix de la ventisca\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Strix de la ventisca entre al campo de batalla, si controlas otro permanente nevado, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea el Strix de la ventisca. Regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1296ced-e216-41e7-aae4-4e5f3b338d28\', \'multiverseId\': 464499}, \'multiverseid\': 464499}, {\'name\': \'Strix du blizzard\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nVol\\nQuand le Strix du blizzard arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez un autre permanent neigeux, exilez un permanent ciblé autre que le Strix du blizzard. Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\', \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464753&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83225595-1e54-4533-a4e4-6f8ebf57a2b7\', \'multiverseId\': 464753}, \'multiverseid\': 464753}, {\'name\': \'Strige della Tormenta\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando lo Strige della Tormenta entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli un altro permanente neve, esilia un permanente bersaglio diverso dallo Strige della Tormenta. Rimetti sul campo di battaglia quella carta sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Uccello\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f736051-910c-4e93-959c-e70591eff2e1\', \'multiverseId\': 465007}, \'multiverseid\': 465007}, {\'name\': \'吹雪の大梟\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n吹雪の大梟が戦場に出たとき、あなたが他の氷雪パーマネントをコントロールしている場合、吹雪の大梟でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e7483ed-862e-4b64-acc8-46e8cbca2215\', \'multiverseId\': 465261}, \'multiverseid\': 465261}, {\'name\': \'눈보라 올빼미\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n비행\\n눈보라 올빼미가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 다른 눈 지속물을 조종한다면, 눈보라 올빼미가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 카드를 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'눈 생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e76409c-43c3-43bf-a9d0-205e405f50e2\', \'multiverseId\': 465515}, \'multiverseid\': 465515}, {\'name\': \'Strix da Nevasca\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nQuando Strix da Nevasca entrar no campo de batalha, se você controlar outra permanente da neve, exile a permanente alvo que não seja Strix da Nevasca. Devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e228274a-44b1-411e-b166-58c6da7095a2\', \'multiverseId\': 465769}, \'multiverseid\': 465769}, {\'name\': \'Вьюжная Неясыть\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nПолет\\nКогда Вьюжная Неясыть выходит на поле битвы, если под вашим контролем есть другой снежный перманент, изгоните целевой перманент, отличный от Вьюжной Неясыти. Верните ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Снежное Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a93d0ff-9e6a-4f98-b502-58b61a29fa9d\', \'multiverseId\': 466023}, \'multiverseid\': 466023}, {\'name\': \'暴雪枭\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当暴雪枭进战场时，若你操控另一个雪境永久物，则放逐目标暴雪枭以外的永久物。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将所放逐的牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd149301-e4fd-4349-91bb-59955dea2524\', \'multiverseId\': 466277}, \'multiverseid\': 466277}, {\'name\': \'暴雪梟\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n飛行\\n當暴雪梟進戰場時，若你操控另一個雪境永久物，則放逐目標暴雪梟以外的永久物。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將所放逐的牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83b591e7-bc00-4607-9794-2f03e7f0eebb\', \'multiverseId\': 466531}, \'multiverseid\': 466531}]', "[{'name': 'Blütenmauer', 'text': 'Verteidiger\\nWenn die Blütenmauer ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Pflanze, Mauer', 'flavor': 'Jede Blüte war identisch, jeder Zweig, jedes Blatt fast störend exakt gleich.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464393&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ab158ad-c852-47db-937c-b92e0e497e82', 'multiverseId': 464393}, 'multiverseid': 464393}, {'name': 'Muro de flores', 'text': 'Defensor.\\nCuando el Muro de flores entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura — Muro planta', 'flavor': 'Cada flor, idéntica; cada hoja y pétalo, perturbadoramente exactos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464647&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '779d0074-68f0-403c-b96e-aea7875f3c21', 'multiverseId': 464647}, 'multiverseid': 464647}, {'name': 'Mur de fleurs', 'text': 'Défenseur\\nQuand le Mur de fleurs arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Créature : plante et mur', 'flavor': 'Les fleurs sont toutes identiques, avec une troublante exactitude. Chaque feuille, chaque pétale !', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464901&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fdd4df3-8ec1-49dd-b908-470c81f1bd8e', 'multiverseId': 464901}, 'multiverseid': 464901}, {'name': 'Muro di Bocciuoli', 'text': 'Difensore\\nQuando il Muro di Bocciuoli entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura — Muro Pianta', 'flavor': 'Ogni fiore identico a se stesso, ogni foglia e petalo uguali in modo inquietante.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465155&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a5b1e8d-b5a4-4f84-8466-cd90612c61fa', 'multiverseId': 465155}, 'multiverseid': 465155}, {'name': '花の壁', 'text': '防衛\\n花の壁が戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 植物・壁', 'flavor': '花の一つ一つが全く同じだ。葉の一枚一枚、花びらの一枚一枚が、気味悪いほど同じなのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465409&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0275c0a-166a-4641-9e31-b7f38c2ff8ec', 'multiverseId': 465409}, 'multiverseid': 465409}, {'name': '꽃의 벽', 'text': '수비태세\\n꽃의 벽이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '생물 — 식물 벽', 'flavor': '모든 꽃은 같은 모습을 하고 있고 모든 잎사귀는 기이할 정도로 똑같다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465663&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'efdc2fcf-a7e1-4c64-a46d-40355c4a8a55', 'multiverseId': 465663}, 'multiverseid': 465663}, {'name': 'Barreira de Flores', 'text': 'Defensor\\nQuando Barreira de Flores entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.', 'type': 'Criatura — Planta Barreira', 'flavor': 'Cada flor, idêntica; cada folha e pétala, perturbadoramente exatas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465917&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b40e32dc-42ec-4c43-a62d-1e5f7514c98a', 'multiverseId': 465917}, 'multiverseid': 465917}, {'name': 'Стена Цветов', 'text': 'Защитник\\nКогда Стена Цветов выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.', 'type': 'Существо — Растение Стена', 'flavor': 'Ни один цветок не отличается от другого, каждый лист и лепесток пугающе одинаковы.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466171&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff89156d-b85a-410e-ac76-58fbfeb7f29e', 'multiverseId': 466171}, 'multiverseid': 466171}, {'name': '花丛之墙', 'text': '守军\\n当花丛之墙进战场时，抓一张牌。', 'type': '生物 ～植物／墙', 'flavor': '每枝花，每片叶和每朵瓣都精确地相同。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466425&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2998a1b7-ef79-451f-b716-c9fc4d091f74', 'multiverseId': 466425}, 'multiverseid': 466425}, {'name': '花叢之牆', 'text': '守軍\\n當花叢之牆進戰場時，抽一張牌。', 'type': '生物 ～植物／牆', 'flavor': '每枝花，每片葉和每朵瓣都精確地相同。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466679&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b7eb31a-41be-4f4b-8462-dd9f25b5706d', 'multiverseId': 466679}, 'multiverseid': 466679}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bodensatz-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof haben Exhumieren {2}.\\nExhumieren {2} ({2}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464291&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e33ea0-f020-4c7d-a04b-c8608d309e1f\', \'multiverseId\': 464291}, \'multiverseid\': 464291}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado del escorial\', \'text\': \'Cada carta de criatura Fragmentado en tu cementerio tiene la habilidad de desenterrar {2}.\\nDesenterrar {2}. ({2}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19b5db83-9aa6-4aeb-ac18-4e1b4237c3c7\', \'multiverseId\': 464545}, \'multiverseid\': 464545}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde de la Bourbière\', \'text\': "Chaque carte de créature Slivoïde de votre cimetière a exhumation {2}.\\nExhumation {2} ({2} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464799&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'557ba08c-b6c4-4563-beb8-0a4221d6b03f\', \'multiverseId\': 464799}, \'multiverseid\': 464799}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante di Fecciorama\', \'text\': "Ogni carta creatura Tramutante nel tuo cimitero ha dissotterrare {2}.\\nDissotterrare {2} ({2}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b9041b2-cc16-40c7-8d03-e6a67a104956\', \'multiverseId\': 465053}, \'multiverseid\': 465053}, {\'name\': \'屑肉スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にある各スリヴァー・クリーチャー・カードはそれぞれ蘇生{2}を持つ。\\n蘇生{2}（{2}：あなたの墓地からこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fc721bc-df24-4310-b58e-2e9bd2581567\', \'multiverseId\': 465307}, \'multiverseid\': 465307}, {\'name\': \'썩은 땅 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 각 슬리버 생물 카드는 발굴 {2}를 가진다.\\n발굴 {2} ({2}: 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 전장으로 되돌린다. 이 카드는 신속을 얻는다. 이 카드를 다음 종료단 시작 또는 전장을 떠날 때 추방한다. 당신은 집중마법을 발동 할 수 있는 시기에만 발굴을 활성화할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4c63f2-8fd8-46cc-aedc-3861105d6d21\', \'multiverseId\': 465561}, \'multiverseid\': 465561}, {\'name\': \'Fractius do Vale das Escórias\', \'text\': \'Cada card de criatura do tipo Fractius em seu cemitério tem desenterrar {2}.\\nDesenterrar {2} ({2}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac53b68-8cc2-4e15-98c7-a6732b9d2c46\', \'multiverseId\': 465815}, \'multiverseid\': 465815}, {\'name\': \'Щепка Протухшего Болота\', \'text\': \'Каждая карта существа-Щепки на вашем кладбище имеет способность Откопать {2}.\\nОткопать {2} ({2}: верните эту карту из вашего кладбища на поле битвы. Она получает Ускорение. Изгоните ее в начале следующего заключительного шага, или если она должна покинуть поле битвы. Откапывайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cfdf605-a0ab-4089-9975-bdd3e061ca19\', \'multiverseId\': 466069}, \'multiverseid\': 466069}, {\'name\': \'渣境裂片妖\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中的每张裂片妖生物牌均具有破坟{2}。\\n破坟{2}（{2}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。破坟的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9cc9725-3404-4964-bc4f-026c0edea11f\', \'multiverseId\': 466323}, \'multiverseid\': 466323}, {\'name\': \'渣境裂片妖\', \'text\': \'你墳墓場中的每張裂片妖生物牌均具有破墳{2}。\\n破墳{2}（{2}：將此牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。它獲得敏捷異能。在下一個結束步驟開始時，或若它將離開戰場，將它放逐。破墳的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf30b4d-5390-4406-a30d-6a722992fff6\', \'multiverseId\': 466577}, \'multiverseid\': 466577}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogardanisches Drachenherz\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine andere Kreatur: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird das Bogardanische Drachenherz zu einem Drachen mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 4/4, Flugfähigkeit und Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Verlangen nach den Weiten der Lüfte muss gestillt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464323&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3890ee2f-9aee-4cdc-8a74-692e316a6afc\', \'multiverseId\': 464323}, \'multiverseid\': 464323}, {\'name\': \'Dracomorfo de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar otra criatura: Hasta el final del turno, el Dracomorfo de Bogardan se convierte en un Dragón con fuerza y resistencia base de 4/4 y las habilidades de volar y prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'Tal ansia de volar debe ser colmada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d77a416-aa74-405f-b7eb-832e41f79aba\', \'multiverseId\': 464577}, \'multiverseid\': 464577}, {\'name\': \'Cœur-dragon du Bogardân\', \'text\': "Sacrifiez une autre créature : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, le Cœur-dragon du Bogardân devient un dragon avec une force et une endurance de base de 4/4, le vol et la célérité.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Une soif d\'envol doit être assouvie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464831&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5e094d-4be8-4f1b-bdd6-56f7c4af9197\', \'multiverseId\': 464831}, \'multiverseid\': 464831}, {\'name\': \'Dragospirito di Bogardan\', \'text\': "Sacrifica un\'altra creatura: Fino alla fine del turno, il Dragospirito di Bogardan diventa un Drago con forza e costituzione base 4/4, volare e rapidità.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Impossibile non soddisfare la voglia di volare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0c7b22-0c04-4fe3-bb0c-3991c0847f16\', \'multiverseId\': 465085}, \'multiverseid\': 465085}, {\'name\': \'ボガーダンの龍心\', \'text\': \'他のクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、ボガーダンの龍心は飛行と速攻を持ち基本のパワーとタフネスが４/４のドラゴンになる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'飛翔への渇望は満たさねばならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dfbee73-8093-4683-aad8-a71c265873c9\', \'multiverseId\': 465339}, \'multiverseid\': 465339}, {\'name\': \'보가단 용심장\', \'text\': \'다른 생물을 희생한다: 턴종료까지, 보가단 용심장은 기본 공격력과 방어력이 4/4이고 비행과 신속을 가진 용이 된다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'날아오르려면 반드시 배를 채워야 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3fbe5db-4ed1-4fbc-9910-87c27475970f\', \'multiverseId\': 465593}, \'multiverseid\': 465593}, {\'name\': \'Coração Dracônico de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique outra criatura: Até o final do turno, Coração Dracônico de Bogardan se torna um Dragão com poder e resistência básicos 4/4, voar e ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'A sede de voar precisa ser saciada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a96a82c-7661-452f-84bd-290eb28b676c\', \'multiverseId\': 465847}, \'multiverseid\': 465847}, {\'name\': \'Богарданец с Сердцем Дракона\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте другое существо: до конца хода Богарданец с Сердцем Дракона становится Драконом с базовой силой и выносливостью 4/4, Полетом и Ускорением.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Жажду полета нельзя не утолять.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba9d5fe-7595-43ae-9c39-dd86323bc50e\', \'multiverseId\': 466101}, \'multiverseid\': 466101}, {\'name\': \'博卡登化龙师\', \'text\': \'牺牲另一个生物：直到回合结束，博卡登化龙师成为基础力量与防御力为4/4，具飞行与敏捷异能的龙。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'一飞冲天的渴望必须得到满足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03cab688-9b1c-4351-91c8-955fcfe11f35\', \'multiverseId\': 466355}, \'multiverseid\': 466355}, {\'name\': \'博卡登化龍師\', \'text\': \'犧牲另一個生物：直到回合結束，博卡登化龍師成為基礎力量與防禦力為4/4，具飛行與敏捷異能的龍。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'一飛沖天的渴望必須得到滿足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f9a035-4bb7-4182-b0d6-0f58127708c0\', \'multiverseId\': 466609}, \'multiverseid\': 466609}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshafter Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Immer wenn dieser Kreatur Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt sie einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl ebenso viele Schadenspunkte zu."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Siege gegen den Schwarm werden teuer erkauft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464351&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bec50b84-6523-496d-a0d1-b9f53432ac5a\', \'multiverseId\': 464351}, \'multiverseid\': 464351}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado malévolo\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen "Siempre que esta criatura reciba daño, hace esa misma cantidad de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'Las victorias contra la colmena son tragedias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7efc4670-d4a6-4e7e-ba7d-b3ce31079fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 464605}, \'multiverseid\': 464605}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde malveillant\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « À chaque fois que cette créature subit des blessures, elle inflige autant de blessures à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Face à l\'essaim, les victoires sont des tragédies.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464859&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe01371c-87e3-476e-b736-3e8a56c3eef2\', \'multiverseId\': 464859}, \'multiverseid\': 464859}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Astioso\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno "Ogniqualvolta viene inflitto danno a questa creatura, essa infligge altrettanti danni a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': "Le vittorie contro l\'alveare sono tragedie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee92dbbe-fc34-40af-a45f-37fe7fb6def1\', \'multiverseId\': 465113}, \'multiverseid\': 465113}, {\'name\': \'悪意スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーにダメージが与えられるたび、プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。これはそれにそのダメージに等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'巣に対する勝利は悲劇である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ea87705-d087-44ad-8d75-3f1a6b93cad2\', \'multiverseId\': 465367}, \'multiverseid\': 465367}, {\'name\': \'악의적인 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 "이 생물이 피해를 입을 때마다, 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 목표에게 그만큼의 피해를 입힌다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'둥지를 상대로 승리를 거두는 일은 항상 비극으로 끝난다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ff8f6c3-5a59-4f40-afc1-a59b15c5f754\', \'multiverseId\': 465621}, \'multiverseid\': 465621}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Malévolo\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm "Toda vez que esta criatura sofre dano, ela causa aquela quantidade de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'As vitórias contra a colônia são tragédias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3a66b2e-1255-4234-be42-ea0f0d4f4862\', \'multiverseId\': 465875}, \'multiverseid\': 465875}, {\'name\': \'Злобная Щепка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют способность «Каждый раз, когда этому существу наносятся повреждения, оно наносит столько же повреждений целевому игроку или planeswalker-у».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'Даже победы над ульем оборачиваются трагедиями.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd19f429-3b9d-4a01-8f58-aeb5a068a7c9\', \'multiverseId\': 466129}, \'multiverseid\': 466129}, {\'name\': \'怨毒裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「每当此生物受到伤害时，它对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成等量的伤害。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'胜过母巢会引大祸临头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbac18f4-d871-4766-92ed-9bec7bede6a1\', \'multiverseId\': 466383}, \'multiverseid\': 466383}, {\'name\': \'怨毒裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「每當此生物受到傷害時，它對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成等量的傷害。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'勝過母巢會引大禍臨頭。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ce9846-5085-456a-a7ab-9c62e48c9f3b\', \'multiverseId\': 466637}, \'multiverseid\': 466637}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutaler Klauenhieb\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls ihre Stärke 2 beträgt. Dann kämpft sie gegen eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Jede der Kreaturen fügt der anderen Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Neun Generationen Schmiedekunst sind neunhundert Pfund roher Gewalt nicht gewachsen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb14cb6-d423-49ca-9595-d58cd459e837\', \'multiverseId\': 464381}, \'multiverseid\': 464381}, {\'name\': \'Zarpazo brutal\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno si su fuerza es de 2. Luego, lucha contra la criatura objetivo que no controlas. (Cada una hace un daño igual a su fuerza a la otra.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Nueve generaciones de herrería siguen sin ser rival para cuatrocientos kilos de ira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff3db2b0-7708-40f3-8ba2-cd1c725d2544\', \'multiverseId\': 464635}, \'multiverseid\': 464635}, {\'name\': \'Frappe sauvage\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour si sa force est de 2. Ensuite, elle se bat contre une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Chacune inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à l\'autre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Neuf générations de talent métallurgique ne sont pas de taille face à quatre cents kilos de rage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464889&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6602d73-4809-4afb-bdbb-9c78f42429c5\', \'multiverseId\': 464889}, \'multiverseid\': 464889}, {\'name\': \'Spazzata Selvaggia\', \'text\': "Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno se la sua forza è 2. Poi lotta con una creatura bersaglio che non controlli. (Ogni creatura infligge all\'altra danno pari alla propria forza.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Cinque generazioni di maestri della metallurgia non hanno speranze contro cinquecento chili di furia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faa34120-5721-49de-94f0-b2715dbfaec9\', \'multiverseId\': 465143}, \'multiverseid\': 465143}, {\'name\': \'凶暴な一振り\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体と、あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。その前者のパワーが２であるなら、ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。その前者はその後者と格闘を行う。（それぞれはもう一方に自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'九世代にわたる金属加工技術でも、九百ポンドの怒りには太刀打ちできない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a483fa-339d-4e33-b9c1-ac75025ab0ce\', \'multiverseId\': 465397}, \'multiverseid\': 465397}, {\'name\': \'야만적인 휘두르기\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물과 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 첫 번째 목표의 공격력이 2라면 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다. 그 후 그 생물은 두 번째 목표와 싸운다. (각 생물은 서로에게 각자의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'아홉 세대에 걸친 금속 제련 기술도 구백 근의 분노에는 상대가 되지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a3f748e-741e-49d6-93c6-8444b976c41e\', \'multiverseId\': 465651}, \'multiverseid\': 465651}, {\'name\': \'Patada Selvagem\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno se seu poder for 2. Em seguida, ela luta com a criatura alvo que você não controla. (Cada uma causa dano igual ao seu poder à outra.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nove gerações de perícia metalúrgica não são páreo para quatrocentos quilos de fúria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9caf9a-540b-4dab-a5b1-c79a8c65b87b\', \'multiverseId\': 465905}, \'multiverseid\': 465905}, {\'name\': \'Дикий Замах\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+2 до конца хода, если его сила равна 2. Затем оно дерется с целевым существом не под вашим контролем. (Они наносят друг другу повреждения, равные своей силе.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Девять поколений мастерства работы по металлу — ничто перед девятью сотнями фунтов ярости.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a39955-dd9b-4051-8e4e-27bdd9355f70\', \'multiverseId\': 466159}, \'multiverseid\': 466159}, {\'name\': \'蛮野挥扫\', \'text\': \'选择目标由你操控的生物和目标不由你操控的生物。如果前者的力量为2，则其得+2/+2直到回合结束。然后它与后者互斗。（它们各向对方造成等同于本身力量的伤害。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'九代单传的金工技术也难挡九百斤怒火。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef65aea-af20-4296-ba93-657745374b7a\', \'multiverseId\': 466413}, \'multiverseid\': 466413}, {\'name\': \'蠻野揮掃\', \'text\': \'選擇目標由你操控的生物和目標不由你操控的生物。如果前者的力量為2，則其得+2/+2直到回合結束。然後它與後者互鬥。（它們各向對方造成等同於本身力量的傷害。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'九代單傳的金工技術也難擋九百斤怒火。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13085cdd-336a-4391-94f9-728f258fc33b\', \'multiverseId\': 466667}, \'multiverseid\': 466667}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brutbaum\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 2/2 farblosen Gestaltwandler-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wandelwicht. (Er hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Wandelwichte können sich nicht erinnern, woher sie stammen. Sie wissen nur, dass es keine Wiege war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464424&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'307d788b-b5a0-4317-9dde-ee4019a4bd33\', \'multiverseId\': 464424}, \'multiverseid\': 464424}, {\'name\': \'Ramas natales\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Metamorfo incolora 2/2 con la habilidad de cambiaformas. (Es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los cambiaformas no recuerdan de dónde vienen, solo saben que no fue de una cuna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'370c33ae-c834-41de-9454-10327740fd64\', \'multiverseId\': 464678}, \'multiverseid\': 464678}, {\'name\': \'Branches de gestation\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 2/2 incolore Changeforme avec le changelin. (Il a tous les types de créature.)\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les changelins ne se souviennent pas d\'où ils viennent. Ils savent simplement que ce n\'est pas d\'un berceau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464932&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6666266-8a99-4bf7-909c-8a80b64f8d85\', \'multiverseId\': 464932}, \'multiverseid\': 464932}, {\'name\': \'Rami Germoglianti\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Polimorfo 2/2 incolore con cangiante. (Ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I cangianti non ricordano da dove siano venuti. Sanno solo che non era una culla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32d78c64-2d40-4da6-bc4b-14ba58943d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 465186}, \'multiverseid\': 465186}, {\'name\': \'産み落とす太枝\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：多相を持つ無色の２/２の多相の戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。（それは常にすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'変わり身は自分がどこで生まれたのか覚えていないが、揺り籠でなかったことは分かっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c26a2ef-c08e-408b-b101-05666adeb2bc\', \'multiverseId\': 465440}, \'multiverseid\': 465440}, {\'name\': \'열매맺는 가지\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: 체인질링을 가진 2/2 무색 변신괴물 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다. (그 생물은 모든 생물 유형이다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'체인질링들은 자신들이 어디서 왔는지를 기억하지 못한다. 그곳이 요람이 아니었다는 것만은 알고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71f29808-b2d9-480b-a707-995aaca5be79\', \'multiverseId\': 465694}, \'multiverseid\': 465694}, {\'name\': \'Ramos Incubadores\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura incolor 2/2 do tipo Metamorfo com morfoloide. (Ela tem todos os tipos de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os morfoloides não conseguem se lembrar de onde vieram. Eles só sabem que não foi de um berço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832ed3e2-3dcd-4922-82a1-bccdd6595404\', \'multiverseId\': 465948}, \'multiverseid\': 465948}, {\'name\': \'Родильные Сучья\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 бесцветный Имитатор с Перевертышем. (У нее есть все типы существа.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Перевертыши не помнят, откуда появились на свет. Они знают лишь одно: это была не колыбель.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'048f74ea-5667-4ec3-b898-f36a4f0d927e\', \'multiverseId\': 466202}, \'multiverseid\': 466202}, {\'name\': \'孕生枝桠\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：派出一个2/2无色，具化形异能的变形兽衍生生物。（它具有所有生物类别。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'化形记不清自己从何处来。只记得那里不是摇篮。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d2fab48-7834-4d44-a571-c4a462dcc9f2\', \'multiverseId\': 466456}, \'multiverseid\': 466456}, {\'name\': \'孕生枝椏\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：派出一個2/2無色，具化形異能的變形獸衍生生物。（它具有所有生物類別。）\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'化形記不清自己從何處來。只記得那裡不是搖籃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3719d091-5472-4938-b644-748cdf218f1a\', \'multiverseId\': 466710}, \'multiverseid\': 466710}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bärenmutter\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}, schicke die Bärenmutter aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge zwei 2/2 grüne Bär-Kreaturenspielsteine. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bär\', \'flavor\': \'Auch ohne sie spüren ihre Jungen, wie sehr sie von ihrer Mutter geliebt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464374&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9230ce2c-970c-4688-beae-50152b033a96\', \'multiverseId\': 464374}, \'multiverseid\': 464374}, {\'name\': \'Mamá osa\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}, exiliar la Mamá osa de tu cementerio: Crea dos fichas de criatura Oso verdes 2/2. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Oso\', \'flavor\': \'Incluso sin ella, los cachorros siempre recordarán el amor de su madre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c847457-98ef-4e2f-aa8f-3f64186099c1\', \'multiverseId\': 464628}, \'multiverseid\': 464628}, {\'name\': \'Maman ourse\', \'text\': "{3}{G}{G}, exilez la Maman ourse depuis votre cimetière : Créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 verte Ours. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : ours\', \'flavor\': "Même sans elle, ses petits connaîtront toujours l\'amour de leur mère.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24542ee-5b91-4a2d-bba7-7e41883c11e3\', \'multiverseId\': 464882}, \'multiverseid\': 464882}, {\'name\': \'Mamma Orsa\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}, Esilia la Mamma Orsa dal tuo cimitero: Crea due pedine creatura Orso 2/2 verdi. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orso\', \'flavor\': "Anche senza di lei, i cuccioli conosceranno sempre l\'amore della loro madre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6cb032-7933-4fd2-9d3b-373a4bf7af03\', \'multiverseId\': 465136}, \'multiverseid\': 465136}, {\'name\': \'母熊\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}, あなたの墓地から母熊を追放する：緑の２/２の熊・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'母親がいなくなったとしても、小熊たちはその愛情を忘れない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2236c5b4-ed66-4150-b1c6-121e9a4302bc\', \'multiverseId\': 465390}, \'multiverseid\': 465390}, {\'name\': \'어미곰\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}, 당신의 무덤에서 어미곰을 추방한다: 2/2 녹색 곰 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곰\', \'flavor\': \'어미곰 없이도, 새끼곰들은 항상 어미의 사랑을 알고 있을 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2fc1c63-d24a-4e0e-8ff3-0da2833e77a6\', \'multiverseId\': 465644}, \'multiverseid\': 465644}, {\'name\': \'Mamãe Ursa\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}, exile Mamãe Ursa de seu cemitério: Crie duas fichas de criatura verde 2/2 do tipo Urso. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Urso\', \'flavor\': \'Mesmo sem sua presença, os filhotes recordarão para sempre o amor da mãe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b68e0e8-6283-4acf-a7d1-9b8d81743b39\', \'multiverseId\': 465898}, \'multiverseid\': 465898}, {\'name\': \'Мать-Медведица\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}, изгоните Мать-Медведицу из вашего кладбища: создайте две фишки существа 2/2 зеленый Медведь. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Медведь\', \'flavor\': \'Даже когда ее нет рядом, медвежат согревает материнская любовь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0db5b6c8-4f83-4dcf-9aac-ed9b304eb5ec\', \'multiverseId\': 466152}, \'multiverseid\': 466152}, {\'name\': \'护幼母熊\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}，从你的坟墓场放逐护幼母熊：派出两个2/2绿色的熊衍生生物。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～熊\', \'flavor\': \'即便母熊不在了，熊崽们还是能感受得到她的爱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8019b5e-92e4-427d-948e-cf91721ce740\', \'multiverseId\': 466406}, \'multiverseid\': 466406}, {\'name\': \'護幼母熊\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{G}，從你的墳墓場放逐護幼母熊：派出兩個2/2綠色的熊衍生生物。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～熊\', \'flavor\': \'即便母熊不在了，熊崽們還是能感受得到她的愛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0a0708c-c7ba-49c3-ad2d-3550d69107d5\', \'multiverseId\': 466660}, \'multiverseid\': 466660}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dem Sturm trotzen\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug vor ihm gewirkt wurde.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Zügle dein Ego und überall kann es so ruhig sein wie im Auge des Sturms."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464394&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea6651e-4f65-40a3-a62a-d2b43cb0daa6\', \'multiverseId\': 464394}, \'multiverseid\': 464394}, {\'name\': \'Capear el temporal\', \'text\': \'Ganas 3 vidas.\\nTormenta. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo lanzado antes que él en este turno.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Apacigua tu interior y cualquier lugar te resultará tan tranquilo como el ojo de un huracán".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b66e7235-0ca2-4fcf-92c9-aa3955e06c6a\', \'multiverseId\': 464648}, \'multiverseid\': 464648}, {\'name\': \'Résister à la tempête\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\nDéluge (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort lancé avant lui ce tour-ci.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Réprimez votre égo et tout endroit peut devenir aussi calme que l\'œil d\'un cyclone. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464902&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'493b2bb6-e803-4c9d-84f7-b5d386226869\', \'multiverseId\': 464902}, \'multiverseid\': 464902}, {\'name\': \'Resistere alla Tempesta\', \'text\': \'Guadagni 3 punti vita.\\nTempesta (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni magia lanciata prima in questo turno.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Placa il tuo ego e qualsiasi luogo potrà essere calmo come l\\\'occhio di un ciclone."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1df2dd0-6393-4dfa-a3e9-7a3a8478cde2\', \'multiverseId\': 465156}, \'multiverseid\': 465156}, {\'name\': \'嵐の乗り切り\', \'text\': \'あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「自我を抑えれば、どこにいようと台風の目のように静かになる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07f04664-4a29-4af1-b644-35c2d1b2b6c5\', \'multiverseId\': 465410}, \'multiverseid\': 465410}, {\'name\': \'고비 넘기기\', \'text\': \'당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\\n폭풍 (당신이 이 주문을 발동할 때, 이번 턴에 이 주문이 발동되기 전에 발동된 주문의 수만큼 이 주문을 복사한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자신을 누그러뜨리면 어디든 태풍의 눈처럼 평온한 곳이 될 수 있다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b2ede0c-6565-48cb-bb75-e27d358c3c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 465664}, \'multiverseid\': 465664}, {\'name\': \'Resistir à Tempestade\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\nRajada (Quando você conjurar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica conjurada antes dela neste turno.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Reprima seu ego e qualquer lugar poderá ser calmo como o olho de um furacão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce5e4706-8e75-4254-8093-748f6eb86872\', \'multiverseId\': 465918}, \'multiverseid\': 465918}, {\'name\': \'Пережить Бурю\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете 3 жизни.\\nШторм (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое заклинание, разыгранное в этом ходу до него.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Умерь свое эго, и ты в любом месте будешь спокоен, как в центре урагана».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'828d29eb-d3b8-4cf3-bba3-8755c82df945\', \'multiverseId\': 466172}, \'multiverseid\': 466172}, {\'name\': \'挺过风暴\', \'text\': \'你获得3点生命。\\n风暴（当施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「平复本我，四处便都如风眼般宁静。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f7c17e-7d79-4ff5-9253-0ab3bdada552\', \'multiverseId\': 466426}, \'multiverseid\': 466426}, {\'name\': \'挺過風暴\', \'text\': \'你獲得3點生命。\\n風暴（當施放此咒語時，本回合於它之前每施放過一個咒語，便將此咒語複製一次。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「平復本我，四處便都如風眼般寧靜。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2175cfe5-6e30-4a79-9a83-558bde880119\', \'multiverseId\': 466680}, \'multiverseid\': 466680}]', '[{\'name\': \'Der Erste Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet als dieser Zauberspruch. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nRemasuri-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, haben Kaskade.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464403&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a7bf36-8cf0-4893-abfe-7138427fdce7\', \'multiverseId\': 464403}, \'multiverseid\': 464403}, {\'name\': \'El Primer Fragmentado\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\\nLos hechizos de Fragmentado que lances tienen la habilidad de cascada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8770d78d-3f28-4260-a1b8-f44c36b9ff8d\', \'multiverseId\': 464657}, \'multiverseid\': 464657}, {\'name\': \'Le Premier slivoïde\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nLes sorts de slivoïde que vous lancez ont la cascade.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464911&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c900de65-6a6b-4fb5-b3fa-96b9390375ee\', \'multiverseId\': 464911}, \'multiverseid\': 464911}, {\'name\': \'Il Primo Tramutante\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\\nLe magie Tramutante che lanci hanno cascata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7eba9bf-f49e-4e61-99a5-73ebe82e296c\', \'multiverseId\': 465165}, \'multiverseid\': 465165}, {\'name\': \'初祖スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカードが追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ追放する。あなたはそれをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。追放したカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\nあなたが唱えるスリヴァー・呪文は続唱を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'351ead19-6456-4e6a-911d-7a9f9176bbf4\', \'multiverseId\': 465419}, \'multiverseid\': 465419}, {\'name\': \'최초의 슬리버\', \'text\': \'연쇄 (당신이 이 주문을 발동할 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위에서 비용이 더 적은 대지가 아닌 카드를 추방할 때까지 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 추방된 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.)\\n당신이 발동하는 슬리버 주문들은 연쇄를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e0b64a-2ba3-46ab-875d-e56136532886\', \'multiverseId\': 465673}, \'multiverseid\': 465673}, {\'name\': \'Primeiro Fractius\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile os cards do topo do seu grimório até exilar um que não seja terreno e que tenha custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\\nAs mágicas de Fractius que você conjura têm cascata.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Fractius\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d676af2-da78-4615-b3e6-cb9372b0b8df\', \'multiverseId\': 465927}, \'multiverseid\': 465927}, {\'name\': \'Первая Щепка\', \'text\': \'Каскад (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, изгоняйте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не изгоните не являющуюся землей и стоящую меньше карту. Вы можете разыграть ее без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Положите изгнанные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.)\\nЗаклинания Щепок, которые вы разыгрываете, имеют Каскад.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09f4e0f-d05c-487d-850a-dccdf60e8350\', \'multiverseId\': 466181}, \'multiverseid\': 466181}, {\'name\': \'原初裂片妖\', \'text\': \'倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。）\\n你施放的裂片妖咒语具有倾曳异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d46c58-67f5-4f1d-a41f-a48e75e61cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 466435}, \'multiverseid\': 466435}, {\'name\': \'原初裂片妖\', \'text\': \'傾曳（當你施放此咒語時，從你的牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到你放逐一張費用比此咒語低的非地牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將所放逐的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。）\\n你施放的裂片妖咒語具有傾曳異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68db7c01-d35e-4f47-bf27-27db49ee7a24\', \'multiverseId\': 466689}, \'multiverseid\': 466689}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Ehrenhaften anwerben\', \'text\': \'Rückkauf {3} (Du kannst zusätzlich {3} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst. Falls du dies tust, nimm diese Karte auf deine Hand, sowie sie verrechnet wird.)\\nErzeuge einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Sie versammelten sich für den Krieg und für ihren Seelenfrieden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464225&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9baae3b6-750f-4417-b817-8e2e0915819f\', \'multiverseId\': 464225}, \'multiverseid\': 464225}, {\'name\': \'Reclutar a los dignos\', \'text\': \'Recuperar {3}. (Puedes pagar {3} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo. Si lo haces, pon esta carta en tu mano en cuanto se resuelva.)\\nCrea una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Para que sus mentes estuvieran en paz, se reunieron para la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5772f6c-9a2f-4036-81a6-077d49acd352\', \'multiverseId\': 464479}, \'multiverseid\': 464479}, {\'name\': \'Recrutement des vaillants\', \'text\': \'Rappel {3} (Vous pouvez payer {3} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez cette carte dans votre main au moment où il se résout.)\\nCréez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Pour avoir la paix de l\'esprit, ils se mobilisaient pour la guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464733&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9d2c4c6-d346-4b23-963a-3dade637712b\', \'multiverseId\': 464733}, \'multiverseid\': 464733}, {\'name\': \'Reclutare i Degni\', \'text\': \'Riscatto {3} (Puoi pagare {3} addizionale mentre lanci questa magia. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano questa carta mentre si risolve.)\\nCrea una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Per portare la pace nei loro cuori, si radunarono per la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f29e93b-c133-4be8-96e9-305b8f76b1fb\', \'multiverseId\': 464987}, \'multiverseid\': 464987}, {\'name\': \'蓋世徴用\', \'text\': \'バイバック{3}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{3}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、これの解決に際し、このカードをあなたの手札に加える。）\\n白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'心の平安を求めて戦争に集ったのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2ed4780-dab4-4e02-95e5-1909ba9a977b\', \'multiverseId\': 465241}, \'multiverseid\': 465241}, {\'name\': \'적격자 모집\', \'text\': \'회수 {3} (당신은 이 주문을 발동하면서 추가로 {3}을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 이 주문을 해결하면서 이 카드를 당신의 손으로 가져간다.)\\n1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'마음의 평안을 위해, 그들은 전쟁을 준비했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'390abddb-9712-4047-932d-21bf5a18ff63\', \'multiverseId\': 465495}, \'multiverseid\': 465495}, {\'name\': \'Recrutar os Dignos\', \'text\': \'Recuperar {3} (Você pode pagar um custo adicional de {3} ao conjurar esta mágica. Se fizer isso, coloque este card na sua mão conforme ela for resolvida.)\\nCrie uma ficha de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Soldado.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Pela paz de espírito, eles se prepararam para a guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96b32181-504e-4a46-a860-bf565fcf1575\', \'multiverseId\': 465749}, \'multiverseid\': 465749}, {\'name\': \'Вербовка Достойных\', \'text\': \'Выкуп {3} (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете дополнительно заплатить {3}. Если вы это делаете, положите эту карту в вашу руку во время ее разрешения.)\\nСоздайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Солдат.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы в душе был мир, они собирались на войну.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b67458f3-c9ba-404a-af35-c553239a1f36\', \'multiverseId\': 466003}, \'multiverseid\': 466003}, {\'name\': \'招募勇士\', \'text\': \'购回{3}（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{3}。如果你如此作，则结算此咒语时将它放入你的手牌。）\\n派出一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'他们为了和平生活集结出战。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a59306-4c0c-4478-9f6b-fd02b547581c\', \'multiverseId\': 466257}, \'multiverseid\': 466257}, {\'name\': \'招募勇士\', \'text\': \'購回{3}（你施放此咒語時可以額外支付{3}。如果你如此作，則結算此咒語時將它放入你的手牌。）\\n派出一個1/1白色士兵衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'他們為了和平生活集結出戰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cd5de15-946c-434b-8924-fc9cbe321578\', \'multiverseId\': 466511}, \'multiverseid\': 466511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Entstehung\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls sich die Entstehung in deinem Friedhof befindet, kannst du {2}{G} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Inkarnation\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht Dryade, nicht Zentaur oder Avatar, sondern das Leben selbst.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d3d7394-aa3b-4e22-a716-557890af19d1\', \'multiverseId\': 464369}, \'multiverseid\': 464369}, {\'name\': \'Génesis\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si el Génesis está en tu cementerio, puedes pagar {2}{G}. Si lo haces, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Encarnación\', \'flavor\': \'No es una dríada, un centauro ni un avatar. Es la vida misma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e111b237-6900-4420-a22b-03e6afeb1a97\', \'multiverseId\': 464623}, \'multiverseid\': 464623}, {\'name\': \'La Genèse\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si La Genèse est dans votre cimetière, vous pouvez payer {2}{G}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature : incarnation\', \'flavor\': \'Ni une dryade, ni un centaure, ni un avatar, mais la vie en personne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464877&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64ec55a3-6ec9-4e16-80db-44ded0c2fd9a\', \'multiverseId\': 464877}, \'multiverseid\': 464877}, {\'name\': \'La Genesi\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se La Genesi è nel tuo cimitero, puoi pagare {2}{G}. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Incarnazione\', \'flavor\': \'Né driade, né centauro, né avatar, ma la vita stessa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62e3f3f7-2a35-46e8-8659-f6e738c3c0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 465131}, \'multiverseid\': 465131}, {\'name\': \'起源\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、起源があなたの墓地にある場合、あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたは{2}{G}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — インカーネーション\', \'flavor\': \'ドライアドでもケンタウルスでもアバターでもなく、生命そのものである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96497777-c5cc-4969-a66a-bc9e9c1fcb11\', \'multiverseId\': 465385}, \'multiverseid\': 465385}, {\'name\': \'기원\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 기원이 당신의 무덤에 있다면, 당신은 {2}{G}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 현신\', \'flavor\': \'드라이어드도, 켄타우로스도, 화신도 아닌 생명 그 자체이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60317bc6-316c-46e4-8ab0-e1428b1892fe\', \'multiverseId\': 465639}, \'multiverseid\': 465639}, {\'name\': \'Gênese\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se Gênese estiver em seu cemitério, você poderá pagar {2}{G}. Se fizer isso, devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Encarnação\', \'flavor\': \'Não é dríade nem centauro, tampouco avatar, mas a própria vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d3e922a-7295-4dbb-8a51-1a9a0bc87bbd\', \'multiverseId\': 465893}, \'multiverseid\': 465893}, {\'name\': \'Рождение\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки, если Рождение находится на вашем кладбище, вы можете заплатить {2}{G}. Если вы это делаете, верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Инкарнация\', \'flavor\': \'Не дриада, не кентавр и не аватара — сама жизнь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e129567d-18f7-448b-a3c5-67e2f3d7f8a7\', \'multiverseId\': 466147}, \'multiverseid\': 466147}, {\'name\': \'创生\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若创生在你的坟墓场中，则你可以支付{2}{G}。若你如此作，则将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～化身\', \'flavor\': \'不是树灵，也非半人马，更不是圣者，而是生命本身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbc4db54-fdd3-424d-8c6c-21ab9711c7be\', \'multiverseId\': 466401}, \'multiverseid\': 466401}, {\'name\': \'創生\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，若創生在你的墳墓場中，則你可以支付{2}{G}。若你如此作，則將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～化身\', \'flavor\': \'不是樹靈，也非半人馬，更不是聖者，而是生命本身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8029292f-f275-4f7b-8299-95c7661aa03c\', \'multiverseId\': 466655}, \'multiverseid\': 466655}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnernde Hufschläge\', \'text\': \'Aussetzen 4 — {G} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, bezahle {G}, schicke sie ins Exil und lege vier Zeitmarken auf sie. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, wirke die Karte, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\\nErzeuge zwei 4/4 grüne Nashorn-Kreaturenspielsteine, die Trampelschaden verursachen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464363&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c57856c3-34fd-468c-8641-fb6568932515\', \'multiverseId\': 464363}, \'multiverseid\': 464363}, {\'name\': \'Pasos aplastadores\', \'text\': \'Suspender 4 — {G}. (En lugar de lanzar esta carta de tu mano, paga {G} y exíliala con cuatro contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná.)\\nCrea dos fichas de criatura Rinoceronte verdes 4/4 con la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4d473e6-29c7-4623-a6d3-ee81a508ad18\', \'multiverseId\': 464617}, \'multiverseid\': 464617}, {\'name\': \'Bruits de sabots déferlants\', \'text\': \'Suspension 4 — {G} (Plutôt que lancer cette carte depuis votre main, payez {G} et exilez-la avec quatre marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, lancez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana.)\\nCréez deux jetons de créature 4/4 verte Rhinocéros avec le piétinement.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464871&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'926978a5-aa4b-4010-af18-49e30d4cc24b\', \'multiverseId\': 464871}, \'multiverseid\': 464871}, {\'name\': \'Passi Schiaccianti\', \'text\': "Sospendere 4—{G} (Invece di lanciare questa carta dalla tua mano, paga {G} ed esiliala con quattro segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, lancia la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)\\nCrea due pedine creatura Rinoceronte 4/4 verdi con travolgere.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32dea771-3577-40ea-b870-494c5ef7cac2\', \'multiverseId\': 465125}, \'multiverseid\': 465125}, {\'name\': \'衝撃の足音\', \'text\': \'待機４―{G}（あなたはあなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、{G}を支払い、時間カウンターを４個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）\\nトランプルを持つ緑の４/４のサイ・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'049643d6-1a51-4f82-899f-8636cabdbb39\', \'multiverseId\': 465379}, \'multiverseid\': 465379}, {\'name\': \'닥쳐드는 발소리\', \'text\': \'유예 4—{G} (이 카드를 손에서 발동하는 대신, {G}를 지불하여 이 카드에 시간 카운터 네 개를 올려놓고 추방한다. 당신의 유지단 시작에, 시간 카운터 한 개를 제거한다. 마지막 카운터가 제거됐을 때, 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 이 카드를 발동한다.)\\n돌진을 가진 4/4 녹색 코뿔소 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28fe2b3-1c9f-49c9-8468-73ebc9a8de2e\', \'multiverseId\': 465633}, \'multiverseid\': 465633}, {\'name\': \'Passos Desabalados\', \'text\': \'Suspender 4 — {G} (Em vez de conjurar este card da sua mão, pague {G} e exile-o com quatro marcadores temporais. No início de sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal. Quando o último for removido, conjure-o sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\\nCrie duas fichas de criatura verde 4/4 do tipo Rinoceronte com atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f20bdb68-68d5-4ad7-aac2-af1e380f38a9\', \'multiverseId\': 465887}, \'multiverseid\': 465887}, {\'name\': \'Громовой Топот\', \'text\': \'Отсрочка 4 — {G} (Вместо того, чтобы разыграть эту карту из вашей руки, заплатите {G} и изгоните ее с четырьмя временными жетонами на ней. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите один временной жетон. Когда удален последний временной жетон, разыграйте эту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\\nСоздайте две фишки существа 4/4 зеленый Носорог с Пробивным ударом.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5853b1a7-12f5-46c2-af28-4f4c4b3e2d71\', \'multiverseId\': 466141}, \'multiverseid\': 466141}, {\'name\': \'坏灭足迹\', \'text\': \'延缓4～{G}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你能支付{G}并将它放逐，且上面有四个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，则施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。）\\n派出两个4/4绿色，具践踏异能的犀牛衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55ada7e9-a0f6-4556-94a8-cc9d611de9db\', \'multiverseId\': 466395}, \'multiverseid\': 466395}, {\'name\': \'壞滅足跡\', \'text\': \'延緩4～{G}（除了從你手上施放此牌，你能支付{G}並將它放逐，且上面有四個計時指示物。在你的維持開始時，從其上移去一個計時指示物。當移去最後一個時，則施放它且不需支付其魔法力費用。）\\n派出兩個4/4綠色，具踐踏異能的犀牛衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60cd65ce-6919-487e-8150-831303fa9c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 466649}, \'multiverseid\': 466649}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnernder Dschinn\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Donnernde Dschinn angreift, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du in diesem Zug Karten gezogen hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dschinn\', \'flavor\': \'Er schlägt zu wie Entladungen eines Gedankenwirbels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464418&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d5e092f-d6a5-4ec2-917b-186be9cb23a0\', \'multiverseId\': 464418}, \'multiverseid\': 464418}, {\'name\': \'Djinn tormentoso\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Djinn tormentoso ataque, hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la cantidad de cartas que robaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Djinn\', \'flavor\': \'Azota como el rayo de una tormenta de ideas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17a6e331-7137-4679-b2c8-5cfe087f040b\', \'multiverseId\': 464672}, \'multiverseid\': 464672}, {\'name\': \'Djinn fulminant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Djinn fulminant attaque, il inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes que vous avez piochées ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : djinn\', \'flavor\': "Il s\'abat tel un éclair de génie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464926&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e8d18f3-94ca-44fd-8bf9-f8a51c8b7793\', \'multiverseId\': 464926}, \'multiverseid\': 464926}, {\'name\': \'Genio Tonante\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Genio Tonante attacca, infligge a un qualsiasi bersaglio danno pari al numero di carte che hai pescato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Genio\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue saette sono veri colpi di genio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a81a9a8b-4ec3-4832-996e-d7f2dc9a8f04\', \'multiverseId\': 465180}, \'multiverseid\': 465180}, {\'name\': \'雷鳴のジン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n雷鳴のジンが攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。これはそれに、このターンにあなたが引いたカードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジン\', \'flavor\': \'その一撃は渦まく知識の雷火のごとく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a695545-4a48-4be5-954e-1827d6233908\', \'multiverseId\': 465434}, \'multiverseid\': 465434}, {\'name\': \'천둥 지니\', \'text\': \'비행\\n천둥 지니가 공격할 때마다, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 천둥 지니는 그 목표에게 당신이 이번 턴에 뽑은 카드 수만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 지니\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 뇌폭풍에서 튀어나온 벼락처럼 공격한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b60e051-537a-4727-9e37-f22dc8d0f82d\', \'multiverseId\': 465688}, \'multiverseid\': 465688}, {\'name\': \'Gênio Trovejante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Gênio Trovejante ataca, ele causa a qualquer alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de cards que você comprou neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gênio\', \'flavor\': \'Seu golpe é como um lampejo de genialidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf0adc0a-6182-46fd-9cff-ed3a69a244c4\', \'multiverseId\': 465942}, \'multiverseid\': 465942}, {\'name\': \'Джинн-Громовержец\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Джинн-Громовержец атакует, он наносит любой цели повреждения, равные количеству карт, которые вы взяли в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Джинн\', \'flavor\': \'Он бьет, как молния — яркая, словно озарение.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f4bd9c-107b-4ff0-a3ff-bfd1e426fbb6\', \'multiverseId\': 466196}, \'multiverseid\': 466196}, {\'name\': \'雷鸣巨灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当雷鸣巨灵攻击时，它对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于你本回合已抓的牌数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨灵\', \'flavor\': \'它将脑力激荡化作真正意义的闪电击。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d4b534e-a8d7-4569-85c8-c21d33a232b2\', \'multiverseId\': 466450}, \'multiverseid\': 466450}, {\'name\': \'雷鳴巨靈\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當雷鳴巨靈攻擊時，它對任意一個目標造成傷害，其數量等同於你本回合已抽的牌數量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨靈\', \'flavor\': \'他將腦力激盪化作真正意義的閃電擊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60c5f97-6370-46fc-841e-78f55a254a34\', \'multiverseId\': 466704}, \'multiverseid\': 466704}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornado\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nUmwandlung {1}{G} ({1}{G}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder Ast und jeder Zweig schlug aus, um den Wald zu beschützen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464387&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'490267ab-439e-4a72-97d3-6459465a6723\', \'multiverseId\': 464387}, \'multiverseid\': 464387}, {\'name\': \'Tornado espinoso\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\\nCiclo {1}{G}. ({1}{G}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Cada rama, cada zarza y cada espina acudieron en defensa del bosque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b3e7ab3-9f14-4ac7-9b84-f230eebc81fd\', \'multiverseId\': 464641}, \'multiverseid\': 464641}, {\'name\': "Tourbillon d\'épines", \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\\nRecyclage {1}{G} ({1}{G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque branche, branchage et ronce se déchaîna pour défendre la forêt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464895&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91424cb0-77e2-4e4e-9e97-0aa5a455af10\', \'multiverseId\': 464895}, \'multiverseid\': 464895}, {\'name\': \'Tornado di Spine\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\\nCiclo {1}{G} ({1}{G}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni ramo, fronda e rovo scattò in difesa della foresta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b05cbb-c7cd-4416-9713-fdbd085ed711\', \'multiverseId\': 465149}, \'multiverseid\': 465149}, {\'name\': \'棘竜巻\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\\nサイクリング{1}{G}（{1}{G}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'大枝や小枝や棘がみな、森を守ろうと押し寄せた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca4af1da-cc52-4125-bdee-d177fda5ef50\', \'multiverseId\': 465403}, \'multiverseid\': 465403}, {\'name\': \'가시폭풍\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\\n순환 {1}{G} ({1}{G}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'모든 나무와 가지들과 덤불들이 숲을 지키려 뻗쳐나왔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcd0816e-9aa7-40bb-835f-9499ea377489\', \'multiverseId\': 465657}, \'multiverseid\': 465657}, {\'name\': \'Espetornado\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\\nReciclar {1}{G} ({1}{G}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Cada ramo, galho e espinheiro correu em defesa da floresta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35315e8b-07b0-49ff-8d8b-bbb042895dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 465911}, \'multiverseid\': 465911}, {\'name\': \'Колючий Вихрь\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\\nЦикл {1}{G} ({1}{G}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Каждый сук, ветка и колючка поднялись на защиту леса.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfc6cb54-5bae-458b-a88b-8cd7fe362614\', \'multiverseId\': 466165}, \'multiverseid\': 466165}, {\'name\': \'棘龙卷\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\\n循环{1}{G}（{1}{G}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'枝条荆棘纷纷伸出长鞭为树林立起防线。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14e851ab-46d4-4a52-b7a1-c0e9192dc221\', \'multiverseId\': 466419}, \'multiverseid\': 466419}, {\'name\': \'棘龍捲\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\\n循環{1}{G}（{1}{G}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'枝條荊棘紛紛伸出長鞭為樹林立起防線。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1e2b059-7a65-416c-bd56-2e119da292b2\', \'multiverseId\': 466673}, \'multiverseid\': 466673}]', "[{'name': 'Echo der Zeitalter', 'text': 'Jeder Spieler mischt die Karten auf seiner Hand und in seinem Friedhof in seine Bibliothek und zieht dann sieben Karten.\\nRückblende {2}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Die Gegenwart ist eine Frage der Perspektive.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464249&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '331b4950-003f-4156-bb48-338d43f7330c', 'multiverseId': 464249}, 'multiverseid': 464249}, {'name': 'Eco de los eones', 'text': 'Cada jugador baraja su mano y su cementerio en su biblioteca, luego roba siete cartas.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'El presente es una cuestión de perspectiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464503&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16a513bd-9b2b-4e57-bbc9-5267c408d873', 'multiverseId': 464503}, 'multiverseid': 464503}, {'name': 'Écho des éons', 'text': 'Chaque joueur mélange sa main et son cimetière avec sa bibliothèque et pioche ensuite sept cartes.\\nFlashback {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Le présent est une question de perspective.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464757&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9a6de5f-cd4c-4acf-bc77-35a302f46147', 'multiverseId': 464757}, 'multiverseid': 464757}, {'name': 'Eco degli Eoni', 'text': 'Ogni giocatore rimescola la propria mano e il proprio cimitero nel proprio grimorio, poi pesca sette carte.\\nFlashback {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Il presente è una questione di prospettiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465011&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37724f5a-77d1-439f-be19-3576ea264cdc', 'multiverseId': 465011}, 'multiverseid': 465011}, {'name': '永劫のこだま', 'text': '各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札と墓地を自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後カードを７枚引く。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{U}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '現在とは視点の問題なのだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465265&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f18d9eda-1523-45f2-8ccb-9f77b323a102', 'multiverseId': 465265}, 'multiverseid': 465265}, {'name': '영겁의 메아리', 'text': '각 플레이어는 자신의 손과 무덤을 서고에 섞어 넣은 후, 카드 일곱 장을 뽑는다.\\n회상 {2}{U} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': '현재라는 것은 관점의 문제다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465519&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46c8092e-2dec-4e2b-8233-4fbe3a30d817', 'multiverseId': 465519}, 'multiverseid': 465519}, {'name': 'Eco das Eras', 'text': 'Cada jogador embaralha a própria mão e o próprio cemitério no próprio grimório e compra sete cards.\\nRecapitular {2}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'O presente é questão de perspectiva.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465773&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1811fd9-c546-4a89-b1e5-1f5cc1b74ab9', 'multiverseId': 465773}, 'multiverseid': 465773}, {'name': 'Эхо Тысячелетий', 'text': 'Каждый игрок втасовывает свои руку и кладбище в свою библиотеку, затем берет семь карт.\\nВоспоминание {2}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Настоящее — это вопрос перспективы.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466027&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3175039f-ee77-42f5-9b28-dc4efdd9bbca', 'multiverseId': 466027}, 'multiverseid': 466027}, {'name': '亘古回声', 'text': '每位牌手将其手牌与坟墓场洗入其牌库，然后各抓七张牌。\\n返照{2}{U}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '何谓当下，端看你观点如何。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466281&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1614c813-0199-427e-9be5-29a178d45143', 'multiverseId': 466281}, 'multiverseid': 466281}, {'name': '亙古回聲', 'text': '每位玩家將其手牌與墳墓場洗入其牌庫，然後各抽七張牌。\\n返照{2}{U}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '何謂當下，端看你觀點如何。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466535&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f224362c-c793-4fd7-af7c-a89d610636d7', 'multiverseId': 466535}, 'multiverseid': 466535}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eichhörnchen-Nest\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nDas verzauberte Land hat „{T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Eichhörnchen-Kreaturenspielstein."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'In den Baumkronen, von vielen unbeachtet, lauert der dahinhuschende, piepsende Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464385&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862d2234-b3b3-4459-bf56-b2703b8b063c\', \'multiverseId\': 464385}, \'multiverseid\': 464385}, {\'name\': \'Nido de ardillas\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nLa tierra encantada tiene "{T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Ardilla verde 1/1".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'En las copas de los árboles, allá donde la mirada no alcanza, chasca y gorjea la muerte encarnada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'025ad571-c7ac-4153-8793-51eb0619864c\', \'multiverseId\': 464639}, \'multiverseid\': 464639}, {\'name\': "Nid d\'écureuils", \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nLe terrain enchanté a « {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Écureuil. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'À la cime des arbres, la mort trottine et gazouille sans être vue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464893&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53c55ee-4b65-4abb-af48-a0100eda7196\', \'multiverseId\': 464893}, \'multiverseid\': 464893}, {\'name\': \'Tana degli Scoiattoli\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nLa terra incantata ha "{T}: Crea una pedina creatura Scoiattolo 1/1 verde".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Tra le cime degli alberi, invisibile a molti, si nasconde una morte squittente e saltellante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cce976bb-6a58-47cf-b242-714cb3c104a3\', \'multiverseId\': 465147}, \'multiverseid\': 465147}, {\'name\': \'リスの巣\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントしている土地は「{T}：緑の１/１のリス・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'多くの者には見えない木の上では、さえずり走り回る死が潜んでいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f415e51-25ae-4915-8de4-56bbdcc29d95\', \'multiverseId\': 465401}, \'multiverseid\': 465401}, {\'name\': \'다람쥐 둥지\', \'text\': \'대지에 부여\\n부여된 대지는 "{T}: 1/1 녹색 다람쥐 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'나무 위에는, 많은 사람들이 눈치채지 못한, 날래고 찍찍대는 죽음이 도사리고 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b34d59e-8d6c-436e-98e4-e2991fd6867a\', \'multiverseId\': 465655}, \'multiverseid\': 465655}, {\'name\': \'Ninho de Esquilos\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nO terreno encantado tem "{T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Esquilo."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nas copas das árvores, oculta de muitos, espreita a morte tremelicante e inquieta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fab0de44-3f8c-464f-8d4b-ee5d704821db\', \'multiverseId\': 465909}, \'multiverseid\': 465909}, {\'name\': \'Беличье Гнездо\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю\\nЗачарованная земля имеет способность «{T}: создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленая Белка».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Среди крон, невидимая, таится прыгучая и трескучая смерть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f87feb-f7b7-4e24-81cc-3d18e9435d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 466163}, \'multiverseid\': 466163}, {\'name\': \'松鼠巢穴\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n所结附的地具有「{T}：派出一个1/1绿色松鼠衍生生物。」\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'树顶上视线未及之处，潜藏着絮聒而灵巧的杀机。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f1fc7f-c00a-4a0f-ad70-06731f7c095b\', \'multiverseId\': 466417}, \'multiverseid\': 466417}, {\'name\': \'松鼠巢穴\', \'text\': \'結附於地\\n所結附的地具有「{T}：派出一個1/1綠色松鼠衍生生物。」\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'樹頂上視線未及之處，潛藏著絮聒而靈巧的殺機。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6593f491-0d3f-49cc-ba59-179e195f1162\', \'multiverseId\': 466671}, \'multiverseid\': 466671}]', "[{'name': 'Einsame Sandbank', 'text': 'Die Einsame Sandbank kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464445&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '043cdbc2-0d57-43ed-b311-62e424324b29', 'multiverseId': 464445}, 'multiverseid': 464445}, {'name': 'Banco de arena solitario', 'text': 'El Banco de arena solitario entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464699&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a728732b-c12d-4904-abc9-02c92556cfe8', 'multiverseId': 464699}, 'multiverseid': 464699}, {'name': 'Banc de sable isolé', 'text': 'Le Banc de sable isolé arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464953&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '02162fa7-9167-49f1-9067-be30c75b5110', 'multiverseId': 464953}, 'multiverseid': 464953}, {'name': 'Secca Solitaria', 'text': 'La Secca Solitaria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465207&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b34ef486-c668-40b1-b830-76f7c7ce978c', 'multiverseId': 465207}, 'multiverseid': 465207}, {'name': '孤立した砂州', 'text': '孤立した砂州はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465461&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0db74185-27f9-443f-8423-1cf0a19596c8', 'multiverseId': 465461}, 'multiverseid': 465461}, {'name': '외로운 모래톱', 'text': '외로운 모래톱은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {U}를 추가한다.\\n순환 {U} ({U}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465715&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd74c5d7-752f-42a8-9643-3d8524f1359c', 'multiverseId': 465715}, 'multiverseid': 465715}, {'name': 'Banco de Areia Isolado', 'text': 'Banco de Areia Isolado entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465969&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db1761b9-ce0e-4697-b46c-6ca21f226f36', 'multiverseId': 465969}, 'multiverseid': 465969}, {'name': 'Одинокая Отмель', 'text': 'Одинокая Отмель выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\\nЦикл {U} ({U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466223&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27ab3139-8e7e-4eb1-90c5-834cec5f2dfc', 'multiverseId': 466223}, 'multiverseid': 466223}, {'name': '孤绝沙洲', 'text': '孤绝沙洲须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n循环{U}（{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466477&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e92773a4-619b-4c90-a0f5-1342ce4e3b88', 'multiverseId': 466477}, 'multiverseid': 466477}, {'name': '孤絕沙洲', 'text': '孤絕沙洲須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{U}。\\n循環{U}（{U}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466731&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b4b5a91e-acbb-4b26-a498-a3aee311744d', 'multiverseId': 466731}, 'multiverseid': 466731}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eisberg-Cancrix\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere verschneite bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du einen Spieler deiner Wahl die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof legen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Krabbe\', \'flavor\': \'Ihr Panzer kann allem widerstehen, außer Feuer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464257&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fc32885-b363-4c71-bee6-3046ee685a34\', \'multiverseId\': 464257}, \'multiverseid\': 464257}, {\'name\': \'Cáncrix iceberg\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro permanente nevado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes hacer que el jugador objetivo ponga las dos primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Cangrejo\', \'flavor\': \'Su caparazón lo aguanta todo salvo la descongelación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e80a39a4-7fd4-4017-922b-af414927a0d3\', \'multiverseId\': 464511}, \'multiverseid\': 464511}, {\'name\': \'Cancrix des icebergs\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre permanent neigeux arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez faire que le joueur ciblé mette les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : crabe\', \'flavor\': \'Sa coquille peut tout supporter, à part la fonte des neiges.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464765&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d27283d5-5a4f-4b40-a460-dbfc9f32e2ad\', \'multiverseId\': 464765}, \'multiverseid\': 464765}, {\'name\': \'Cancrix degli Iceberg\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro permanente neve entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi far mettere a un giocatore bersaglio le prime due carte del suo grimorio nel suo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Granchio\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo carapace può resistere a tutto tranne un disgelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de3b4d5e-0734-436f-9cf9-27870affe736\', \'multiverseId\': 465019}, \'multiverseid\': 465019}, {\'name\': \'氷山のカンクリックス\', \'text\': \'他の氷雪パーマネントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは「そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚自分の墓地に置く。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — カニ\', \'flavor\': \'その殻は雪解け以外の何物にも耐える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c674eab0-56cb-4a11-b048-28c873451dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 465273}, \'multiverseid\': 465273}, {\'name\': \'빙산 캔크릭스\', \'text\': \'다른 눈 지속물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 플레이어가 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'눈 생물 — 게\', \'flavor\': \'그것의 껍질은 녹는 것 말고는 모든 것을 견딜 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'265c09fc-e758-4681-b84d-d98761ad0c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 465527}, \'multiverseid\': 465527}, {\'name\': \'Cancrix do Iceberg\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra permanente da neve entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você pode fazer com que o jogador alvo coloque os dois cards do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Caranguejo\', \'flavor\': \'Sua carapaça resiste a qualquer coisa, menos ao degelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4cd4f4c-bec1-4280-a099-44cafcc924c9\', \'multiverseId\': 465781}, \'multiverseid\': 465781}, {\'name\': \'Айсберговый Канкрикс\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другой снежный перманент выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заставить целевого игрока положить две верхние карты его библиотеки на его кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Снежное Существо — Краб\', \'flavor\': \'Его панцирь может выдержать что угодно, кроме оттепели.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ed2e142-b854-4db2-a5ac-b528676c0b9f\', \'multiverseId\': 466035}, \'multiverseid\': 466035}, {\'name\': \'冰山蟹兽\', \'text\': \'每当另一个雪境永久物在你的操控下进战场时，你可以令目标牌手将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～蟹\', \'flavor\': \'它的寒冰外壳刀枪不入，唯热火可侵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3047aef7-5e27-4064-a382-a8702f4d4e19\', \'multiverseId\': 466289}, \'multiverseid\': 466289}, {\'name\': \'冰山蟹獸\', \'text\': \'每當另一個雪境永久物在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以令目標玩家將其牌庫頂的兩張牌置入其墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～蟹\', \'flavor\': \'牠的寒冰外殼刀槍不入，唯熱火可侵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bd2eb0f-c6e7-4df6-8429-f2c4a08e7f42\', \'multiverseId\': 466543}, \'multiverseid\': 466543}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eishautgolem\', \'text\': \'({S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten bleibenden Karte bezahlt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'In kalten Gefilden ist Eis gehorsamer als Stein.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464427&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97ae7387-dce4-494e-b063-91bcf40be7cc\', \'multiverseId\': 464427}, \'multiverseid\': 464427}, {\'name\': \'Gólem pellejohelado\', \'text\': \'({S} puede pagarse con un maná de un permanente nevado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto nevada — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'En los climas más fríos, el hielo es más obediente que la piedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd785679-04da-44ec-ad0e-14fa5f1445dc\', \'multiverseId\': 464681}, \'multiverseid\': 464681}, {\'name\': \'Golem à peau de glace\', \'text\': "({S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'un permanent neigeux.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact neigeuse : golem\', \'flavor\': \'Sous un climat polaire, la glace est plus docile que la roche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464935&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a11e0c-97d0-4c49-a2a6-cfb3c49fca09\', \'multiverseId\': 464935}, \'multiverseid\': 464935}, {\'name\': \'Golem Pellegelida\', \'text\': \'({S} può essere pagato con un mana da un permanente neve.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto Neve — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Nei climi più rigidi, il ghiaccio è più obbediente della pietra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'889d11e2-4dfe-4693-a609-b893ec4e6eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 465189}, \'multiverseid\': 465189}, {\'name\': \'氷皮ゴーレム\', \'text\': \'（{S}は氷雪パーマネントからのマナ１点で支払える。）\', \'type\': \'氷雪アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'寒冷な気候では、石よりも氷の方が従順である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80f701a-d88f-4194-9c26-c2dfd407ca1c\', \'multiverseId\': 465443}, \'multiverseid\': 465443}, {\'name\': \'얼음가죽 골렘\', \'text\': \'({S}는 눈 지속물의 마나 한 개로 지불할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'눈 마법물체 생물 — 골렘\', \'flavor\': \'추운 날씨에는, 얼음이 돌보다 더 말을 잘 듣는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcd4e72f-47f4-436c-a0c7-5ba581f561dd\', \'multiverseId\': 465697}, \'multiverseid\': 465697}, {\'name\': \'Golem Glaciodérmico\', \'text\': \'({S} pode ser pago com um mana de uma permanente da neve.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato da Neve — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Em climas mais frios, o gelo é mais obediente que a pedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e877090e-9576-4879-a418-2fc8bf680cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 465951}, \'multiverseid\': 465951}, {\'name\': \'Ледошкурый Голем\', \'text\': \'({S} можно оплатить одной маной от снежного перманента.)\', \'type\': \'Снежный Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': \'В холодном климате лед податливее камня.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e28d75-d092-4ca1-966d-243c786d9015\', \'multiverseId\': 466205}, \'multiverseid\': 466205}, {\'name\': \'冰壳巨像\', \'text\': \'（{S}能以产自雪境永久物的一点法术力来支付。）\', \'type\': \'雪境神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'在极寒气候中，冰块比石块更容易塑造。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e7467e9-9eca-41db-a053-025e40655f31\', \'multiverseId\': 466459}, \'multiverseid\': 466459}, {\'name\': \'冰殼巨像\', \'text\': \'（{S}能以產自雪境永久物的一點魔法力來支付。）\', \'type\': \'雪境神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'在極寒氣候中，冰塊比石塊更容易塑造。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa5534d-c944-40c5-bde4-f3cc120e1878\', \'multiverseId\': 466713}, \'multiverseid\': 466713}]', "[{'name': 'Eiszahn-Coatl', 'text': 'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Eiszahn-Coatl ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDer Eiszahn-Coatl hat Todesberührung, solange du mindestens drei andere verschneite bleibende Karten kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Verschneite Kreatur — Ophis', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464406&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6de4a92c-5ed2-4ae8-8a6d-b345906d7e61', 'multiverseId': 464406}, 'multiverseid': 464406}, {'name': 'Coatl colmillogélido', 'text': 'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Coatl colmillogélido entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nEl Coatl colmillogélido tiene la habilidad de toque mortal mientras controles al menos otros tres permanentes nevados.', 'type': 'Criatura nevada — Víbora', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464660&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88cf0a92-2372-42ee-9363-977688ac7f84', 'multiverseId': 464660}, 'multiverseid': 464660}, {'name': 'Coatl aux crocs de glace', 'text': 'Flash\\nVol\\nQuand le Coatl aux crocs de glace arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLe Coatl aux crocs de glace a le contact mortel tant que vous contrôlez au moins trois autres permanents neigeux.', 'type': 'Créature neigeuse : serpent', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464914&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2edfc6d9-9fbc-420b-a294-653629e2737d', 'multiverseId': 464914}, 'multiverseid': 464914}, {'name': 'Coatl dalle Zanne di Ghiaccio', 'text': 'Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando il Coatl dalle Zanne di Ghiaccio entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nIl Coatl dalle Zanne di Ghiaccio ha tocco letale fintanto che controlli almeno altri tre permanenti neve.', 'type': 'Creatura Neve — Serpente', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465168&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3ae77ec-c424-4d75-8fa8-783f8b93622a', 'multiverseId': 465168}, 'multiverseid': 465168}, {'name': '氷牙のコアトル', 'text': '瞬速\\n飛行\\n氷牙のコアトルが戦場に出たとき、カードを１枚引く。\\nあなたが他の氷雪パーマネントを少なくとも３つコントロールしているかぎり、氷牙のコアトルは接死を持つ。', 'type': '氷雪クリーチャー — 蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465422&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fb033d4-1a36-421a-b53c-bf6e9fc486d2', 'multiverseId': 465422}, 'multiverseid': 465422}, {'name': '얼음송곳니 코아틀', 'text': '섬광\\n비행\\n얼음송곳니 코아틀이 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n얼음송곳니 코아틀은 당신이 다른 눈 지속물을 세 개 이상 조종하는 한 치명타를 가진다.', 'type': '눈 생물 — 뱀', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465676&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd64c20c9-90ec-42df-ad82-72310d3cc887', 'multiverseId': 465676}, 'multiverseid': 465676}, {'name': 'Coatl Presa-de-gelo', 'text': 'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nQuando Coatl Presa-de-gelo entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nCoatl Presa-de-gelo terá toque mortífero enquanto você controlar ao menos três outras permanentes da neve.', 'type': 'Criatura da Neve — Cobra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465930&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc6a2221-9dfa-4d93-835a-1932d205b1b6', 'multiverseId': 465930}, 'multiverseid': 465930}, {'name': 'Коатль Ледяного Клыка', 'text': 'Миг\\nПолет\\nКогда Коатль Ледяного Клыка выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\nКоатль Ледяного Клыка имеет Смертельное касание, пока вы контролируете не менее трех других снежных перманентов.', 'type': 'Снежное Существо — Змея', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466184&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c182283-cfad-4613-8505-5c43cfaaa16e', 'multiverseId': 466184}, 'multiverseid': 466184}, {'name': '冰牙寇特蛇', 'text': '闪现\\n飞行\\n当冰牙寇特蛇进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n只要你操控至少三个其他雪境永久物，冰牙寇特蛇便具有死触异能。', 'type': '雪境生物 ～蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466438&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d9c8286-a843-4c0f-b2f8-2714c6f2b7b0', 'multiverseId': 466438}, 'multiverseid': 466438}, {'name': '冰牙寇特蛇', 'text': '閃現\\n飛行\\n當冰牙寇特蛇進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n只要你操控至少三個其他雪境永久物，冰牙寇特蛇便具有死觸異能。', 'type': '雪境生物 ～蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466692&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '528505e3-7034-412b-85af-4be9300348ee', 'multiverseId': 466692}, 'multiverseid': 466692}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eladamris Ruf\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Kreaturenkarte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Stammesrivalitäten und kleinliche Konflikte wurden beiseitegelegt, als Eladamri rief.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464400&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0326b7f-182a-45df-8c07-aaabef10b313\', \'multiverseId\': 464400}, \'multiverseid\': 464400}, {\'name\': \'Llamado de Eladamri\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de criatura, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Las rivalidades tribales y las disputas triviales se dejaban a un lado cuando Eladamri los convocaba.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'731071d6-091b-4e15-8363-68682b339325\', \'multiverseId\': 464654}, \'multiverseid\': 464654}, {\'name\': "Appel d\'Éladämri", \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de créature, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Les rivalités tribales et les disputes furent temporairement ignorées à l\'appel d\'Éladämri.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464908&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6202b39f-b0ff-420b-a7e8-ffcc92eded3d\', \'multiverseId\': 464908}, \'multiverseid\': 464908}, {\'name\': \'Convocazione di Eladamri\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta creatura, rivela quella carta e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Le rivalità tra tribù e le piccole dispute vennero messe da parte quando giunse la convocazione di Eladamri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e621c587-418e-44ee-afee-d9a035242b68\', \'multiverseId\': 465162}, \'multiverseid\': 465162}, {\'name\': \'エラダムリーの呼び声\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーからクリーチャー・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'エラダムリーからの召集がかかると、部族間の葛藤やつまらないいさかいは、すべて棚上げになった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f821420a-b984-4381-a060-3eec0cac177f\', \'multiverseId\': 465416}, \'multiverseid\': 465416}, {\'name\': \'엘라담리의 부름\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고에서 생물 카드 한 장을 찾아, 그 카드를 공개하고, 당신의 손으로 가져간 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'엘라담리가 부르자, 그들은 부족 간의 경쟁의식이나 사사로운 다툼을 멈추었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60615ba5-1867-42ae-bf00-805df27f5979\', \'multiverseId\': 465670}, \'multiverseid\': 465670}, {\'name\': \'Chamado de Eladamri\', \'text\': \'Procure um card de criatura em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Rivalidades tribais e disputas mesquinhas foram deixadas de lado ao chamado de Eladamri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'695193b0-986d-499a-95b2-c97dd4caf435\', \'multiverseId\': 465924}, \'multiverseid\': 465924}, {\'name\': \'Зов Эладамри\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту существа, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Раздоры между племенами и мелочные споры были забыты, когда позвал Эладамри.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b18fbe5-9634-466b-b149-52d109f57b63\', \'multiverseId\': 466178}, \'multiverseid\': 466178}, {\'name\': \'艾拉达力的召集\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张生物牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'在艾拉达力的召唤之下，部落之间的过节都暂且打住。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32ea8815-02dc-4cc5-80e8-e71a4cfba97c\', \'multiverseId\': 466432}, \'multiverseid\': 466432}, {\'name\': \'艾拉達力的召集\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋一張生物牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'在艾拉達力的召喚之下，部落之間的過節都暫且打住。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c9db4d5-90b0-4374-a7c0-6668dfc02fa8\', \'multiverseId\': 466686}, \'multiverseid\': 466686}]', '[{\'name\': \'Endling\', \'text\': \'{B}: Der Endling erhält Bedrohlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{B}: Der Endling erhält Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{B}: Der Endling erhält Unverwüstlichkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und falls keine +1/+1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer +1/+1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\\n{1}: Der Endling erhält +1/-1 oder -1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464292&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96fcd6fb-e9fc-49dd-a610-f522f4532037\', \'multiverseId\': 464292}, \'multiverseid\': 464292}, {\'name\': \'Defuntoide\', \'text\': \'{B}: El Defuntoide gana la habilidad de amenaza hasta el final del turno.\\n{B}: El Defuntoide gana la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\\n{B}: El Defuntoide gana la habilidad de resiliencia hasta el final del turno. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador +1/+1.)\\n{1}: El Defuntoide obtiene +1/-1 o -1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7179c26-c428-497a-96a8-8d71c9ae9fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 464546}, \'multiverseid\': 464546}, {\'name\': \'Mortelin\', \'text\': "{B} : Le Mortelin acquiert la menace jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{B} : Le Mortelin acquiert le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{B} : Le Mortelin acquiert la survivance jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.)\\n{1} : Le Mortelin gagne +1/-1 ou -1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464800&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4ed8089-b903-4eb1-a1f4-a0664aca4d70\', \'multiverseId\': 464800}, \'multiverseid\': 464800}, {\'name\': \'Letalmorfa\', \'text\': \'{B}: La Letalmorfa ha minacciare fino alla fine del turno.\\n{B}: La Letalmorfa ha tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\\n{B}: La Letalmorfa ha immortale fino alla fine del turno. (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini +1/+1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino +1/+1.)\\n{1}: La Letalmorfa prende +1/-1 o -1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52615ea3-2882-4aa1-8321-cc3185a4ca57\', \'multiverseId\': 465054}, \'multiverseid\': 465054}, {\'name\': \'終異種\', \'text\': \'{B}：ターン終了時まで、終異種は威迫を得る。\\n{B}：ターン終了時まで、終異種は接死を得る。\\n{B}：ターン終了時まで、終異種は不死を得る。（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\\n{1}：ターン終了時まで、終異種は＋１/－１か－１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbceea0-f82f-49b5-b0d8-7790d7fd47bc\', \'multiverseId\': 465308}, \'multiverseid\': 465308}, {\'name\': \'종말의 괴물\', \'text\': \'{B}: 종말의 괴물은 턴종료까지 호전적을 얻는다.\\n{B}: 종말의 괴물은 턴종료까지 치명타를 얻는다.\\n{B}: 종말의 괴물은 턴종료까지 불사를 얻는다. (이 생물이 죽을 때, 이 생물이 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 있지 않았다면, 이 생물을 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 가진 채로 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.)\\n{1}: 종말의 괴물은 턴종료까지 +1/-1 또는 -1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 변신괴물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4902641-dd0c-47e2-9aad-6e6e4798d70f\', \'multiverseId\': 465562}, \'multiverseid\': 465562}, {\'name\': \'Finalídeo\', \'text\': \'{B}: Finalídeo ganha ameaçar até o final do turno.\\n{B}: Finalídeo ganha toque mortífero até o final do turno.\\n{B}: Finalídeo ganha imortal até o final do turno. (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador +1/+1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador +1/+1.)\\n{1}: Finalídeo recebe +1/-1 ou -1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7d1af7a-83b6-46d0-a10b-3bb0e95fe130\', \'multiverseId\': 465816}, \'multiverseid\': 465816}, {\'name\': \'Гибелинг\', \'text\': \'{B}: Гибелинг получает Угрозу до конца хода.\\n{B}: Гибелинг получает Смертельное касание до конца хода.\\n{B}: Гибелинг получает Нетленность до конца хода. (Когда это существо умирает, если на нем не было ни одного жетона +1/+1, верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца с одним жетоном +1/+1 на нем.)\\n{1}: Гибелинг получает +1/-1 или -1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Имитатор\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8d1950-f856-45d7-8fbe-49cade112aad\', \'multiverseId\': 466070}, \'multiverseid\': 466070}, {\'name\': \'末灵精怪\', \'text\': \'{B}：末灵精怪获得威慑异能直到回合结束。\\n{B}：末灵精怪获得死触异能直到回合结束。\\n{B}：末灵精怪获得不息异能直到回合结束。（当此生物死去时，若其上没有+1/+1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且上面有一个+1/+1指示物。）\\n{1}：末灵精怪得+1/-1或-1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2f48b7-60ed-435a-a63b-70362f79268f\', \'multiverseId\': 466324}, \'multiverseid\': 466324}, {\'name\': \'末靈精怪\', \'text\': \'{B}：末靈精怪獲得威懾異能直到回合結束。\\n{B}：末靈精怪獲得死觸異能直到回合結束。\\n{B}：末靈精怪獲得不息異能直到回合結束。（當此生物死去時，若其上沒有+1/+1指示物，則將它在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場，且上面有一個+1/+1指示物。）\\n{1}：末靈精怪得+1/-1或-1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／變形獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa12e1f4-3559-4247-8c32-58f3527c834d\', \'multiverseId\': 466578}, \'multiverseid\': 466578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entfesseltes Gedeihen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Bleibende-Karte-Zauberspruch mit {X} in den Manakosten wirkst, verdopple den Wert von X.\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder eine Fähigkeit aktivierst und falls die Manakosten des Zauberspruchs oder die Aktivierungskosten der Fähigkeit {X} enthalten, kopiere den Zauberspruch oder die Fähigkeit. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464392&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fa26697-82f2-4fbb-a3a0-043eeff46a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 464392}, \'multiverseid\': 464392}, {\'name\': \'Florecimiento descontrolado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de permanente con un coste de maná que contenga {X}, duplica el valor de X.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro o actives una habilidad, si el coste de maná de ese hechizo o el coste de activación de esa habilidad contiene {X}, copia ese hechizo o habilidad. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668e04ac-d8a6-45ac-8f54-20aaa244051f\', \'multiverseId\': 464646}, \'multiverseid\': 464646}, {\'name\': \'Abondance déchaînée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de permanent dont le coût de mana contient {X}, doublez la valeur de X.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ou que vous activez une capacité, si le coût de mana de ce sort ou le coût d\'activation de cette capacité contient {X}, copiez ce sort ou cette capacité. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464900&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1575b6b-1f0a-42d9-a1ea-48211217f63e\', \'multiverseId\': 464900}, \'multiverseid\': 464900}, {\'name\': \'Abbondanza Sfrenata\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia permanente con un costo di mana che contiene {X}, raddoppia il valore di X.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria o attivi un\'abilità, se il costo di mana di quella magia o il costo di attivazione di quella abilità contengono {X}, copia quella magia o abilità. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa1be442-9fe5-4d18-9043-d56eec3a0b37\', \'multiverseId\': 465154}, \'multiverseid\': 465154}, {\'name\': \'解き放たれた繁栄\', \'text\': \'あなたがマナ・コストに{X}を含むパーマネント・呪文を唱えるたび、そのＸの値を２倍にする。\\nあなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるか起動型能力を起動するたび、その呪文のマナ・コストかその能力の起動コストが{X}を含む場合、その呪文か能力をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0660c83-bd15-4425-8ff4-96fcfc7e7a3f\', \'multiverseId\': 465408}, \'multiverseid\': 465408}, {\'name\': \'무한한 융성\', \'text\': \'당신이 마나 비용에 {X}가 있는 지속물 주문을 발동할 때마다, X의 값을 두 배로 한다.\\n당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법을 발동하거나 능력을 활성화할 때마다, 그 주문의 마나 비용 또는 그 능력의 활성화비용에 {X}가 있다면, 그 주문 또는 능력을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6ca700b-2feb-44f8-9a32-628c1d16a17f\', \'multiverseId\': 465662}, \'multiverseid\': 465662}, {\'name\': \'Florescimento Ilimitado\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de permanente com custo de mana que contenha {X}, dobre o valor de X.\\nToda vez que você conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço ou ativar uma habilidade, se o custo de mana daquela mágica ou o custo de ativação daquela habilidade contiver {X}, copie aquela mágica ou habilidade. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'323410ff-207a-4367-bc89-43a6526a6507\', \'multiverseId\': 465916}, \'multiverseid\': 465916}, {\'name\': \'Безграничный Расцвет\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание перманента с {X} в мана-стоимости, удвойте то значение X.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание, заклинание волшебства или активируете способность, если в мана-стоимости того заклинания или в стоимости активации той способности есть {X}, скопируйте то заклинание или способность. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7811ae50-5904-4e34-b1bd-49e502b43baf\', \'multiverseId\': 466170}, \'multiverseid\': 466170}, {\'name\': \'无拘滋养\', \'text\': \'每当你施放法术力费用中包含{X}的永久物咒语时，将X的数值加倍。\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语或起动异能时，若该咒语的法术力费用或该异能的起动费用中包含{X}，则复制该咒语或异能。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28c5e5cb-27da-4b43-8fd5-6ba01ce9b0aa\', \'multiverseId\': 466424}, \'multiverseid\': 466424}, {\'name\': \'無拘滋養\', \'text\': \'每當你施放魔法力費用中包含{X}的永久物咒語時，將X的數值加倍。\\n每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語或起動異能時，若該咒語的魔法力費用或該異能的起動費用中包含{X}，則複製該咒語或異能。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d8890ba-5d88-499f-b5c5-beef48cf80f7\', \'multiverseId\': 466678}, \'multiverseid\': 466678}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erdstoß-Zyklop\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Erdstoß-Zyklop ins Spiel kommt, können bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\\nUmwandlung {1}{R} ({1}{R}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Erdstoß-Zyklopen umwandelst, kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zyklop\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464345&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd658b3a-73d4-45cd-a804-767ad4242191\', \'multiverseId\': 464345}, \'multiverseid\': 464345}, {\'name\': \'Cíclope pierremoto\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cíclope pierremoto entre al campo de batalla, hasta dos criaturas objetivo no pueden bloquear este turno.\\nCiclo {1}{R}. ({1}{R}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Cíclope pierremoto, la criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cíclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57dc53c5-7721-414c-b118-c9558c4e50e6\', \'multiverseId\': 464599}, \'multiverseid\': 464599}, {\'name\': \'Cyclope tellurique\', \'text\': "Quand le Cyclope tellurique arrive sur le champ de bataille, jusqu\'à deux créatures ciblées ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\\nRecyclage {1}{R} ({1}{R}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Cyclope tellurique, la créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : cyclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464853&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'963d6df0-f5a1-46d5-afad-edef48ce8a40\', \'multiverseId\': 464853}, \'multiverseid\': 464853}, {\'name\': \'Ciclope Piedesisma\', \'text\': \'Quando il Ciclope Piedesisma entra nel campo di battaglia, fino a due creature bersaglio non possono bloccare in questo turno.\\nCiclo {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Ciclope Piedesisma, una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15a4afaf-bc54-40fa-afa9-1e581f0a6f7a\', \'multiverseId\': 465107}, \'multiverseid\': 465107}, {\'name\': \'震足サイクロプス\', \'text\': \'震足サイクロプスが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー最大２体を対象とする。このターン、それらではブロックできない。\\nサイクリング{1}{R}（{1}{R}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたが震足サイクロプスをサイクリングしたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイクロプス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85714900-f2a6-4f4a-bbd1-6bc2fbb7aa3e\', \'multiverseId\': 465361}, \'multiverseid\': 465361}, {\'name\': \'지진발자국 키클롭스\', \'text\': \'지진발자국 키클롭스가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 이번 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\\n순환 {1}{R} ({1}{R}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\\n당신이 지진발자국 키클롭스를 순환할 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 키클롭스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3605a932-42f7-4e96-a21d-2cff1b93eac3\', \'multiverseId\': 465615}, \'multiverseid\': 465615}, {\'name\': \'Ciclope Sismópode\', \'text\': \'Quando Ciclope Sismópode entra no campo de batalha, até duas criaturas alvo não podem bloquear neste turno.\\nReciclar {1}{R} ({1}{R}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você recicla Ciclope Sismópode, a criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b6a436b-d063-46bf-bf42-8507706527aa\', \'multiverseId\': 465869}, \'multiverseid\': 465869}, {\'name\': \'Циклоп Сотрясающей Поступи\', \'text\': \'Когда Циклоп Сотрясающей Поступи выходит на поле битвы, не более двух целевых существ не могут блокировать в этом ходу.\\nЦикл {1}{R} ({1}{R}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете Цикл Циклопа Сотрясающей Поступи, целевое существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Циклоп\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39173221-cf18-46e8-9b55-b13f3165a54f\', \'multiverseId\': 466123}, \'multiverseid\': 466123}, {\'name\': \'撼地独眼巨人\', \'text\': \'当撼地独眼巨人进战场时，至多两个目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\\n循环{1}{R}（{1}{R}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n每当你循环撼地独眼巨人时，目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～独眼巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'964427fb-0caa-43a9-bd76-eee1f2ce415b\', \'multiverseId\': 466377}, \'multiverseid\': 466377}, {\'name\': \'撼地獨眼巨人\', \'text\': \'當撼地獨眼巨人進戰場時，至多兩個目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\\n循環{1}{R}（{1}{R}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\\n每當你循環撼地獨眼巨人時，目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～獨眼巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'212fdaf7-a490-4d03-a825-5e9015399676\', \'multiverseId\': 466631}, \'multiverseid\': 466631}]', "[{'name': 'Erfahrener Pyromagier', 'text': 'Wenn der Erfahrene Pyromagier ins Spiel kommt, wirf zwei Karten ab und ziehe dann zwei Karten. Erzeuge für jede auf diese Weise abgeworfene Nichtland-Karte einen 1/1 roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{3}{R}{R}, schicke den Erfahrenen Pyromagier aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielsteine.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464348&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afc72dd9-eed4-43c3-b5b9-9dd644a26e49', 'multiverseId': 464348}, 'multiverseid': 464348}, {'name': 'Piromante experimentado', 'text': 'Cuando el Piromante experimentado entre al campo de batalla, descarta dos cartas, luego roba dos cartas. Por cada carta que no sea tierra descartada de esta manera, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental roja 1/1.\\n{3}{R}{R}, exiliar el Piromante experimentado de tu cementerio: Crea dos fichas de criatura Elemental rojas 1/1.', 'type': 'Criatura — Chamán humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464602&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e2b286f-d7a7-4662-9ac2-41af1aabd789', 'multiverseId': 464602}, 'multiverseid': 464602}, {'name': 'Pyromancien aguerri', 'text': 'Quand le Pyromancien aguerri arrive sur le champ de bataille, défaussez-vous de deux cartes, puis piochez deux cartes. Pour chaque carte non-terrain défaussée de cette manière, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Élémental.\\n{3}{R}{R}, exilez le Pyromancien aguerri depuis votre cimetière : Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Élémental.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et shamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464856&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '068f9c64-663f-40a2-9b7d-4b55f158ae2b', 'multiverseId': 464856}, 'multiverseid': 464856}, {'name': 'Piromante Navigato', 'text': 'Quando il Piromante Navigato entra nel campo di battaglia, scarta due carte, poi pesca due carte. Per ogni carta non terra scartata in questo modo, crea una pedina creatura Elementale 1/1 rossa.\\n{3}{R}{R}, Esilia il Piromante Navigato dal tuo cimitero: Crea due pedine creatura Elementale 1/1 rosse.', 'type': 'Creatura — Sciamano Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465110&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c605916-6ba6-43c6-a812-f0599b1b532d', 'multiverseId': 465110}, 'multiverseid': 465110}, {'name': '歴戦の紅蓮術士', 'text': '歴戦の紅蓮術士が戦場に出たとき、カード２枚を捨て、その後カードを２枚引く。これにより捨てられて土地でないカード１枚につき、赤の１/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{3}{R}{R}, あなたの墓地から歴戦の紅蓮術士を追放する：赤の１/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465364&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b18e054-76e6-48b5-b8b4-4cb151366721', 'multiverseId': 465364}, 'multiverseid': 465364}, {'name': '노련한 화염술사', 'text': '노련한 화염술사가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 두 장을 버린 후, 카드 두 장을 뽑는다. 이렇게 버려진 대지가 아닌 카드 한 장마다, 1/1 적색 정령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{3}{R}{R}, 당신의 무덤에서 노련한 화염술사를 추방한다: 1/1 적색 정령 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 주술사', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465618&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cf79a94-d170-405c-934e-868edaee3f57', 'multiverseId': 465618}, 'multiverseid': 465618}, {'name': 'Piromante Experiente', 'text': 'Quando Piromante Experiente entrar no campo de batalha, descarte dois cards e depois compre dois cards. Para cada card que não seja um terreno descartado dessa forma, crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Elemental.\\n{3}{R}{R}, exile Piromante Experiente de seu cemitério: Crie duas fichas de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Elemental.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Xamã', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465872&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ecc27c8-adec-4289-b285-9ae9529fb9ca', 'multiverseId': 465872}, 'multiverseid': 465872}, {'name': 'Опытный Пиромант', 'text': 'Когда Опытный Пиромант выходит на поле битвы, сбросьте две карты, затем возьмите две карты. За каждую не являющуюся землей карту, сброшенную таким образом, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 красный Элементаль.\\n{3}{R}{R}, изгоните Опытного Пироманта из вашего кладбища: создайте две фишки существа 1/1 красный Элементаль.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Шаман', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466126&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '360c1f0c-4b58-4649-9987-ba32090f1d71', 'multiverseId': 466126}, 'multiverseid': 466126}, {'name': '干练烈焰术士', 'text': '当干练烈焰术士进战场时，弃两张牌，然后抓两张牌。每以此法弃掉一张非地牌，便派出一个1/1红色元素衍生生物。\\n{3}{R}{R}，从你的坟墓场放逐干练烈焰术士：派出两个1/1红色元素衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466380&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11eca8b5-387e-4741-bc52-01adc1a41d8a', 'multiverseId': 466380}, 'multiverseid': 466380}, {'name': '幹練烈焰術士', 'text': '當幹練烈焰術士進戰場時，棄兩張牌，然後抽兩張牌。每以此法棄掉一張非地牌，便派出一個1/1紅色元素衍生生物。\\n{3}{R}{R}，從你的墳墓場放逐幹練烈焰術士：派出兩個1/1紅色元素衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～人類／祭師', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466634&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df621a94-91ab-4930-900a-ac2a0c93f86c', 'multiverseId': 466634}, 'multiverseid': 466634}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ergreifende Ansprache\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nÜberlast {5}{W} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Überlast-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, verändere seinen Text, indem du alle Vorkommen von „eine … deiner Wahl" durch „jede …" ersetzt.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Für Ruhm! Für Gerechtigkeit! Für unsere Königin!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464235&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16dfc16c-a10d-43ba-8872-8a4afe683c8e\', \'multiverseId\': 464235}, \'multiverseid\': 464235}, {\'name\': \'Discurso alentador\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\\nSobrecarga {5}{W}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de sobrecarga. Si lo haces, cambia su texto reemplazando "la criatura objetivo" por "cada criatura".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Por la gloria! ¡Por la justicia! ¡Por nuestra reina!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'034230c9-4415-421c-9cb9-a7b6b805864e\', \'multiverseId\': 464489}, \'multiverseid\': 464489}, {\'name\': \'Adresse poignante\', \'text\': "Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nSurcharge {5}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de surcharge. Si vous faites ainsi, modifiez son texte en remplaçant toutes les occurrences de « ciblé(e) » par « chaque ».)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Pour la gloire ! Pour la justice ! Pour notre reine ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464743&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37786819-f186-415b-9c14-3e90aad038ce\', \'multiverseId\': 464743}, \'multiverseid\': 464743}, {\'name\': \'Arringa Esaltante\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio che controlli prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\\nSovraccarico {5}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di sovraccarico. Se lo fai, cambiane il testo sostituendo "una creatura bersaglio" con "ogni creatura".)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per la gloria! Per la giustizia! Per la nostra regina!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e7c81fb-42ad-4935-aa92-d94ee26e0896\', \'multiverseId\': 464997}, \'multiverseid\': 464997}, {\'name\': \'奮起の演説\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n超過{5}{W}（あなたはこの呪文をこれの超過コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、対象は取らず、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーはそれぞれ＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「栄光のために！正義のために！女王陛下のために！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fb974d2-e4c7-4999-b5b3-b4b92f0c96da\', \'multiverseId\': 465251}, \'multiverseid\': 465251}, {\'name\': \'마음을 뒤흔드는 연설\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\\n과부하 {5}{W} (당신은 과부하 비용을 지불하여 이 주문을 발동할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 이 주문은 "당신이 조종하는 각 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다"로 내용이 변한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"영광을 위해! 정의를 위해! 여왕 폐하를 위해!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca6994ec-dc68-483e-af9a-22d555b26b25\', \'multiverseId\': 465505}, \'multiverseid\': 465505}, {\'name\': \'Discurso Instigante\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo que você controla recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno.\\nSobrecarga {5}{W} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de sobrecarga. Se fizer isso, altere seu texto substituindo todas as ocorrências de "a criatura alvo" por "cada criatura".)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Pela glória! Pela justiça! Pela nossa rainha!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'778afcf2-7212-4232-9c6f-e79885e6cefa\', \'multiverseId\': 465759}, \'multiverseid\': 465759}, {\'name\': \'Вдохновляющее Обращение\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо под вашим контролем получает +2/+2 до конца хода.\\nПерегрузка {5}{W} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Перегрузки. Если вы это делаете, измените в его тексте все слова «целевой» на «каждый».)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«За славу! За справедливость! За нашу королеву!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b8f38a-21b9-4282-9aa0-ea0ec28b5cef\', \'multiverseId\': 466013}, \'multiverseid\': 466013}, {\'name\': \'撼奋宣讲\', \'text\': \'目标由你操控的生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\\n超载{5}{W}（你可以支付此咒语的超载费用来施放它。如果你如此作，将其中的「目标」字样全部更改为「每个」。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「为了荣耀！为了正义！为了女王！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12b6c2a3-2568-458d-9551-019a5df66bd1\', \'multiverseId\': 466267}, \'multiverseid\': 466267}, {\'name\': \'撼奮宣講\', \'text\': \'目標由你操控的生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。\\n超載{5}{W}（你可以支付此咒語的超載費用來施放它。如果你如此作，將其中的「目標」字樣全部更改為「每個」。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「為了榮耀！為了正義！為了女王！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3155fbaf-6aae-45f2-b896-94c4015b4248\', \'multiverseId\': 466521}, \'multiverseid\': 466521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erhörte Gebete\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. Falls die Erhörten Gebete keine Kreatur sind, werden sie bis zum Ende des Zuges zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen zu einer 3/3 Engel-Kreatur mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Engel können frommes Flehen nicht ignorieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464205&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a832e87d-cb51-4668-a9ef-2c339cfdcad0\', \'multiverseId\': 464205}, \'multiverseid\': 464205}, {\'name\': \'Plegarias escuchadas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas 1 vida. Si las Plegarias escuchadas no son una criatura, se convierten en una criatura Ángel 3/3 con la habilidad de volar además de sus otros tipos hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Los ángeles no pueden ignorar las súplicas piadosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cd36aef-5017-4c69-b738-2f0200875ef2\', \'multiverseId\': 464459}, \'multiverseid\': 464459}, {\'name\': \'Prières exaucées\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez 1 point de vie. Si les Prières exaucées ne sont pas une créature, elles deviennent une créature 3/3 Ange avec le vol en plus de leurs autres types jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Les anges ne peuvent pas ignorer les pieuses suppliques.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464713&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5cbe1f2-d284-4716-81ac-17e76db66d19\', \'multiverseId\': 464713}, \'multiverseid\': 464713}, {\'name\': \'Preghiere Accolte\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni 1 punto vita. Se le Preghiere Accolte non sono una creatura, diventano una creatura Angelo 3/3 con volare in aggiunta ai loro altri tipi fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Gli angeli non possono ignorare le suppliche dei devoti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'002c547a-8ec0-4264-8e18-b2c05b0b3d5d\', \'multiverseId\': 464967}, \'multiverseid\': 464967}, {\'name\': \'叶えられた祈り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。叶えられた祈りがクリーチャーでないなら、ターン終了時まで、これはこれの他のタイプに加えて飛行を持つ３/３の天使・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'天使は敬虔な願いを無視できない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8846b68c-3566-46f1-b2cc-8b342e93cb5f\', \'multiverseId\': 465221}, \'multiverseid\': 465221}, {\'name\': \'응답받은 기도들\', \'text\': \'생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다. 응답받은 기도들이 생물이 아니라면, 응답받은 기도들은 턴종료까지 자신의 다른 유형에 더불어 비행을 가진 3/3 천사 생물이 된다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'천사들은 경건한 간청을 무시하지 못한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a0a07e5-0b88-4eca-bae0-1f9f15f588d4\', \'multiverseId\': 465475}, \'multiverseid\': 465475}, {\'name\': \'Preces Atendidas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você ganha 1 ponto de vida. Se Preces Atendidas não é uma criatura, ela se torna uma criatura 3/3 do tipo Anjo com voar além de seus outros tipos até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os anjos não conseguem ignorar preces pias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ba29c9a-26db-4d8f-a26b-bf91531bf7b3\', \'multiverseId\': 465729}, \'multiverseid\': 465729}, {\'name\': \'Услышанные Молитвы\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете 1 жизнь. Если Услышанные Молитвы не являются существом, они становятся существом 3/3 Ангел с Полетом в дополнение к своим другим типам до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Ангелы всегда отвечают на молитву праведника.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b8c297-6a27-4787-b6d2-f3721eb20018\', \'multiverseId\': 465983}, \'multiverseid\': 465983}, {\'name\': \'祝祷显灵\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你获得1点生命。若祝祷显灵不是生物，则它成为3/3，具飞行异能的天使生物直到回合结束，且仍具有原本类别。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'天使无法将虔诚祷告置诸不理。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ebd097b-6eaa-4837-bde6-f7168fe01fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 466237}, \'multiverseid\': 466237}, {\'name\': \'祝禱顯靈\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。若祝禱顯靈不是生物，則它成為3/3，具飛行異能的天使生物直到回合結束，且仍具有原本類別。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'天使無法將虔誠禱告置諸不理。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b4dc37e-29d9-4d8c-bf9e-64f2293961d2\', \'multiverseId\': 466491}, \'multiverseid\': 466491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erntehelfer des Gehöfts\', \'text\': \'Der Erntehelfer des Gehöfts enttappt nicht während deines Enttappsegments.\\n{2}, {Q}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Erntehelfer des Gehöfts. ({Q} ist das Enttappsymbol.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogelscheuche\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Felder abgeerntet sind, kannst du dich nirgends mehr verstecken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464425&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21200496-5bd5-4830-9bad-f1ab372283d4\', \'multiverseId\': 464425}, \'multiverseid\': 464425}, {\'name\': \'Cosechador de la granja\', \'text\': \'El Cosechador de la granja no se endereza durante tu paso de enderezar.\\n{2}, {Q}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Cosechador de la granja. ({Q} es el símbolo de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Espantapájaros\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando termine la cosecha, no tendrás dónde esconderte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817c7b7e-aadd-4ebf-b7fa-89db598fc064\', \'multiverseId\': 464679}, \'multiverseid\': 464679}, {\'name\': \'Glaneur fermier\', \'text\': \'Le Glaneur fermier ne se dégage pas pendant votre étape de dégagement.\\n{2}, {Q} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Glaneur fermier. ({Q} est le symbole de dégagement.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : épouvantail\', \'flavor\': "Lorsqu\'il terminera sa moisson, vous n\'aurez nulle part où vous cacher.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464933&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7986019-a6c1-4de6-8be3-2e3a8f7dd1b5\', \'multiverseId\': 464933}, \'multiverseid\': 464933}, {\'name\': \'Spigolatore della Fattoria\', \'text\': \'Lo Spigolatore della Fattoria non STAPpa durante il tuo STAP.\\n{2}, {Q}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 sullo Spigolatore della Fattoria. ({Q} è il simbolo di STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Spaventapasseri\', \'flavor\': \'Quando terminerà il raccolto, non avrai alcun posto in cui nasconderti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23849011-a471-4fa4-be3b-8f21fc117c12\', \'multiverseId\': 465187}, \'multiverseid\': 465187}, {\'name\': \'農場の収穫者\', \'text\': \'農場の収穫者はあなたのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\\n{2}, {Q}：農場の収穫者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。（{Q}はアンタップ・シンボルである。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — カカシ\', \'flavor\': \'収穫が終われば、もう隠れる場所はない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92cbaedf-2124-4a9b-9798-62d818c76518\', \'multiverseId\': 465441}, \'multiverseid\': 465441}, {\'name\': \'농장 수확꾼\', \'text\': \'농장 수확꾼은 당신의 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\\n{2}, {Q}: 농장 수확꾼에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. ({Q}는 언탭 기호이다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 허수아비\', \'flavor\': \'그것이 추수를 끝마치고 나면, 어디에도 숨을 곳이 없을 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ce636f4-c3d8-4570-b760-7a9f2ac26187\', \'multiverseId\': 465695}, \'multiverseid\': 465695}, {\'name\': \'Respigador da Chácara\', \'text\': \'Respigador da Chácara não desvira durante sua etapa de desvirar.\\n{2}, {Q}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Respigador da Chácara. ({Q} é o símbolo de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Espantalho\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ele terminar a colheita, você não terá onde se esconder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcc71f35-9c22-46c4-9ba1-8e92df810d59\', \'multiverseId\': 465949}, \'multiverseid\': 465949}, {\'name\': \'Фермерский Сборщик\', \'text\': \'Фермерский Сборщик не разворачивается во время вашего шага разворота.\\n{2}, {Q}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на Фермерского Сборщика. ({Q} — это символ разворота.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Пугало\', \'flavor\': \'Когда он закончит жатву, тебе будет негде спрятаться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1981f5d9-e2de-4950-acf3-68fe39ec0d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 466203}, \'multiverseid\': 466203}, {\'name\': \'农庄拾穗人\', \'text\': \'农庄拾穗人于你的重置步骤中不能重置。\\n{2}，{Q}：在农庄拾穗人上放置一个+1/+1指示物。（{Q}是重置符号。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～稻草人\', \'flavor\': \'待它收割完毕后，你便无处躲藏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c11a48-78b8-4c06-befb-928236f54851\', \'multiverseId\': 466457}, \'multiverseid\': 466457}, {\'name\': \'農莊拾穗人\', \'text\': \'農莊拾穗人於你的重置步驟中不能重置。\\n{2}，{Q}：在農莊拾穗人上放置一個+1/+1指示物。（{Q}是重置符號。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～稻草人\', \'flavor\': \'待它收割完畢後，你便無處躲藏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2accb60c-582d-42d6-87be-9760cb8df90d\', \'multiverseId\': 466711}, \'multiverseid\': 466711}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzschuppen-Wächter\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Länderkarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\\nFliegend, Eile\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Die Loyalität eines Drachen kann man sich nicht verdienen, aber man kann sie kaufen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464340&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc116503-73fa-49b5-9206-7c46d42f4b46\', \'multiverseId\': 464340}, \'multiverseid\': 464340}, {\'name\': \'Guardián escamas de cobre\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada carta de tierra en tu cementerio.\\nVuela, prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'La lealtad de un dragón no se gana, pero se puede comprar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581b9aa7-cb7c-4387-a5dc-cd4b97032c00\', \'multiverseId\': 464594}, \'multiverseid\': 464594}, {\'name\': \'Vigile aux écailles de minerai\', \'text\': \'Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte de terrain dans votre cimetière.\\nVol, célérité\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "La loyauté d\'un dragon ne se gagne pas, mais elle peut s\'acheter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464848&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec0d26c8-a22a-485e-bf50-9a36dd647b77\', \'multiverseId\': 464848}, \'multiverseid\': 464848}, {\'name\': \'Guardiano Metalscaglia\', \'text\': \'Questa magia costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni carta terra nel tuo cimitero.\\nVolare, rapidità\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Non puoi conquistare la fedeltà di un drago, ma puoi comprarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64738d95-eadf-4af9-a714-f49020f4bf8f\', \'multiverseId\': 465102}, \'multiverseid\': 465102}, {\'name\': \'鉱石鱗の守護者\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\\n飛行、速攻\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'ドラゴンの忠誠を勝ち取ることはできないが、買うことはできる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7434fe6-a105-477e-8140-c89c21bf48ab\', \'multiverseId\': 465356}, \'multiverseid\': 465356}, {\'name\': \'광석비늘 수호자\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 당신의 무덤에 있는 각 대지 카드마다 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n비행, 신속\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'용의 충성심은 얻을 수는 없지만, 살 수는 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c127a661-edd7-4996-b6a9-6b055ec14f83\', \'multiverseId\': 465610}, \'multiverseid\': 465610}, {\'name\': \'Guardião da Escama Férrea\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {1} a menos para ser conjurada para cada card de terreno em seu cemitério.\\nVoar, ímpeto\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'A lealdade de um dragão não se ganha, mas se compra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06e636af-aa34-458e-b502-690663c8cddb\', \'multiverseId\': 465864}, \'multiverseid\': 465864}, {\'name\': \'Стражник Рудной Чешуи\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {1} меньше за каждую карту земли на вашем кладбище.\\nПолет, Ускорение\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Верность дракона нельзя заслужить, а купить — пожалуйста.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a391308-ab3a-4cc6-85ff-6c6b0264a204\', \'multiverseId\': 466118}, \'multiverseid\': 466118}, {\'name\': \'铁鳞守护者\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张地牌，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n飞行，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'巨龙的忠心赢不到，但买得来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fef17b5-ccc0-4a77-9301-8c7b4fd112dc\', \'multiverseId\': 466372}, \'multiverseid\': 466372}, {\'name\': \'鐵鱗守護者\', \'text\': \'你墳墓場中每有一張地牌，此咒語便減少{1}來施放。\\n飛行，敏捷\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'巨龍的忠心贏不到，但買得來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cae9b04-08d2-44e3-9d4b-f3ed2af05e5a\', \'multiverseId\': 466626}, \'multiverseid\': 466626}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fakt oder Fiktion\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Ein Gegner teilt diese Karten auf zwei Haufen auf. Nimm die Karten des einen Haufens auf deine Hand und lege die anderen auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jede Wahl ist eine Freude."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464253&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ff26684-5153-4db0-b6ba-0c994e0e9778\', \'multiverseId\': 464253}, \'multiverseid\': 464253}, {\'name\': \'Realidad o ficción\', \'text\': \'Muestra las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Un oponente separa esas cartas en dos montones. Pon un montón en tu mano y el otro en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Elegir siempre es un placer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c45350d-74c3-4dfd-b0ce-3892a47c52e8\', \'multiverseId\': 464507}, \'multiverseid\': 464507}, {\'name\': \'Fait ou fiction\', \'text\': "Révélez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Un adversaire sépare ces cartes en deux tas. Mettez un tas dans votre main et l\'autre dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque choix est une joie. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464761&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'015196c2-5151-4779-8e4d-9074713d3124\', \'multiverseId\': 464761}, \'multiverseid\': 464761}, {\'name\': \'Certezza o Finzione\', \'text\': "Rivela le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Un avversario separa quelle carte in due pile. Aggiungi alla tua mano una pila e metti l\'altra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni scelta è una gioia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2714bc8-20be-4784-b2a9-70f6b5e88ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 465015}, \'multiverseid\': 465015}, {\'name\': \'嘘か真か\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚公開する。対戦相手１人はそれらのカードを２つの束に分ける。あなたは一方の束をあなたの手札に加え、もう一方をあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「選択とは喜びである。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66276947-4ad6-47fb-b8cd-3930f2cb2f05\', \'multiverseId\': 465269}, \'multiverseid\': 465269}, {\'name\': \'사실 혹은 허구\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 공개한다. 상대 한 명이 그 카드들을 두 더미로 나눈다. 그중 한 더미를 당신의 손으로 가져가고 다른 더미는 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"어떤 선택을 해도 즐겁지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'241f0e94-5df8-4b76-b90d-8d48709da2fd\', \'multiverseId\': 465523}, \'multiverseid\': 465523}, {\'name\': \'Fato ou Ficção\', \'text\': \'Revele os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Um oponente separa aqueles cards em dois montes. Você coloca um monte na própria mão e o outro no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Toda escolha é uma alegria."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'396b7bdf-faed-4148-8706-019a0d716d74\', \'multiverseId\': 465777}, \'multiverseid\': 465777}, {\'name\': \'Факт или Вымысел\', \'text\': \'Покажите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Оппонент делит те карты на две стопки. Положите одну стопку в вашу руку, а другую — на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Всякий выбор — наслаждение».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d85bd2e-4a2e-4daf-a18a-ae506bc5c513\', \'multiverseId\': 466031}, \'multiverseid\': 466031}, {\'name\': \'真伪莫辨\', \'text\': \'展示你牌库顶的五张牌。由任一对手将它们分成两堆。将其中一堆置于你手上，另一堆置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每项选择都是乐趣。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d6f9dce-649b-465d-85dc-e50a5a8769ff\', \'multiverseId\': 466285}, \'multiverseid\': 466285}, {\'name\': \'真偽莫辨\', \'text\': \'展示你牌庫頂的五張牌。由任一對手將它們分成兩堆。將其中一堆置於你手上，另一堆置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「每項選擇都是樂趣。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b871283a-b2b7-4c65-968a-bd6e531e5750\', \'multiverseId\': 466539}, \'multiverseid\': 466539}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuerblitz\', \'text\': \'Der Feuerblitz fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nRückblende {4}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wo das herkam gibt\\\'s noch mehr!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464325&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0979beec-199f-4405-9dd9-34af70043dbf\', \'multiverseId\': 464325}, \'multiverseid\': 464325}, {\'name\': \'Rayo de fuego\', \'text\': \'El Rayo de fuego hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Todavía me quedan más!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24ddb624-a9ce-4980-bb71-cca2e5fb2a78\', \'multiverseId\': 464579}, \'multiverseid\': 464579}, {\'name\': \'Coup de flamme\', \'text\': "Le Coup de flamme inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\nFlashback {4}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Et j\'en ai d\'autres en réserve ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464833&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d886cb62-d469-4654-90dc-57cb9c7738a4\', \'multiverseId\': 464833}, \'multiverseid\': 464833}, {\'name\': \'Lampo di Fuoco\', \'text\': \'Il Lampo di Fuoco infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\nFlashback {4}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ce ne sono altri da dove è arrivato quello!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2eb442d-62f8-43a3-94e2-5f7a077985e6\', \'multiverseId\': 465087}, \'multiverseid\': 465087}, {\'name\': \'炎の稲妻\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炎の稲妻はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「同じ場所にもっとあるぞ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'040b257a-b23e-4363-b161-ca25d9a07619\', \'multiverseId\': 465341}, \'multiverseid\': 465341}, {\'name\': \'불꽃화살\', \'text\': \'원하는 목표를 정한다. 불꽃화살은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n회상 {4}{R} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"아직 많이 남아있다고!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'207c0f12-933d-436c-9377-9f0c2dd48b1c\', \'multiverseId\': 465595}, \'multiverseid\': 465595}, {\'name\': \'Raio de Fogo\', \'text\': \'Raio de Fogo causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\\nRecapitular {4}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Tem mais de onde esse veio!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89d37cbc-ea74-4412-89c2-93f96265a5f9\', \'multiverseId\': 465849}, \'multiverseid\': 465849}, {\'name\': \'Огненная Стрела\', \'text\': \'Огненная Стрела наносит 2 повреждения любой цели.\\nВоспоминание {4}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Там, откуда она взялась, есть еще много!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc6ae88f-bc2b-4c43-aa03-a10451623aeb\', \'multiverseId\': 466103}, \'multiverseid\': 466103}, {\'name\': \'火束\', \'text\': \'火束对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\\n返照{4}{R}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这招我还多着呢！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d7bb614-c830-4f89-bdda-b48f34f3c271\', \'multiverseId\': 466357}, \'multiverseid\': 466357}, {\'name\': \'火束\', \'text\': \'火束對任意一個目標造成2點傷害。\\n返照{4}{R}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「這招我還多著呢！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adc99a11-0287-4737-bb86-0828b071074e\', \'multiverseId\': 466611}, \'multiverseid\': 466611}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuriges Eiland\', \'text\': \'{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere das Feurige Eiland: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wo Wasser die Leinwand ist und Lava die Farbe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464441&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0069491c-c2f6-4ea7-8a61-52bf3edb7926\', \'multiverseId\': 464441}, \'multiverseid\': 464441}, {\'name\': \'Islote ardiente\', \'text\': \'{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {U} o {R}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Islote ardiente: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Un lugar donde el agua es el lienzo y la lava, la pintura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc304d6c-298e-4593-ac74-0ede5452a5cf\', \'multiverseId\': 464695}, \'multiverseid\': 464695}, {\'name\': \'Îlot ardent\', \'text\': "{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Îlot ardent : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Là où l\'eau est une toile, et la lave la peinture.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464949&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64c72a1e-2ec7-4888-9f51-832052fe77df\', \'multiverseId\': 464949}, \'multiverseid\': 464949}, {\'name\': \'Isolotto Fiammeggiante\', \'text\': "{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {U} o {R}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Isolotto Fiammeggiante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Dove l\'acqua è la tela e la lava la pittura.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef058796-2c80-4f97-96f2-c1f0301b9876\', \'multiverseId\': 465203}, \'multiverseid\': 465203}, {\'name\': \'焦熱島嶼域\', \'text\': \'{T}, １点のライフを支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{R}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 焦熱島嶼域を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'水のキャンバスに、溶岩の絵の具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61ef4c89-9a8c-44b5-8190-38124cd491aa\', \'multiverseId\': 465457}, \'multiverseid\': 465457}, {\'name\': \'불타는 작은 섬\', \'text\': \'{T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: {U} 또는 {R}를 추가한다.\\n{1}, {T}, 불타는 작은 섬을 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'물이 있는 곳이 화폭이고 용암은 물감이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'418bdfe1-55d4-4ab5-8534-07ce723c8151\', \'multiverseId\': 465711}, \'multiverseid\': 465711}, {\'name\': \'Ilhota Ardente\', \'text\': \'{T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione {U} ou {R}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Ilhota Ardente: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Onde a água se faz tela e a lava se faz tinta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6d740c1-80af-4136-a98c-1c848757dc43\', \'multiverseId\': 465965}, \'multiverseid\': 465965}, {\'name\': \'Пламенный Островок\', \'text\': \'{T}, заплатите 1 жизнь: добавьте {U} или {R}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Пламенный Островок: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Там, где вода — это холст, а лава — краска.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6eef25b-3b17-498c-ab43-06408eb6a8a2\', \'multiverseId\': 466219}, \'multiverseid\': 466219}, {\'name\': \'炽火孤岛\', \'text\': \'{T}，支付1点生命：加{U}或{R}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲炽火孤岛：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'流水作底，熔岩为画。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e14c8c2-38b6-4c8b-91cf-d64732d92e2f\', \'multiverseId\': 466473}, \'multiverseid\': 466473}, {\'name\': \'熾火孤島\', \'text\': \'{T}，支付1點生命：加{U}或{R}。\\n{1}，{T}，犧牲熾火孤島：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'流水作底，熔岩為畫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'902ccf32-ff0d-45f6-9737-1c46c80960cf\', \'multiverseId\': 466727}, \'multiverseid\': 466727}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuriges Elementar\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {2} weniger, falls sich eine Länderkarte in deinem Friedhof befindet.\\nWenn das Feurige Elementar ins Spiel kommt, kannst du es einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Manifestierte vulkanische Urgewalt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464336&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a7aa905-40bf-4e54-9252-52e350c19081\', \'multiverseId\': 464336}, \'multiverseid\': 464336}, {\'name\': \'Elemental ígneo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo si hay una carta de tierra en tu cementerio.\\nCuando el Elemental ígneo entre al campo de batalla, puedes hacer que haga 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'La encarnación de la violencia de un volcán.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a42b98-32e5-4550-925c-23246400409f\', \'multiverseId\': 464590}, \'multiverseid\': 464590}, {\'name\': \'Élémental ignescent\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer s\'il y a une carte de terrain dans votre cimetière.\\nQuand l\'Élémental ignescent arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez faire qu\'il inflige 2 blessures à une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': "La violence volcanique à l\'état pur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6298e6bb-d8ba-4a84-b315-bbf3d5282791\', \'multiverseId\': 464844}, \'multiverseid\': 464844}, {\'name\': \'Elementale Igneo\', \'text\': "Questa magia costa {2} in meno per essere lanciata se c\'è una carta terra nel tuo cimitero.\\nQuando l\'Elementale Igneo entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi fargli infliggere 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'La violenza vulcanica resa manifesta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1ac6ff2-953f-48df-a012-41273d53962f\', \'multiverseId\': 465098}, \'multiverseid\': 465098}, {\'name\': \'炎血の精霊\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地に土地・カードがあるなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\n炎血の精霊が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「炎血の精霊はそれに２点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'姿を現した火山の猛威。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff81c291-ee1f-4903-9cb3-bbe6bcc8061d\', \'multiverseId\': 465352}, \'multiverseid\': 465352}, {\'name\': \'화성 정령\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 대지 카드가 있다면 이 주문은 발동하는 데 {2}가 덜 든다.\\n화성 정령이 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 화성 정령이 그 생물에게 피해 2점을 입히게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'화산의 맹렬함이 육체를 얻었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d0e8d0-1898-4c52-98ed-ea30dbbe80ff\', \'multiverseId\': 465606}, \'multiverseid\': 465606}, {\'name\': \'Elemental Ígneo\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica custa {2} a menos para ser conjurada se houver um card de terreno em seu cemitério.\\nQuando Elemental Ígneo entra no campo de batalha, você pode fazer com que ele cause 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'A encarnação da violência vulcânica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce33a63e-c88a-4804-bad3-5077c8c49ed9\', \'multiverseId\': 465860}, \'multiverseid\': 465860}, {\'name\': \'Пламенный Элементаль\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывание этого заклинания стоит на {2} меньше, если на вашем кладбище есть карта земли.\\nКогда Пламенный Элементаль выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заставить его нанести 2 повреждения целевому существу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Живое воплощение вулканической ярости.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f14a0625-b738-4fb6-9cfa-c15357c2c2bb\', \'multiverseId\': 466114}, \'multiverseid\': 466114}, {\'name\': \'火热元素\', \'text\': \'如果你坟墓场中有地牌，则此咒语减少{2}来施放。\\n当火热元素进战场时，你可以令它对目标生物造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'火山的暴力具现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaddc2ba-fdc5-4231-96b3-ddfe11e03546\', \'multiverseId\': 466368}, \'multiverseid\': 466368}, {\'name\': \'火熱元素\', \'text\': \'如果你墳墓場中有地牌，則此咒語減少{2}來施放。\\n當火熱元素進戰場時，你可以令它對目標生物造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': \'火山的暴力具現。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e877d408-2d3c-43b9-b8da-45e94f1e9065\', \'multiverseId\': 466622}, \'multiverseid\': 466622}]', '[{\'name\': \'Finsterwald-Einsiedlerin\', \'text\': \'Verschwinden 3 (Diese Kreatur kommt mit drei Zeitmarken ins Spiel. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, opfere sie.)\\nWenn die Finsterwald-Einsiedlerin ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge vier 1/1 grüne Eichhörnchen-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nEichhörnchen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464364&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e76804b-e565-44d2-8519-45277eb4b1ef\', \'multiverseId\': 464364}, \'multiverseid\': 464364}, {\'name\': \'Ermitaña del bosque profundo\', \'text\': \'Desmaterializarse 3. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo de ella. Cuando sea removido el último, sacrifícala.)\\nCuando la Ermitaña del bosque profundo entre al campo de batalla, crea cuatro fichas de criatura Ardilla verdes 1/1.\\nLas Ardillas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8a0010-a087-417f-a96c-3f4cae38c8d0\', \'multiverseId\': 464618}, \'multiverseid\': 464618}, {\'name\': \'Ermite du fond des bois\', \'text\': "Disparition 3 (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur elle, trois marqueurs « temps ». Au début de votre entretien, retirez-lui un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, sacrifiez-la.)\\nQuand l\'Ermite du fond des bois arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez quatre jetons de créature 1/1 verte Écureuil.\\nLes écureuils que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464872&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec9a100a-23ad-4151-a655-f78783f4f1ca\', \'multiverseId\': 464872}, \'multiverseid\': 464872}, {\'name\': \'Eremita del Folto della Foresta\', \'text\': "Evanescenza 3 (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini tempo. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo da essa. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, sacrificala.)\\nQuando l\'Eremita del Folto della Foresta entra nel campo di battaglia, crea quattro pedine creatura Scoiattolo 1/1 verdi.\\nGli Scoiattoli che controlli prendono +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eee2f984-ec3b-4b84-838e-92f0328f708e\', \'multiverseId\': 465126}, \'multiverseid\': 465126}, {\'name\': \'深き森の隠遁者\', \'text\': \'消失３（このクリーチャーは、時間カウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、これの上から時間カウンター１個を取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\\n深き森の隠遁者が戦場に出たとき、緑の１/１のリス・クリーチャー・トークンを４体生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているリスは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69121b51-11a7-48ae-9be8-83690b03ca32\', \'multiverseId\': 465380}, \'multiverseid\': 465380}, {\'name\': \'깊은 숲의 은자\', \'text\': \'소실 3 (이 생물은 시간 카운터 세 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다. 당신의 유지단 시작에, 이 생물에서 시간 카운터 한 개를 제거한다. 마지막 카운터가 제거될 때, 이 생물을 희생한다.)\\n깊은 숲의 은자가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 녹색 다람쥐 생물 토큰 네 개를 만든다.\\n당신이 조종하는 다람쥐들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eaa6224-ce13-4c74-9a9d-ce4b85df7d70\', \'multiverseId\': 465634}, \'multiverseid\': 465634}, {\'name\': \'Eremita da Floresta Profunda\', \'text\': \'Desaparecer 3 (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores temporais. No início da sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal dela. Quando o último for removido, sacrifique-a.)\\nQuando Eremita da Floresta Profunda entrar no campo de batalha, crie quatro fichas de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Esquilo.\\nOs Esquilos que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c05c5934-f3a6-4622-8f7f-82c7bb5477f3\', \'multiverseId\': 465888}, \'multiverseid\': 465888}, {\'name\': \'Отшельница из Глубокой Чащи\', \'text\': \'Исчезновение 3 (Это существо выходит на поле битвы с тремя временными жетонами на нем. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите с него один временной жетон. Когда удален последний временной жетон, пожертвуйте это существо.)\\nКогда Отшельница из Глубокой Чащи выходит на поле битвы, создайте четыре фишки существа 1/1 зеленая Белка.\\nБелки под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06cbfb43-b4ff-4dab-84b2-9fd1daa0d414\', \'multiverseId\': 466142}, \'multiverseid\': 466142}, {\'name\': \'深林隐者\', \'text\': \'消逝3（此生物进战场时上面有三个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，将它牺牲。）\\n当深林隐者进战场时，派出四个1/1绿色松鼠衍生生物。\\n由你操控的松鼠得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3c71cc1-aca7-443f-b7a5-07d7e1ac447f\', \'multiverseId\': 466396}, \'multiverseid\': 466396}, {\'name\': \'深林隱者\', \'text\': \'消逝3（此生物進戰場時上面有三個計時指示物。在你的維持開始時，從其上移去一個計時指示物。當移去最後一個時，將它犧牲。）\\n當深林隱者進戰場時，派出四個1/1綠色松鼠衍生生物。\\n由你操控的松鼠得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fed54ab-1053-455c-8ef4-1e81dc8ce0f1\', \'multiverseId\': 466650}, \'multiverseid\': 466650}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flammende Fäuste\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verursacht eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Trampelschaden und erhält +1/+0 für jede Karte, die du in diesem Zug gezogen hast.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Feuer ist schon immer mein treuester Gefährte."\\n—Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464326&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fd47fca-2878-4d7c-9985-bf78a4146c1d\', \'multiverseId\': 464326}, \'multiverseid\': 464326}, {\'name\': \'Puños de llamas\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta. Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de arrollar y obtiene +1/+0 por cada carta que robaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"El fuego siempre fue mi más fiel compañero".\\n—Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'969bad45-fa06-44c2-bc67-ff39e45689e4\', \'multiverseId\': 464580}, \'multiverseid\': 464580}, {\'name\': \'Poings de flammes\', \'text\': "Piochez une carte. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la créature ciblée acquiert le piétinement et gagne +1/+0 pour chaque carte que vous avez piochée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Le feu a toujours été mon plus fidèle compagnon. »\\n—Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464834&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0458920b-cb62-47c6-8fe6-a6efe4583795\', \'multiverseId\': 464834}, \'multiverseid\': 464834}, {\'name\': \'Pugni di Fiamme\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta. Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio ha travolgere e prende +1/+0 per ogni carta che hai pescato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il fuoco è sempre stato il mio compagno più fedele."\\n—Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fcd8daf-7748-4a67-b4ba-3d268ab19966\', \'multiverseId\': 465088}, \'multiverseid\': 465088}, {\'name\': \'炎の拳\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。カードを１枚引く。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーはトランプルを得て、このターンにあなたが引いたカード１枚につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「炎はずっと、私の頼れる相棒だ。」\\n――ジャレッド・カルサリオン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5927e6e8-a3e0-4030-8d07-9a34fcc6f776\', \'multiverseId\': 465342}, \'multiverseid\': 465342}, {\'name\': \'불길의 주먹\', \'text\': \'카드 한 장을 뽑는다. 생물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지, 그 생물은 돌진을 얻고 당신이 이번 턴에 뽑은 각 카드마다 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"불길은 언제나 내 충직한 동료였지."\\n—자레드 카르탈리온\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bb26e38-9220-4021-8446-9fe76314c5e8\', \'multiverseId\': 465596}, \'multiverseid\': 465596}, {\'name\': \'Punhos Chamejantes\', \'text\': \'Compre um card. Até o final do turno, a criatura alvo ganha atropelar e recebe +1/+0 para cada card que você comprou neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"O fogo sempre foi meu companheiro mais fiel."\\n— Jared Carthalion\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f67c449c-c2bb-4be6-8c02-26d8382ff3e1\', \'multiverseId\': 465850}, \'multiverseid\': 465850}, {\'name\': \'Кулаки Пламени\', \'text\': \'Возьмите карту. До конца хода целевое существо получает Пробивной удар и +1/+0 за каждую карту, которую вы взяли в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Огонь всегда был самым верным из моих спутников».\\n— Джаред Карталион\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe685937-e54c-452c-b41f-3aba69718036\', \'multiverseId\': 466104}, \'multiverseid\': 466104}, {\'name\': \'火焰冲拳\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌。直到回合结束，目标生物获得践踏异能，且你本回合每已抓一张牌，便得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「火焰一直是我最忠实的伙伴。」\\n～贾瑞卡萨隆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7075be43-809a-4260-a129-8fc10c914545\', \'multiverseId\': 466358}, \'multiverseid\': 466358}, {\'name\': \'火焰衝拳\', \'text\': \'抽一張牌。直到回合結束，目標生物獲得踐踏異能，且你本回合每已抽一張牌，便得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「火焰一直是我最忠實的伙伴。」\\n～賈瑞卡薩隆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15fcb929-d518-4b2c-9210-20d92e96939e\', \'multiverseId\': 466612}, \'multiverseid\': 466612}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fluss der Gedanken\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl legt die obersten vier Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof. Du mischst bis zu vier Karten aus deinem Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.\\nReproduktion {2}{U}{U} (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn so oft, wie du seine Reproduktionskosten bezahlst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464274&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05d412ec-557c-4ad1-aa10-ebdf5c983892\', \'multiverseId\': 464274}, \'multiverseid\': 464274}, {\'name\': \'Flujo de pensamientos\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo pone las cuatro primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio. Barajas hasta cuatro cartas de tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.\\nReproducir {2}{U}{U}. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada vez que pagaste su coste de reproducir. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6409596-7454-47a8-90bf-c2c1d3087e81\', \'multiverseId\': 464528}, \'multiverseid\': 464528}, {\'name\': \'Source de pensée\', \'text\': "Le joueur ciblé met les quatre cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière. Vous mélangez jusqu\'à quatre cartes depuis votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.\\nDuplication {2}{U}{U} (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez payé son coût de duplication. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464782&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dbbaef2-e01e-4d9c-964c-3e293c2dc1e9\', \'multiverseId\': 464782}, \'multiverseid\': 464782}, {\'name\': \'Flusso di Pensiero\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero le prime quattro carte del suo grimorio. Rimescoli nel tuo grimorio fino a quattro carte dal tuo cimitero.\\nReplicare {2}{U}{U} (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni volta che hai pagato il suo costo di replica. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'654cc108-b18c-4aa0-8132-43fa33ca15d5\', \'multiverseId\': 465036}, \'multiverseid\': 465036}, {\'name\': \'思考の流れ\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚自分の墓地に置く。あなたはあなたの墓地からカード最大４枚をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\\n複製{2}{U}{U}（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたがこれの複製コストを支払った回数１回につき１つ、これをコピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e10dcc03-f1fd-44bc-b463-96ade45b1e7a\', \'multiverseId\': 465290}, \'multiverseid\': 465290}, {\'name\': \'생각의 시냇물\', \'text\': \'플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다. 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드를 최대 네 장까지 당신의 서고에 섞어 넣는다.\\n복제 {2}{U}{U} (당신이 이 주문을 발동할 때, 당신이 이 주문의 복제 비용을 지불한 횟수만큼 이 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본들의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f111a26-aadb-4876-a004-5b2d0dd1958a\', \'multiverseId\': 465544}, \'multiverseid\': 465544}, {\'name\': \'Fluxo de Pensamento\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo coloca os quatro cards do topo do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério. Você embaralha até quatro cards de seu cemitério em seu grimório.\\nReplicar {2}{U}{U} (Quando você conjurar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada vez que tiver pago seu custo de replicação. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb3c962f-50d0-42bd-b400-8f42a34b5416\', \'multiverseId\': 465798}, \'multiverseid\': 465798}, {\'name\': \'Поток Мыслей\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок кладет четыре верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище. Вы втасовываете не более четырех карт из вашего кладбища в вашу библиотеку.\\nКопия {2}{U}{U} (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, скопируйте его столько раз, сколько раз вы уплатили его стоимость Копии. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для тех копий.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad29ff57-df25-4ea8-abda-d4f78070a8ed\', \'multiverseId\': 466052}, \'multiverseid\': 466052}, {\'name\': \'思绪流动\', \'text\': \'目标牌手将其牌库顶的四张牌置入其坟墓场。你将至多四张牌从你的坟墓场洗入你的牌库。\\n覆诵{2}{U}{U}（当你施放此咒语时，你每支付过一次覆诵费用，便将它复制一次。你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3c1432-788f-471d-b958-1c9780ef1632\', \'multiverseId\': 466306}, \'multiverseid\': 466306}, {\'name\': \'思緒流動\', \'text\': \'目標玩家將其牌庫頂的四張牌置入其墳墓場。你將至多四張牌從你的墳墓場洗入你的牌庫。\\n覆誦{2}{U}{U}（當你施放此咒語時，你每支付過一次覆誦費用，便將它複製一次。你可以為每個複製品選擇新的目標。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6461379-3351-4663-ab70-d16408a1503a\', \'multiverseId\': 466560}, \'multiverseid\': 466560}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flügelscherben\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert eine angreifende Kreatur.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug vor ihm gewirkt wurde. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Ihre Federn durchschneiden die Luft und sind genauso scharf, wie sie lautlos sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464241&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ebdb41-5c28-4b7c-a48a-5666e9321035\', \'multiverseId\': 464241}, \'multiverseid\': 464241}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentos de ala\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo sacrifica una criatura atacante.\\nTormenta. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo lanzado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Sus plumas cortan el aire, tan afiladas como silenciosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42e8a871-fcee-4ffe-af87-76d484b1a127\', \'multiverseId\': 464495}, \'multiverseid\': 464495}, {\'name\': "Échardes d\'ailes", \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé sacrifie une créature attaquante.\\nDéluge (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort lancé avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Ses plumes fendaient l\'air, tranchantes et silencieuses.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464749&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb37fff-f020-4a8a-b1e7-05bde3f41768\', \'multiverseId\': 464749}, \'multiverseid\': 464749}, {\'name\': "Frammenti d\'Ala", \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio sacrifica una creatura attaccante.\\nTempesta (Quando lanci questa magia, copiala per ogni magia lanciata prima in questo turno. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per le copie.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Le sue piume fendono l\'aria, tanto affilate quanto silenziose.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6d5ce2a-daf4-4554-884d-83a8bc400888\', \'multiverseId\': 465003}, \'multiverseid\': 465003}, {\'name\': \'翼の破片\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは攻撃クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文１つにつきこれを１回コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'その空を切る羽は、静かであるほどに鋭い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'286e184d-0d14-4e15-b463-47c4ab3f4e29\', \'multiverseId\': 465257}, \'multiverseid\': 465257}, {\'name\': \'날개의 파편\', \'text\': \'플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 공격 중인 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n폭풍 (당신이 이 주문을 발동할 때, 이번 턴에 이 주문이 발동되기 전에 발동된 주문의 수만큼 이 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본들의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'깃털들은 조용하고도 날카롭게 대기를 갈랐다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75fb9210-829d-4bce-8930-a808cbac1571\', \'multiverseId\': 465511}, \'multiverseid\': 465511}, {\'name\': \'Retalhos de Asas\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo sacrifica uma criatura atacante.\\nRajada (Quando você conjurar esta mágica, faça uma cópia dela para cada mágica conjurada antes dela neste turno. Você pode escolher novos alvos para as cópias.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Suas penas cortam o ar, tão afiadas quanto silenciosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4529e698-0759-4fed-ac66-1a53fb6e667a\', \'multiverseId\': 465765}, \'multiverseid\': 465765}, {\'name\': \'Осколки Крыльев\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок жертвует атакующее существо.\\nШторм (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, скопируйте его за каждое заклинание, разыгранное в этом ходу до него. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для тех копий.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Ее перья разрезали воздух — такие же острые, как и бесшумные.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72f4ebdb-7d5d-43bf-9808-7673974b5d08\', \'multiverseId\': 466019}, \'multiverseid\': 466019}, {\'name\': \'翎羽飞射\', \'text\': \'目标牌手牺牲一个进行攻击的生物。\\n风暴（当施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'她的飞羽划空而过，悄然无声、锋利无匹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'301a7770-ead0-40d5-b5ab-f7b32606a3e8\', \'multiverseId\': 466273}, \'multiverseid\': 466273}, {\'name\': \'翎羽飛射\', \'text\': \'目標玩家犧牲一個進行攻擊的生物。\\n風暴（當施放此咒語時，本回合於它之前每施放過一個咒語，便將此咒語複製一次。你可以為每個複製品選擇新的目標。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'她的飛羽劃空而過，悄然無聲、鋒利無匹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6bf106c-9f35-4c6a-9ea5-b6bccbd72cb1\', \'multiverseId\': 466527}, \'multiverseid\': 466527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frosteidechse\', \'text\': \'{S}: Die Frosteidechse erhält +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug. ({S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten bleibenden Karte bezahlt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Eidechse\', \'flavor\': \'Das Glitzern der borealen Weiten verbirgt ihre wahre Größe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464368&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3fe1770-2661-451b-a00d-e575c112f7b9\', \'multiverseId\': 464368}, \'multiverseid\': 464368}, {\'name\': \'Neviguana\', \'text\': \'{S}: La Neviguana obtiene +2/+2 hasta el final del turno. Activa esta habilidad solo una vez por turno. ({S} puede pagarse con un maná de un permanente nevado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'El resplandor de las nieves en la extensión boreal oculta su verdadero tamaño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1143520-07b3-416e-bb82-07319d1da8f1\', \'multiverseId\': 464622}, \'multiverseid\': 464622}, {\'name\': \'Agame de givre\', \'text\': "{S} : L\'Agame de givre gagne +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez cette capacité qu\'une seule fois par tour. ({S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'un permanent neigeux.)", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : lézard\', \'flavor\': "L\'éclat éblouissant de la neige des étendues boréales dissimule sa véritable taille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464876&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cbe50bd-461d-4777-9e45-32789a36fec6\', \'multiverseId\': 464876}, \'multiverseid\': 464876}, {\'name\': \'Lucertola delle Nevi\', \'text\': \'{S}: La Lucertola delle Nevi prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. Attiva questa abilità solo una volta per turno. ({S} può essere pagato con un mana da un permanente neve.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Lucertola\', \'flavor\': \'Il riverbero delle nevi nella distesa boreale cela le sue vere dimensioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a91cccff-2641-42b9-9d51-09bf98c3db4d\', \'multiverseId\': 465130}, \'multiverseid\': 465130}, {\'name\': \'フロストワラ\', \'text\': \'{S}：ターン終了時まで、フロストワラは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。この能力は、毎ターン１回のみ起動できる。（{S}は氷雪パーマネントからのマナ１点で支払える。）\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — トカゲ\', \'flavor\': \'寒冷地に広がる雪の照り返しで、実際の大きさが分かりにくい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96457653-a095-49c2-b9b7-a8817328c98b\', \'multiverseId\': 465384}, \'multiverseid\': 465384}, {\'name\': \'서리왈라\', \'text\': \'{S}: 서리왈라는 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다. 이 능력은 한 턴에 한 번만 활성화할 수 있다. ({S}는 눈 지속물의 마나 한 개로 지불할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'눈 생물 — 도마뱀\', \'flavor\': \'북녘의 땅을 뒤덮은 눈 속에서 자신의 진정한 크기를 숨긴 채로 노려본다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c8efe5d-6e31-4470-9547-aaecc74b6d97\', \'multiverseId\': 465638}, \'multiverseid\': 465638}, {\'name\': \'Glaciowalla\', \'text\': \'{S}: Glaciowalla recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno. Ative esta habilidade apenas uma vez a cada turno. ({S} pode ser pago com um mana de uma permanente da neve.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Lagarto\', \'flavor\': \'A brancura da neve na vastidão boreal esconde seu tamanho real.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4f49693-e667-4a91-93e3-afb8df502af6\', \'multiverseId\': 465892}, \'multiverseid\': 465892}, {\'name\': \'Фроствалла\', \'text\': \'{S}: Фроствалла получает +2/+2 до конца хода. Активируйте эту способность только один раз за ход. ({S} можно оплатить одной маной от снежного перманента.)\', \'type\': \'Снежное Существо — Ящер\', \'flavor\': \'Слепящий блеск снега на северных равнинах скрывает ее истинные размеры.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffabbd71-a0d9-46d1-b38c-9c3c7d2fc7de\', \'multiverseId\': 466146}, \'multiverseid\': 466146}, {\'name\': \'冰霜瓦拉\', \'text\': \'{S}：冰霜瓦拉得+2/+2直到回合结束。此异能每回合中只能起动一次。（{S}能以产自雪境永久物的一点法术力来支付。）\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'波利尔雪原的反光掩盖了它们的真实大小。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'143dc95a-4926-4f70-af48-a7d908c98c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 466400}, \'multiverseid\': 466400}, {\'name\': \'冰霜瓦拉\', \'text\': \'{S}：冰霜瓦拉得+2/+2直到回合結束。此異能每回合中只能起動一次。（{S}能以產自雪境永久物的一點魔法力來支付。）\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～蜥蜴\', \'flavor\': \'波利爾雪原的反光掩蓋了牠們的真實大小。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5ecb6aa-a624-44e5-9a83-5621740eae2d\', \'multiverseId\': 466654}, \'multiverseid\': 466654}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frostschreiter-Bastion\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}{S}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird die Frostschreiter-Bastion zu einer 2/3 Konstrukt-Artefaktkreatur. Sie ist immer noch ein Land. ({S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten bleibenden Karte bezahlt werden.)\\nImmer wenn die Frostschreiter-Bastion einer Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, tappe die Kreatur und sie enttappt nicht während des nächsten Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers.\', \'type\': \'Verschneites Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464443&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83e1c9da-2bff-4f6f-9cb0-a8691862cb91\', \'multiverseId\': 464443}, \'multiverseid\': 464443}, {\'name\': \'Bastión escarchambulante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}{S}: Hasta el final del turno, el Bastión escarchambulante se convierte en una criatura artefacto Constructo 2/3. Sigue siendo una tierra. ({S} puede pagarse con un maná de un permanente nevado.)\\nSiempre que el Bastión escarchambulante haga daño de combate a una criatura, gírala y esa criatura no se endereza durante el próximo paso de enderezar de su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Tierra nevada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67f657bf-af62-4442-adb8-79dd9345b3e3\', \'multiverseId\': 464697}, \'multiverseid\': 464697}, {\'name\': \'Bastion de Marchegivre\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}{S} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, le Bastion de Marchegivre devient une créature-artefact 2/3 Construction. C\'est toujours un terrain. ({S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'un permanent neigeux.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Bastion de Marchegivre inflige des blessures de combat à une créature, engagez cette créature et elle ne se dégage pas pendant la prochaine étape de dégagement de son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Terrain neigeux\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464951&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97443032-99f7-4b1a-bd50-42361ab876eb\', \'multiverseId\': 464951}, \'multiverseid\': 464951}, {\'name\': \'Baluardo Calcaghiacci\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}{S}: Fino alla fine del turno, il Baluardo Calcaghiacci diventa una creatura artefatto Costrutto 2/3. È ancora una terra. ({S} può essere pagato con un mana da un permanente neve.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Baluardo Calcaghiacci infligge danno da combattimento a una creatura, TAPpa quella creatura ed essa non STAPpa durante il prossimo STAP del suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Terra Neve\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c060e91c-4edd-4683-a25e-5351c3dcdf42\', \'multiverseId\': 465205}, \'multiverseid\': 465205}, {\'name\': \'霜歩き砦\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}{S}：ターン終了時まで、霜歩き砦は２/３の構築物・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。（{S}は氷雪パーマネントからのマナ１点で支払える。）\\n霜歩き砦がクリーチャー１体に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのクリーチャーをタップする。それはそれのコントローラーの次のアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'氷雪土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'210544f3-afe6-49b6-bc72-53d75b0b3ab1\', \'multiverseId\': 465459}, \'multiverseid\': 465459}, {\'name\': \'서리걸음 요새\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 추가한다.\\n{1}{S}: 턴종료까지, 서리걸음 요새는 2/3 자동기계 마법물체 생물이 된다. 그 생물은 여전히 대지다. ({S}는 눈 지속물의 마나 한 개로 지불할 수 있다.)\\n서리걸음 요새가 생물에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 생물을 탭하고 그 생물은 조종자의 다음 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'눈 대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05c10006-374d-4536-b42d-e0db62089ac6\', \'multiverseId\': 465713}, \'multiverseid\': 465713}, {\'name\': \'Bastião Glaciambulante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}{S}: Até o final do turno, Bastião Glaciambulante se torna uma criatura artefato 2/3 do tipo Constructo. Ela ainda é um terreno. ({S} pode ser pago com um mana de uma permanente da neve.)\\nToda vez que Bastião Glaciambulante causar dano de combate a uma criatura, vire aquela criatura e ela não desvira durante a próxima etapa de desvirar de seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Terreno da Neve\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36667c6c-eaa5-4deb-a91f-ce39ee4a8219\', \'multiverseId\': 465967}, \'multiverseid\': 465967}, {\'name\': \'Бастион Ледяной Поступи\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}{S}: до конца хода Бастион Ледяной Поступи становится артефактом существом 2/3 Конструкция. При этом он остается землей. ({S} можно оплатить одной маной от снежного перманента.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Бастион Ледяной Поступи наносит боевые повреждения существу, поверните то существо, и оно не разворачивается во время следующего шага разворота контролирующего его игрока.\', \'type\': \'Снежная Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1eb47b0-4bc1-4e44-a6ec-15e0a21ee09f\', \'multiverseId\': 466221}, \'multiverseid\': 466221}, {\'name\': \'霜行堡垒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}{S}：直到回合结束，霜行堡垒成为2/3组构体神器生物。它仍然是地。（{S}能以产自雪境永久物的一点法术力来支付。）\\n每当霜行堡垒对任一生物造成战斗伤害时，横置该生物，且它于其操控者的下一个重置步骤中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'雪境地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7337c8be-36e9-49ef-9f64-485977a67c73\', \'multiverseId\': 466475}, \'multiverseid\': 466475}, {\'name\': \'霜行堡壘\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}{S}：直到回合結束，霜行堡壘成為2/3組構體神器生物。它仍然是地。（{S}能以產自雪境永久物的一點魔法力來支付。）\\n每當霜行堡壘對任一生物造成戰鬥傷害時，橫置該生物，且它於其操控者的下一個重置步驟中不能重置。\', \'type\': \'雪境地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'529ed8e6-db4d-4585-9e71-d8151f2a7aa9\', \'multiverseId\': 466729}, \'multiverseid\': 466729}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frühlingsblüten-Druide\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Frühlingsblüten-Druide ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Land opfern. Falls du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Neues Wachstum legt einen heilenden Verband über vernarbte Wunden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464384&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d3e5c2a-f736-4d5c-909f-59c06198db1d\', \'multiverseId\': 464384}, \'multiverseid\': 464384}, {\'name\': \'Druida broteflorecedor\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Druida broteflorecedor entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar una tierra. Si lo haces, busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El crecimiento de brotes nuevos es una cataplasma para heridas que llevan demasiado tiempo sin cicatrizar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a82d37bd-1bf5-406a-b79e-fcd7aec4a31f\', \'multiverseId\': 464638}, \'multiverseid\': 464638}, {\'name\': \'Druide du printemps\', \'text\': "Quand le Druide du printemps arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier un terrain. Si vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées et mélangez votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« La première pousse applique un cataplasme qui soulage les plaies cicatrisées depuis longtemps. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464892&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ec39a8-bf10-4f9b-9bb4-a49288544c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 464892}, \'multiverseid\': 464892}, {\'name\': \'Druido dei Germogli Primaverili\', \'text\': \'Quando il Druido dei Germogli Primaverili entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare una terra. Se lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La nuova vegetazione applica un impiastro curativo a ferite mai rimarginate."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a117f6e-28d9-46c9-a1ad-6571699cee06\', \'multiverseId\': 465146}, \'multiverseid\': 465146}, {\'name\': \'春花のドルイド\', \'text\': \'春花のドルイドが戦場に出たとき、あなたは土地１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、それらをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「新たなる成長が長くかさぶたになっていた傷跡を癒すのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f4e1e91-36f6-40a5-baa3-c1ecbd02e30e\', \'multiverseId\': 465400}, \'multiverseid\': 465400}, {\'name\': \'봄꽃 드루이드\', \'text\': \'봄꽃 드루이드가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 대지 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드를 두 장까지 찾아, 탭된 채로 전장에 놓은 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"새로이 자라나는 생명은 오래된 상처를 덮어 주는 처방이 된다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6157ba8e-6c60-48d7-a7f4-07001da64a76\', \'multiverseId\': 465654}, \'multiverseid\': 465654}, {\'name\': \'Druida do Florescimento\', \'text\': \'Quando Druida do Florescimento entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar um terreno. Se fizer isso, procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e, depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O crescimento de novos brotos é um cataplasma para feridas há muito cicatrizadas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'051b45b8-3a46-44fa-85dc-066211a556b2\', \'multiverseId\': 465908}, \'multiverseid\': 465908}, {\'name\': \'Друид Весеннего Роста\', \'text\': \'Когда Друид Весеннего Роста выходит на поле битвы, вы можете пожертвовать землю. Если вы это делаете, найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Новая поросль — как целительный бальзам на давно покрывшиеся струпьями раны».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2766f496-439a-44c7-926c-d29387dd8ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 466162}, \'multiverseid\': 466162}, {\'name\': \'春华德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'当春华德鲁伊进战场时，你可以牺牲一个地。若你如此作，则从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「全新生机为早已结痂的伤口涂上治疗药膏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db49abf6-e6f9-4d15-9afc-0a9caf010f84\', \'multiverseId\': 466416}, \'multiverseid\': 466416}, {\'name\': \'春華德魯伊\', \'text\': \'當春華德魯伊進戰場時，你可以犧牲一個地。若你如此作，則從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張基本地牌，將它們橫置放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「全新生機為早已結痂的傷口塗上治療藥膏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26f41bae-06ab-4ad6-b383-e81257b88fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 466670}, \'multiverseid\': 466670}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchtloser Angriff\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+0 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nRückblende {2}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464347&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'807d14a2-1b77-40da-9f71-d6c028947b9b\', \'multiverseId\': 464347}, \'multiverseid\': 464347}, {\'name\': \'Carga temeraria\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+0 y gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3eec369-0bfa-4045-85ba-a3985bc9956f\', \'multiverseId\': 464601}, \'multiverseid\': 464601}, {\'name\': \'Charge téméraire\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+0 et acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464855&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39dcbbd3-c29e-4c8d-ad3e-a4662c6d1cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 464855}, \'multiverseid\': 464855}, {\'name\': \'Carica Avventata\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+0 e ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\nFlashback {2}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da800a4e-faeb-4e22-b0f7-4ee76aac4217\', \'multiverseId\': 465109}, \'multiverseid\': 465109}, {\'name\': \'無謀なる突進\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋０の修整を受け速攻を得る。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd4c5f33-0998-4d99-830a-0ac226e30187\', \'multiverseId\': 465363}, \'multiverseid\': 465363}, {\'name\': \'무모한 돌격\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+0을 받고 신속을 얻는다.\\n회상 {2}{R} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4df6a2b-4817-4166-81be-23b11e6adbd2\', \'multiverseId\': 465617}, \'multiverseid\': 465617}, {\'name\': \'Investida Imprudente\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+0 e ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\\nRecapitular {2}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'552ac5a8-a85c-41b8-b596-37215afe6ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 465871}, \'multiverseid\': 465871}, {\'name\': \'Безрассудный Рывок\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+0 и Ускорение до конца хода.\\nВоспоминание {2}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282f87d8-b493-4f4e-adc6-e3f0b691f757\', \'multiverseId\': 466125}, \'multiverseid\': 466125}, {\'name\': \'鲁莽冲锋\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+3/+0且获得敏捷异能。\\n返照{2}{R}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用。然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d17a4b-cd5f-4212-8cd6-1719444bf2a6\', \'multiverseId\': 466379}, \'multiverseid\': 466379}, {\'name\': \'魯莽衝鋒\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+3/+0且獲得敏捷異能。\\n返照{2}{R}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用。然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fca26e6-99bb-4875-af6b-40017c75242e\', \'multiverseId\': 466633}, \'multiverseid\': 466633}]', '[{\'name\': \'Galeerenqualle\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Galeerenqualle ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Qualle\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn etwas schön anzusehen ist, bedeutet das nicht immer, dass man es auch anfassen sollte."\\n—Naimah, Femeref-Philosoph\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464258&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c456e99e-aadc-423f-aea3-8133a3623b0a\', \'multiverseId\': 464258}, \'multiverseid\': 464258}, {\'name\': \'Carabela\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Carabela entre al campo de batalla, regresa la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Medusa\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo bello a los ojos no siempre lo es al tacto".\\n—Naimah, filósofo femeref\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1573e2ce-d0e8-4737-aaa2-a376f3bc3720\', \'multiverseId\': 464512}, \'multiverseid\': 464512}, {\'name\': \'Physalie\', \'text\': \'Quand la Physalie arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature : méduse\', \'flavor\': "« Ce qui est beau à l\'œil ne l\'est pas forcément au toucher. »\\n—Naïmah, philosophe fémeiref", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464766&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96a24d4b-2b39-4573-be0f-febaa48fe4ae\', \'multiverseId\': 464766}, \'multiverseid\': 464766}, {\'name\': \'Caravella Portoghese\', \'text\': \'Quando la Caravella Portoghese entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Medusa\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sempre ciò che è bello da vedere risulta poi gradevole al tatto."\\n—Naimah, filosofo Femeref\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'243fbcc0-19f8-4ef0-9072-6269247d63a3\', \'multiverseId\': 465020}, \'multiverseid\': 465020}, {\'name\': \'大クラゲ\', \'text\': \'大クラゲが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クラゲ\', \'flavor\': \'「見た目が美しくても、触って楽しいとは限らない。」\\n――フェメレフの哲人、ナイマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a16bd11a-b255-4bac-abb1-7b9d10149478\', \'multiverseId\': 465274}, \'multiverseid\': 465274}, {\'name\': \'매노워\', \'text\': \'매노워가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 해파리\', \'flavor\': \'"보기에 아름다운 것이 만져도 무해하다는 의미는 아니지."\\n—페메레프 철학자, 나이마\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6efac0fb-dd11-4c68-88b1-79818f95a524\', \'multiverseId\': 465528}, \'multiverseid\': 465528}, {\'name\': \'Physalia\', \'text\': \'Quando Physalia entrar no campo de batalha, devolva a criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Água-viva\', \'flavor\': \'"Nem sempre o que é belo aos olhos é belo ao toque."\\n— Naimah, filósofa femeref\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741da86d-41e1-45c5-9476-6a09d1dcf277\', \'multiverseId\': 465782}, \'multiverseid\': 465782}, {\'name\': \'Физалия\', \'text\': \'Когда Физалия выходит на поле битвы, верните целевое существо в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Медуза\', \'flavor\': \'«Прекрасный облик не означает, что и остальные свойства будут столь же прекрасны».\\n— Найма, фемерефский философ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddda22d-ee26-4e1b-9a46-dd695faab9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 466036}, \'multiverseid\': 466036}, {\'name\': \'战舰水母\', \'text\': \'当战舰水母进战场时，将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～水母\', \'flavor\': \'「外观上的美丽并不总是等同于触觉上的舒适。」\\n～费米瑞甫哲学家奈玛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df1fc40a-9421-4a82-8d0b-4cad8f882bf4\', \'multiverseId\': 466290}, \'multiverseid\': 466290}, {\'name\': \'戰艦水母\', \'text\': \'當戰艦水母進戰場時，將目標生物移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～水母\', \'flavor\': \'「外觀上的美麗並不總是等同於觸覺上的舒適。」\\n～費米瑞甫哲學家奈瑪\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96dc434c-7631-4f02-8307-5fe259bbd543\', \'multiverseId\': 466544}, \'multiverseid\': 466544}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gambit des Geomagiers\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl. Sein Beherrscher kann seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und dann seine Bibliothek mischen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Telepathie ändert Gedanken, Nekromagie ändert Leben, aber Geomagie ändert die Welt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464328&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b03329-dc7c-49c8-92fe-d65c4886a9a6\', \'multiverseId\': 464328}, \'multiverseid\': 464328}, {\'name\': \'Táctica de geomante\', \'text\': \'Destruye la tierra objetivo. Su controlador puede buscar en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar su biblioteca.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La telepatía cambia mentes y la necromancia cambia vidas, pero la geomancia cambia el mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5b51d25-997b-45bd-9237-60af153c6ed0\', \'multiverseId\': 464582}, \'multiverseid\': 464582}, {\'name\': \'Pari du géomancien\', \'text\': \'Détruisez le terrain ciblé. Son contrôleur peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille et mélanger ensuite sa bibliothèque.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La télépathie change l\'esprit, la nécromancie change les vies, mais la géomancie change le monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464836&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d429f5-a791-43c2-b48c-d559527092c2\', \'multiverseId\': 464836}, \'multiverseid\': 464836}, {\'name\': \'Mossa del Geomante\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una terra bersaglio. Il suo controllore può passare in rassegna il suo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescolare il suo grimorio.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La telepatia cambia le menti, la necromanzia cambia le vite, ma la geomanzia cambia il mondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a1c059-74da-45b2-afaa-e3a2ee0760f1\', \'multiverseId\': 465090}, \'multiverseid\': 465090}, {\'name\': \'地操術士の計略\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは「自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探して戦場に出し、その後自分のライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'テレパシーは心を操る。屍術は生命を操る。地操術は世界を操る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd195088-0a8f-4c2d-89ea-b80a7693e917\', \'multiverseId\': 465344}, \'multiverseid\': 465344}, {\'name\': \'대지마도사의 술수\', \'text\': \'대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 대지를 파괴한다. 그 대지의 조종자는 자신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아, 전장에 놓을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'정신술은 마음을 변화시키고, 사령술은 생명을 변화시키지만, 대지술은 세계를 변화시킨다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'066a4b74-b8e2-4bb9-bdb6-e8757f70e987\', \'multiverseId\': 465598}, \'multiverseid\': 465598}, {\'name\': \'Estratagema do Geomante\', \'text\': \'Destrua o terreno alvo. Seu controlador pode procurar um card de terreno básico, colocá-lo no campo de batalha e depois embaralhar o próprio grimório.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A telepatia muda mentes e a necromancia muda vidas, mas a geomancia muda o mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'292a8fd5-641a-4d36-a01c-914b987fa534\', \'multiverseId\': 465852}, \'multiverseid\': 465852}, {\'name\': \'Гамбит Геоманта\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевую землю. Контролирующий ее игрок может найти в своей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положить ее на поле битвы, затем перетасовать свою библиотеку.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Телепатия меняет разум, некромантия меняет жизнь, геомантия же меняет весь мир.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'391fffa5-d942-4719-9d72-793c340cfd52\', \'multiverseId\': 466106}, \'multiverseid\': 466106}, {\'name\': \'大地术士的计策\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。该地的操控者可以从其牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后将其牌库洗牌。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'读心术能改变心智，死灵术能改变生命，而大地术则能改变世界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b112be12-8adf-47f2-8364-31f2f9f22780\', \'multiverseId\': 466360}, \'multiverseid\': 466360}, {\'name\': \'大地術士的計策\', \'text\': \'消滅目標地。該地的操控者可以從其牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之放進戰場，然後將其牌庫洗牌。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'讀心術能改變心智，死靈術能改變生命，而大地術則能改變世界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f843efe-075e-42c0-81d5-65f56f92fa75\', \'multiverseId\': 466614}, \'multiverseid\': 466614}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gargantua der Ersten Sphäre\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Gargantua der Ersten Sphäre ins Spiel kommt, ziehst du eine Karte und verlierst 1 Lebenspunkt.\\nExhumieren {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464294&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a84c8262-d578-43a9-b58b-8abd65eabbc3\', \'multiverseId\': 464294}, \'multiverseid\': 464294}, {\'name\': \'Gargantúa de la Primera Esfera\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gargantúa de la Primera Esfera entre al campo de batalla, robas una carta y pierdes 1 vida.\\nDesenterrar {2}{B}. ({2}{B}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'260f1306-0af4-413c-bf88-059a364fe715\', \'multiverseId\': 464548}, \'multiverseid\': 464548}, {\'name\': \'Gargantua de la Première Sphère\', \'text\': "Quand le Gargantua de la Première Sphère arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous piochez une carte et vous perdez 1 point de vie.\\nExhumation {2}{B} ({2}{B} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464802&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23eb3a4a-992e-41e3-aeaa-33bba4bc2a73\', \'multiverseId\': 464802}, \'multiverseid\': 464802}, {\'name\': \'Gargantua della Prima Sfera\', \'text\': "Quando il Gargantua della Prima Sfera entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta e perdi 1 punto vita.\\nDissotterrare {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Ha rapidità. Esiliala all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale o se sta per lasciare il campo di battaglia. Dissotterra solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31e9ca8f-f5a5-4552-a517-bb7a214b1216\', \'multiverseId\': 465056}, \'multiverseid\': 465056}, {\'name\': \'第一球層のガルガンチュア\', \'text\': \'第一球層のガルガンチュアが戦場に出たとき、あなたはカードを１枚引き、あなたは１点のライフを失う。\\n蘇生{2}{B}（{2}{B}：あなたの墓地からこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、またはこれが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b53f3a57-cca3-46ca-ae11-c01384856a1a\', \'multiverseId\': 465310}, \'multiverseid\': 465310}, {\'name\': \'첫 계층의 가르강투아\', \'text\': \'첫 계층의 가르강투아가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 카드 한 장을 뽑고 생명 1점을 잃는다.\\n발굴 {2}{B} ({2}{B}: 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 전장으로 되돌린다. 이 생물은 신속을 얻는다. 이 카드를 다음 종료단 시작 또는 전장을 떠날 때 추방한다. 당신은 집중마법을 발동 할 수 있는 시기에만 발굴을 활성화할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 괴수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4e0d77f-4048-4689-974b-10ec73cd3f11\', \'multiverseId\': 465564}, \'multiverseid\': 465564}, {\'name\': \'Gargantua da Primeira Esfera\', \'text\': \'Quando Gargantua da Primeira Esfera entra no campo de batalha, você compra um card e perde 1 ponto de vida.\\nDesenterrar {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Devolva este card de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha. Ele ganha ímpeto. Exile-o no início da próxima etapa final ou se ele for deixar o campo de batalha. Use desenterrar somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d0af31a-f8cf-4e85-b10f-95245a1512b7\', \'multiverseId\': 465818}, \'multiverseid\': 465818}, {\'name\': \'Исполин с Первой Сферы\', \'text\': \'Когда Исполин с Первой Сферы выходит на поле битвы, вы берете карту и теряете 1 жизнь.\\nОткопать {2}{B} ({2}{B}: верните эту карту из вашего кладбища на поле битвы. Она получает Ускорение. Изгоните ее в начале следующего заключительного шага, или если она должна покинуть поле битвы. Откапывайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcb706f0-4633-47d7-9115-b35e1736b166\', \'multiverseId\': 466072}, \'multiverseid\': 466072}, {\'name\': \'一重天巨罡兽\', \'text\': \'当一重天巨罡兽进战场时，你抓一张牌且你失去1点生命。\\n破坟{2}{B}（{2}{B}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。破坟的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b915121-dfe5-41ef-9420-c2f7b6aad44a\', \'multiverseId\': 466326}, \'multiverseid\': 466326}, {\'name\': \'一重天巨罡獸\', \'text\': \'當一重天巨罡獸進戰場時，你抽一張牌且你失去1點生命。\\n破墳{2}{B}（{2}{B}：將此牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。它獲得敏捷異能。在下一個結束步驟開始時，或若它將離開戰場，將它放逐。破墳的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26613845-a070-41be-96e6-9d6f9f74fa20\', \'multiverseId\': 466580}, \'multiverseid\': 466580}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefallener Shinobi\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{B} ({2}{U}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Gefallene Shinobi einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt der Spieler die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du die Karten spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464402&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29d1e68b-72a2-4cef-84fb-9bb2936d76ac\', \'multiverseId\': 464402}, \'multiverseid\': 464402}, {\'name\': \'Shinobi caída\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{B}. ({2}{U}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que la Shinobi caída haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia las dos primeras cartas de su biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar esas cartas sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4e45cf-6c5a-431f-bec5-337474879695\', \'multiverseId\': 464656}, \'multiverseid\': 464656}, {\'name\': \'Shinobi déchu\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {2}{U}{B} ({2}{U}{B}, renvoyez dans votre main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Shinobi déchu inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464910&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ec5526-0914-435b-aa46-6555dfe6b90e\', \'multiverseId\': 464910}, \'multiverseid\': 464910}, {\'name\': \'Shinobi Caduto\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{B} ({2}{U}{B}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta lo Shinobi Caduto infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia le prime due carte del suo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare quelle carte senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a48f1821-025e-4e15-8452-2411bacb5e13\', \'multiverseId\': 465164}, \'multiverseid\': 465164}, {\'name\': \'堕ちた忍び\', \'text\': \'忍術{2}{U}{B}（{2}{U}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\n堕ちた忍びがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを２枚追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e6c657-cc20-4dca-904a-0148545722b0\', \'multiverseId\': 465418}, \'multiverseid\': 465418}, {\'name\': \'타락한 시노비\', \'text\': \'인술 {2}{U}{B} ({2}{U}{B}, 당신이 조종하는 공격 중인 생물 중 방어당하지 않은 생물 한 개를 손으로 되돌린다: 당신의 손에서 이 카드를 탭되어 공격 중인 상태로 전장에 놓는다.)\\n타락한 시노비가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드 두 장을 추방한다. 턴종료까지, 당신은 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드들을 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 닌자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff8485da-baaf-4758-93ad-68e287b501ac\', \'multiverseId\': 465672}, \'multiverseid\': 465672}, {\'name\': \'Shinobi Caído\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{B} ({2}{U}{B}, devolva para a mão um atacante que você controla que não tenha sido bloqueado: Coloque este card no campo de batalha de sua mão, virado e atacando.)\\nToda vez que Shinobi Caído causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador exila os dois cards do topo do próprio grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode jogar aqueles cards sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1350d6c2-c4cf-4544-a45f-040fccc85049\', \'multiverseId\': 465926}, \'multiverseid\': 465926}, {\'name\': \'Павший Синоби\', \'text\': \'Ниндзюцу {2}{U}{B} ({2}{U}{B}, верните незаблокированного атакующего под вашим контролем в руку: положите эту карту на поле битвы из вашей руки повернутой и атакующей.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Павший Синоби наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет две верхние карты своей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыграть те карты без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Ниндзя\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cb7fa00-9a85-4ac3-8f7e-5fff9f3b2eae\', \'multiverseId\': 466180}, \'multiverseid\': 466180}, {\'name\': \'堕亡忍者\', \'text\': \'忍术{2}{U}{B}（{2}{U}{B}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物移回其拥有者手上：将此牌从你手上横置进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n每当堕亡忍者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶的两张牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用这些牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc847ae7-7fa5-4c0b-9d77-8a5ee5c0fd6d\', \'multiverseId\': 466434}, \'multiverseid\': 466434}, {\'name\': \'墮亡忍者\', \'text\': \'忍術{2}{U}{B}（{2}{U}{B}，將一個由你操控且未受阻擋的攻擊生物移回其擁有者手上：將此牌從你手上橫置進戰場，且正進行攻擊。）\\n每當墮亡忍者對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家放逐其牌庫頂的兩張牌。直到回合結束，你可以使用這些牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7be4b6d-ef93-43c3-9731-722aca5ac04c\', \'multiverseId\': 466688}, \'multiverseid\': 466688}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßige Schnecke\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWeiterentwicklung (Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt und falls deren Stärke oder Widerstandskraft höher ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schnecke, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': \'Du kannst nicht genug Salz bei dir tragen, um dich zu retten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464296&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b589223e-9a10-454a-b245-87faa69ae63a\', \'multiverseId\': 464296}, \'multiverseid\': 464296}, {\'name\': \'Babosa glotona\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nEvolucionar. (Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, si la fuerza o la resistencia de esa criatura es mayor que la de esta criatura, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror babosa\', \'flavor\': \'Ninguna cantidad de sal te salvará.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e36c8f70-ff92-4c90-8856-a18922a7868e\', \'multiverseId\': 464550}, \'multiverseid\': 464550}, {\'name\': \'Limace gloutonne\', \'text\': "Menace\\nÉvolution (À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, si sa force ou son endurance est supérieure à celle de cette créature, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature : limace et horreur\', \'flavor\': \'Lui lancer du sel ne vous sauvera pas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464804&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1414ac9b-40d3-4114-b26c-9a1022aba023\', \'multiverseId\': 464804}, \'multiverseid\': 464804}, {\'name\': \'Lumaca Ingorda\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\nEvoluzione (Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, se quella creatura ha forza o costituzione maggiori di questa creatura, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore Lumaca\', \'flavor\': \'Neppure tutto il sale del mondo potrà salvarti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b59570b-5221-4a5f-a986-26df3105e71b\', \'multiverseId\': 465058}, \'multiverseid\': 465058}, {\'name\': \'暴食するナメクジ\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n進化（クリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのクリーチャーのパワーかタフネスがこのクリーチャーよりも大きい場合、このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナメクジ・ホラー\', \'flavor\': \'どれほどの塩があっても無駄である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f151649-eaf7-4b6b-a3df-56601a7e890f\', \'multiverseId\': 465312}, \'multiverseid\': 465312}, {\'name\': \'탐욕스러운 민달팽이\', \'text\': \'호전적\\n진화 (생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 그 생물의 공격력이 이 생물의 공격력보다 높거나 방어력이 이 생물의 방어력보다 높다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 민달팽이 괴수\', \'flavor\': \'소금을 아무리 준비해도 안전하지 않다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8cd04ca-15ce-49e4-a017-dfe93524d0cc\', \'multiverseId\': 465566}, \'multiverseid\': 465566}, {\'name\': \'Lesma Glutona\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nEvoluir (Toda vez que uma criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, se ela tiver poder ou resistência maior que a desta criatura, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lesma Horror\', \'flavor\': \'Nenhuma quantidade de sal salvará vocês.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'326c057c-3e22-41a5-b98b-3a9f1ba5453f\', \'multiverseId\': 465820}, \'multiverseid\': 465820}, {\'name\': \'Прожорливый Слизень\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\nЭволюция (Каждый раз, когда существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, если сила или выносливость того существа больше, чем у этого существа, положите один жетон +1/+1 на это существо.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Слизень Ужас\', \'flavor\': \'Сколько бы соли ни было, она тебя не спасет.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf791ff3-6fd7-46f4-9072-84f84a891e63\', \'multiverseId\': 466074}, \'multiverseid\': 466074}, {\'name\': \'暴食蛞蝓\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n进化（每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，若该生物的力量或防御力大于此生物，则在后者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛞蝓／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': \'撒再多的盐也救不了你。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de4aa2eb-7059-4b6a-8332-b01f5bb323ac\', \'multiverseId\': 466328}, \'multiverseid\': 466328}, {\'name\': \'暴食蛞蝓\', \'text\': \'威懾\\n進化（每當一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，若該生物的力量或防禦力大於此生物，則在後者上放置一個+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛞蝓／驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': \'撒再多的鹽也救不了你。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'effb7c71-7cc1-4128-98d5-6e08ec3ff700\', \'multiverseId\': 466582}, \'multiverseid\': 466582}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gehärteter Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Die Frage ist nicht, ob sich die Remasuris an die Gefahren der Welt anpassen, sondern ob sich die Gefahren der Welt an die Remasuris anpassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464386&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e7e88e-ae04-4025-b819-ad51f7dae044\', \'multiverseId\': 464386}, \'multiverseid\': 464386}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado forjado\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'La pregunta no es si los fragmentados se adaptarán a los peligros de un mundo, sino si los peligros de ese mundo se adaptarán a los fragmentados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad21db3-2909-444b-9a2d-720fc1f39cf8\', \'multiverseId\': 464640}, \'multiverseid\': 464640}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde trempé\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "La question n\'est pas de savoir si les slivoïdes s\'adapteront aux dangers du monde, mais si les dangers du monde s\'adapteront aux slivoïdes.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464894&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f743c7e-da18-4fc7-ace1-ebfbf76a4e0c\', \'multiverseId\': 464894}, \'multiverseid\': 464894}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Temprato\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'La domanda non è se i tramutanti si adatteranno ai pericoli del mondo, ma se i pericoli del mondo si adatteranno ai tramutanti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'373617cf-0ff9-4300-99aa-70a16ac430e8\', \'multiverseId\': 465148}, \'multiverseid\': 465148}, {\'name\': \'鍛錬スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'スリヴァーが世界の危機に適応できるかどうかは問題ではない。世界の危機がスリヴァーに適応できるかどうかが問題なのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28a9e1ab-bc0a-4e93-b518-c71db8990c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 465402}, \'multiverseid\': 465402}, {\'name\': \'단련된 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 "이 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'슬리버들이 세계에 산재한 위험 요소들에 적응할지는 문제가 아니다. 그 위험 요소들이 슬리버들에게 적응할지가 더 관건이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be906838-3e2a-4526-816b-76c937f404ae\', \'multiverseId\': 465656}, \'multiverseid\': 465656}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Temperado\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm "Toda vez que esta criatura causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'A questão não é se os fractius se adaptarão aos perigos do mundo, mas se os perigos do mundo se adaptarão aos fractius.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91937d55-38e3-4952-9d86-0dfd9e1e5ce4\', \'multiverseId\': 465910}, \'multiverseid\': 465910}, {\'name\': \'Закаленная Щепка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют способность «Каждый раз, когда это существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите на него один жетон +1/+1».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'Вопрос не в том, сумеют ли щепки приспособиться к опасностям мира, а в том, сумеют ли опасности мира приспособиться к щепкам.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c564bdf-ccb2-4997-9694-8d76015542bd\', \'multiverseId\': 466164}, \'multiverseid\': 466164}, {\'name\': \'蓄势裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'问题不是裂片妖是否能适应世界上的种种威胁，而是这些威胁是否能适应裂片妖。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc01d5af-1288-4ef1-ba7c-9318045800f4\', \'multiverseId\': 466418}, \'multiverseid\': 466418}, {\'name\': \'蓄勢裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「每當此生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'問題不是裂片妖是否能適應世界上的種種威脅，而是這些威脅是否能適應裂片妖。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5e3b919-1c09-48ce-b71e-e1cbed4c257a\', \'multiverseId\': 466672}, \'multiverseid\': 466672}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geist der Zwischenwelt\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls der Geist der Zwischenwelt die einzige Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof ist, kannst du den Geist der Zwischenwelt ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Vier Wände und ein Dach bieten keine Sicherheit vor dem, was begraben liegt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464301&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5db5e9ae-b0bd-4bba-aeee-8b52b72f1443\', \'multiverseId\': 464301}, \'multiverseid\': 464301}, {\'name\': \'Espíritu del submundo\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si el Espíritu del submundo es la única carta de criatura en tu cementerio, puedes regresar el Espíritu del submundo al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Cuatro paredes y un techo no protegen de lo que yace bajo tierra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1654b2a-8838-43a4-8005-846f5f6d4ac1\', \'multiverseId\': 464555}, \'multiverseid\': 464555}, {\'name\': \'Esprit infernal\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, si l\'Esprit infernal est la seule carte de créature dans votre cimetière, vous pouvez renvoyer l\'Esprit infernal sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Quatre murs et un toit ne protègent pas de ce qui est enterré.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464809&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a025629-7fea-42e1-8c3f-4a5ed6200954\', \'multiverseId\': 464809}, \'multiverseid\': 464809}, {\'name\': \'Spirito Abissale\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se lo Spirito Abissale è l\'unica carta creatura nel tuo cimitero, puoi rimetterlo sul campo di battaglia.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Quattro mura e un tetto non ti proteggeranno da ciò che è sepolto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ec0b46-bdd0-46b3-bb9e-dbb3b7d3a760\', \'multiverseId\': 465063}, \'multiverseid\': 465063}, {\'name\': \'冥界のスピリット\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、冥界のスピリットがあなたの墓地にある唯一のクリーチャー・カードであった場合、あなたは冥界のスピリットを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'四方の壁と屋根のみでは、葬られた者から逃げられない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39df075e-61aa-4704-b655-447784af335c\', \'multiverseId\': 465317}, \'multiverseid\': 465317}, {\'name\': \'명계의 신령\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드가 명계의 신령뿐이라면, 당신은 명계의 신령을 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'사방을 벽과 지붕으로 둘러싸도 파묻혀 있는 것에게서 보호받을 수는 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3793c8ac-a208-4d34-a415-d8272dc03eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 465571}, \'multiverseid\': 465571}, {\'name\': \'Espírito Ínfero\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se Espírito Ínfero for o único card de criatura em seu cemitério, você poderá devolver Espírito Ínfero para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Quatro paredes e um teto não protegem contra o que está enterrado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87b52f87-5a90-4212-b649-e24ab8f57fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 465825}, \'multiverseid\': 465825}, {\'name\': \'Глубинный Дух\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки, если Глубинный Дух — единственная карта существа на вашем кладбище, то вы можете вернуть Глубинного Духа на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Четыре стены и крыша не защитят от того, кто закопан в землю.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32954f83-6b85-42a9-87b6-6581d7884fb4\', \'multiverseId\': 466079}, \'multiverseid\': 466079}, {\'name\': \'冥府精怪\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若冥府精怪是你坟墓场中唯一的生物牌，则你可以将冥府精怪移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'四面高墙和厚实屋顶也挡不住来自地底的滋扰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46a36210-2b20-4b96-ad8d-d23724832420\', \'multiverseId\': 466333}, \'multiverseid\': 466333}, {\'name\': \'冥府精靈\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，若冥府精靈是你墳墓場中唯一的生物牌，則你可以將冥府精靈移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'四面高牆和厚實屋頂也擋不住來自地底的滋擾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b210ae-93c2-4304-8607-3391de917c6c\', \'multiverseId\': 466587}, \'multiverseid\': 466587}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geniale Infiltratorin\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {U}{B} ({U}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn ein Ninja, den du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vedalken, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464407&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbd8579b-c608-4e02-8600-c7c4032dd0d5\', \'multiverseId\': 464407}, \'multiverseid\': 464407}, {\'name\': \'Infiltradora ingeniosa\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {U}{B}. ({U}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que un Ninja que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65fc0f5a-7296-4af7-8880-3085d6fde1f5\', \'multiverseId\': 464661}, \'multiverseid\': 464661}, {\'name\': \'Infiltratrice ingénieuse\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {U}{B} ({U}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un ninja que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : vedalken et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464915&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1abf8387-29fe-40f3-b822-aa6f0e89df7d\', \'multiverseId\': 464915}, \'multiverseid\': 464915}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrata Ingegnosa\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {U}{B} ({U}{B}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta un Ninja che controlli infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Vedalken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'194478d9-4abd-459b-99f1-43dedb770530\', \'multiverseId\': 465169}, \'multiverseid\': 465169}, {\'name\': \'巧妙な潜入者\', \'text\': \'忍術{U}{B}（{U}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\nあなたがコントロールしている忍者が１体、プレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヴィダルケン・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9f4e656-fe4c-4158-98d4-636f382fa1fd\', \'multiverseId\': 465423}, \'multiverseid\': 465423}, {\'name\': \'독창적인 침투자\', \'text\': \'인술 {U}{B} ({U}{B}, 당신이 조종하는 공격 중인 생물 중 방어당하지 않은 생물 한 개를 손으로 되돌린다: 당신의 손에서 이 카드를 탭되어 공격 중인 상태로 전장에 놓는다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 닌자가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 베달켄 닌자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3592506-1e5a-44ad-85e3-4694ac84cc11\', \'multiverseId\': 465677}, \'multiverseid\': 465677}, {\'name\': \'Infiltradora Engenhosa\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {U}{B} ({U}{B}, devolva para a mão um atacante que você controla que não tenha sido bloqueado: Coloque este card no campo de batalha de sua mão, virado e atacando.)\\nToda vez que um Ninja que você controla causar dano de combate a um jogador, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vedalkeano Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8003c162-0efe-4b63-b45a-57ca707cf11c\', \'multiverseId\': 465931}, \'multiverseid\': 465931}, {\'name\': \'Находчивая Лазутчица\', \'text\': \'Ниндзюцу {U}{B} ({U}{B}, верните незаблокированного атакующего под вашим контролем в руку: положите эту карту на поле битвы из вашей руки повернутой и атакующей.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Ниндзя под вашим контролем наносит боевые повреждения игроку, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ведалкен Ниндзя\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa52f9b-f60a-41b3-a2d6-18e50d9cf4df\', \'multiverseId\': 466185}, \'multiverseid\': 466185}, {\'name\': \'妙手渗透者\', \'text\': \'忍术{U}{B}（{U}{B}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物移回其拥有者手上：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n每当一个由你操控的忍者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～维多肯／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f39096c4-07ff-4114-a03e-67735967e86a\', \'multiverseId\': 466439}, \'multiverseid\': 466439}, {\'name\': \'妙手滲透者\', \'text\': \'忍術{U}{B}（{U}{B}，將一個由你操控且未受阻擋的攻擊生物移回其擁有者手上：將此牌從你手上橫置放進戰場，且正進行攻擊。）\\n每當一個由你操控的忍者對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～維多肯／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1df2710a-673d-4105-af02-78c432ecdb6a\', \'multiverseId\': 466693}, \'multiverseid\': 466693}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesang der Natur\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Pflanze jedes Schwert. Umarme jede Seele."\\n—Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464413&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdbe6934-98f4-480b-b5fd-b771a7faffdd\', \'multiverseId\': 464413}, \'multiverseid\': 464413}, {\'name\': \'Cántico de la naturaleza\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Planta todas las espadas. Acepta a todas las especies".\\n—Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228cf0c2-cf12-478a-b7cb-4684a521f13a\', \'multiverseId\': 464667}, \'multiverseid\': 464667}, {\'name\': \'Chant de la nature\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Plantez chaque épée. Enlacez chaque âme. »\\n—Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464921&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d47d55-4f07-441e-91fa-2238f8d3065f\', \'multiverseId\': 464921}, \'multiverseid\': 464921}, {\'name\': \'Canto della Natura\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Piantate ogni spada, abbracciate ogni anima."\\n—Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'027de7b4-2cc1-42f1-a738-adde5660c970\', \'multiverseId\': 465175}, \'multiverseid\': 465175}, {\'name\': \'自然の詠唱\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つかエンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「あらゆる剣に命を植え、あらゆる魂を受け入れるのです。」\\n――トロスターニ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a4ecd6e-8270-4f80-822b-d462f64d264b\', \'multiverseId\': 465429}, \'multiverseid\': 465429}, {\'name\': \'자연의 구호\', \'text\': \'마법물체나 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"검을 모두 심어라. 영혼을 모두 받아들여라."\\n—트로스타니\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f731cf-1269-4b23-8eea-3ab0611ae016\', \'multiverseId\': 465683}, \'multiverseid\': 465683}, {\'name\': \'Canto da Natureza\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Plante cada espada. Abrace cada alma."\\n— Trostani\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d1f5da3-9ec5-4c35-81d3-8060b5c83bea\', \'multiverseId\': 465937}, \'multiverseid\': 465937}, {\'name\': \'Песнь Природы\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Посадить каждый меч. Принять каждую душу».\\n— Тростани\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdbed078-3c2a-4f7c-86f4-3a01ee25f390\', \'multiverseId\': 466191}, \'multiverseid\': 466191}, {\'name\': \'自然颂歌\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「埋下每一把剑。包容每一颗心。」\\n～卓塔妮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3d02d5-36d4-4a2a-b394-6f72bdcf11e2\', \'multiverseId\': 466445}, \'multiverseid\': 466445}, {\'name\': \'自然頌歌\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器或結界。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「埋下每一把劍。包容每一顆心。」\\n～卓塔妮\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b29f3119-0b97-4c63-9a99-5911d62b8be1\', \'multiverseId\': 466699}, \'multiverseid\': 466699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gesattelter Raureifhirsch\', \'text\': \'Der Gesattelte Raureifhirsch erhält +2/+2, solange in diesem Zug eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'Hörner aus Raureif wachsen jede Nacht, glänzen in der Morgenröte und schmelzen in der Dämmerung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464380&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8639dbb-1272-4854-a593-6c4bad85941b\', \'multiverseId\': 464380}, \'multiverseid\': 464380}, {\'name\': \'Cuernoescarcha ensillado\', \'text\': \'El Cuernoescarcha ensillado obtiene +2/+2 mientras otra criatura haya entrado al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Le crecen cuernos de escarcha cada noche, relucen al alba y se deshacen con el crepúsculo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a8aa1c-d1fe-4c12-9f9e-89568ec916f8\', \'multiverseId\': 464634}, \'multiverseid\': 464634}, {\'name\': \'Cerf des frimas sellé\', \'text\': \'Le Cerf des frimas sellé gagne +2/+2 tant que vous avez fait arriver une autre créature sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : élan\', \'flavor\': "Ses bois de givre poussent toutes les nuits, luisent à l\'aube et fondent avant le crépuscule.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464888&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97b1226d-2585-4c37-b4d2-c56b078ae519\', \'multiverseId\': 464888}, \'multiverseid\': 464888}, {\'name\': \'Brinocervo Sellato\', \'text\': "Il Brinocervo Sellato prende +2/+2 se hai fatto entrare nel campo di battaglia un\'altra creatura sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Alce\', \'flavor\': "Le sue corna di brina crescono ogni notte, scintillano alle luci dell\'alba e si sciolgono prima del tramonto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d5857a-bf98-414f-9496-e77fb3c0e271\', \'multiverseId\': 465142}, \'multiverseid\': 465142}, {\'name\': \'鞍載せ霧氷鹿\', \'text\': \'このターンに他のクリーチャーがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出ているかぎり、鞍載せ霧氷鹿は＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'霜の角は夜の間に大きくなり、夜明けとともに輝き出し、日暮れまでに溶けてしまう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e112565d-e963-4dd1-a2c8-bbe38c86f9d6\', \'multiverseId\': 465396}, \'multiverseid\': 465396}, {\'name\': \'안장을 올린 서리수사슴\', \'text\': \'안장을 올린 서리수사슴은 이번 턴에 다른 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어온 한 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'눈 생물 — 엘크\', \'flavor\': \'서리로 만들어진 뿔이 매일 밤 자라나, 새벽에 빛을 발하다가, 황혼에 녹아내린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c289c66a-1e11-4704-95ee-1ea03c3b7dcc\', \'multiverseId\': 465650}, \'multiverseid\': 465650}, {\'name\': \'Cervo-das-geadas Selado\', \'text\': \'Cervo-das-geadas Selado recebe +2/+2 desde que outra criatura tenha entrado no campo de batalha sob o seu controle neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Os chifres de geada crescem todas as noites, brilham ao amanhecer e derretem até o pôr do sol.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3517523-108c-43d5-bbd8-3bb8f77ef545\', \'multiverseId\': 465904}, \'multiverseid\': 465904}, {\'name\': \'Оседланный Олень Инея\', \'text\': \'Оседланный Олень Инея получает +2/+2 при условии, что другое существо уже вышло на поле битвы под вашим контролем в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Снежное Существо — Вапити\', \'flavor\': \'Его рога из инея вырастают каждую ночь, сверкают на рассвете и успевают растаять к закату.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf13f49-8c51-4d6b-877e-1f1c36a52ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 466158}, \'multiverseid\': 466158}, {\'name\': \'备鞍霜角鹿\', \'text\': \'只要本回合中有另一个生物在你的操控下进战场，备鞍霜角鹿便得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'白霜角在夜里生长，于破晓闪耀，待日落融化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1caf578-9815-4d17-990e-52fa7ba23270\', \'multiverseId\': 466412}, \'multiverseid\': 466412}, {\'name\': \'備鞍霜角鹿\', \'text\': \'只要本回合中有另一個生物在你的操控下進戰場，備鞍霜角鹿便得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'白霜角在夜裡生長，於破曉閃耀，待日落融化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'749b6121-30dd-49b5-b1ba-d2db34f906aa\', \'multiverseId\': 466666}, \'multiverseid\': 466666}]', "[{'name': 'Gewundener Weg', 'text': 'Bestimme Kreatur oder Land. Decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm davon alle Karten des bestimmten Typs auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Jeder Pfad führt zu einer Entdeckung.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464396&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '47890ac6-c289-4d65-aa4b-9fd7163aa560', 'multiverseId': 464396}, 'multiverseid': 464396}, {'name': 'Camino serpenteante', 'text': 'Elige criatura o tierra. Muestra las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas mostradas de esta manera del tipo elegido en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Todos los caminos llevan a un descubrimiento.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464650&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bb608e7-403b-4280-997a-ad29196d847b', 'multiverseId': 464650}, 'multiverseid': 464650}, {'name': 'Voie sinueuse', 'text': 'Choisissez créature ou terrain. Révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes du type choisi révélées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Chaque sentier mène à une découverte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464904&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30260b0c-5b86-4988-9b74-5f3eb590bab8', 'multiverseId': 464904}, 'multiverseid': 464904}, {'name': 'Cammino Serpeggiante', 'text': 'Scegli creatura o terra. Rivela le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano tutte le carte del tipo scelto rivelate in questo modo e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Ogni cammino conduce a una scoperta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465158&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b87bc6ee-7e13-414a-b6e7-1e78790f01db', 'multiverseId': 465158}, 'multiverseid': 465158}, {'name': '紆余曲折', 'text': '「クリーチャー」か「土地」を選ぶ。あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚公開する。これにより公開された、選ばれたタイプのカードをすべてあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'どの道も発見へと繋がっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465412&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7915ecfb-be82-4481-910e-58cbd70d4c83', 'multiverseId': 465412}, 'multiverseid': 465412}, {'name': '굽은 길', 'text': '생물 또는 대지를 선택한다. 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 공개한다. 그중 선택한 유형의 카드를 모두 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': '모든 길은 발견으로 통한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465666&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49cbc3b8-19a0-455f-81f0-379fbe156042', 'multiverseId': 465666}, 'multiverseid': 465666}, {'name': 'Caminho Tortuoso', 'text': 'Escolha criatura ou terreno. Revele os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque todos os cards com o tipo escolhido revelados desta forma em sua mão e o restante em seu cemitério.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Todo caminho leva à descoberta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465920&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6350fb00-7ba7-423f-a4ea-bd490d04437e', 'multiverseId': 465920}, 'multiverseid': 465920}, {'name': 'Извилистый Путь', 'text': 'Выберите существо или землю. Покажите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите все показанные таким образом карты выбранного типа в вашу руку, а остальные — на ваше кладбище.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Каждый путь ведет к открытию.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466174&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '54f8e660-5ab5-49e9-9ec2-62d76464147f', 'multiverseId': 466174}, 'multiverseid': 466174}, {'name': '蜿蜒长路', 'text': '选择生物或地。展示你牌库顶的四张牌。将所有以此法展示且为该类别的牌置于你手上，其余则置入你的坟墓场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '条条道路通发现。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466428&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e521377-63d3-4053-8507-728817ae6504', 'multiverseId': 466428}, 'multiverseid': 466428}, {'name': '蜿蜒長路', 'text': '選擇生物或地。展示你牌庫頂的四張牌。將所有以此法展示且為該類別的牌置於你手上，其餘則置入你的墳墓場。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '條條道路通發現。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466682&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '685c5f62-b663-4fd6-ae21-43d5f1717c76', 'multiverseId': 466682}, 'multiverseid': 466682}]", '[{\'name\': \'Giftiger Wandelwicht\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nTodesberührung\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Er enthält kein Gift. Er ist Gift.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464317&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97d2569c-f431-43b9-a965-05496659cf94\', \'multiverseId\': 464317}, \'multiverseid\': 464317}, {\'name\': \'Cambiaformas venenoso\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nToque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'No contiene veneno. Es veneno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'207a7c2f-ffbf-47e6-b7d6-8cdc10195fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 464571}, \'multiverseid\': 464571}, {\'name\': \'Changelin venimeux\', \'text\': \'Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nContact mortel\', \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': "Il ne contient pas de poison. C\'est un poison.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464825&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82df3810-f652-474b-b7d6-23133d155439\', \'multiverseId\': 464825}, \'multiverseid\': 464825}, {\'name\': \'Cangiante Velenoso\', \'text\': \'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nTocco letale\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Non contiene veleno, è veleno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6c44247-315d-4080-84f9-8ae24e1f2363\', \'multiverseId\': 465079}, \'multiverseid\': 465079}, {\'name\': \'有毒な変わり身\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードは常にすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n接死\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'毒を持っているわけではない。それ自体が毒なのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98284544-04d9-470d-8180-e5d759612a92\', \'multiverseId\': 465333}, \'multiverseid\': 465333}, {\'name\': \'맹독 체인질링\', \'text\': \'체인질링 (이 카드는 모든 생물 유형이다.)\\n치명타\', \'type\': \'생물 — 변신괴물\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 독을 가지고 있지 않다. 그것 자체가 독이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfc54b52-27e5-4082-8649-8aabe7c2883b\', \'multiverseId\': 465587}, \'multiverseid\': 465587}, {\'name\': \'Morfoloide Peçonhento\', \'text\': \'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nToque mortífero\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Ele não é peçonhento. Ele é a peçonha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18e24dd5-d89d-4981-bda9-2788013c189f\', \'multiverseId\': 465841}, \'multiverseid\': 465841}, {\'name\': \'Ядовитый Перевертыш\', \'text\': \'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nСмертельное касание\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': \'Его тело не пропитано ядом. Оно из него сделано.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5256f337-1a0a-4c0c-916c-30b643e1c01a\', \'multiverseId\': 466095}, \'multiverseid\': 466095}, {\'name\': \'剧毒化形\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n死触\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'它不带毒。它本身便是毒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06f3a2d2-6def-4920-b061-dec14ba666ac\', \'multiverseId\': 466349}, \'multiverseid\': 466349}, {\'name\': \'劇毒化形\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物類別。）\\n死觸\', \'type\': \'生物 ～變形獸\', \'flavor\': \'牠不帶毒。牠本身便是毒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf1288f5-2b49-4157-baeb-9f7ad282695f\', \'multiverseId\': 466603}, \'multiverseid\': 466603}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glupschaugensceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDer Glupschaugensceada erhält +2/+0, solange du in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Karten gezogen hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': \'„Der hier braucht jemanden, dem er folgen kann. Schließlich ist jedes seiner Augen größer als sein Gehirn."\\n—Cyla, Fürstin der Lüfte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464252&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b0f1e93-e971-49fd-85df-4fe6bea680d8\', \'multiverseId\': 464252}, \'multiverseid\': 464252}, {\'name\': \'Engendro tarsio\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nEl Engendro tarsio obtiene +2/+0 mientras hayas robado dos o más cartas este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': \'"Este necesita supervisión. Después de todo, sus ojos son más grandes que su cerebro".\\n—Cyla, señora del Nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f10d56e2-2bfc-48e5-906b-2414d56f9c72\', \'multiverseId\': 464506}, \'multiverseid\': 464506}, {\'name\': \'Escouflœil\', \'text\': "Vol\\nL\'Escouflœil gagne +2/+0 tant que vous avez pioché au moins deux cartes ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : drakôn\', \'flavor\': "« Celui-ci devra être guidé. Après tout, chacun de ses yeux est plus gros que son cerveau. »\\n—Cyla, seigneuresse de l\'Aérain", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464760&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89377fa0-0315-4ccb-8c3b-26056e28f607\', \'multiverseId\': 464760}, \'multiverseid\': 464760}, {\'name\': \'Oculonibbio\', \'text\': "Volare\\nL\'Oculonibbio prende +2/+0 se hai pescato due o più carte in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Draghetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo andrà guidato. Dopotutto, ciascuno dei suoi occhi è più grande del suo cervello."\\n—Cyla, Signora del Nido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fac4042c-e3fb-4616-a473-dee22f904209\', \'multiverseId\': 465014}, \'multiverseid\': 465014}, {\'name\': \'ミルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nこのターンにあなたがカードを２枚以上引いているかぎり、ミルカイトは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': \'「目標を示してやる必要があるな。なんと言っても、こいつの脳は目玉よりも小さいんだから。」\\n――エアリーの長、サイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c7db3db-776c-4993-b40e-8f866845f3c4\', \'multiverseId\': 465268}, \'multiverseid\': 465268}, {\'name\': \'큰눈용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n큰눈용은 당신이 이번 턴에 카드를 두 장 이상 뽑은 한 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 드레이크\', \'flavor\': \'"이 녀석에게는 지시가 필요할 거야. 이녀석의 두 눈이 각각 자기 뇌보다 더 크거든."\\n—둥지의 군주, 사일라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1246d27-46f7-40c8-876c-a0556234f41e\', \'multiverseId\': 465522}, \'multiverseid\': 465522}, {\'name\': \'Dragonóculo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDragonóculo recebe +2/+0 desde que você tenha comprado dois ou mais cards neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragonete\', \'flavor\': \'"Esse vai precisar de direcionamento. Afinal, cada olho dele é maior que o cérebro."\\n— Cyla, Senhora do Ninho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817304c9-b99a-4aeb-b390-fad4630bef45\', \'multiverseId\': 465776}, \'multiverseid\': 465776}, {\'name\': \'Зоркий Змей\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nЗоркий Змей получает +2/+0 при условии, что в этом ходу вы уже взяли не менее двух карт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дрейк\', \'flavor\': \'«Самостоятельно действовать он не сможет. У него каждый из глаз больше, чем весь его мозг».\\n— Сайла, Владычица Гнездовья\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2c33a00-5288-4931-9510-cda354a2a875\', \'multiverseId\': 466030}, \'multiverseid\': 466030}, {\'name\': \'巨眼兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n只要你本回合已抓两张或更多牌，巨眼兽便得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙兽\', \'flavor\': \'「这小家伙需要你为它指往哪边飞。毕竟它的脑子比任何一只眼睛都要小。」\\n～羽巢之王塞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6904113c-7d5a-432d-bacb-6d141993b3ed\', \'multiverseId\': 466284}, \'multiverseid\': 466284}, {\'name\': \'巨眼獸\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n只要你本回合已抽兩張或更多牌，巨眼獸便得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍獸\', \'flavor\': \'「這小傢伙需要你為它指往哪邊飛。畢竟它的腦子比任何一隻眼睛都要小。」\\n～羽巢之王塞拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cfb6451-a8b0-4f8b-8618-7b9213a3bad7\', \'multiverseId\': 466538}, \'multiverseid\': 466538}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glückseinhorn\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jene Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Einhorn\', \'flavor\': \'Wer auch nur einen Blick auf eines dieser Geschöpfe erhascht, dem ist das Glück für acht Jahre hold.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464404&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9cac31-8d38-492c-9daf-011bf7194572\', \'multiverseId\': 464404}, \'multiverseid\': 464404}, {\'name\': \'Unicornio de la buena fortuna\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicornio\', \'flavor\': \'Si logras entrever uno, tendrás ocho años de buena suerte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2ba9dc-7a5d-470e-962b-8cb6bcce7e01\', \'multiverseId\': 464658}, \'multiverseid\': 464658}, {\'name\': \'Licorne de bon augure\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : licorne\', \'flavor\': "En apercevoir une, ne serait-ce que du coin de l\'œil, marque le début de huit ans de bonheur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464912&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b60293ba-dbbc-4f80-a2cb-89c64d2aa457\', \'multiverseId\': 464912}, \'multiverseid\': 464912}, {\'name\': \'Unicorno della Buona Sorte\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Unicorno\', \'flavor\': "Vederne uno anche solo di sfuggita segna l\'inizio di otto anni di fortuna.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad9a200c-3d72-4dea-8bc0-654b105f3c24\', \'multiverseId\': 465166}, \'multiverseid\': 465166}, {\'name\': \'吉兆の一角獣\', \'text\': \'他のクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、そのクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ユニコーン\', \'flavor\': \'その姿を一瞬でも見ることができれば、八年間続く幸運が始まる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8402adba-1699-4b8b-82f3-9dd07c024c49\', \'multiverseId\': 465420}, \'multiverseid\': 465420}, {\'name\': \'행운의 유니콘\', \'text\': \'다른 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 유니콘\', \'flavor\': \'한 마리를 힐끗 쳐다볼 수만 있어도 8년간 재수가 좋아진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb8ea48b-ef4b-4a0b-a591-2ffc4dfbd863\', \'multiverseId\': 465674}, \'multiverseid\': 465674}, {\'name\': \'Unicórnio da Boa Fortuna\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra criatura entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador +1/+1 naquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicórnio\', \'flavor\': \'Um mero vislumbre de um deles marca o início de oito anos de boa sorte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29cfbea7-9a8c-400c-8940-be442d78e31a\', \'multiverseId\': 465928}, \'multiverseid\': 465928}, {\'name\': \'Благодатный Единорог\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другое существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон +1/+1 на то существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Единорог\', \'flavor\': \'Увидеть такого хотя бы одним глазком — верный знак, что впереди восемь лет везения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5df9be02-d200-4300-950b-248b32a8b675\', \'multiverseId\': 466182}, \'multiverseid\': 466182}, {\'name\': \'好运独角兽\', \'text\': \'每当另一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，在该生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～独角兽\', \'flavor\': \'即便只是瞄到一眼，也能交上八年好运。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc3bbd9f-74eb-4304-bfcf-02e9ed742e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 466436}, \'multiverseid\': 466436}, {\'name\': \'好運獨角獸\', \'text\': \'每當另一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，在該生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～獨角獸\', \'flavor\': \'即便只是瞄到一眼，也能交上八年好運。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0024c6e9-f285-46d9-a176-fb91582ad774\', \'multiverseId\': 466690}, \'multiverseid\': 466690}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Champion\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nEdelmut (Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, alleine angreift, erhält sie +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geschichten über seine Heldentaten sind inspirierend, aber keine von ihnen ist auch nur im Entferntesten wahr.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464330&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b679d42e-282b-407b-9363-d830ed2d84fe\', \'multiverseId\': 464330}, \'multiverseid\': 464330}, {\'name\': \'Campeón trasgo\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nExaltado. (Siempre que una criatura que controlas ataque sola, esa criatura obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'El relato de sus hazañas inspira a muchos otros, aunque ninguna de ellas es verdad ni de lejos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99899c10-6af5-4ced-810f-6ec03e3bea30\', \'multiverseId\': 464584}, \'multiverseid\': 464584}, {\'name\': \'Champion gobelin\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nExaltation (À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez attaque seule, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Les récits de ses faits d\'armes donnent des ailes, mais aucun d\'eux ne contient une once de vérité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464838&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a14dc9-f61e-4f7c-b77e-a86203cd645f\', \'multiverseId\': 464838}, \'multiverseid\': 464838}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Campione\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nEsaltato (Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli attacca da sola, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Le storie dei suoi atti eroici sono ispiratrici, sebbene nessuna sia neanche lontanamente vera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cc33793-ffa6-42a1-8891-c6b9db16d58c\', \'multiverseId\': 465092}, \'multiverseid\': 465092}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの勇者\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n賛美（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが単独で攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'彼の英雄物語は勇気を与えてくれるが、ほんの少しも事実に基づいた箇所はない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b3b9ed-69dc-455b-801e-034902b72487\', \'multiverseId\': 465346}, \'multiverseid\': 465346}, {\'name\': \'고블린 용사\', \'text\': \'신속\\n고귀 (당신이 조종하는 생물이 혼자 공격할 때마다, 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 전사\', \'flavor\': \'그의 영웅적인 이야기들은 듣는 이를 고무시키지만, 그 이야기들은 하나같이 손톱만큼도 진실이 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83ad608b-d3f3-4cca-beb0-b98cbb6f006f\', \'multiverseId\': 465600}, \'multiverseid\': 465600}, {\'name\': \'Campeão Goblin\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nExaltado (Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla ataca sozinha, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'As histórias de seus feitos são inspiradoras, ainda que nenhuma seja sequer remotamente verdadeira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1513e10-fdf4-450e-a5e2-c80af896f37b\', \'multiverseId\': 465854}, \'multiverseid\': 465854}, {\'name\': \'Гоблин-Воитель\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nПовышение (Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем атакует в одиночку, то существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Истории о его подвигах вдохновляют, хоть ни одна из них даже близко не похожа на правду.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1134e083-f2e7-4130-9f28-6d7ba55e3cbe\', \'multiverseId\': 466108}, \'multiverseid\': 466108}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪斗士\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n颂威（每当一个由你操控的生物单独攻击时，该生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'他的英勇事迹件件鼓舞人心，可惜哪个都经不起半点推敲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6915f4ec-c82d-42a2-837e-661edc766556\', \'multiverseId\': 466362}, \'multiverseid\': 466362}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪鬥士\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n頌威（每當一個由你操控的生物單獨攻擊時，該生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'他的英勇事跡件件鼓舞人心，可惜哪個都經不起半點推敲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938a5f4f-105d-4e8a-b080-1f4509767361\', \'multiverseId\': 466616}, \'multiverseid\': 466616}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Ingenieur\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Goblin-Ingenieur ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Artefaktkarte durchsuchen, sie auf deinen Friedhof legen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.\\n{R}, {T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Bringe eine Artefaktkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464331&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6904c449-8991-4e2e-b8d7-192276260a59\', \'multiverseId\': 464331}, \'multiverseid\': 464331}, {\'name\': \'Ingeniero trasgo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ingeniero trasgo entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de artefacto, ponerla en tu cementerio y luego barajar tu biblioteca.\\n{R}, {T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Regresa la carta de artefacto objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2010fc4-9eec-46dc-a4fc-1353fcc01d5a\', \'multiverseId\': 464585}, \'multiverseid\': 464585}, {\'name\': \'Ingénieur gobelin\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Ingénieur gobelin arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte d\'artefact, la mettre dans votre cimetière et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.\\n{R}, {T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte d\'artefact ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464839&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaee563c-89bd-4b72-9f98-4d4db6d3341e\', \'multiverseId\': 464839}, \'multiverseid\': 464839}, {\'name\': \'Goblin Ingegnere\', \'text\': \'Quando il Goblin Ingegnere entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta artefatto, metterla nel tuo cimitero, poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.\\n{R}, {T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta artefatto bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac5213c2-8c1a-449e-8777-ac8777ebc721\', \'multiverseId\': 465093}, \'multiverseid\': 465093}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの技師\', \'text\': \'ゴブリンの技師が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーからアーティファクト・カード１枚を探し、それをあなたの墓地に置き、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n{R}, {T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが３以下のアーティファクト・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3e5300e-846c-4d9e-ab53-a91bb0da84d1\', \'multiverseId\': 465347}, \'multiverseid\': 465347}, {\'name\': \'고블린 기술자\', \'text\': \'고블린 기술자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 마법물체 카드 한 장을 찾아, 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\\n{R}, {T}, 마법물체 한 개를 희생한다: 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 3 이하인 마법물체 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 기능공\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'048260e0-b32b-41bb-abee-70b47ae1a506\', \'multiverseId\': 465601}, \'multiverseid\': 465601}, {\'name\': \'Engenheiro Goblin\', \'text\': \'Quando Engenheiro Goblin entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de artefato em seu grimório, colocá-lo em seu cemitério e depois embaralhar seu grimório.\\n{R}, {T}, sacrifique um artefato: Devolva o card de artefato alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f1ed866-cde0-4761-8b31-5b0659bc828d\', \'multiverseId\': 465855}, \'multiverseid\': 465855}, {\'name\': \'Гоблин-Инженер\', \'text\': \'Когда Гоблин-Инженер выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту артефакта, положить ее на ваше кладбище, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.\\n{R}, {T}, пожертвуйте артефакт: верните целевую карту артефакта с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 3 из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e24010e0-d910-4664-9695-e6d0f68a5687\', \'multiverseId\': 466109}, \'multiverseid\': 466109}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪技师\', \'text\': \'当鬼怪技师进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张神器牌，将它置入你的坟墓场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\\n{R}，{T}，牺牲一个神器：将目标总法术力费用等于或小于3的神器牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a18c59-824c-4c65-aab3-f70d92c33052\', \'multiverseId\': 466363}, \'multiverseid\': 466363}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪技師\', \'text\': \'當鬼怪技師進戰場時，你可以從你牌庫中搜尋一張神器牌，將它置入你的墳墓場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\\n{R}，{T}，犧牲一個神器：將目標總魔法力費用等於或小於3的神器牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e7345e-977f-424a-9e09-f35d3ed0d12b\', \'multiverseId\': 466617}, \'multiverseid\': 466617}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Kriegstrupp\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Erzeuge drei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\n• Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 und Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nVerflechtung {2}{R} (Bestimme beides, falls du die Verflechtungskosten bezahlst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464334&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf0620fe-8d36-437b-b303-846f9cb21a94\', \'multiverseId\': 464334}, \'multiverseid\': 464334}, {\'name\': \'Partida de guerra trasga\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Crea tres fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\\n• Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\\nEntrelazar {2}{R}. (Si pagas el coste de entrelazar, elige ambas opciones.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b48d96-f6c2-424d-bc1e-da5713ff3a21\', \'multiverseId\': 464588}, \'multiverseid\': 464588}, {\'name\': \'Compagnie de guerre gobeline\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\n• Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nUnion {2}{R} (Choisissez les deux si vous payez le coût d\'union.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8996f1c9-020d-4601-a297-3dbd1f44f287\', \'multiverseId\': 464842}, \'multiverseid\': 464842}, {\'name\': \'Brigata di Guerra dei Goblin\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Crea tre pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\n• Le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\\nIntrecciare {2}{R} (Scegli entrambi se paghi il costo di intrecciare.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7cde208-550e-4bef-91c7-b82087c54722\', \'multiverseId\': 465096}, \'multiverseid\': 465096}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの戦闘隊\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを３体生成する。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け速攻を得る。\\n双呪{2}{R}（双呪コストを支払ったなら、両方を選ぶ。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7c1edfd-e5d9-47ca-803f-4da9b8aa3cda\', \'multiverseId\': 465350}, \'multiverseid\': 465350}, {\'name\': \'고블린 출진 부대\', \'text\': \'하나를 선택한다 —\\n• 1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 세 개를 만든다.\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 신속을 얻는다.\\n엮어내기 {2}{R} (당신이 엮어내기 비용을 지불한다면 둘 다 선택한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c25f91b-e7cd-49bf-ab9c-b79f9c38c90a\', \'multiverseId\': 465604}, \'multiverseid\': 465604}, {\'name\': \'Bando de Guerra Goblin\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Crie três fichas de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\\n• As criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham ímpeto até o final do turno.\\nEntrelaçar {2}{R} (Escolha ambos se pagar o custo de entrelaçar.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef05ffb-97f5-4e99-85d0-de4d24567a61\', \'multiverseId\': 465858}, \'multiverseid\': 465858}, {\'name\': \'Гоблинский Боевой Отряд\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Создайте три фишки существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\\n• Существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и Ускорение до конца хода.\\nСплетение {2}{R} (Выберите оба, если вы оплачиваете стоимость Сплетения.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87372a9-c1dd-43ee-8166-7e33127a5245\', \'multiverseId\': 466112}, \'multiverseid\': 466112}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪战宴\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•派出三个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n•直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得敏捷异能。\\n打包{2}{R}（如果你支付打包费用，则两项都选。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96add6e5-b1f4-4e76-afd5-757daad6cefb\', \'multiverseId\': 466366}, \'multiverseid\': 466366}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪戰宴\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•派出三個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n•直到回合結束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且獲得敏捷異能。\\n打包{2}{R}（如果你支付打包費用，則兩項都選。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'642384c1-37d5-4910-8159-cd2b9b171be9\', \'multiverseId\': 466620}, \'multiverseid\': 466620}]', "[{'name': 'Goblin-Matrone', 'text': 'Wenn die Goblin-Matrone ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Goblin-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Eine Mutter, die nur das eigene Kind lieben kann.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464332&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4b62724-024d-4c5d-8add-099d092876e5', 'multiverseId': 464332}, 'multiverseid': 464332}, {'name': 'Matrona trasgo', 'text': 'Cuando la Matrona trasgo entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de Trasgo, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura — Trasgo', 'flavor': 'Madre no hay más que una..., por suerte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464586&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0296481-d926-4bf2-be26-ec6c3fcc226f', 'multiverseId': 464586}, 'multiverseid': 464586}, {'name': 'Matrone gobeline', 'text': 'Quand la Matrone gobeline arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de gobelin, révéler cette carte, la mettre dans votre main et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature : gobelin', 'flavor': 'Une mère que seul un enfant pourrait aimer.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464840&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dba55100-9330-43a6-a3b1-fb3d2a7e6390', 'multiverseId': 464840}, 'multiverseid': 464840}, {'name': 'Matrona Goblin', 'text': 'Quando la Matrona Goblin entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Goblin, rivelare quella carta, aggiungerla alla tua mano e poi rimescolare il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Una madre che solo un figlio potrebbe amare.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465094&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b42a4adb-926d-4872-808d-5fc9ffe09db0', 'multiverseId': 465094}, 'multiverseid': 465094}, {'name': 'ゴブリンの女看守', 'text': 'ゴブリンの女看守が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーからゴブリン・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゴブリン', 'flavor': '子の目にはどんな母も愛らしい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465348&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d6ddfe8-ebf8-4758-95fe-ad7119fdf6e4', 'multiverseId': 465348}, 'multiverseid': 465348}, {'name': '고블린 여사감', 'text': '고블린 여사감이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 고블린 카드 한 장을 찾아, 그 카드를 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '생물 — 고블린', 'flavor': '아이만이 사랑할 수 있는 어머니.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465602&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8d1d71f-e4cd-4290-a5fc-873f7dd8a258', 'multiverseId': 465602}, 'multiverseid': 465602}, {'name': 'Matrona Goblin', 'text': 'Quando Matrona Goblin entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de Goblin em seu grimório, revelá-lo, colocá-lo em sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório.', 'type': 'Criatura — Goblin', 'flavor': 'Uma mãe que só um filho seria capaz de amar.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465856&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac294eca-76c5-4f5a-8eb9-a205bd4afb9c', 'multiverseId': 465856}, 'multiverseid': 465856}, {'name': 'Гоблинская Матрона', 'text': 'Когда Гоблинская Матрона выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту Гоблина, показать ту карту, положить ее в вашу руку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Существо — Гоблин', 'flavor': 'Мать, которую лишь ее дитя способно полюбить.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466110&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bfb47635-3807-4f35-9b5f-24c90f43a4ab', 'multiverseId': 466110}, 'multiverseid': 466110}, {'name': '鬼怪女舍监', 'text': '当鬼怪女舍监进战场时，你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张鬼怪牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼怪', 'flavor': '老娘疼幼子，长大不认妈。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466364&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ccb7247-37b3-45a3-807d-784b66aa0fe3', 'multiverseId': 466364}, 'multiverseid': 466364}, {'name': '鬼怪女舍監', 'text': '當鬼怪女舍監進戰場時，你可以從你牌庫中搜尋一張鬼怪牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。', 'type': '生物 ～鬼怪', 'flavor': '老娘疼幼子，長大不認媽。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466618&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e44d41b-f7fb-4204-89e5-eea88e8d7cb5', 'multiverseId': 466618}, 'multiverseid': 466618}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grabender Anurid\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Grabende Anurid ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Land opfern. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\\nGrenzwert — Solange sieben oder mehr Karten in deinem Friedhof sind, erhält der Grabende Anurid +1/+1 und hat Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Frosch, Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Turgs Spross regierte noch lange nachdem Turg ins Gras biss.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cce3ea4-16ac-4fdf-aacb-c0e48c7cedea\', \'multiverseId\': 464366}, \'multiverseid\': 464366}, {\'name\': \'Anuro excavador\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Anuro excavador entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar una tierra. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\\nUmbral — Mientras haya siete o más cartas en tu cementerio, el Anuro excavador obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia rana\', \'flavor\': \'Los vástagos de Turg reinaron mucho tiempo después de que él estirase la pata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20772943-f4b3-4925-ac07-1381c6f81468\', \'multiverseId\': 464620}, \'multiverseid\': 464620}, {\'name\': \'Anouride excavateur\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Anouride excavateur arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier un terrain. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\nSeuil — Tant qu\'il y a au moins sept cartes dans votre cimetière, l\'Anouride excavateur gagne +1/+1 et a la vigilance.", \'type\': \'Créature : grenouille et bête\', \'flavor\': "L\'engeance de Turg régna encore longtemps après son dernier coassement.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464874&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cef91cae-2901-45f6-b45b-621b86df061e\', \'multiverseId\': 464874}, \'multiverseid\': 464874}, {\'name\': \'Anuro Scavatore\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Anuro Scavatore entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare una terra. Se lo fai, pesca una carta.\\nSoglia — Fintanto che ci sono sette o più carte nel tuo cimitero, l\'Anuro Scavatore prende +1/+1 e ha cautela.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia Rana\', \'flavor\': \'La progenie di Turg regnò a lungo dopo il suo ultimo gracidio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4c12f64-82d4-43e3-a8cf-0a1bc74218db\', \'multiverseId\': 465128}, \'multiverseid\': 465128}, {\'name\': \'掘削するアヌーリッド\', \'text\': \'掘削するアヌーリッドが戦場に出たとき、あなたは土地１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、カードを１枚引く。\\nスレッショルド ― あなたの墓地にカードが７枚以上あるかぎり、掘削するアヌーリッドは＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — カエル・ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'トゥーグがくたばった後も長く、その子孫による支配が続いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'478a7164-ffda-457d-bceb-fcd1bfffc21d\', \'multiverseId\': 465382}, \'multiverseid\': 465382}, {\'name\': \'파내는 아누리드\', \'text\': \'파내는 아누리드가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 대지 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n문턱 — 당신의 무덤에 카드가 일곱 장 이상 있는 한, 파내는 아누리드는 +1/+1을 받고 경계를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 개구리 야수\', \'flavor\': \'투르그의 산란체는 개굴 하고 운 뒤로 오래도록 번성했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ddd8826-8e05-4fb6-b0ae-ead3717bb48e\', \'multiverseId\': 465636}, \'multiverseid\': 465636}, {\'name\': \'Anurídeo Escavador\', \'text\': \'Quando Anurídeo Escavador entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar um terreno. Se fizer isso, compre um card.\\nLimiar — Enquanto houver sete ou mais cards em seu cemitério, Anurídeo Escavador receberá +1/+1 e terá vigilância.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sapo Besta\', \'flavor\': \'A prole de Turg reinou por muito tempo após seu último coaxar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52cd1e99-0f43-464c-8c1a-362ee23274da\', \'multiverseId\': 465890}, \'multiverseid\': 465890}, {\'name\': \'Роющийся Анурид\', \'text\': \'Когда Роющийся Анурид выходит на поле битвы, вы можете пожертвовать землю. Если вы это делаете, возьмите карту.\\nПорог — Пока на вашем кладбище есть не менее семи карт, Роющийся Анурид получает +1/+1 и имеет Бдительность.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Лягушка Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Потомство Турга правило еще долго после того, как он квакнулся.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'411585c4-627b-4272-bc45-85e0f52e7600\', \'multiverseId\': 466144}, \'multiverseid\': 466144}, {\'name\': \'掘地驽蛙\', \'text\': \'当掘地驽蛙进战场时，你可以牺牲一个地。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\\n门槛～只要你的坟墓场中有七张或更多牌，掘地驽蛙便得+1/+1且具有警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛙／野兽\', \'flavor\': \'托咕蛙声不复存，统治地位延数代。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'debed2a8-523d-492c-b2ad-a77419bd8b2b\', \'multiverseId\': 466398}, \'multiverseid\': 466398}, {\'name\': \'掘地駑蛙\', \'text\': \'當掘地駑蛙進戰場時，你可以犧牲一個地。若你如此作，則抽一張牌。\\n門檻～只要你的墳墓場中有七張或更多牌，掘地駑蛙便得+1/+1且具有警戒異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蛙／野獸\', \'flavor\': \'托咕蛙聲不復存，統治地位延數代。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'653e14d9-2fe9-42ad-bcc1-c94d8e87f750\', \'multiverseId\': 466652}, \'multiverseid\': 466652}]', "[{'name': 'Großzügiges Geschenk', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Elefant-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Die besten Geschenke können unmöglich weiterverschenkt werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464214&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1206d9a-8686-4b41-b1fe-0d4dd7d879ff', 'multiverseId': 464214}, 'multiverseid': 464214}, {'name': 'Regalo paquidérmico', 'text': 'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Elefante verde 3/3.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Los mejores regalos son los que no pueden volverse a ofrecer a nadie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464468&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12d1950e-ebaf-4cd1-9f3d-8af85325fb6e', 'multiverseId': 464468}, 'multiverseid': 464468}, {'name': 'Cadeau généreux', 'text': 'Détruisez le permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Éléphant.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Les meilleurs cadeaux sont impossibles à rétrocéder.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464722&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '082e5a3c-408a-4dea-88bb-046eb19e8218', 'multiverseId': 464722}, 'multiverseid': 464722}, {'name': 'Dono Abbondante', 'text': 'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Elefante 3/3 verde.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'I regali migliori sono impossibili da riciclare.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464976&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b46ba3a6-4c15-4b40-97da-990d71f99739', 'multiverseId': 464976}, 'multiverseid': 464976}, {'name': '過大な贈り物', 'text': 'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３の象・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '最高の贈り物は他人に渡せない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465230&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f24d248-18b8-4bb1-8d00-46550fc1ce8f', 'multiverseId': 465230}, 'multiverseid': 465230}, {'name': '후한 선물', 'text': '지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 파괴한다. 그 지속물의 조종자는 3/3 녹색 코끼리 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': '최고의 선물은 다른 사람에게 다시 선물로 줄 수 없다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465484&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9df6cfa2-b621-407d-aa7f-1bc4f7db7c08', 'multiverseId': 465484}, 'multiverseid': 465484}, {'name': 'Presente Generoso', 'text': 'Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura verde 3/3 do tipo Elefante.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Os melhores presentes são dados apenas uma vez.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465738&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '267e2081-a8db-4008-a237-f7a569697c5c', 'multiverseId': 465738}, 'multiverseid': 465738}, {'name': 'Щедрый Подарок', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевой перманент. Контролирующий его игрок создает одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Слон.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Лучшие подарки никак нельзя передарить.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465992&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '786fcd2a-7147-44de-93df-a96c08d28506', 'multiverseId': 465992}, 'multiverseid': 465992}, {'name': '慷慨赠礼', 'text': '消灭目标永久物。其操控者派出一个3/3绿色的象衍生生物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '最好的礼物都无法转送。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466246&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e67e01af-62be-43d1-bf5a-f0abc09cca46', 'multiverseId': 466246}, 'multiverseid': 466246}, {'name': '慷慨贈禮', 'text': '消滅目標永久物。其操控者派出一個3/3綠色的象衍生生物。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '最好的禮物都無法轉送。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466500&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f594d0e1-e749-4270-a1a7-8b0ae1b0b96a', 'multiverseId': 466500}, 'multiverseid': 466500}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gruftratten\', \'text\': \'{X}: Die Gruftratten fügen jeder Kreatur und jedem Spieler X Schadenspunkte zu. Verwende nur schwarzes Mana für X.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ratte\', \'flavor\': \'„Ksch! Verschwindet, ihr kleinen Wurmschwänze. Meine Leichen sind nicht euer Abendessen!"\\n—Gisa die Ghulruferin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464287&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8db5359-aaf1-4fc8-87a6-79e02f85141f\', \'multiverseId\': 464287}, \'multiverseid\': 464287}, {\'name\': \'Ratas de la cripta\', \'text\': \'{X}: Las Ratas de la cripta hacen X puntos de daño a cada criatura y a cada jugador. Usa solo maná negro para pagar X.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rata\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Fuera, colitas de gusano! ¡Largo de aquí! ¡Mis cadáveres no son vuestra cena!".\\n—Gisa, la llamamuertos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e70b2a9e-c50e-4c94-b29d-291459381683\', \'multiverseId\': 464541}, \'multiverseid\': 464541}, {\'name\': \'Rats des cryptes\', \'text\': \'{X} : Les Rats des cryptes infligent X blessures à chaque créature et à chaque joueur. Ne dépensez que du mana noir pour X.\', \'type\': \'Créature : rat\', \'flavor\': \'« Pschttt, misérables vermines ! Allez-vous-en ! Mes cadavres ne sont pas pour vous ! »\\n—Gisa, meneuse de goule\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464795&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b740a5df-d818-4c1d-af8c-2d60d5a8a873\', \'multiverseId\': 464795}, \'multiverseid\': 464795}, {\'name\': \'Ratti della Cripta\', \'text\': \'{X}: I Ratti della Cripta infliggono X danni a ogni creatura e a ogni giocatore. Spendi solo mana nero per X.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ratto\', \'flavor\': \'"Sciò, piccole code di verme, andate via! I miei cadaveri non sono la vostra cena!"\\n—Gisa l\\\'evocaghoul\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd3cc595-1437-4601-8cc8-690f8f7ff71e\', \'multiverseId\': 465049}, \'multiverseid\': 465049}, {\'name\': \'墓所のネズミ\', \'text\': \'{X}：墓所のネズミは各クリーチャーと各プレイヤーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは黒マナでのみ支払える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ネズミ\', \'flavor\': \'「シッ、このチビどもめ。あっちへ行け！この死体はお前らのエサじゃない！」\\n――グール呼びのギサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eec28bbc-5f27-4a5e-8757-098e62acceda\', \'multiverseId\': 465303}, \'multiverseid\': 465303}, {\'name\': \'묘지 쥐떼\', \'text\': \'{X}: 묘지 쥐떼는 각 생물과 각 플레이어에게 피해 X점을 입힌다. X는 흑색 마나만을 사용한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 쥐\', \'flavor\': \'"쉿, 이 작은 벌레같은 것들아—썩 꺼져! 내 시체들은 너희들의 식사거리가 아니야!"\\n—악귀소환술사 기샤\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93d15016-1f47-4f88-b306-256fa92920fe\', \'multiverseId\': 465557}, \'multiverseid\': 465557}, {\'name\': \'Ratos da Cripta\', \'text\': \'{X}: Ratos da Cripta causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura e a cada jogador. Gaste somente mana preto para pagar X.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rato\', \'flavor\': \'"Xô! Fora daqui seus rabinhos de verme! Xô! Os meus cadáveres não são jantar, não!"\\n— Gisa, Invocadora de Carniçais\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6dd122-aebf-4170-8fea-45d5359650f8\', \'multiverseId\': 465811}, \'multiverseid\': 465811}, {\'name\': \'Могильные Крысы\', \'text\': \'{X}: Могильные Крысы наносят X повреждений каждому существу и каждому игроку. Расходуйте на X только черную ману.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Крыса\', \'flavor\': \'«Брысь, проклятые червехвосты. Убирайтесь! Мои трупы вам не обед!»\\n— призывательница упырей Джиза\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69bf0a50-ea6d-4892-b610-cf509682a213\', \'multiverseId\': 466065}, \'multiverseid\': 466065}, {\'name\': \'墓穴老鼠\', \'text\': \'{X}：墓穴老鼠对每个生物和每位牌手各造成X点伤害。只能将黑色法术力用于X。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'「去，你们这些死耗子～一边去！我的那些尸体可不是你们的晚餐！」\\n～尸鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fddd7956-dcd5-4592-b86c-4ea8317bac79\', \'multiverseId\': 466319}, \'multiverseid\': 466319}, {\'name\': \'墓穴老鼠\', \'text\': \'{X}：墓穴老鼠對每個生物和每位玩家各造成X點傷害。只能將黑色魔法力用於X。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～老鼠\', \'flavor\': \'「去，你們這些死耗子～一邊去！我的那些屍體可不是你們的晚餐！」\\n～屍鬼牧者基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc67724d-8b0d-4eb7-9a45-ccdaab4ea82e\', \'multiverseId\': 466573}, \'multiverseid\': 466573}]', '[{\'name\': \'Güldenes Licht\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst Verhülltheit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Du kannst nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Wer den ersten Schlag überlebt, landet den zweiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464215&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7f0e86b-a235-4f29-8b84-9ea7565019e5\', \'multiverseId\': 464215}, \'multiverseid\': 464215}, {\'name\': \'Luz de oropel\', \'text\': \'Ganas la habilidad de velo hasta el final del turno. (No puedes ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Quien sobreviva al primer golpe será quien pueda asestar el segundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0c28adf-d216-4498-9e32-1dd261221237\', \'multiverseId\': 464469}, \'multiverseid\': 464469}, {\'name\': \'Lumière dorée\', \'text\': "Vous acquérez le linceul jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Vous ne pouvez pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Quiconque survit au premier coup peut décocher le second.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464723&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab4bdea1-cb9c-4515-af91-e5a31511f660\', \'multiverseId\': 464723}, \'multiverseid\': 464723}, {\'name\': \'Luce Dorata\', \'text\': \'Hai velo fino alla fine del turno. (Non puoi essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\\nCiclo {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Chi sopravvive al primo colpo riesce a piazzare il secondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ba474da-ab8c-4d0a-8fd3-694dba7b7507\', \'multiverseId\': 464977}, \'multiverseid\': 464977}, {\'name\': \'金粉の光\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたは被覆を得る。（あなたは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'最初の一撃を生き延びた者は二度目に備えて生き続ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78d29912-be31-4afb-81cb-5b57ce4477c6\', \'multiverseId\': 465231}, \'multiverseid\': 465231}, {\'name\': \'금박입힌 빛\', \'text\': \'당신은 턴종료까지 은신을 얻는다. (당신은 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\\n순환 {2} ({2}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'첫 번째 타격에서 살아남는 자만이 두 번째 타격을 날릴 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5462a242-a1fd-430f-a33a-249ea4af34e3\', \'multiverseId\': 465485}, \'multiverseid\': 465485}, {\'name\': \'Luz Engalanada\', \'text\': \'Você ganha manto até o final do turno. (Você não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\\nReciclar {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Quem quer que resista ao primeiro golpe sobrevive para dar o segundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'764e84ba-a6a1-4129-afc3-2d437864fa80\', \'multiverseId\': 465739}, \'multiverseid\': 465739}, {\'name\': \'Золоченый Свет\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете Пелену до конца хода. (Вы не можете быть целью заклинаний или способностей.)\\nЦикл {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Тот, кто выживет после первого удара, сумеет нанести второй.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3047bb0a-cbfc-4f16-8a83-aabfb2a52835\', \'multiverseId\': 465993}, \'multiverseid\': 465993}, {\'name\': \'金光眩目\', \'text\': \'你获得帷幕异能直到回合结束。（你不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'撑过第一击才能还击。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a93e7b-d636-43da-8c71-c1d3f89b7fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 466247}, \'multiverseid\': 466247}, {\'name\': \'金光眩目\', \'text\': \'你獲得帷幕異能直到回合結束。（你不能成為咒語或異能的目標。）\\n循環{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'撐過第一擊才能還擊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9afb3329-c3a6-4910-9f75-60ca9529d5cc\', \'multiverseId\': 466501}, \'multiverseid\': 466501}]', "[{'name': 'Handelsmagier des Basars', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Handelsmagier des Basars ins Spiel kommt, ziehe zwei Karten und wirf dann drei Karten ab.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': 'Er tauschte eine Lampe gegen ein Zepter, das Zepter gegen einen Rubin und den Rubin gegen einen einfachen Teppich.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464244&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd780e43c-b35e-48dd-a6cc-b968714836b7', 'multiverseId': 464244}, 'multiverseid': 464244}, {'name': 'Mercamago del bazar', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nCuando el Mercamago del bazar entre al campo de batalla, roba dos cartas, luego descarta tres cartas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hechicero humano', 'flavor': 'Cambió una lámpara por un cetro, el cetro por un rubí y el rubí por una alfombra sencilla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464498&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd5ddddd-cc06-4c01-8121-04233b7e6948', 'multiverseId': 464498}, 'multiverseid': 464498}, {'name': 'Négocemage du bazar', 'text': 'Vol\\nQuand le Négocemage du bazar arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez deux cartes, puis défaussez-vous de trois cartes.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': 'Il échangea une lampe contre un sceptre, le sceptre contre un rubis, et le rubis contre un simple tapis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464752&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd34327b6-9be8-4b4d-944b-a5bdfc262dca', 'multiverseId': 464752}, 'multiverseid': 464752}, {'name': 'Magimercante del Bazar', 'text': 'Volare\\nQuando il Magimercante del Bazar entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca due carte, poi scarta tre carte.', 'type': 'Creatura — Mago Umano', 'flavor': 'Barattò una lampada per uno scettro, lo scettro per un rubino e il rubino per un semplice tappeto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465006&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0cde400-72c7-4705-a5b8-8213f2675eb3', 'multiverseId': 465006}, 'multiverseid': 465006}, {'name': 'バザールの交易魔道士', 'text': '飛行\\nバザールの交易魔道士が戦場に出たとき、カードを２枚引き、その後カード３枚を捨てる。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': 'ランプを杖と交換し、杖をルビーと交換し、ルビーを絨毯と交換した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465260&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd88661c5-a001-4d5c-9b6e-1bcf2c35fd61', 'multiverseId': 465260}, 'multiverseid': 465260}, {'name': '상점가 거래마도사', 'text': '비행\\n상점가 거래마도사가 전장에 들어올 때, 카드 두 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 세 장을 버린다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 마법사', 'flavor': '그는 등불과 지팡이를 바꿨고, 지팡이와 루비를 바꾼 다음, 루비와 단순한 양탄자를 바꿨다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465514&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '891fc196-fb41-4bca-b604-f0f3e91f38c0', 'multiverseId': 465514}, 'multiverseid': 465514}, {'name': 'Magimercante do Bazar', 'text': 'Voar\\nQuando Magimercante do Bazar entrar no campo de batalha, compre dois cards e depois descarte três cards.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Mago', 'flavor': 'Ele trocou uma lâmpada por um cetro, o cetro por um rubi e o rubi por um tapete simples.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465768&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '807c7fa6-059e-40b6-94aa-8cc4f8f08ee2', 'multiverseId': 465768}, 'multiverseid': 465768}, {'name': 'Базарный Маг-Купец', 'text': 'Полет\\nКогда Базарный Маг-Купец выходит на поле битвы, возьмите две карты, затем сбросьте три карты.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Чародей', 'flavor': 'Он поменял лампу на посох, посох на рубин, а рубин — на простецкий коврик.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466022&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac977534-464f-4d98-84d7-966e60de8ef6', 'multiverseId': 466022}, 'multiverseid': 466022}, {'name': '市集行商法师', 'text': '飞行\\n当市集行商法师进战场时，抓两张牌，然后弃三张牌。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／法术师', 'flavor': '他用盏灯换了根权杖，再用权杖换了颗红宝石，再用红宝石换了块不起眼的毛毯。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466276&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9604c72f-5849-47bc-b457-8b23e96af92a', 'multiverseId': 466276}, 'multiverseid': 466276}, {'name': '市集行商法師', 'text': '飛行\\n當市集行商法師進戰場時，抽兩張牌，然後棄三張牌。', 'type': '生物 ～人類／魔法師', 'flavor': '他用盞燈換了根權杖，再用權杖換了顆紅寶石，再用紅寶石換了塊不起眼的毛毯。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466530&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdb2e8f4-759f-4f10-b31b-21966b831eae', 'multiverseId': 466530}, 'multiverseid': 466530}]", '[{\'name\': \'Herzlicher Vampir\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Herzliche Vampir oder eine andere Kreatur stirbt, lege auf jeden Vampir, den du kontrollierst, eine +1/+1-Marke.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Tretet bitte ein! Die Hors d\\\'oeuvres sind angerichtet."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464286&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fdf498c-cdc8-4c6a-9e1c-7016c949175f\', \'multiverseId\': 464286}, \'multiverseid\': 464286}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro cordial\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Vampiro cordial u otra criatura muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada Vampiro que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Pasa, pasa! El aperitivo está servido".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33ef090e-7309-45af-853a-89ecca221428\', \'multiverseId\': 464540}, \'multiverseid\': 464540}, {\'name\': \'Vampire cordial\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que le Vampire cordial ou une autre créature meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chaque vampire que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': "« Entrez, entrez ! Les hors d\'œuvres sont sur la table. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464794&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11460b63-ed3a-4078-b43d-3fa04c4f0f22\', \'multiverseId\': 464794}, \'multiverseid\': 464794}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro Cordiale\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Vampiro Cordiale o un\'altra creatura muoiono, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ogni Vampiro che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Prego, accomodatevi! L\\\'antipasto è già in tavola."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a259a8d-3af4-42a5-8c48-97b1b61f4280\', \'multiverseId\': 465048}, \'multiverseid\': 465048}, {\'name\': \'親切な吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'親切な吸血鬼か他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、あなたがコントロールしている各吸血鬼の上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「こちらへどうぞ！テーブルに前菜を用意してありますよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a016858-7a46-4acc-99bf-f1b539855857\', \'multiverseId\': 465302}, \'multiverseid\': 465302}, {\'name\': \'다정한 흡혈귀\', \'text\': \'다정한 흡혈귀 또는 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 각 흡혈귀에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"자, 들어와! 전채가 테이블에 차려져 있다구."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f72df30e-c672-47aa-b078-7fc670042e02\', \'multiverseId\': 465556}, \'multiverseid\': 465556}, {\'name\': \'Vampiro Cordial\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Vampiro Cordial ou outra criatura morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada Vampiro que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Entre, por favor. O aperitivo está servido."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c515d593-66c5-41d9-a7aa-57e670bd8806\', \'multiverseId\': 465810}, \'multiverseid\': 465810}, {\'name\': \'Радушный Вампир\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Радушный Вампир или другое существо умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждого Вампира под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Прошу, заходите! На столе ждут закуски».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e1d3be2-69a3-4b35-9a0e-3f271ecf848d\', \'multiverseId\': 466064}, \'multiverseid\': 466064}, {\'name\': \'热忱吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'每当热忱吸血鬼或另一个生物死去时，在每个由你操控的吸血鬼上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「快请进！前菜已经摆上桌了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e60077c-cdec-47b4-a8e6-f8e130e2d9b4\', \'multiverseId\': 466318}, \'multiverseid\': 466318}, {\'name\': \'熱忱吸血鬼\', \'text\': \'每當熱忱吸血鬼或另一個生物死去時，在每個由你操控的吸血鬼上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「快請進！前菜已經擺上桌了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19fabd14-1e21-4e2c-8763-39c8962b2fff\', \'multiverseId\': 466572}, \'multiverseid\': 466572}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hirnraspel\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl wirft zwei Karten ab.\\nÜberlast {1}{B} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Überlast-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, verändere seinen Text, indem du alle Vorkommen von „eine … deiner Wahl" durch „jede …" ersetzt.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zauber des Wahnsinns erfordern es oft, den Verstand zu opfern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464299&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e1c073f-d07c-417f-9aac-9d60f38cf43c\', \'multiverseId\': 464299}, \'multiverseid\': 464299}, {\'name\': \'Hurgar en la mente\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo descarta dos cartas.\\nSobrecarga {1}{B}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de sobrecarga. Si lo haces, cambia su texto reemplazando "el jugador objetivo" por "cada jugador".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los hechizos de demencia normalmente precisan un sacrificio de cordura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550cb946-41df-49f1-a709-9c07bd4fe5cc\', \'multiverseId\': 464553}, \'multiverseid\': 464553}, {\'name\': "Ratisser l\'esprit", \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé se défausse de deux cartes.\\nSurcharge {1}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de surcharge. Si vous faites ainsi, modifiez son texte en remplaçant toutes les occurrences de « ciblé(e) » par « chaque ».)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les sorts de folie nécessitent souvent de sacrifier sa raison.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464807&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'305a8333-6f64-4d81-9e85-c94282239a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 464807}, \'multiverseid\': 464807}, {\'name\': \'Squarciare la Mente\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio scarta due carte.\\nSovraccarico {1}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di sovraccarico. Se lo fai, cambiane il testo sostituendo "un giocatore bersaglio" con "ogni giocatore".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le magie della follia spesso richiedono il sacrificio del senno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e9ae3ca-b98b-44b1-9723-a53a1171cb19\', \'multiverseId\': 465061}, \'multiverseid\': 465061}, {\'name\': \'精神の掻き寄せ\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を捨てる。\\n超過{1}{B}（あなたはこの呪文をこれの超過コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、対象は取らず、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード２枚を捨てる。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'狂気の呪文は往々にして正気の生け贄を求める。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bb8d383-9fb1-439d-a0da-66aad3387ae3\', \'multiverseId\': 465315}, \'multiverseid\': 465315}, {\'name\': \'정신 갈퀴\', \'text\': \'플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 두 장을 버린다.\\n과부하 {1}{B} (당신은 과부하 비용을 지불하여 이 주문을 발동할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 이 주문은 "각 플레이어는 카드 두 장을 버린다."로 내용이 변한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'광기의 주문들은 종종 이성을 희생하기를 요구한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa7aca22-1d2a-4975-bf4e-16c41e3f7e11\', \'multiverseId\': 465569}, \'multiverseid\': 465569}, {\'name\': \'Laceração Mental\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo descarta dois cards.\\nSobrecarga {1}{B} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de sobrecarga. Se fizer isso, altere seu texto substituindo todas as ocorrências de "o jogador alvo" por "cada jogador".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As mágicas de loucura muitas vezes exigem um sacrifício de sanidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cd9c7b8-0d37-4cfb-bb4a-115b7036a174\', \'multiverseId\': 465823}, \'multiverseid\': 465823}, {\'name\': \'Выскабливание Разума\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок сбрасывает две карты.\\nПерегрузка {1}{B} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Перегрузки. Если вы это делаете, измените в его тексте все слова «целевой» на «каждый».)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Заклинания безумия зачастую требуют пожертвовать ясностью рассудка.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b48484d9-55fa-45c6-80b2-58c375623f20\', \'multiverseId\': 466077}, \'multiverseid\': 466077}, {\'name\': \'纵掠心灵\', \'text\': \'目标牌手弃两张牌。\\n超载{1}{B}（你可以支付此咒语的超载费用来施放它。如果你如此作，将其中的「目标」字样全部更改为「每个」。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'疯魔咒语通常需要牺牲理智。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'805394ea-7660-40bf-96d8-1ffb6a7e7b58\', \'multiverseId\': 466331}, \'multiverseid\': 466331}, {\'name\': \'縱掠心靈\', \'text\': \'目標玩家棄兩張牌。\\n超載{1}{B}（你可以支付此咒語的超載費用來施放它。如果你如此作，將其中的「目標」字樣全部更改為「每個」。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'瘋魔咒語通常需要犧牲理智。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dc0e039-f495-4e2a-b8ff-c4d4902efa23\', \'multiverseId\': 466585}, \'multiverseid\': 466585}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hogaak, erwachte Nekropolis\', \'text\': \'Du kannst kein Mana bezahlen, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nEinberufen, Wühlen (Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur. Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, bezahlst du {1}.)\\nDu kannst Hogaak, erwachte Nekropolis, aus deinem Friedhof wirken.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464405&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a465633-3153-46e0-81db-da7e00d66ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 464405}, \'multiverseid\': 464405}, {\'name\': \'Hogaak, necrópolis resurgida\', \'text\': \'No puedes usar maná para lanzar este hechizo.\\nConvocar, excavar. (Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura. Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nPuedes lanzar a Hogaak, necrópolis resurgida desde tu cementerio.\\nArrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9ac0223-ba42-4e7c-a3b9-99563e516766\', \'multiverseId\': 464659}, \'multiverseid\': 464659}, {\'name\': \'Hogaak, nécropole transcendée\', \'text\': "Vous ne pouvez pas dépenser de mana pour lancer ce sort.\\nConvocation, fouille (Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort réduit son coût de {1} ou d\'un mana de la couleur de cette créature. Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière paie {1}.)\\nVous pouvez lancer Hogaak, nécropole transcendée depuis votre cimetière.\\nPiétinement", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464913&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0716e019-7146-489c-b396-d2501c8586ca\', \'multiverseId\': 464913}, \'multiverseid\': 464913}, {\'name\': \'Hogaak, Necropoli Risvegliata\', \'text\': \'Non puoi spendere mana per lanciare questa magia.\\nConvocazione, esumare (Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura. Ogni carta che esili dal tuo cimitero corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nPuoi lanciare Hogaak, Necropoli Risvegliata dal tuo cimitero.\\nTravolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06576c1c-2e40-4f26-b761-104e3778d911\', \'multiverseId\': 465167}, \'multiverseid\': 465167}, {\'name\': \'甦る死滅都市、ホガーク\', \'text\': \'あなたは、この呪文を唱えるためにマナを支払うことはできない。\\n召集、探査（この呪文を唱える段階で、あなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、それぞれ{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。あなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、それぞれ{1}を支払う。）\\nあなたはあなたの墓地から甦る死滅都市、ホガークを唱えてもよい。\\nトランプル\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34377b1d-03b0-4a07-a36e-a2dc9036926a\', \'multiverseId\': 465421}, \'multiverseid\': 465421}, {\'name\': \'부활한 네크로폴리스, 호가크\', \'text\': \'당신은 이 주문을 발동하기 위해 마나를 사용할 수 없다.\\n집합, 파헤치기 (이 주문을 발동하는 동안 탭하는 각 생물은 이 주문의 비용 중 {1} 또는 그 생물의 색 마나 한 개를 지불한다. 당신이 당신의 무덤에서 추방하는 각 카드는 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n당신은 부활한 네크로폴리스, 호가크를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다.\\n돌진\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 화신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'191dbb88-3a0f-4a3c-8fd7-7c807854921a\', \'multiverseId\': 465675}, \'multiverseid\': 465675}, {\'name\': \'Hogaak, Necrópole Erguida\', \'text\': \'Você não pode gastar mana para conjurar esta mágica.\\nConvocar, esquadrinhar (Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga por {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura. Cada card que você exila de seu cemitério paga por {1}.)\\nVocê pode conjurar Hogaak, Necrópole Erguida, de seu cemitério.\\nAtropelar\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3271ff8d-9e92-47a8-897d-20f2e7cf79b2\', \'multiverseId\': 465929}, \'multiverseid\': 465929}, {\'name\': \'Хогаак, Восставший Некрополь\', \'text\': \'Вы не можете тратить ману на разыгрывание этого заклинания.\\nСозыв, Выкапывание (Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа. Каждая карта, которую вы изгоняете из вашего кладбища, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nВы можете разыгрывать Хогаак, Восставший Некрополь из вашего кладбища.\\nПробивной удар\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Аватара\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfc13740-3236-4405-bd9c-e58e681bfdfc\', \'multiverseId\': 466183}, \'multiverseid\': 466183}, {\'name\': \'醒转古陵寝霍佳葛\', \'text\': \'你不能用法术力来施放此咒语。\\n召集，掘穴（于施放此咒语时，你每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力，且每从你坟墓场中放逐一张牌，也能支付{1}。）\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中施放醒转古陵寝霍佳葛。\\n践踏\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'975a3483-048e-456e-9baa-ed29decc8a6c\', \'multiverseId\': 466437}, \'multiverseid\': 466437}, {\'name\': \'醒轉古陵寢霍佳葛\', \'text\': \'你不能用魔法力來施放此咒語。\\n召集，掘穴（於施放此咒語時，你每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力，且每從你墳墓場中放逐一張牌，也能支付{1}。）\\n你可以從你的墳墓場中施放醒轉古陵寢霍佳葛。\\n踐踏\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～聖者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9745988a-7de5-4f22-8d81-2fa023b39648\', \'multiverseId\': 466691}, \'multiverseid\': 466691}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höhle der Versuchung\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{4}, {T}, opfere die Höhle der Versuchung: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur zu einem Zeitpunkt, zu dem du auch eine Hexerei wirken könntest.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464440&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a2d228-710a-4ba3-b099-5fd0d26333c1\', \'multiverseId\': 464440}, \'multiverseid\': 464440}, {\'name\': \'Cueva de la tentación\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrificar la Cueva de la tentación: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo. Activa esta habilidad solo cuando puedas lanzar un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0a7395e-554b-4024-b340-88f57563bf2a\', \'multiverseId\': 464694}, \'multiverseid\': 464694}, {\'name\': \'Caverne de la tentation\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifiez la Caverne de la tentation : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée. N\'activez cette capacité que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464948&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abe8c81f-7eae-450c-ac9d-6f85d85374d2\', \'multiverseId\': 464948}, \'multiverseid\': 464948}, {\'name\': \'Caverna della Tentazione\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{4}, {T}, Sacrifica la Caverna della Tentazione: Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio. Attiva questa abilità solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4678160f-d375-47d1-acf7-8d75cfc417fa\', \'multiverseId\': 465202}, \'multiverseid\': 465202}, {\'name\': \'誘惑の洞窟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{4}, {T}, 誘惑の洞窟を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。この能力は、あなたがソーサリーを唱えられるときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79406381-f2e8-4f03-b018-b9b0d3edd1da\', \'multiverseId\': 465456}, \'multiverseid\': 465456}, {\'name\': \'유혹의 동굴\', \'text\': \'{T}: {C}를 추가한다.\\n{1}, {T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\\n{4}, {T}, 유혹의 동굴을 희생한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 이 능력을 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c64a6327-f445-488e-948d-801d1bcd8216\', \'multiverseId\': 465710}, \'multiverseid\': 465710}, {\'name\': \'Caverna da Tentação\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{4}, {T}, sacrifique Caverna da Tentação: Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo. Ative esta habilidade somente nos momentos em que poderia conjurar um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'102e875d-b409-4172-bb56-76a74f86f198\', \'multiverseId\': 465964}, \'multiverseid\': 465964}, {\'name\': \'Пещера Искушений\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{4}, {T}, пожертвуйте Пещеру Искушений: положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо. Активируйте эту способность только при возможности разыгрывать волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5d79b3d-cca9-41af-8677-65578ff794f2\', \'multiverseId\': 466218}, \'multiverseid\': 466218}, {\'name\': \'诱魅洞窟\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{4}，{T}，牺牲诱魅洞窟：在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。只可以于你能施放法术的时机下起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741d9d94-fc9c-4bce-b2a6-0e0fd9b1cca0\', \'multiverseId\': 466472}, \'multiverseid\': 466472}, {\'name\': \'誘魅洞窟\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\\n{4}，{T}，犧牲誘魅洞窟：在目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。只可以於你能施放巫術的時機下起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6bb3323-ea3f-47eb-bae8-90e0c46c379e\', \'multiverseId\': 466726}, \'multiverseid\': 466726}]', "[{'name': 'Hüter des Morgen', 'text': 'Refugium (Diese Kreatur kommt getappt ins Spiel. Wenn dies geschieht, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege den Rest unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nWenn der Hüter des Morgen das Spiel verlässt, bringe die ins Exil geschickte Karte auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464279&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a72554e-0052-4865-a15c-f0fb0bee5228', 'multiverseId': 464279}, 'multiverseid': 464279}, {'name': 'Vigilante del mañana', 'text': 'Esconder. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla girada. Cuando lo haga, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\nCuando el Vigilante del mañana deje el campo de batalla, pon la carta exiliada en la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hechicero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464533&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07d719fd-35bd-4a0c-9989-f37bc589764f', 'multiverseId': 464533}, 'multiverseid': 464533}, {'name': 'Gardien de demain', 'text': 'Cachette (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée. Quand elle le fait, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\nQuand le Gardien de demain quitte le champ de bataille, mettez la carte exilée dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464787&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44a59e7d-6ffa-450f-8777-30a3c62f5cd4', 'multiverseId': 464787}, 'multiverseid': 464787}, {'name': 'Scrutatore del Domani', 'text': 'Nascondiglio (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata. Quando lo fa, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\nQuando lo Scrutatore del Domani lascia il campo di battaglia, aggiungi la carta esiliata alla mano del suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Creatura — Mago Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465041&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b551f626-6013-48ad-8059-8617a158709f', 'multiverseId': 465041}, 'multiverseid': 465041}, {'name': '明日の見張り', 'text': '秘匿（このクリーチャーはタップ状態で戦場に出る。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを４枚見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。）\\n明日の見張りが戦場を離れたとき、その追放されたカードをオーナーの手札に加える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465295&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cebe3ec-9104-46b7-9e2c-440d77a05c14', 'multiverseId': 465295}, 'multiverseid': 465295}, {'name': '내일의 감시자', 'text': '은닉 (이 생물은 탭된 상태로 전장에 들어온다. 이 생물이 그렇게 할 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 네 장을 보고, 그중 한 장을 뒷면 상태로 추방한 후, 나머지를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 넣는다.)\\n내일의 감시자가 전장을 떠날 때, 추방한 카드를 소유자의 손에 넣는다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 마법사', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465549&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd70a2fb-485b-46ec-8f61-9d2ce04dd5eb', 'multiverseId': 465549}, 'multiverseid': 465549}, {'name': 'Vigia do Amanhã', 'text': 'Refúgio (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha virada. Quando entrar, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo, e depois coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório.)\\nQuando Vigia do Amanhã deixar o campo de batalha, coloque o card exilado na mão de seu dono.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Mago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465803&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd410f6f5-f0ef-453e-bc29-cdb66600cc42', 'multiverseId': 465803}, 'multiverseid': 465803}, {'name': 'Стражник Грядущего', 'text': 'Укрытие (Это существо выходит на поле битвы повернутым. Когда оно это делает, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки).\\nКогда Стражник Грядущего покидает поле битвы, положите изгнанную карту в руку ее владельца.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Чародей', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466057&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac548cd4-0f37-474b-8a21-35c8cf712789', 'multiverseId': 466057}, 'multiverseid': 466057}, {'name': '明日护卫', 'text': '掩蔽（此生物须横置进战场。当它进战场时，检视你牌库顶的四张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌置于你牌库底。）\\n当明日护卫离开战场时，将所放逐的牌置于其拥有者手上。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466311&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1b2cf6a-1e5b-4a2e-8176-1a6edd7e58b0', 'multiverseId': 466311}, 'multiverseid': 466311}, {'name': '明日護衛', 'text': '掩蔽（此生物須橫置進戰場。當它進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌，將其中一張牌面朝下地放逐，然後將其餘的牌置於你牌庫底。）\\n當明日護衛離開戰場時，將所放逐的牌置於其擁有者手上。', 'type': '生物 ～人類／魔法師', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466565&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51e305a0-5025-4339-9dea-e2bc08af4fb7', 'multiverseId': 466565}, 'multiverseid': 466565}]", '[{\'name\': \'Im Jenseits abrechnen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du nicht kontrollierst, ins Exil.\\n• Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil und bringe sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zwei verschwanden, einer kehrte zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464230&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b72d56-cc93-4e65-9c46-ac8a56a02c76\', \'multiverseId\': 464230}, \'multiverseid\': 464230}, {\'name\': \'Solucionar más allá de la realidad\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos:\\n• Exilia la criatura objetivo que no controlas.\\n• Exilia la criatura objetivo que controlas, luego regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Se llevaron a dos, juzgaron a dos, pero solo una regresó.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e12b41b6-b19f-48ac-b3c3-57da62e2e85b\', \'multiverseId\': 464484}, \'multiverseid\': 464484}, {\'name\': \'Résolution hors réalité\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Exilez une créature ciblée que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\n• Exilez une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Deux furent choisis, deux furent jugés, un seul revint.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464738&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82494a33-54dd-4fb5-801c-f42eda184ef8\', \'multiverseId\': 464738}, \'multiverseid\': 464738}, {\'name\': \'Resa dei Conti Surreale\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Esilia una creatura bersaglio che non controlli.\\n• Esilia una creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Due furono presi, due furono giudicati, uno fece ritorno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9da8423c-5c87-40b1-af39-6d0f86704b60\', \'multiverseId\': 464992}, \'multiverseid\': 464992}, {\'name\': \'超現実的決着\', \'text\': \'以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしていないクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。\\n• あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。その後それをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'二人が消え、二人が裁かれ、一人が戻った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a6aaad2-de49-4837-b526-ae9001dabbc3\', \'multiverseId\': 465246}, \'multiverseid\': 465246}, {\'name\': \'현실을 넘어선 결정\', \'text\': \'하나 혹은 둘 다를 선택한다 —\\n• 당신이 조종하지 않는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다.\\n• 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한 후, 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'두 명이 사라져, 두 명이 심판을 받았고, 한 명이 돌아왔다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dbe86bd-bdf3-4893-8bb5-758cb1d5c702\', \'multiverseId\': 465500}, \'multiverseid\': 465500}, {\'name\': \'Resolver Além da Realidade\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou ambos —\\n• Exile a criatura alvo que você não controla.\\n• Exile a criatura alvo que você controla e depois devolva-a para o campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Dois foram presos, dois julgados, um retornou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8e683c-9186-4d79-9ce3-9f3a33a77def\', \'multiverseId\': 465754}, \'multiverseid\': 465754}, {\'name\': \'Внереальное Решение\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно или оба —\\n• Изгоните целевое существо не под вашим контролем.\\n• Изгоните целевое существо под вашим контролем, затем верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Двоих забрали, двоих осудили, один вернулся.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f58d760d-99f8-42f7-8848-cb685af4de9c\', \'multiverseId\': 466008}, \'multiverseid\': 466008}, {\'name\': \'超凡安生\', \'text\': \'选择一项或都选～\\n•放逐目标不由你操控的生物。\\n•放逐目标由你操控的生物，然后将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'羁押两人，审判两人，返回一人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f3bd38e-cb34-441c-b8be-8f6fad683b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 466262}, \'multiverseid\': 466262}, {\'name\': \'超凡安生\', \'text\': \'選擇一項或都選～\\n•放逐目標不由你操控的生物。\\n•放逐目標由你操控的生物，然後將它在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'羈押兩人，審判兩人，返回一人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'526b64cc-7f22-4fd3-a618-0990958e6742\', \'multiverseId\': 466516}, \'multiverseid\': 466516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Irreguläre Kohorte\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nWenn die Irreguläre Kohorte ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 2/2 farblosen Gestaltwandler-Kreaturenspielstein mit Wandelwicht.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Wo unbeständige Form auf langwährende Loyalität trifft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464218&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e657b9-bbe7-45d9-b510-2e757527268c\', \'multiverseId\': 464218}, \'multiverseid\': 464218}, {\'name\': \'Cohorte irregular\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nCuando la Cohorte irregular entre al campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Metamorfo incolora 2/2 con la habilidad de cambiaformas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Una forma inestable, pero una lealtad firme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fb96c15-860c-4af7-ba5c-a31a3d07998a\', \'multiverseId\': 464472}, \'multiverseid\': 464472}, {\'name\': \'Cohorte irrégulière\', \'text\': \'Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nQuand la Cohorte irrégulière arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 incolore Changeforme avec le changelin.\', \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': \'Quand une forme changeante se trouve face à une loyauté indéfectible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464726&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31607668-b8e7-4086-ac51-d616ba5bf65c\', \'multiverseId\': 464726}, \'multiverseid\': 464726}, {\'name\': \'Coorte Irregolare\', \'text\': \'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nQuando la Coorte Irregolare entra nel campo di battaglia, crea una pedina creatura Polimorfo 2/2 incolore con cangiante.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': "L\'unione tra forma mutevole e lealtà durevole.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e72d6df4-d402-46e8-b62f-96a1e833481b\', \'multiverseId\': 464980}, \'multiverseid\': 464980}, {\'name\': \'変容の軍勢\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードは常にすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n変容の軍勢が戦場に出たとき、多相を持つ無色の２/２の多相の戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'移ろう姿と変わらぬ忠誠が共存する場所。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b744bbe-d2b2-418e-b20c-ab84fa198cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 465234}, \'multiverseid\': 465234}, {\'name\': \'비정상적인 집단\', \'text\': \'체인질링 (이 카드는 모든 생물 유형이다.)\\n비정상적인 집단이 전장에 들어올 때, 체인질링을 가진 2/2 무색 변신괴물 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 변신괴물\', \'flavor\': \'변덕스러운 형체가 영구적인 충성심과 만났다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36610e0d-302e-4028-8a05-035b5a62adea\', \'multiverseId\': 465488}, \'multiverseid\': 465488}, {\'name\': \'Coorte Irregular\', \'text\': \'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nQuando Coorte Irregular entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma ficha de criatura incolor 2/2 do tipo Metamorfo com morfoloide.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'O encontro entre a forma efêmera e a lealdade perene.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bbf542-74fa-4aad-88a8-6ee55872f482\', \'multiverseId\': 465742}, \'multiverseid\': 465742}, {\'name\': \'Непостоянная Когорта\', \'text\': \'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nКогда Непостоянная Когорта выходит на поле битвы, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 бесцветный Имитатор с Перевертышем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': \'Когда непостоянство облика встречается с незыблемой верностью.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da023ca5-015c-40a3-90d0-8171eecd796c\', \'multiverseId\': 465996}, \'multiverseid\': 465996}, {\'name\': \'异形助拳人\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n当异形助拳人进战场时，派出一个2/2无色，具化形异能的变形兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'形态多变，忠心唯一。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3be364-9ce7-4138-9bcb-5ad9854b0ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 466250}, \'multiverseid\': 466250}, {\'name\': \'異形助拳人\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物類別。）\\n當異形助拳人進戰場時，派出一個2/2無色，具化形異能的變形獸衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～變形獸\', \'flavor\': \'形態多變，忠心唯一。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a52a8574-acc9-4ec4-ac8c-8478ad213fde\', \'multiverseId\': 466504}, \'multiverseid\': 466504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kabbalistischer Therapeut\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nZu Beginn deiner Hauptphase vor dem Kampf kannst du eine Kreatur opfern. Wenn du dies tust, bestimme einen Nichtland-Kartennamen, dann zeigt ein Spieler deiner Wahl die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor und wirft alle Karten mit dem bestimmten Namen ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464283&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07264b0c-017f-4efc-88b5-73199166df79\', \'multiverseId\': 464283}, \'multiverseid\': 464283}, {\'name\': \'Terapeuta de la Cábala\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nAl comienzo de tu fase principal precombate, puedes sacrificar una criatura. Cuando lo hagas, elige un nombre de carta que no sea tierra. Luego, el jugador objetivo muestra su mano y descarta todas las cartas con ese nombre.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146037c2-4db8-4761-9fe6-1c45e9dde38a\', \'multiverseId\': 464537}, \'multiverseid\': 464537}, {\'name\': \'Thérapeute de la Coterie\', \'text\': \'Menace\\nAu début de votre première phase principale, vous pouvez sacrifier une créature. Quand vous faites ainsi, choisissez un nom de carte non-terrain, puis le joueur ciblé révèle sa main et se défausse de toutes les cartes avec ce nom.\', \'type\': \'Créature : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464791&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb5f4596-fa1f-4e77-a3ff-59f247a22ced\', \'multiverseId\': 464791}, \'multiverseid\': 464791}, {\'name\': \'Terapeuta della Cabala\', \'text\': "Minacciare\\nAll\'inizio della tua fase principale pre-combattimento, puoi sacrificare una creatura. Quando lo fai, scegli il nome di una carta non terra, poi un giocatore bersaglio rivela la sua mano e scarta tutte le carte con quel nome.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30ae3a52-77ef-4a84-86dd-f464be3d87de\', \'multiverseId\': 465045}, \'multiverseid\': 465045}, {\'name\': \'陰謀団の療法士\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nあなたの戦闘前メイン・フェイズの開始時に、あなたはクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは土地でないカード名１つを選ぶ。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開してその名前を持つカードをすべて捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d2b668-8c7d-4bec-b26f-8fc9009a6771\', \'multiverseId\': 465299}, \'multiverseid\': 465299}, {\'name\': \'도당의 치료사\', \'text\': \'호전적\\n당신의 전투전 본단계 시작에, 당신은 생물 한 개를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 할 때, 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 대지가 아닌 카드 이름 하나를 선택한 후, 그 플레이어는 손을 공개해 그 이름을 가진 카드를 모두 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 괴수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a01b35b-d44b-4235-b0e2-2df6fa905d7e\', \'multiverseId\': 465553}, \'multiverseid\': 465553}, {\'name\': \'Terapeuta da Cabala\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nNo início de sua fase principal pré-combate, você pode sacrificar uma criatura. Quando fizer isso, escolha o nome de um card que não seja um terreno. Em seguida, o jogador alvo revela a própria mão e descarta todos os cards com aquele nome.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a26bd677-a0e7-4e39-99c4-0c6ab6c488e6\', \'multiverseId\': 465807}, \'multiverseid\': 465807}, {\'name\': \'Терапевт Кабала\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\nВ начале вашей предбоевой главной фазы вы можете пожертвовать существо. Когда вы это делаете, выберите имя не являющейся землей карты, затем целевой игрок показывает свою руку и сбрасывает все карты с тем именем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ef56f0-8290-4c76-bb50-0ab66a65d3f1\', \'multiverseId\': 466061}, \'multiverseid\': 466061}, {\'name\': \'柯帮疗师\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n在你战斗前的行动阶段开始时，你可以牺牲一个生物。当你如此作时，选择一个非地牌的名称，然后目标牌手展示其手牌，并弃掉所有具该名称的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9e33c3-6d74-40bf-8456-81be93e2625e\', \'multiverseId\': 466315}, \'multiverseid\': 466315}, {\'name\': \'柯幫療師\', \'text\': \'威懾\\n在你戰鬥前的行動階段開始時，你可以犧牲一個生物。當你如此作時，選擇一個非地牌的名稱，然後目標玩家展示其手牌，並棄掉所有具該名稱的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cfa7b26-17bf-48e7-9de2-12bc2b3682e1\', \'multiverseId\': 466569}, \'multiverseid\': 466569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kampfkreischen\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge zwei 1/1 weiße Vogel-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nRückblende — Tappe drei ungetappte weiße Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Geräusche sind mit der Weltenseele im Einklang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464207&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cccc9a98-6576-46b2-a2c2-c1422b02d39d\', \'multiverseId\': 464207}, \'multiverseid\': 464207}, {\'name\': \'Alarido de guerra\', \'text\': \'Crea dos fichas de criatura Ave blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\nRetrospectiva — Girar tres criaturas blancas enderezadas que controlas. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todos los sonidos están en armonía con el alma del mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f845a9d-2dac-407d-9f64-c1c0c69f1e4c\', \'multiverseId\': 464461}, \'multiverseid\': 464461}, {\'name\': \'Piaillement de bataille\', \'text\': \'Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Oiseau avec le vol.\\nFlashback — Engagez trois créatures blanches dégagées que vous contrôlez. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tous les bruits sont en harmonie avec l\'Âme du monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464715&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'854e3cd0-4b0f-4693-9e15-a4d624e42a5d\', \'multiverseId\': 464715}, \'multiverseid\': 464715}, {\'name\': \'Strillo di Battaglia\', \'text\': \'Crea due pedine creatura Uccello 1/1 bianche con volare.\\nFlashback—TAPpa tre creature bianche STAPpate che controlli. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tutti i suoni sono in armonia con l\'Anima del Mondo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82605892-7110-49d5-a34f-e4ac68d0928c\', \'multiverseId\': 464969}, \'multiverseid\': 464969}, {\'name\': \'金切るときの声\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つ白の１/１の鳥・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\nフラッシュバック―あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態の白のクリーチャー３体をタップする。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'一切の音が世界魂と響き合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebcc186c-584d-44f6-ab08-7df29412c190\', \'multiverseId\': 465223}, \'multiverseid\': 465223}, {\'name\': \'전투 비명소리\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 1/1 백색 조류 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\\n회상—당신이 조종하는 언탭된 백색 생물 세 개를 탭한다. (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'모든 소리는 세계의 영혼과 조화를 이룬다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc2ba198-8d69-40dc-baab-18b455d0fe5b\', \'multiverseId\': 465477}, \'multiverseid\': 465477}, {\'name\': \'Guinchado de Guerra\', \'text\': \'Crie duas fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Ave com voar.\\nRecapitular — Vire três criaturas brancas desviradas que você controla. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Todos os sons harmonizam com a Anima Mundi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'545cc7a2-98e0-4c63-a1f1-aebd329f0618\', \'multiverseId\': 465731}, \'multiverseid\': 465731}, {\'name\': \'Боевой Клекот\', \'text\': \'Создайте две фишки существа 1/1 белая Птица с Полетом.\\nВоспоминание — Поверните три неповернутых белых существа под вашим контролем. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Все звуки звучат в унисон во Всесознании.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2271f7a9-48c1-4221-bbef-724518e475d4\', \'multiverseId\': 465985}, \'multiverseid\': 465985}, {\'name\': \'战呼\', \'text\': \'派出两个1/1白色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生生物。\\n返照～横置三个由你操控且未横置的白色生物。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'无声不与世界之魂相谐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c48519-f1b9-4692-91ec-3c632e90f34f\', \'multiverseId\': 466239}, \'multiverseid\': 466239}, {\'name\': \'戰呼\', \'text\': \'派出兩個1/1白色，具飛行異能的鳥衍生生物。\\n返照～橫置三個由你操控且未橫置的白色生物。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'無聲不與世界之魂相諧。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90c59bed-487e-4f7e-9826-873b45d555d3\', \'multiverseId\': 466493}, \'multiverseid\': 466493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kayas Arglist\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei —\\n• Jeder Gegner opfert eine Kreatur.\\n• Schicke alle Karten aus allen Friedhöfen deiner Gegner ins Exil.\\n• Erzeuge einen 1/1 weißen und schwarzen Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n• Du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nVerflechtung {3} (Bestimme alles, falls du die Verflechtungskosten bezahlst.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464408&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ef9dd1-18b3-4f13-9c33-5aec1e363769\', \'multiverseId\': 464408}, \'multiverseid\': 464408}, {\'name\': \'Astucia de Kaya\', \'text\': \'Elige dos:\\n• Cada oponente sacrifica una criatura.\\n• Exilia todas las cartas del cementerio de cada oponente.\\n• Crea una ficha de criatura Espíritu blanca y negra 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n• Ganas 4 vidas.\\nEntrelazar {3}. (Si pagas el coste de entrelazar, elige todas las opciones.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4cc4630-38af-4fe8-ad0d-d0a46b60aea0\', \'multiverseId\': 464662}, \'multiverseid\': 464662}, {\'name\': \'Sagacité de Kaya\', \'text\': "Choisissez deux —\\n• Chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature.\\n• Exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière de chaque adversaire.\\n• Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche et noire Esprit avec le vol.\\n• Vous gagnez 4 points de vie.\\nUnion {3} (Choisissez tout si vous payez le coût d\'union.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464916&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'018d01b4-9e79-4d46-a284-3276353a23d7\', \'multiverseId\': 464916}, \'multiverseid\': 464916}, {\'name\': \'Astuzia di Kaya\', \'text\': \'Scegli due —\\n• Ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura.\\n• Esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di ogni avversario.\\n• Crea una pedina creatura Spirito 1/1 bianca e nera con volare.\\n• Guadagni 4 punti vita.\\nIntrecciare {3} (Scegli tutti se paghi il costo di intrecciare.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a75e689-3bff-4ff7-a608-81fdc0c4b76b\', \'multiverseId\': 465170}, \'multiverseid\': 465170}, {\'name\': \'ケイヤの手管\', \'text\': \'以下から２つを選ぶ。\\n• 各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\n• 各対戦相手の墓地からそれぞれカードをすべて追放する。\\n• 飛行を持つ白であり黒である１/１のスピリット・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n• あなたは４点のライフを得る。\\n双呪{3}（双呪コストを支払ったなら、すべてを選ぶ。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e91d9901-2cbe-43d0-935d-fca732d19f12\', \'multiverseId\': 465424}, \'multiverseid\': 465424}, {\'name\': \'카야의 간계\', \'text\': \'둘을 선택한다 —\\n• 각 상대는 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n• 각 상대의 무덤에 있는 모든 카드를 추방한다.\\n• 비행을 가진 1/1 백색 및 흑색 신령 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n• 당신은 생명 4점을 얻는다.\\n엮어내기 {3} (당신이 엮어내기 비용을 지불한다면 모두 선택한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aed27ee2-b485-449f-8b33-6c9cdb9d34ed\', \'multiverseId\': 465678}, \'multiverseid\': 465678}, {\'name\': \'Ardil de Kaya\', \'text\': \'Escolha dois —\\n• Cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura.\\n• Exile todos os cards do cemitério de cada oponente.\\n• Crie uma ficha de criatura branca e preta 1/1 do tipo Espírito com voar.\\n• Você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\\nEntrelaçar {3} (Escolha todos se pagar o custo de entrelaçar.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c331990-c7a8-4f3d-8b4c-862bbee8f55b\', \'multiverseId\': 465932}, \'multiverseid\': 465932}, {\'name\': \'Коварство Кайи\', \'text\': \'Выберите два —\\n• Каждый оппонент жертвует существо.\\n• Изгоните все карты из кладбища каждого оппонента.\\n• Создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 белый и черный Дух с Полетом.\\n• Вы получаете 4 жизни.\\nСплетение {3} (Выберите все режимы, если вы оплачиваете стоимость Сплетения.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ae57cb-3a87-4fcb-b2b0-4d89880932a6\', \'multiverseId\': 466186}, \'multiverseid\': 466186}, {\'name\': \'卡娅的智谋\', \'text\': \'选择两项～\\n•每位对手各牺牲一个生物。\\n•放逐所有对手坟墓场中的所有牌。\\n•派出一个1/1，白黑双色，具飞行异能的精怪衍生生物。\\n•你获得4点生命。\\n打包{3}（如果你支付打包费用，则四项都选。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546a917f-5d1c-49d7-82c7-28d7c8461960\', \'multiverseId\': 466440}, \'multiverseid\': 466440}, {\'name\': \'卡婭的智謀\', \'text\': \'選擇兩項～\\n•每位對手各犧牲一個生物。\\n•放逐所有對手墳墓場中的所有牌。\\n•派出一個1/1，白黑雙色，具飛行異能的精靈衍生生物。\\n•你獲得4點生命。\\n打包{3}（如果你支付打包費用，則四項都選。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd9cd634-3258-4994-8c2a-9538b20ee61a\', \'multiverseId\': 466694}, \'multiverseid\': 466694}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kehlensucher\', \'text\': \'Ungeblockte angreifende Ninjas, die du kontrollierst, haben Lebensverknüpfung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Ninja\', \'flavor\': \'„War das ein Tropfen? Es wird wohl gleich regnen."\\n—Händler vom Steinstraßenmarkt, letzte Worte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464313&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da44db96-1983-4384-bd30-ade44bad69ab\', \'multiverseId\': 464313}, \'multiverseid\': 464313}, {\'name\': \'Buscagaznates\', \'text\': \'Los Ninjas atacantes no bloqueados que controlas tienen la habilidad de vínculo vital.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Me ha caído una gota. Estará a punto de llover".\\n—Mercader de la lonja Callestrecha, últimas palabras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80112e82-791e-4425-ac5c-b2636fe68b00\', \'multiverseId\': 464567}, \'multiverseid\': 464567}, {\'name\': \'Traqueur de gorge\', \'text\': \'Les ninjas attaquants non-bloqués que vous contrôlez ont le lien de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et ninja\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai reçu une goutte. Il va sûrement pleuvoir. »\\n—Vendeur des halles de la rue Pavée, derniers mots", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464821&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed02cee3-d8da-467c-a976-e12c07f05858\', \'multiverseId\': 464821}, \'multiverseid\': 464821}, {\'name\': \'Cacciagole\', \'text\': \'I Ninja attaccanti non bloccati che controlli hanno legame vitale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho appena sentito una goccia. Credo stia per piovere."\\n—Venditore del Mercato di Vicolo della Pietra, ultime parole\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff3c4fc2-d693-41c0-98f7-8c5f271fae82\', \'multiverseId\': 465075}, \'multiverseid\': 465075}, {\'name\': \'喉追い\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている、攻撃していてブロックされていない忍者は絆魂を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・忍者\', \'flavor\': \'「ポタっと来たな。雨が降りそうだ。」\\n――小石通りの露天商、最後の言葉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a10d648c-6fac-41cc-a5dd-dccdd202b9f0\', \'multiverseId\': 465329}, \'multiverseid\': 465329}, {\'name\': \'목줄기 추적자\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 방어되지 않은 공격 중인 닌자들은 생명연결을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 닌자\', \'flavor\': \'"물방울이 떨어진 걸 느꼈어. 비가 오겠는걸."\\n—돌 통로 시장의 상인이 남긴 마지막 유언\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e40fa73-cd37-4eb6-8736-77f0d7524529\', \'multiverseId\': 465583}, \'multiverseid\': 465583}, {\'name\': \'Caça-garganta\', \'text\': \'Os Ninjas atacantes não bloqueados que você controla têm vínculo com a vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Ninja\', \'flavor\': \'"Senti um pingo. Deve estar para chover."\\n— Comerciante do Mercado da Via Pétrea, últimas palavras\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77cc3dd1-18f5-48eb-9021-f0a5d9565a5a\', \'multiverseId\': 465837}, \'multiverseid\': 465837}, {\'name\': \'Кровопийца\', \'text\': \'Незаблокированные атакующие Ниндзя под вашим контролем имеют Цепь жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Ниндзя\', \'flavor\': \'«Что-то капнуло. Наверное, дождь начинается».\\n— последние слова торговца с рынка на Каменной Аллее\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c146e344-38d6-4bbc-8f7d-c3af933cba30\', \'multiverseId\': 466091}, \'multiverseid\': 466091}, {\'name\': \'觅喉客\', \'text\': \'由你操控、进行攻击且未受阻挡的忍者具有系命异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／忍者\', \'flavor\': \'「好像有水滴落下。一定是要下雨了。」\\n～石道集市商贩的遗言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83852294-4666-43ab-b34b-a9efd6ccf30e\', \'multiverseId\': 466345}, \'multiverseid\': 466345}, {\'name\': \'覓喉客\', \'text\': \'由你操控、進行攻擊且未受阻擋的忍者具有繫命異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／忍者\', \'flavor\': \'「好像有水滴落下。一定是要下雨了。」\\n～石道集市商販的遺言\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c13efc3-81fd-4135-bcc5-bb87ed445898\', \'multiverseId\': 466599}, \'multiverseid\': 466599}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kess, abtrünnige Magierin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWährend jedes deiner Züge kannst du eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof wirken. Falls eine Karte, die auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde, auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Was nimmt man denen, die bereits alles verloren haben?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464409&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eef9d9bb-9f94-49aa-ba35-ca3bcb749465\', \'multiverseId\': 464409}, \'multiverseid\': 464409}, {\'name\': \'Kess, maga disidente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nDurante cada uno de tus turnos, puedes lanzar una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro de tu cementerio. Si una carta lanzada de esta manera fuera a ir a tu cementerio, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquí el verbo perder no tiene sentido. No puedes robar a quienes no tienen nada".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6331d550-a278-48c2-b37e-7f857849dc7a\', \'multiverseId\': 464663}, \'multiverseid\': 464663}, {\'name\': \'Kess, mage insoumise\', \'text\': "Vol\\nPendant chacun de vos tours, vous pouvez lancer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel depuis votre cimetière. Si une carte lancée de cette manière devait être mise dans votre cimetière, exilez-la à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Le mot "perte" ne signifie rien ici. Vous ne pouvez pas enlever quoi que ce soit à ceux qui n\\\'ont rien. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464917&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be6ce546-5190-40fb-8ebe-c9ed39e5a89b\', \'multiverseId\': 464917}, \'multiverseid\': 464917}, {\'name\': \'Kess, Maga Dissidente\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nDurante ogni tuo turno, puoi lanciare una carta istantaneo o stregoneria dal tuo cimitero. Se una carta lanciata in questo modo sta per essere messa nel tuo cimitero, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Qui la parola \\\'perdere\\\' è priva di significato. Non si può derubare chi non possiede nulla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'034b0782-3303-47ba-9c53-478681d8684e\', \'multiverseId\': 465171}, \'multiverseid\': 465171}, {\'name\': \'反体制魔道士、ケス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの各ターンの間、あなたはあなたの墓地からインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を唱えてもよい。これにより唱えたカードがあなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「敗北なんて何の意味もないわ。失うものは何もないのだから。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325787ce-87cb-4baf-9f00-da06286cbd77\', \'multiverseId\': 465425}, \'multiverseid\': 465425}, {\'name\': \'반체제 마도사, 케스\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 각 턴 동안, 당신은 당신의 무덤에서 순간마법 또는 집중마법 카드 한 장을 발동할 수 있다. 이런 식으로 발동한 카드가 무덤에 들어가려고 하면, 대신 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"상실은 이곳에서 아무런 의미도 없어. 이미 아무 것도 가지지 않은 자에게서 뺏을 수는 없으니까."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'855c2449-a91b-43e7-b8ae-e73a5f2ac17c\', \'multiverseId\': 465679}, \'multiverseid\': 465679}, {\'name\': \'Kess, Maga Dissidente\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDurante cada um de seus turnos, você pode conjurar um card de mágica instantânea ou feitiço do seu cemitério. Se um card conjurado desta forma seria colocado em seu cemitério, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Perder não significa nada aqui. Não se pode tirar dos que nada têm."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c90f5bec-8885-425d-8da8-c96a0be84f30\', \'multiverseId\': 465933}, \'multiverseid\': 465933}, {\'name\': \'Кесс, Колдунья-Отступница\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВо время каждого из ваших ходов вы можете разыграть одну карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища. Если разыгранная таким образом карта должна быть положена на ваше кладбище, изгоните ее вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Потери здесь ничего не значат. У тех, у кого ничего нет, и забрать ничего нельзя».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'425b1ab6-684b-4558-92c0-9e0e9ed782dc\', \'multiverseId\': 466187}, \'multiverseid\': 466187}, {\'name\': \'异见法师凯丝\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n你于你的每个回合中可以从你的坟墓场施放一张瞬间或法术牌。如果以此法施放的牌将置入你的坟墓场，则改为将其放逐。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我们不在乎损失。既然已一无所有，也就无所谓失去。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8b48856-0e57-4f9d-bf3f-5531d1f9630b\', \'multiverseId\': 466441}, \'multiverseid\': 466441}, {\'name\': \'異見法師凱絲\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n你於你的每個回合中可以從你的墳墓場施放一張瞬間或巫術牌。如果以此法施放的牌將置入你的墳墓場，則改為將其放逐。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我們不在乎損失。既然已一無所有，也就無所謂失去。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f37edb0d-ca64-43e3-85c4-fa9a3dab5b1d\', \'multiverseId\': 466695}, \'multiverseid\': 466695}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kleiner Mastikor\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\n{4}: Der Kleine Mastikor fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nBeharrlichkeit (Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt und falls keine -1/-1-Marke auf ihr lag, bringe sie mit einer -1/-1-Marke unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Mastikor\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464428&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'075603f1-36fa-4825-af3e-d3763f4ae947\', \'multiverseId\': 464428}, \'multiverseid\': 464428}, {\'name\': \'Masticore menor\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta.\\n{4}: La Masticore menor hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nPersistir. (Cuando esta criatura muera, si no tenía contadores -1/-1 sobre ella, regrésala al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario con un contador -1/-1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Masticore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e2c756c-afcb-4572-9c0e-444869c56c43\', \'multiverseId\': 464682}, \'multiverseid\': 464682}, {\'name\': \'Petite masticore\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\n{4} : La Petite masticore inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée.\\nPersistance (Quand cette créature meurt, si elle n\'avait pas de marqueurs -1/-1 sur elle, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire avec un marqueur -1/-1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : masticore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464936&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85e6ef46-ccda-464d-97d4-46bda4e60c41\', \'multiverseId\': 464936}, \'multiverseid\': 464936}, {\'name\': \'Masticora Minore\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, scarta una carta.\\n{4}: La Masticora Minore infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio.\\nPersistere (Quando questa creatura muore, se non aveva segnalini -1/-1, rimettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario con un segnalino -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Masticora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0746ca6-549f-43a9-91b1-08050a25b28d\', \'multiverseId\': 465190}, \'multiverseid\': 465190}, {\'name\': \'小型マスティコア\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\n{4}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。小型マスティコアはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n頑強（このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これの上に－１/－１カウンターが置かれていなかった場合、これを－１/－１カウンターが１個置かれた状態でオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — マスティコア\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c16206f9-9f8d-4769-b4c7-01553c68b8df\', \'multiverseId\': 465444}, \'multiverseid\': 465444}, {\'name\': \'소형 마스티코어\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n{4}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 소형 마스티코어는 그 생물에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n집요 (이 생물이 죽을 때, 이 생물이 -1/-1 카운터를 가지고 있지 않았다면, 이 생물을 -1/-1 카운터 한 개를 가진 채로 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌린다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 마스티코어\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d78a58f8-b4d8-4e0f-8f18-c32073d87703\', \'multiverseId\': 465698}, \'multiverseid\': 465698}, {\'name\': \'Mastícora Menor\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, descarte um card.\\n{4}: Mastícora Menor causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo.\\nPersistir (Quando esta criatura morrer, se ela não tiver nenhum marcador -1/-1, devolva-a ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono com um marcador -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Mastícora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63a481f1-59d8-43b5-9b85-e617e19d1641\', \'multiverseId\': 465952}, \'multiverseid\': 465952}, {\'name\': \'Малая Мастикора\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания сбросьте карту.\\n{4}: Малая Мастикора наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу.\\nУпорство (Когда это существо умирает, если на нем не было ни одного жетона -1/-1, верните его на поле битвы под контролем его владельца с одним жетоном -1/-1 на нем.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Мастикора\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d95fd47-f8fd-4b86-bc6b-b696a0dfa3ae\', \'multiverseId\': 466206}, \'multiverseid\': 466206}, {\'name\': \'小型异狮\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n{4}：小型异狮对目标生物造成1点伤害。\\n留存（当此生物死去时，若其上没有-1/-1指示物，则将它在其拥有者的操控下移回战场，且上面有一个-1/-1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～异狮\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9407597-e724-4eb8-b2d7-7013af648957\', \'multiverseId\': 466460}, \'multiverseid\': 466460}, {\'name\': \'小型異獅\', \'text\': \'棄一張牌，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n{4}：小型異獅對目標生物造成1點傷害。\\n留存（當此生物死去時，若其上沒有-1/-1指示物，則將它在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場，且上面有一個-1/-1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～異獅\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a998515-e755-42bb-81ee-d1bc1555b2ae\', \'multiverseId\': 466714}, \'multiverseid\': 466714}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klingenrücken-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Versessenheit — Solange du keine Karten auf der Hand hast, haben Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, „{T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Remasuris können ein letztes Aufbäumen in einen beeindruckenden Sieg verwandeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464322&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f200f427-d111-44c1-a63b-af08f38bfe7d\', \'multiverseId\': 464322}, \'multiverseid\': 464322}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado lomo de filos\', \'text\': \'Temerario — Mientras no tengas cartas en la mano, las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen "{T}: Esta criatura hace 1 punto de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'Los Fragmentados pueden convertir una defensa desesperada en una victoria impresionante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca8d522e-91b1-459d-afde-6e56d61e6828\', \'multiverseId\': 464576}, \'multiverseid\': 464576}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde dorselame\', \'text\': "Acharnement — Tant que vous n\'avez pas de carte en main, les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « {T} : Cette créature inflige 1 blessure à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker. »", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Les slivoïdes peuvent transformer un baroud d\'honneur en victoire magistrale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464830&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f351e2a6-7b84-472a-b8aa-21540fcaa171\', \'multiverseId\': 464830}, \'multiverseid\': 464830}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Dorsospada\', \'text\': \'Determinazione — Fintanto che non hai carte in mano, le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno "{T}: Questa creatura infligge 1 danno a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'I tramutanti possono trasformare una resistenza disperata in una vittoria schiacciante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'864170f9-c876-493b-a4f3-16daae0e1848\', \'multiverseId\': 465084}, \'multiverseid\': 465084}, {\'name\': \'刃背スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'暴勇 ― あなたの手札にカードがないかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「{T}：プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'スリヴァーは最後の悪あがきを見事な勝利に変えてしまう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8320799a-497c-4bc7-b724-26da613f13a1\', \'multiverseId\': 465338}, \'multiverseid\': 465338}, {\'name\': \'칼날등짝 슬리버\', \'text\': \'광분 — 당신의 손에 카드가 없는 한, 당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 "{T}: 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'슬리버들은 최후의 저항을 눈부신 승리로 바꿀 수 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ce56ffc-5e7b-4d82-9976-78ffde0eaf44\', \'multiverseId\': 465592}, \'multiverseid\': 465592}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Laminodorso\', \'text\': \'Determinação — Enquanto você não tiver nenhum card na mão, as criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla terão "{T}: Esta criatura causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'Os fractius são capazes de transformar uma resistência desesperada em uma vitória espetacular.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5971191-0a31-4fcc-a03c-ee9ef9925331\', \'multiverseId\': 465846}, \'multiverseid\': 465846}, {\'name\': \'Мечеспинная Щепка\', \'text\': \'Безрассудство — Пока у вас нет карт в руке, существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют способность «{T}: это существо наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку или planeswalker-у».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'Щепки способны превратить последний бой в триумфальную победу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2746a4df-fc9c-4c7b-a95d-ea26552b8d1d\', \'multiverseId\': 466100}, \'multiverseid\': 466100}, {\'name\': \'刃背裂片妖\', \'text\': \'背水战～只要你没有手牌，由你操控的裂片妖生物便具有「{T}：此生物对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成造成1点伤害。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'裂片妖能将破釜沉舟局面化作精彩胜利。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a082255e-9a42-4d75-be4d-5a6be5fb8a5a\', \'multiverseId\': 466354}, \'multiverseid\': 466354}, {\'name\': \'刃背裂片妖\', \'text\': \'背水戰～只要你沒有手牌，由你操控的裂片妖生物便具有「{T}：此生物對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成造成1點傷害。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'裂片妖能將破釜沉舟局面化作精彩勝利。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b015755a-d919-4a7f-9caf-a5bc595d54c5\', \'multiverseId\': 466608}, \'multiverseid\': 466608}]', '[{\'name\': \'Koniferenwurm\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\n{3}{G}: Der Koniferenwurm erhält +X/+X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an verschneiten bleibenden Karten ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn es im Frühling taut, streifen diese Würmer ihre Haut an Bäumen ab, um das Wachstum anzuregen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464362&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c06c3c30-1fb2-43c2-96fb-61333c8baf41\', \'multiverseId\': 464362}, \'multiverseid\': 464362}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe conífera\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\n{3}{G}: La Sierpe conífera obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de permanentes nevados que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': \'Durante los deshielos de temporada, las sierpes mudan la piel frotándose contra los árboles para crecer más.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b6bca4-b040-4345-a080-3cbf4b56e637\', \'multiverseId\': 464616}, \'multiverseid\': 464616}, {\'name\': \'Guivre des conifères\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\n{3}{G} : La Guivre des conifères gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de permanents neigeux que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : guivre\', \'flavor\': \'Pendant la fonte des neiges, les guivres muent en frottant leur peau contre les arbres pour favoriser leur croissance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464870&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a937db4-4b23-4ebf-9315-950d5dba13c0\', \'multiverseId\': 464870}, \'multiverseid\': 464870}, {\'name\': \'Wurm delle Conifere\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\n{3}{G}: Il Wurm delle Conifere prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di permanenti neve che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Wurm\', \'flavor\': \'Durante i disgeli stagionali, i wurm mutano la pelle strusciandosi contro gli alberi per stimolare la propria crescita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1641875b-36e3-4221-b349-f21498a9de65\', \'multiverseId\': 465124}, \'multiverseid\': 465124}, {\'name\': \'針葉樹ワーム\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n{3}{G}：ターン終了時まで、針葉樹ワームは＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしている氷雪パーマネントの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': \'雪解けの季節に、ワームは木に体をこすりつけ脱皮し、成長に備える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'071f6e1f-7ca3-40dc-b4f0-c4036cd3b402\', \'multiverseId\': 465378}, \'multiverseid\': 465378}, {\'name\': \'침엽수 웜\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n{3}{G}: 침엽수 웜은 턴종료까지 +X/+X를 받는다. X는 당신이 조종하는 눈 지속물의 개수다.\', \'type\': \'눈 생물 — 웜\', \'flavor\': \'봄철이 되어 눈이 녹기 시작하면, 웜들은 나무에 껍질을 비벼 허물을 벗고 몸집을 키운다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3cfe38e-2180-47ec-baa2-4e9726afbcf6\', \'multiverseId\': 465632}, \'multiverseid\': 465632}, {\'name\': \'Vorme Conífero\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\n{3}{G}: Vorme Conífero recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X o número de permanentes da neve que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Vorme\', \'flavor\': \'Durante os degelos sazonais, os vormes raspam o couro nas árvores para estimular o próprio crescimento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91670b1c-a634-4595-b2db-610e0ba03cd1\', \'multiverseId\': 465886}, \'multiverseid\': 465886}, {\'name\': \'Хвойный Вурм\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\n{3}{G}: Хвойный Вурм получает +X/+X до конца хода, где Х — количество снежных перманентов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Снежное Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': \'Во времена редких оттепелей вурмы обдирают старую кожу об деревья, чтобы быстрее подрасти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ec4fa3e-106e-4e7b-a523-20319015d25e\', \'multiverseId\': 466140}, \'multiverseid\': 466140}, {\'name\': \'针叶林亚龙\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n{3}{G}：针叶林亚龙得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为由你操控的雪境永久物数量。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～亚龙\', \'flavor\': \'每当季节性冻融到来时，亚龙便会靠树干蹭去旧皮，好让自己迅速成长。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0415914c-9b7d-40c6-9617-db7729bba105\', \'multiverseId\': 466394}, \'multiverseid\': 466394}, {\'name\': \'針葉林亞龍\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n{3}{G}：針葉林亞龍得+X/+X直到回合結束，X為由你操控的雪境永久物數量。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～亞龍\', \'flavor\': \'每當季節性凍融到來時，亞龍便會靠樹幹磨去舊皮，好讓自己迅速成長。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862a61c6-3725-427e-a49c-fae8c0412e01\', \'multiverseId\': 466648}, \'multiverseid\': 466648}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kopfloses Gespenst\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nVersessenheit — Immer wenn das Kopflose Gespenst einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt und falls du keine Karten auf der Hand hast, wirft der Spieler eine zufällig bestimmte Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Specter\', \'flavor\': \'Er hat keine Zunge und dennoch ertönt die vergessene Hymne aus seinem Körper.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464298&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c1c714f-253b-4e74-8c11-04c2f8f06ffc\', \'multiverseId\': 464298}, \'multiverseid\': 464298}, {\'name\': \'Espectro sin cabeza\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTemerario — Siempre que el Espectro sin cabeza haga daño de combate a un jugador, si no tienes cartas en tu mano, ese jugador descarta una carta al azar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espectro\', \'flavor\': \'No tiene lengua para entonar, pero el himno olvidado sigue emanando de todo su cuerpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5df09ae-0347-46a5-9cc8-871248c587b2\', \'multiverseId\': 464552}, \'multiverseid\': 464552}, {\'name\': \'Spectre sans tête\', \'text\': "Vol\\nAcharnement — À chaque fois que le Spectre sans tête inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, si vous n\'avez pas de carte en main, ce joueur se défausse d\'une carte au hasard.", \'type\': \'Créature : spectre\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'a pas de langue pour chanter, mais il émane toujours de son corps un cantique maudit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464806&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba96adb-526b-4162-ad17-73870d49995d\', \'multiverseId\': 464806}, \'multiverseid\': 464806}, {\'name\': \'Spettro Senza Testa\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nDeterminazione — Ogniqualvolta lo Spettro Senza Testa infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, se non hai carte in mano, quel giocatore scarta una carta a caso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spettro\', \'flavor\': \'Non ha una bocca per cantare, eppure il suo corpo emana ancora un inno desolato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4227eb20-7985-48b5-838d-dc2cdd4b70f9\', \'multiverseId\': 465060}, \'multiverseid\': 465060}, {\'name\': \'首無し死霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n暴勇 ― 首無し死霊がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたの手札にカードが無い場合、そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を無作為に選んで捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スペクター\', \'flavor\': \'歌う口はないが、体から絶望の聖歌が響く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24b79b1-6e35-4710-a6ed-79d5fde19094\', \'multiverseId\': 465314}, \'multiverseid\': 465314}, {\'name\': \'머리 없는 스펙터\', \'text\': \'비행\\n광분 — 머리 없는 스펙터가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신의 손에 카드가 없다면, 그 플레이어는 무작위로 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 스펙터\', \'flavor\': \'기도문을 되뇌일 혓바닥은 없지만, 그 몸으로부터 사악한 찬송이 뿜어져 나온다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b038e2-8215-49bc-a6e4-696fd15081e7\', \'multiverseId\': 465568}, \'multiverseid\': 465568}, {\'name\': \'Espectro Sem Cabeça\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDeterminação — Toda vez que Espectro Sem Cabeça causa dano de combate a um jogador, se você não tiver nenhum card na mão, aquele jogador descarta um card aleatoriamente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espectro\', \'flavor\': \'Ele não tem língua para cantar, mas mesmo assim o hino renegado ainda emana de seu corpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325729ef-fc19-422d-88bc-f7756ee2bf3f\', \'multiverseId\': 465822}, \'multiverseid\': 465822}, {\'name\': \'Безголовый Призрак\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nБезрассудство — Каждый раз, когда Безголовый Призрак наносит боевые повреждения игроку, если у вас в руке нет карт, тот игрок сбрасывает одну случайно выбранную карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Призрак\', \'flavor\': \'У него нет языка, чтобы петь, но забытый гимн исходит от самого его тела.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf8d595-b5f3-4182-8d90-7bd85c8ac9c5\', \'multiverseId\': 466076}, \'multiverseid\': 466076}, {\'name\': \'无头幽灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n背水战～每当无头幽灵对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，若你没有手牌，则该牌手随机弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～幽灵\', \'flavor\': \'它虽无嘴可吟唱，但其躯体仍能传出久遭遗弃的赞歌旋律。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'148902df-7d12-4d64-a991-780a2c412347\', \'multiverseId\': 466330}, \'multiverseid\': 466330}, {\'name\': \'無頭幽靈\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n背水戰～每當無頭幽靈對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，若你沒有手牌，則該玩家隨機棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～幽靈\', \'flavor\': \'它雖無嘴可吟唱，但其軀體仍能傳出久遭遺棄的讚歌旋律。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0274d9a4-e606-412a-9a11-6bd81c7e30d2\', \'multiverseId\': 466584}, \'multiverseid\': 466584}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krabbelnder Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „{2}: Enttappe diese Kreatur."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri, Trilobit\', \'flavor\': \'Ein lebendes Fossil, wieder aktiv nach Äonen der Dormanz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464271&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'818a9fc8-116a-4396-9def-ac479d10ba46\', \'multiverseId\': 464271}, \'multiverseid\': 464271}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado palinúrido\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen "{2}: Endereza esta criatura".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trilobites fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'Un fósil viviente que despierta después de eones en estado latente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'031931c2-05a9-4cdf-ae79-720c93269c82\', \'multiverseId\': 464525}, \'multiverseid\': 464525}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde galopant\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « {2} : Dégagez cette créature. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde et trilobite\', \'flavor\': "Un fossile vivant et actif après des éons d\'hibernation.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464779&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c35216c9-92fa-4936-8e06-7a8ca93486a7\', \'multiverseId\': 464779}, \'multiverseid\': 464779}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Brulicante\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno: "{2}: STAPpa questa creatura".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Trilobite Tramutante\', \'flavor\': "Un fossile vivente attivo dopo un\'eternità di letargo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c6e005-b7e4-4856-bb9b-6b3e88ee4a6d\', \'multiverseId\': 465033}, \'multiverseid\': 465033}, {\'name\': \'小走りスリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「{2}：このクリーチャーをアンタップする。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー・三葉虫\', \'flavor\': \'生きた化石が永劫の眠りから目覚めた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1ee03cf-e92e-4865-b579-a3a4481f70d2\', \'multiverseId\': 465287}, \'multiverseid\': 465287}, {\'name\': \'재촉하는 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 "{2}: 이 생물을 언탭한다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버 삼엽충\', \'flavor\': \'영원의 세월 동안 휴면한 뒤 깨어난 살아 있는 화석.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b95273-f3c2-4f18-927a-d1f5e389a32d\', \'multiverseId\': 465541}, \'multiverseid\': 465541}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Rastejador\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm "{2}: Desvire esta criatura."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius Trilobita\', \'flavor\': \'Um fóssil vivo, ativo depois de eras de dormência.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39699e35-fd93-4285-bed2-469e6c8af0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 465795}, \'multiverseid\': 465795}, {\'name\': \'Проворная Щепка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют способность «{2}: разверните это существо».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка Трилобит\', \'flavor\': \'Живое ископаемое, проснувшееся после тысячелетнего сна.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c69f7ff-b65a-4083-a3d9-e8502b66bf99\', \'multiverseId\': 466049}, \'multiverseid\': 466049}, {\'name\': \'疾步裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「{2}：重置此生物。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖／三叶虫\', \'flavor\': \'亘古沉眠后再度苏醒的活化石。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e349b9d-1fc5-4b74-b24c-b03f5a303260\', \'multiverseId\': 466303}, \'multiverseid\': 466303}, {\'name\': \'疾步裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「{2}：重置此生物。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖／三葉蟲\', \'flavor\': \'亙古沉眠後再度甦醒的活化石。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6a1f88-fff5-4519-988a-c80bd78cb0ea\', \'multiverseId\': 466557}, \'multiverseid\': 466557}]', "[{'name': 'Krosanischer Keiler', 'text': 'Umwandlung {2}{G} ({2}{G}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Krosanischen Keiler umwandelst, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie offen vorzeigen, auf deine Hand nehmen und dann deine Bibliothek mischen. (Ziehe erst danach eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Wildschwein, Bestie', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464372&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aadd2948-5f83-44ec-a7a7-834c5ea548e3', 'multiverseId': 464372}, 'multiverseid': 464372}, {'name': 'Colmilludo krosano', 'text': 'Ciclo {2}{G}. ({2}{G}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Colmilludo krosano, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, mostrarla, ponerla en tu mano y luego barajar tu biblioteca. (Haz esto antes de robar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Bestia jabalí', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464626&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '599b2282-0667-46cc-872d-7f268dd4ffbe', 'multiverseId': 464626}, 'multiverseid': 464626}, {'name': 'Terrocorne krosian', 'text': 'Recyclage {2}{G} ({2}{G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Terrocorne krosian, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la révéler, la mettre dans votre main et mélanger ensuite votre bibliothèque. (Faites ceci avant de piocher.)', 'type': 'Créature : sanglier et bête', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464880&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91209c9d-13f9-4d55-8a71-efe1f8f92fb6', 'multiverseId': 464880}, 'multiverseid': 464880}, {'name': 'Zannuto di Krosa', 'text': 'Ciclo {2}{G} ({2}{G}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli lo Zannuto di Krosa, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, rivelarla, aggiungerla alla tua mano e rimescolare il tuo grimorio. (Devi farlo prima di pescare.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Bestia Cinghiale', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465134&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36ed5146-9e9b-415d-a9ae-647e599271d8', 'multiverseId': 465134}, 'multiverseid': 465134}, {'name': 'クローサの大牙獣', 'text': 'サイクリング{2}{G}（{2}{G}, このカードを捨てる：カードを１枚引く。）\\nあなたがクローサの大牙獣をサイクリングしたとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。（これはあなたがカードを引く前に行う。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 猪・ビースト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465388&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c25147f8-0ccb-4ca1-9ea4-db1342ca7cd3', 'multiverseId': 465388}, 'multiverseid': 465388}, {'name': '크로사의 엄니야수', 'text': '순환 {2}{G} ({2}{G}, 이 카드를 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\\n당신이 크로사의 엄니야수를 순환할 때, 당신은 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 한 장을 찾아, 그 카드를 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 당신의 서고를 섞는다. (카드를 뽑기 전에 이 행동을 한다.)', 'type': '생물 — 멧돼지 야수', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465642&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12364d1a-74b0-41b6-8ebd-cff4c83b9b9e', 'multiverseId': 465642}, 'multiverseid': 465642}, {'name': 'Javali Krosano', 'text': 'Reciclar {2}{G} ({2}{G}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você recicla Javali Krosano, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, revelá-lo, colocá-lo em sua mão e depois embaralhar seu grimório. (Faça isso antes de comprar.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Javali Besta', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465896&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eacedda6-6a0f-417b-b9bd-22f50e7a9fd5', 'multiverseId': 465896}, 'multiverseid': 465896}, {'name': 'Кросанский Клыкач', 'text': 'Цикл {2}{G} ({2}{G}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете Цикл Кросанского Клыкача, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, показать ту карту, положить ее в вашу руку, затем перетасовать вашу библиотеку. (Сделайте это до того, как возьмете карту.)', 'type': 'Существо — Вепрь Зверь', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466150&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a795fcda-38a5-4502-a81f-704846cbd47f', 'multiverseId': 466150}, 'multiverseid': 466150}, {'name': '克洛萨长牙野猪', 'text': '循环{2}{G}（{2}{G}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环克洛萨长牙野猪时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。（先如此作后再抓牌。）', 'type': '生物 ～野猪／野兽', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466404&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c34f11f-0558-4ee9-a89f-b5f25e02e09a', 'multiverseId': 466404}, 'multiverseid': 466404}, {'name': '克洛薩長牙野豬', 'text': '循環{2}{G}（{2}{G}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\\n當你循環克洛薩長牙野豬時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。（先如此作後再抽牌。）', 'type': '生物 ～野豬／野獸', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466658&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab3f0669-186b-4330-8e66-dd31f1bf4211', 'multiverseId': 466658}, 'multiverseid': 466658}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kunst des Spleißers\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge einen 3/3 farblosen Golem-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\nKopplung mit Spontanzauber oder Hexerei {3}{W} (Sowie du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, kannst du diese Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen und ihre Kopplungskosten bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, füge dem Zauberspruch den Effekt dieser Karte hinzu.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464234&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5978674e-9c3d-432f-9147-219a510bd2d5\', \'multiverseId\': 464234}, \'multiverseid\': 464234}, {\'name\': \'Pericia del ensamblador\', \'text\': \'Crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Gólem incolora 3/3.\\nEmpalmar con instantáneo o conjuro {3}{W}. (En cuanto lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, puedes mostrar esta carta de tu mano y pagar su coste de empalme. Si lo haces, agrega los efectos de esta carta a ese hechizo.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1b9234-da9c-4aa7-b437-f89630386d55\', \'multiverseId\': 464488}, \'multiverseid\': 464488}, {\'name\': "Talent de l\'épisseur", \'text\': "Créez un jeton de créature-artefact 3/3 incolore Golem.\\nImprégnation d\'éphémère ou de rituel {3}{W} (Au moment où vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous pouvez révéler cette carte depuis votre main et payer son coût d\'imprégnation. Si vous faites ainsi, ajoutez les effets de cette carte à ce sort.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464742&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02116382-b9f0-4cc9-aa4a-73adacc736f6\', \'multiverseId\': 464742}, \'multiverseid\': 464742}, {\'name\': \'Abilità del Giuntatore\', \'text\': \'Crea una pedina creatura artefatto Golem 3/3 incolore.\\nUnire a istantaneo o stregoneria {3}{W} (Mentre lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, puoi rivelare questa carta dalla tua mano e pagare il suo costo di unione. Se lo fai, aggiungi gli effetti di questa carta a quella magia.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82861f3b-adcc-43a9-b799-a350c51d09e7\', \'multiverseId\': 464996}, \'multiverseid\': 464996}, {\'name\': \'接合者の技法\', \'text\': \'無色の３/３のゴーレム・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n連繋（インスタントかソーサリー）{3}{W}（あなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたはあなたの手札からこのカードを公開して、連繋コストを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、このカードの効果をその呪文に加える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e65669d-d0db-415a-a9d4-756ab1bd3f66\', \'multiverseId\': 465250}, \'multiverseid\': 465250}, {\'name\': \'접합자의 솜씨\', \'text\': \'3/3 무색 골렘 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n순간마법 또는 집중마법에 접합 {3}{W} (당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동하면서, 당신은 이 카드를 당신의 손에서 공개하고 접합 비용을 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 이 카드의 효과를 그 주문에 추가한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b099fe85-2d9f-45e8-959c-624fc38ab943\', \'multiverseId\': 465504}, \'multiverseid\': 465504}, {\'name\': \'Perícia do Implantador\', \'text\': \'Crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 3/3 do tipo Golem.\\nUnir com mágica instantânea ou feitiço {3}{W} (Conforme conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, você pode revelar este card da sua mão e pagar seu custo de união. Se fizer isso, adicione os efeitos deste card àquela mágica.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9caab10-3d59-457d-848b-3db08835885a\', \'multiverseId\': 465758}, \'multiverseid\': 465758}, {\'name\': \'Мастерство Приращивателя\', \'text\': \'Создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 3/3 бесцветный Голем.\\nСращивание с мгновенным заклинанием или волшебством {3}{W} (При разыгрывании вами мгновенного заклинания или заклинания волшебства вы можете показать эту карту из вашей руки и оплатить ее стоимость Сращивания. Если вы это делаете, добавьте эффекты этой карты к тому заклинанию.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63352c67-81d8-4f2a-97ed-084afdd18774\', \'multiverseId\': 466012}, \'multiverseid\': 466012}, {\'name\': \'接合师技艺\', \'text\': \'派出一个3/3无色魔像衍生神器生物。\\n通联瞬间或法术{3}{W}（于你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，你可以从手上展示此牌，并支付其通联费用。如果你如此作，则将此牌的效应加入该咒语中。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bd1b887-dec1-48b6-879c-288d7359266a\', \'multiverseId\': 466266}, \'multiverseid\': 466266}, {\'name\': \'接合師技藝\', \'text\': \'派出一個3/3無色魔像衍生神器生物。\\n通聯瞬間或巫術{3}{W}（於你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，你可以從手上展示此牌，並支付其通聯費用。如果你如此作，則將此牌的效應加入該咒語中。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3db72f7c-3c82-4b08-a28c-eb23b9b84765\', \'multiverseId\': 466520}, \'multiverseid\': 466520}]', '[{\'name\': \'König des Rudels\', \'text\': \'Andere Katzen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': \'„Wunderbar ist es, wieder mit den Meinen durch die Savanne zu schreiten."\\n—„Das Liebeslied von Nacht und Tag"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464219&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56204988-61fb-4443-8ee7-f68a2174cf67\', \'multiverseId\': 464219}, \'multiverseid\': 464219}, {\'name\': \'Rey de la manada\', \'text\': \'Los otros Felinos que controlas obtienen +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Qué maravilla, volver a caminar por la sabana con mi amada".\\n—"Canción de amor de la noche y el día"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b50bbd1a-5f9b-4fdc-b478-a3895fbf72c6\', \'multiverseId\': 464473}, \'multiverseid\': 464473}, {\'name\': \'Roi de la bande\', \'text\': \'Les autres chats que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': "« Quelle gloire d\'arpenter à nouveau la savane avec ma bien-aimée. »\\n—« Nuit et Jour, la chanson de leur amour »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464727&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'671a866b-94c4-4caa-956c-296d9b477200\', \'multiverseId\': 464727}, \'multiverseid\': 464727}, {\'name\': \'Re del Branco\', \'text\': \'Gli altri Felini che controlli prendono +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Glorioso è camminare di nuovo nella savana con la mia amata."\\n—"Canzone d\\\'Amore del Giorno e della Notte"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee728c4e-5c8e-459d-ae10-2c93aa3d19b9\', \'multiverseId\': 464981}, \'multiverseid\': 464981}, {\'name\': \'群れの王\', \'text\': \'他の、あなたがコントロールしている猫は＋２/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': \'「なんと素晴らしい、愛する者とまたサバンナを歩けるとは。」\\n――「夜と昼の恋歌」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96405072-7b0d-43bc-9f17-8ba6ecee7a92\', \'multiverseId\': 465235}, \'multiverseid\': 465235}, {\'name\': \'무리의 왕\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 고양이들은 +2/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이\', \'flavor\': \'"사랑하는 이와 다시금 사바나를 거닐 수 있다니, 영광스럽구나."\\n—"밤과 낮의 애가"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e48ecc-1866-4ebb-b75d-b892416eb4ac\', \'multiverseId\': 465489}, \'multiverseid\': 465489}, {\'name\': \'Rei do Bando\', \'text\': \'Os outros felinos que você controla recebem +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Que maravilha caminhar novamente pela savana com minha amada."\\n— "Canção de Amor da Noite e do Dia"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f25849-7e7c-4982-8975-e94269fd5143\', \'multiverseId\': 465743}, \'multiverseid\': 465743}, {\'name\': \'Царь Прайда\', \'text\': \'Другие Кошки под вашим контролем получают +2/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': \'«О, сколь радостно вновь идти по саванне с моей возлюбленной».\\n— «Любовная песнь Ночи и Дня»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d640cec7-97b0-4c50-bfc1-f47fad87be05\', \'multiverseId\': 465997}, \'multiverseid\': 465997}, {\'name\': \'狮群之王\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他猫得+2/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': \'「愉悦啊，与所钟爱的行走在大草原上。」\\n～《昼与夜的恋曲》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1010a0-b9d3-4ee8-95cb-40bd601d1f4b\', \'multiverseId\': 466251}, \'multiverseid\': 466251}, {\'name\': \'獅群之王\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他貓得+2/+1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓\', \'flavor\': \'「愉悅啊，與所鍾愛的行走在大草原上。」\\n～《晝與夜的戀曲》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'198f94b6-de13-4a09-b683-b4a22c571eb3\', \'multiverseId\': 466505}, \'multiverseid\': 466505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Labor durchstöbern\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich glaube, jemand stiehlt aus meinem Labor. Das bist besser nicht du!"\\n—Geralf, Brief an Gisa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464306&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a28c6c93-2bbf-4f95-bd74-2a204290fb55\', \'multiverseId\': 464306}, \'multiverseid\': 464306}, {\'name\': \'Rebuscar en el laboratorio\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Creo que alguien está robando cosas de mi laboratorio. ¡Más te vale no ser tú!".\\n—Geralf, carta a Gisa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901b7051-d9b1-4a09-9b08-70987e0ff1ed\', \'multiverseId\': 464560}, \'multiverseid\': 464560}, {\'name\': \'Saccage du laboratoire\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je suis sûr que quelqu\'un pille mon laboratoire. J\'ose espérer que ce n\'est pas toi ! »\\n—Geralf, lettre à Gisa", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464814&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06320ca7-d2d6-464c-bfa9-13bd7fbedd83\', \'multiverseId\': 464814}, \'multiverseid\': 464814}, {\'name\': \'Saccheggiare il Laboratorio\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Credo che qualcuno stia rubando nel mio laboratorio. Ti conviene non essere stata tu!"\\n—Geralf, lettera a Gisa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddbbf2b5-c08a-4567-bd71-245e3c9dd10d\', \'multiverseId\': 465068}, \'multiverseid\': 465068}, {\'name\': \'研究室荒らし\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「何者かが我が研究室で盗みを働きました。姉上の仕業でなければよいのですが。」\\n――ゲラルフからギサへの手紙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f13c72de-bba8-488b-b5b4-c4dd7efef993\', \'multiverseId\': 465322}, \'multiverseid\': 465322}, {\'name\': \'연구실 뒤집어엎기\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지는 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"누군가가 내 연구실에서 물건을 훔치고 있는 것 같아. 누나가 아니어야 할 걸!"\\n—게랄프가, 기샤에게 보내는 편지에서\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08b5aa9e-8cfe-4fd2-aced-153cb1234bad\', \'multiverseId\': 465576}, \'multiverseid\': 465576}, {\'name\': \'Saquear o Laboratório\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles em sua mão e o restante em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Acho que tem alguém roubando do meu laboratório. É melhor não ser você!"\\n— Geralf, em carta a Gisa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f56b9098-f787-4981-be7a-a8759b8ea9a1\', \'multiverseId\': 465830}, \'multiverseid\': 465830}, {\'name\': \'Обыск в Лаборатории\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Похоже, что кто-то ворует из моей лаборатории. Надеюсь, что это не ты!»\\n— Геральф, в письме к Джизе\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f67810b-dc06-4a8f-a9df-408ca960a5e3\', \'multiverseId\': 466084}, \'multiverseid\': 466084}, {\'name\': \'搜刮实验室\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「总觉得有人从我实验室里面偷东西。最好不是你干的！」\\n～基拉夫致基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'620a1218-0e9b-4cc7-ab09-d71bc69fe768\', \'multiverseId\': 466338}, \'multiverseid\': 466338}, {\'name\': \'搜刮實驗室\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘則置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「總覺得有人從我實驗室裡面偷東西。最好不是妳幹的！」\\n～基拉夫致基沙\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adb61fd6-11b4-4b63-b37b-f8614795d2e3\', \'multiverseId\': 466592}, \'multiverseid\': 466592}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lanzenremasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Hellebarden sollten uns eigentlich einen Vorteil verschaffen!"\\n—Merrik Aidar, benalische Patrouille\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464221&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59aeadd6-4d4d-4249-82f3-1f28fe8ab147\', \'multiverseId\': 464221}, \'multiverseid\': 464221}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado lancero\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Se supone que esas lanzas iban a ayudarnos!".\\n—Merrik Aidar, patrullero benalita\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e97ee99-c145-403f-be3f-dd6c05979c07\', \'multiverseId\': 464475}, \'multiverseid\': 464475}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde lancier\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'« Ces perches étaient censées nous aider ! »\\n—Merrik Aidar, patrouilleur bénalian\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464729&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96d4cbdd-7166-43e8-aa86-5be23acdf409\', \'multiverseId\': 464729}, \'multiverseid\': 464729}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Lanciere\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'"Queste armi in asta dovevano esserci d\\\'aiuto!"\\n—Merrik Aidar, pattuglia di Benalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a60c56e-a4a0-47c5-ae2d-6bf68b8aeb2b\', \'multiverseId\': 464983}, \'multiverseid\': 464983}, {\'name\': \'長槍スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「この長柄の武器が役に立ちそうだったのに！」\\n――ベナリアの巡回兵、メリク・エイダー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aac8b41-d93a-4808-a0f5-5ddd794f2090\', \'multiverseId\': 465237}, \'multiverseid\': 465237}, {\'name\': \'창잡이 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 선제공격을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'"이 장창들은 원래 도움이 되었어야 한다고!"\\n—베날리아 순찰대, 메릭 에이다르\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f749d61-a9ea-4d94-8ab5-8b350f1351d7\', \'multiverseId\': 465491}, \'multiverseid\': 465491}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Lanceiro\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm iniciativa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'"Era para essas lanças ajudarem!"\\n— Merrik Aidar, da patrulha de Benália\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2430cfe9-ad92-4662-827b-f5e242ed705f\', \'multiverseId\': 465745}, \'multiverseid\': 465745}, {\'name\': \'Копьеносная Щепка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют Первый удар.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'«Наши копья должны были помочь нам!»\\n— Меррик Аидар, беналийский патрульный\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b4bf64-6dc7-464a-b332-4ddf8d339be1\', \'multiverseId\': 465999}, \'multiverseid\': 465999}, {\'name\': \'舞枪裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「我以为这些长枪能救我们！」\\n～宾纳里亚巡卫梅里可艾达\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15394993-7829-4129-95c5-fca6e9f7cf2c\', \'multiverseId\': 466253}, \'multiverseid\': 466253}, {\'name\': \'舞槍裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有先攻異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「我以為這些長槍能救我們！」\\n～賓納里亞巡衛梅里可艾達\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45bdbcf1-11b9-49c4-b346-8e69d68c5b2a\', \'multiverseId\': 466507}, \'multiverseid\': 466507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lavabauch-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, fügt sie einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Heiß genug, um Eier auszubrüten und potenzielle Eierdiebe zu verbrennen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464410&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be1a58b-010c-422a-be73-93dafa2c05d4\', \'multiverseId\': 464410}, \'multiverseid\': 464410}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado panzamagma\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen "Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, hace 1 punto de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo y tú ganas 1 vida".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'Su cuerpo despide un calor suficiente para incubar huevos o para incinerar a aquellos que amaguen con comérselos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'298b6d12-de79-4da7-aa9f-bbe12984002b\', \'multiverseId\': 464664}, \'multiverseid\': 464664}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde ventrelave\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle inflige 1 blessure à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker, et vous gagnez 1 point de vie. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'Suffisamment chaud pour incuber des œufs ou incinérer ceux qui voudraient les manger.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464918&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a67f5b9-5350-4862-893c-ae4b91d23514\', \'multiverseId\': 464918}, \'multiverseid\': 464918}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Ventrelava\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno "Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 1 danno a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio e tu guadagni 1 punto vita".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'È abbastanza caldo da incubare uova o incenerire chi vorrebbe mangiarle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc9955b-2aa2-48ea-9db9-ae841c2252f7\', \'multiverseId\': 465172}, \'multiverseid\': 465172}, {\'name\': \'溶岩腹スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１人を対象とする。これはそれに１点のダメージを与え、あなたは１点のライフを得る。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'ここは十分暖かいので、卵を孵しやすく、卵を食べに来るものを灰にしやすい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6070e060-6433-4248-8e52-87af05845d78\', \'multiverseId\': 465426}, \'multiverseid\': 465426}, {\'name\': \'용암배때기 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 "이 생물이 전장에 들어올 때, 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입히고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'알들을 부화시키기에도 적당하고 알들을 먹어치우는 자들을 태워버리기에도 적당하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72eb9c7a-ef7c-41f1-acee-42060a8ba993\', \'multiverseId\': 465680}, \'multiverseid\': 465680}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Ventrelávico\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm "Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, ela causa 1 ponto de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo e você ganha 1 ponto de vida."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'Quente o suficiente para incubar ovos ou incinerar quem os comeria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b82552c4-5d3e-409e-a874-d672b4560bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 465934}, \'multiverseid\': 465934}, {\'name\': \'Лавоядная Щепка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют способность «Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, оно наносит 1 повреждение целевому игроку или planeswalker-у, а вы получаете 1 жизнь».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'У нее хватает тепла и для того, чтобы высиживать яйца, и для того, чтобы испепелить тех, кто захочет ими полакомиться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0069356f-0542-46df-a4de-91e2016a54d1\', \'multiverseId\': 466188}, \'multiverseid\': 466188}, {\'name\': \'炎腹裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「当此生物进战场时，它对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害且你获得1点生命。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'温度足以孵卵，或烧穿食用者的胃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'616fcd62-0732-4c50-ab7e-2803f09dff37\', \'multiverseId\': 466442}, \'multiverseid\': 466442}, {\'name\': \'炎腹裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「當此生物進戰場時，它對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成1點傷害且你獲得1點生命。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'溫度足以孵卵，或燒穿食用者的胃。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb23709d-7ed8-40dd-a25d-f93cd612e53e\', \'multiverseId\': 466696}, \'multiverseid\': 466696}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lavapfeil\', \'text\': \'Der Lavapfeil fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nRückblende — Opfere ein Gebirge. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Kleine Ausbrüche sind gesund."\\n—Koth vom Hammerclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464337&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509f0ffc-c23c-4794-ac83-64aa216496e0\', \'multiverseId\': 464337}, \'multiverseid\': 464337}, {\'name\': \'Dardo de lava\', \'text\': \'El Dardo de lava hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\nRetrospectiva — Sacrificar una Montaña. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es sano tener pequeñas explosiones".\\n—Koth del Martillo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75512a39-15be-45d2-9ae1-c6e458e37c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 464591}, \'multiverseid\': 464591}, {\'name\': \'Dard de lave\', \'text\': "Le Dard de lave inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.\\nFlashback — Sacrifiez une montagne. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Une petite explosion de temps en temps, ça fait du bien. »\\n—Koth du Marteau\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cb05ad2-902a-46e7-9648-505caff9ecf3\', \'multiverseId\': 464845}, \'multiverseid\': 464845}, {\'name\': \'Dardo di Lava\', \'text\': \'Il Dardo di Lava infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\nFlashback—Sacrifica una Montagna. (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I piccoli sfoghi sono salutari."\\n—Koth del Martello\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1a9b6c9-7ffb-4ffb-b8c1-e95e15e3a509\', \'multiverseId\': 465099}, \'multiverseid\': 465099}, {\'name\': \'溶岩の投げ矢\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。溶岩の投げ矢はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\nフラッシュバック―山１つを生け贄に捧げる。（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「少々の噴出なら健全だ。」\\n――槌のコス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1381ce93-ced7-4f12-8ffd-db6690d9e716\', \'multiverseId\': 465353}, \'multiverseid\': 465353}, {\'name\': \'용암 다트\', \'text\': \'원하는 목표를 정한다. 용암 다트는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n회상—산 한 개를 희생한다. (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"약간씩 분출되는 건 좋은 일이지."\\n—망치의 코쓰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca12362-b8e3-416e-b465-ae563a3e109c\', \'multiverseId\': 465607}, \'multiverseid\': 465607}, {\'name\': \'Dardo de Lava\', \'text\': \'Dardo de Lava causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\\nRecapitular — Sacrifique uma Montanha. (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Pequenas irrupções são saudáveis."\\n— Koth do Martelo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dfce0ac-678d-41f3-8e37-76122dbe40d9\', \'multiverseId\': 465861}, \'multiverseid\': 465861}, {\'name\': \'Лавовый Дротик\', \'text\': \'Лавовый Дротик наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\\nВоспоминание — Пожертвуйте Гору. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Небольшие выбросы — совершенно нормальное явление».\\n— Кос из племени Молота\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dbe5849-4e3a-4861-8c0f-99b3e2a162e1\', \'multiverseId\': 466115}, \'multiverseid\': 466115}, {\'name\': \'熔岩镖\', \'text\': \'熔岩镖对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\\n返照～牺牲一个山脉。（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「小型喷发属于健康的现象。」\\n～锤族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b620c1-01a1-470d-8eb8-35b4d04eea50\', \'multiverseId\': 466369}, \'multiverseid\': 466369}, {\'name\': \'熔岩鏢\', \'text\': \'熔岩鏢對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。\\n返照～犧牲一個山脈。（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「小型噴發屬於健康的現象。」\\n～鎚族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'384f7043-97ae-4d46-9c6a-ccd5b416409f\', \'multiverseId\': 466623}, \'multiverseid\': 466623}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leerschädel-Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}, wirf eine Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'„Faszinierend! Die Evolution hat ihre Hirne zurückgebildet, sodass sie weniger Energie verbrauchen. Sie reagieren nur auf Signale vom Schwarmbewusstsein."\\n—Rukarumel, Tagebucheintrag\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464335&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8f3b660-1214-4949-b422-45a2e4904228\', \'multiverseId\': 464335}, \'multiverseid\': 464335}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado cabezahueca\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen "{T}, descartar una carta: Roba una carta".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Magnífico! Han evolucionado más allá de un cerebro que requiere grandes aportes de energía. Ahora son enormes médulas espinales que responden solo a las órdenes de la mente colmena".\\n—Rúkarumel, diario de investigación\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a53a505-5b5c-4a4c-b336-7459d686b83e\', \'multiverseId\': 464589}, \'multiverseid\': 464589}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde à tête creuse\', \'text\': "Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont « {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte : Piochez une carte ».", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Fantastique ! Ils ont évolué sans pollution cérébrale et ne répondent qu\'aux stimuli vertébraux générés par l\'esprit de l\'essaim. »\\n—Rukarumel, journal de bord", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'535ae78f-1f31-487d-b7d2-7c2ed7d288cb\', \'multiverseId\': 464843}, \'multiverseid\': 464843}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Testacava\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli hanno "{T}, Scarta una carta: Pesca una carta".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'"Geniale! Si sono evoluti eliminando il dispendio energetico del cervello e rispondono solo ad archi riflessi spinali della mente collettiva."\\n—Rukarumel, registro delle attività\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b7d22c0-fa65-4013-a0ca-b80349151568\', \'multiverseId\': 465097}, \'multiverseid\': 465097}, {\'name\': \'頭空スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは「{T}, カード１枚を捨てる：カードを１枚引く。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'「素晴らしい！彼らはエネルギー消費の大きい脳を進化によって捨て去り、巣の精神から届く反射信号のみに反応するのだ。」\\n――ルカルメルの観察日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d39746c-baff-427b-a57e-993d7b6bc957\', \'multiverseId\': 465351}, \'multiverseid\': 465351}, {\'name\': \'빈머리 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 "{T}, 카드 한 장을 버린다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'"대단해! 저것들은 에너지를 필요로 하는 뇌를 버리고 둥지로부터 전해져 오는 척수 반사 신호에만 반응하도록 진화했다."\\n—루카루멜, 현장 기록\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3592b42-1089-431c-907a-ab07718dfc46\', \'multiverseId\': 465605}, \'multiverseid\': 465605}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Cabeça-oca\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm "{T}, descarte um card: Compre um card."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'"Brilhante! Eles evoluíram abandonando cérebros de alto consumo energético para responder apenas aos reflexos espinhais da mente coletiva."\\n— Rukarumel, anotações de campo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2bf7c57-4970-4b28-ab75-e8fa02cb4a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 465859}, \'multiverseid\': 465859}, {\'name\': \'Пустоголовая Щепка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют способность «{T}, сбросьте карту: возьмите карту».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'«Гениально! В ходе эволюции они избавились от расходующего энергию мозга и теперь действуют, руководствуясь нервными импульсами разума улья».\\n— Рукарумель, полевой журнал\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a7709a1-aa8f-4d68-92a0-948ad70b0c95\', \'multiverseId\': 466113}, \'multiverseid\': 466113}, {\'name\': \'无脑裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「{T}，弃一张牌：抓一张牌。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「奇妙极了！它们没有朝着耗费能量的大脑方向进化，而且只对母巢主脑的脊椎反射弧作出反应。」\\n～陆卡陆梅的现场日志\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df7ca5dd-3738-4e35-8788-496f52bec117\', \'multiverseId\': 466367}, \'multiverseid\': 466367}, {\'name\': \'無腦裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物具有「{T}，棄一張牌：抽一張牌。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'「奇妙極了！牠們沒有朝著耗費能量的大腦方向進化，而且只對母巢主腦的脊椎反射弧作出反應。」\\n～陸卡陸梅的現場日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'331de16c-945f-48c4-97a7-f3e74ff21c63\', \'multiverseId\': 466621}, \'multiverseid\': 466621}]', '[{\'name\': \'Listiges Ausweichen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, geblockt wird, kannst du sie auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Beginne mit deiner Flucht und arbeite dich vom Ende zum Anfang."\\n—*Weg der Geheimnisse*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464248&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f2b3322-05a9-466d-8047-20411373f0d0\', \'multiverseId\': 464248}, \'multiverseid\': 464248}, {\'name\': \'Evasión ingeniosa\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas sea bloqueada, puedes regresarla a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Comienza con la huida y planea de ahí hacia atrás".\\n—*Libro de los secretos*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc44c252-cf99-4018-98ca-d1506934c3b3\', \'multiverseId\': 464502}, \'multiverseid\': 464502}, {\'name\': \'Évasion rusée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez devient bloquée, vous pouvez la renvoyer dans la main de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Commence par l\'évasion et rebrousse chemin. »\\n—*Voie des secrets*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464756&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c64c49-4fff-4ae8-aed8-a81976fa5eab\', \'multiverseId\': 464756}, \'multiverseid\': 464756}, {\'name\': \'Evasione Astuta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli viene bloccata, puoi farla tornare in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Inizia dalla fuga e procedi a ritroso."\\n—*L\\\'arte dei segreti*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52f7c44d-accf-4d69-8ff7-49f1d5cb5e7a\', \'multiverseId\': 465010}, \'multiverseid\': 465010}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な回避\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーが１体ブロックされた状態になるたび、あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「出口から始めて逆向きに働く。」\\n――*秘密の道*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c53d3aa8-6b0f-4cb1-86bf-fb24d0285542\', \'multiverseId\': 465264}, \'multiverseid\': 465264}, {\'name\': \'기묘한 회피\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물이 방어될 때마다, 당신은 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"탈출에서 시작해서 되감아가며 행동해라."\\n—*비밀의 도*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bb50213-eb8f-43b5-9893-14aaa8b12c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 465518}, \'multiverseid\': 465518}, {\'name\': \'Evasão Sagaz\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla é bloqueada, você pode devolvê-la para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Comece pela fuga e planeje o restante daí para trás."\\n— *Caminho dos Segredos*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'315fc8eb-feb2-4266-9e2f-965df9fbc3b9\', \'multiverseId\': 465772}, \'multiverseid\': 465772}, {\'name\': \'Хитроумное Уклонение\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем становится заблокированным, вы можете вернуть его в руку его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Начинай со своего побега и от этого работай в обратном направлении».\\n— *«Дорога Тайн»*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06bd8b5-f8da-4e6d-b981-2953d5d52fec\', \'multiverseId\': 466026}, \'multiverseid\': 466026}, {\'name\': \'机敏闪避\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物被阻挡时，你可以将它移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「首先脱困，而后从反面着手。」\\n～《奥秘奇谭》**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fcb451a-a5f9-478f-b5cc-75960c9cf7e8\', \'multiverseId\': 466280}, \'multiverseid\': 466280}, {\'name\': \'機敏閃避\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的生物被阻擋時，你可以將它移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「首先脫困，而後從反面著手。」\\n～《奧秘奇譚》**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25de3120-fe4f-4060-beaf-043838be04e3\', \'multiverseId\': 466534}, \'multiverseid\': 466534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Llanowar-Stamm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {G}{G}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Llanowar erinnert sich an die Eiszeit, die Phyrexianische Invasion und die Zeitriss-Ära. Solange wir atmen, werden wir sicherstellen, dass solche Katastrophen niemals wieder unsere Welt bedrohen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcac5f3f-87e7-4fa2-a866-2749b72547de\', \'multiverseId\': 464373}, \'multiverseid\': 464373}, {\'name\': \'Tribu de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G}{G}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Llanowar recuerda la Era Glacial, la invasión pirexiana y la Era de la Grieta. Mientras vivamos, nos aseguraremos de que semejantes desastres no amenacen a nuestro mundo de nuevo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'048a34ff-15af-42b4-a85d-ccda4ae2e771\', \'multiverseId\': 464627}, \'multiverseid\': 464627}, {\'name\': \'Tribu de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G}{G}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Llanowar se souvient de l\'Ère glaciaire, de l\'invasion phyrexiane et de l\'Ère des failles. Tant qu\'il nous restera un souffle de vie, nous ferons en sorte que de tels désastres ne menacent plus jamais notre monde. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464881&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c61040a-2f4f-4e4b-8842-c84994bff044\', \'multiverseId\': 464881}, \'multiverseid\': 464881}, {\'name\': \'Tribù di Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G}{G}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Llanowar ricorda l\\\'Era Glaciale, l\\\'Invasione di Phyrexia e l\\\'Era degli Squarci. Finché avremo fiato, ci assicureremo che simili disastri non minaccino più il nostro mondo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee6f65d1-f82a-407a-9e52-9917819d47a7\', \'multiverseId\': 465135}, \'multiverseid\': 465135}, {\'name\': \'ラノワールの部族\', \'text\': \'{T}：{G}{G}{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「ラノワールは氷河期も、ファイレクシアの侵攻も、裂け目時代も覚えている。我々の目の黒いうちは、この世界を二度とあんな災害に遭わせはしない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a681288-e448-4de2-8948-eb9df41762f5\', \'multiverseId\': 465389}, \'multiverseid\': 465389}, {\'name\': \'라노워 부족\', \'text\': \'{T}: {G}{G}{G}를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"라노워는 얼음의 시대를, 피렉시아의 침략을, 균열의 시대를 기억한다. 우리에게 숨이 붙어 있는 한, 다시는 그런 재앙들이 우리의 세계를 위협하게 두지 않겠다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86763a33-fa96-437e-9273-1fa70ad898e0\', \'multiverseId\': 465643}, \'multiverseid\': 465643}, {\'name\': \'Tribo de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G}{G}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Llanowar lembra-se da Era Glacial, da Invasão Phyrexiana e da Era da Fenda. Enquanto vivermos, garantiremos que desastres assim jamais ameacem nosso mundo novamente."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e401e5-c2a0-42c2-94f1-0a08f347176f\', \'multiverseId\': 465897}, \'multiverseid\': 465897}, {\'name\': \'Лановарское Племя\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {G}{G}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Лановар помнит Ледниковый период, фирексийское вторжение и Эру Разломов. Пока мы дышим, мы положим все силы на то, чтобы подобные катастрофы больше не грозили нашему миру».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d8e4405-81ee-481e-8c4a-66ea84fd9afb\', \'multiverseId\': 466151}, \'multiverseid\': 466151}, {\'name\': \'罗堰部族\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}{G}{G}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「罗堰记得冰雪时代，记得非瑞克西亚大战役，也记得时缝年代。只要我们还有一口气，我们就要确保此类灾难再也不会威胁我们的世界。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46245b3f-b4fc-433b-9e57-0e6ba6c42b0e\', \'multiverseId\': 466405}, \'multiverseid\': 466405}, {\'name\': \'羅堰部族\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}{G}{G}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「羅堰記得冰雪時代，記得非瑞克西亞大戰役，也記得時縫年代。只要我們還有一口氣，我們就要確保此類災難再也不會威脅我們的世界。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef695d3-1865-4e5f-92b9-990e4a70285e\', \'multiverseId\': 466659}, \'multiverseid\': 466659}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magmaspeiendes Erdloch\', \'text\': \'Wühlen (Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du {1} seiner Kosten.)\\nDas Magmaspeiende Erdloch fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Erde öffnete sich wie ein Maul und verschlang den Reisenden in einem Stück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464338&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'760e05d4-a5f8-4bfe-ab50-3d2f375095b8\', \'multiverseId\': 464338}, \'multiverseid\': 464338}, {\'name\': \'Sima magmática\', \'text\': \'Excavar. (Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nLa Sima magmática hace 5 puntos de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La tierra se abrió como las mandíbulas de un infernal y se tragó entero al viajero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4f49173-8a64-4bd4-bf35-dfc4b7d4cd13\', \'multiverseId\': 464592}, \'multiverseid\': 464592}, {\'name\': \'Doline magmatique\', \'text\': \'Fouille (Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière en lançant ce sort paie {1}.)\\nLa Doline magmatique inflige 5 blessures à la créature ciblée ou au planeswalker ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Béante, telle la gueule d\'une monstruosité, la terre avala le voyageur tout entier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464846&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'919bd4a3-cde6-47a4-819a-8b8efd8df339\', \'multiverseId\': 464846}, \'multiverseid\': 464846}, {\'name\': \'Voragine Magmatica\', \'text\': \'Esumare (Ogni carta che esili dal tuo cimitero mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1}.)\\nLa Voragine Magmatica infligge 5 danni a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La terrà si aprì come le fauci di un infernale e inghiottì in un istante il viaggiatore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5117335a-cea0-405d-ad8a-62d447d71e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 465100}, \'multiverseid\': 465100}, {\'name\': \'マグマの陥没孔\', \'text\': \'探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたがあなたの墓地から追放した各カードは、{1}を支払う。）\\nクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。マグマの陥没孔はそれに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'大地はヘリオンのような大口を開け、通りがかった人々をすべて飲み込んだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae9198f7-35f1-4c16-aba9-30d20f1930cf\', \'multiverseId\': 465354}, \'multiverseid\': 465354}, {\'name\': \'마그마 구덩이\', \'text\': \'파헤치기 (이 주문을 발동하는 동안 당신이 당신의 무덤에서 추방하는 카드는 {1}을 지불한다.)\\n생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 마그마 구덩이는 그 목표에게 피해 5점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'대지가 헬리온의 아가리처럼 입을 쩍 벌리고서, 여행객을 통째로 집어삼켰다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394c5706-917c-4cb8-a3ed-db7b41e1444d\', \'multiverseId\': 465608}, \'multiverseid\': 465608}, {\'name\': \'Sumidouro Magmático\', \'text\': \'Esquadrinhar (Cada card que você exila de seu cemitério quando conjura esta mágica paga por {1}.)\\nSumidouro Magmático causa 5 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Abrindo-se como a boca de um avernal, a terra engoliu o viajante inteiro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f50c64b-6a02-4084-8512-867dd9089a1d\', \'multiverseId\': 465862}, \'multiverseid\': 465862}, {\'name\': \'Магмовая Воронка\', \'text\': \'Выкапывание (Каждая карта, которую вы изгоняете из вашего кладбища при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1}.)\\nМагмовая Воронка наносит 5 повреждений целевому существу или planeswalker-у.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Раскрывшись, словно пасть геллиона, земля поглотила путника целиком.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03ff0660-00b8-4860-8f76-61467fbaff21\', \'multiverseId\': 466116}, \'multiverseid\': 466116}, {\'name\': \'熔岩地陷\', \'text\': \'掘穴（你于施放此咒语时每从你坟墓场中放逐一张牌，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n熔岩地陷对目标生物或鹏洛客造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'大地张开地狱兽般血口，将旅人整个吞下。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcd50056-bb89-407c-a8d9-b8e598a169e1\', \'multiverseId\': 466370}, \'multiverseid\': 466370}, {\'name\': \'熔岩地陷\', \'text\': \'掘穴（你於施放此咒語時每從你墳墓場中放逐一張牌，就能為此咒語支付{1}。）\\n熔岩地陷對目標生物或鵬洛客造成5點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'大地張開地獄獸般血口，將旅人整個吞下。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d2f37b9-3528-40c5-b36c-b4af2a2f4e69\', \'multiverseId\': 466624}, \'multiverseid\': 466624}]', '[{\'name\': \'Marit Lages Schlummer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Marit Lages Schlummer oder eine andere verschneite bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du zehn oder mehr verschneite bleibende Karten kontrollierst, opfere Marit Lages Schlummer. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen legendären 20/20 schwarzen Avatar-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Unzerstörbarkeit namens Marit Lage.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre verschneite Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464259&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc90f1be-b776-49ae-a687-51119563b7ec\', \'multiverseId\': 464259}, \'multiverseid\': 464259}, {\'name\': \'Sueño de Marit Lage\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Sueño de Marit Lage u otro permanente nevado entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, adivina 1.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas diez o más permanentes nevados, sacrifica el Sueño de Marit Lage. Si lo haces, crea a Marit Lage, una ficha de criatura legendaria Avatar negra 20/20 con las habilidades de volar e indestructible.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento nevado legendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'058556b0-bbfd-466d-ab32-c44a97b51bbb\', \'multiverseId\': 464513}, \'multiverseid\': 464513}, {\'name\': \'Sommeil de Marit Lage\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Sommeil de Marit Lage ou un autre permanent neigeux arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, regard 1.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez au moins dix permanents neigeux, sacrifiez le Sommeil de Marit Lage. Si vous faites ainsi, créez Marit Lage, un jeton de créature légendaire 20/20 noire Avatar avec le vol et l\'indestructible.", \'type\': \'Enchantement neigeux légendaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464767&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b1e8b40-339e-432c-aa04-82e9ed6db65d\', \'multiverseId\': 464767}, \'multiverseid\': 464767}, {\'name\': \'Sonno di Marit Lage\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Sonno di Marit Lage o un altro permanente neve entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, profetizza 1.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli dieci o più permanenti neve, sacrifica il Sonno di Marit Lage. Se lo fai, crea Marit Lage, una pedina creatura leggendaria Avatar 20/20 nera con volare e indistruttibile.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo Neve Leggendario\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95addc60-68df-4364-b9b1-50b227f46f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 465021}, \'multiverseid\': 465021}, {\'name\': \'マリット・レイジのまどろみ\', \'text\': \'マリット・レイジのまどろみか他の氷雪パーマネントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、占術１を行う。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが氷雪パーマネントを10個以上コントロールしている場合、マリット・レイジのまどろみを生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、「マリット・レイジ」という名前で飛行と破壊不能を持つ黒の20/20の伝説のアバター・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説の氷雪エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b7d6d5-2864-4b5c-9b28-6949fb536fab\', \'multiverseId\': 465275}, \'multiverseid\': 465275}, {\'name\': \'마릿 레이지의 수면\', \'text\': \'마릿 레이지의 수면 또는 다른 눈 지속물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 점술 1을 한다.\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신이 눈 지속물을 열 개 이상 조종한다면, 마릿 레이지의 수면을 희생한다. 그렇게 한다면, 이름이 마릿 레이지이고 비행과 무적을 가진 전설적 20/20 흑색 화신 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 눈 부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3035b645-f679-423a-8bf9-dbced4bdd474\', \'multiverseId\': 465529}, \'multiverseid\': 465529}, {\'name\': \'Repouso de Marit Lage\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Repouso de Marit Lage ou outra permanente da neve entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, use vidência 1.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, se você controlar dez ou mais permanentes da neve, sacrifique Repouso de Marit Lage. Se fizer isso, crie Marit Lage, uma ficha de criatura lendária preta 20/20 do tipo Avatar com voar e indestrutível.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento Lendário da Neve\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef16bfa0-5afa-48dd-9e67-fb064de56f8e\', \'multiverseId\': 465783}, \'multiverseid\': 465783}, {\'name\': \'Сон Марит Лейдж\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Сон Марит Лейдж или другой снежный перманент выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, предскажите 1.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки, если под вашим контролем есть десять или больше снежных перманентов, пожертвуйте Сон Марит Лейдж. Если вы это делаете, создайте Марит Лейдж, фишку легендарного существа 20/20 черная Аватара с Полетом и Неразрушимостью.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Снежные Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'771ebb52-73fa-4eec-993f-fe2f82334eec\', \'multiverseId\': 466037}, \'multiverseid\': 466037}, {\'name\': \'玛莉雷基沉眠\', \'text\': \'每当玛莉雷基沉眠或另一个雪境永久物在你的操控下进战场时，占卜1。\\n在你的维持开始时，若你操控十个或更多雪境永久物，则牺牲玛莉雷基沉眠。若你如此作，则派出传奇衍生生物玛莉雷基，其为20/20黑色，具飞行与不灭异能的圣者。\', \'type\': \'传奇雪境结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b666fd7-e0fa-4074-9118-146735db138d\', \'multiverseId\': 466291}, \'multiverseid\': 466291}, {\'name\': \'瑪莉雷基沉眠\', \'text\': \'每當瑪莉雷基沉眠或另一個雪境永久物在你的操控下進戰場時，占卜1。\\n在你的維持開始時，若你操控十個或更多雪境永久物，則犧牲瑪莉雷基沉眠。若你如此作，則派出傳奇衍生生物瑪莉雷基，其為20/20黑色，具飛行與不滅異能的聖者。\', \'type\': \'傳奇雪境結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdf0ba34-b035-4f53-87a4-e6beb5d8258f\', \'multiverseId\': 466545}, \'multiverseid\': 466545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mauer der tausend Schwerter\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger, Fliegend\\n{W}: Die Mauer der tausend Schwerter kann in diesem Zug angreifen, als ob sie nicht Verteidiger hätte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'Die Familien der Gefallenen spenden deren Schwerter, um die Verteidigung der Stadt zu verbessern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464239&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7ec4624-1975-4249-bdbc-ac8770ae1530\', \'multiverseId\': 464239}, \'multiverseid\': 464239}, {\'name\': \'Muro de los Mil Tajos\', \'text\': \'Defensor, vuela.\\n{W}: El Muro de los Mil Tajos puede atacar este turno como si no tuviera la habilidad de defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'Las familias de los caídos donan las espadas de sus seres queridos para reforzar las defensas de la ciudad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4068d5a3-70f2-41b7-92ed-089c71685960\', \'multiverseId\': 464493}, \'multiverseid\': 464493}, {\'name\': \'Mur des mille coupures\', \'text\': "Défenseur, vol\\n{W} : Le Mur des mille coupures peut attaquer ce tour-ci comme s\'il n\'avait pas le défenseur.", \'type\': \'Créature : mur\', \'flavor\': \'Les familles des morts font don des épées de leurs êtres chers pour renforcer les défenses de la ville.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464747&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'364e19b1-d0f3-4ed3-81ad-69f8b6eaf7dd\', \'multiverseId\': 464747}, \'multiverseid\': 464747}, {\'name\': \'Muro dei Mille Fendenti\', \'text\': \'Difensore, volare\\n{W}: Il Muro dei Mille Fendenti può attaccare in questo turno come se non avesse difensore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'Le famiglie dei caduti donano le spade dei loro cari per rafforzare le difese della città.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29dc4ad4-10c4-4f5d-9be4-3706d41a84b1\', \'multiverseId\': 465001}, \'multiverseid\': 465001}, {\'name\': \'千本刀の壁\', \'text\': \'防衛、飛行\\n{W}：このターン、千本刀の壁は防衛を持たないかのように攻撃できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'戦死者の家族が大切だった者の剣を寄付して街を守っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b346c51-b274-44b5-829a-30a871bc9884\', \'multiverseId\': 465255}, \'multiverseid\': 465255}, {\'name\': \'천 번 난도질하는 벽\', \'text\': \'수비태세, 비행\\n{W}: 천 번 난도질하는 벽은 이번 턴에 수비태세가 없는 것처럼 공격할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 벽\', \'flavor\': \'쓰러진 자의 유가족들이 사랑했던 이의 검을 기부해 도시의 수비를 강화한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f17fa0d-6092-4474-84f6-7d00c42690a2\', \'multiverseId\': 465509}, \'multiverseid\': 465509}, {\'name\': \'Barreira de Mil Cortes\', \'text\': \'Defensor, voar\\n{W}: Barreira de Mil Cortes pode atacar neste turno como se não tivesse defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Barreira\', \'flavor\': \'As famílias dos que tombam doam as espadas de seus entes queridos para reforçar as defesas da cidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62a1541b-369c-4eab-bfa9-d507605bd075\', \'multiverseId\': 465763}, \'multiverseid\': 465763}, {\'name\': \'Стена Тысячи Порезов\', \'text\': \'Защитник, Полет\\n{W}: Стена Тысячи Порезов может атаковать в этом ходу, как если бы у нее не было способности Защитника.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Стена\', \'flavor\': \'Семьи погибших отдавали мечи своих любимых, чтобы укрепить оборону города.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13bab0c7-fa7b-459b-899c-6a87e39f2222\', \'multiverseId\': 466017}, \'multiverseid\': 466017}, {\'name\': \'千剑之墙\', \'text\': \'守军，飞行\\n{W}：千剑之墙于本回合中能视同不具守军异能地进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～墙\', \'flavor\': \'战殁者的亲眷纷纷捐出逝者所藏宝剑，以期增强城市工事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18346997-f365-498a-bb76-f8df4d65a568\', \'multiverseId\': 466271}, \'multiverseid\': 466271}, {\'name\': \'千劍之牆\', \'text\': \'守軍，飛行\\n{W}：千劍之牆於本回合中能視同不具守軍異能地進行攻擊。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牆\', \'flavor\': \'戰歿者的親眷紛紛捐出逝者所藏寶劍，以期增強城市工事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cded0b8d-15d2-4439-8c2a-a810979c8263\', \'multiverseId\': 466525}, \'multiverseid\': 466525}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mirrodins Belagerung\', \'text\': \'Sowie Mirrodins Belagerung ins Spiel kommt, wähle Mirraner oder Phyrexianer.\\n• Mirraner — Immer wenn du einen Artefaktzauber wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Myr-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\\n• Phyrexianer — Ziehe zu Beginn deines Endsegments eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab. Falls dann fünfzehn oder mehr Artefaktkarten in deinem Friedhof sind, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl die Partie.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464260&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b8f97f4-549e-450b-84f4-1d2e75f09d72\', \'multiverseId\': 464260}, \'multiverseid\': 464260}, {\'name\': \'Mirrodin sitiado\', \'text\': \'En cuanto Mirrodin sitiado entre al campo de batalla, elige mirrodianos o pirexianos.\\n• Mirrodianos — Siempre que lances un hechizo de artefacto, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Myr incolora 1/1.\\n• Pirexianos — Al comienzo de tu paso final, roba una carta, luego descarta una carta. Luego, si hay quince o más cartas de artefacto en tu cementerio, el oponente objetivo pierde el juego.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5accac3-3e97-4fcb-8bef-05cc468c5c39\', \'multiverseId\': 464514}, \'multiverseid\': 464514}, {\'name\': \'Mirrodin assiégé\', \'text\': "Au moment où Mirrodin assiégé arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez Mirran ou Phyrexian.\\n• Mirran — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'artefact, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Myr.\\n• Phyrexian — Au début de votre étape de fin, piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte. Ensuite, s\'il y a au moins quinze cartes d\'artefact dans votre cimetière, l\'adversaire ciblé perd la partie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464768&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c2273d6-1819-4b7b-a7de-b70d0fc6ac35\', \'multiverseId\': 464768}, \'multiverseid\': 464768}, {\'name\': \'Mirrodin Assediato\', \'text\': "Mentre Mirrodin Assediato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli Mirran o Phyrexian.\\n• Mirran — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia artefatto, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Myr 1/1 incolore.\\n• Phyrexian — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta. Poi, se ci sono quindici o più carte artefatto nel tuo cimitero, un avversario bersaglio perde la partita.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'affcb450-fa53-4bbc-89b5-95d2bb82f5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 465022}, \'multiverseid\': 465022}, {\'name\': \'ミラディン包囲戦\', \'text\': \'ミラディン包囲戦が戦場に出るに際し、ミラディン軍かファイレクシア軍を選ぶ。\\n• ミラディン軍 ― あなたがアーティファクト・呪文を唱えるたび、無色の１/１のマイア・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n• ファイレクシア軍 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、対戦相手１人を対象とする。あなたは、カードを１枚引き、カード１枚を捨てる。その後、あなたの墓地にアーティファクト・カードが15枚以上あるなら、そのプレイヤーはこのゲームに敗北する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'267ff513-80aa-4582-8ddd-aeefd4edc5b9\', \'multiverseId\': 465276}, \'multiverseid\': 465276}, {\'name\': \'미로딘 포위전\', \'text\': \'미로딘 포위전이 전장에 들어올 때, 미로딘 또는 피렉시아를 선택한다.\\n• 미로딘 — 당신이 마법물체 주문을 발동할 때마다, 1/1 무색 미르 마법물체 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n• 피렉시아 — 당신의 종료단 시작에, 카드 한 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다. 그 후 당신의 무덤에 마법물체 카드가 열다섯 장 이상 있다면, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 게임에서 패배한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'821cd85d-2cd3-4886-9744-4c75c27d1298\', \'multiverseId\': 465530}, \'multiverseid\': 465530}, {\'name\': \'Mirrodin Sitiada\', \'text\': \'Conforme Mirrodin Sitiada entrar no campo de batalha, escolha Mirraniano ou Phyrexiano.\\n• Mirraniano — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de artefato, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato incolor 1/1 do tipo Myr.\\n• Phyrexiano — No início da sua etapa final, compre um card e depois descarte um card. Em seguida, se houver quinze ou mais cards de artefato em seu cemitério, o oponente alvo perde o jogo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc30a609-091a-441c-9898-ba27b2cfb00a\', \'multiverseId\': 465784}, \'multiverseid\': 465784}, {\'name\': \'Осада Мирродина\', \'text\': \'При выходе Осады Мирродина на поле битвы выберите мирродинцев или фирексийцев.\\n• Мирродинцы — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание артефакта, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Миэр.\\n• Фирексийцы — В начале вашего заключительного шага возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту. Затем, если на вашем кладбище есть пятнадцать или больше карт артефактов, целевой оппонент проигрывает партию.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71286346-fc8f-4efd-bd95-12a36930a14f\', \'multiverseId\': 466038}, \'multiverseid\': 466038}, {\'name\': \'围攻秘罗地\', \'text\': \'于围攻秘罗地进战场时，选择秘罗地或非瑞克西亚。\\n•秘罗地～每当你施放神器咒语时，派出一个1/1无色秘耳衍生神器生物。\\n•非瑞克西亚～在你的结束步骤开始时，抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。然后若你坟墓场中有十五张或更多神器牌，则目标对手输掉这盘游戏。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb2ca066-a9fa-478d-8f1a-c6dd28066c82\', \'multiverseId\': 466292}, \'multiverseid\': 466292}, {\'name\': \'圍攻秘羅地\', \'text\': \'於圍攻秘羅地進戰場時，選擇秘羅地或非瑞克西亞。\\n•秘羅地～每當你施放神器咒語時，派出一個1/1無色秘耳衍生神器生物。\\n•非瑞克西亞～在你的結束步驟開始時，抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。然後如果你墳墓場中有十五張或更多神器牌，則目標對手輸掉這盤遊戲。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f0cf3e4-0d99-4095-91ef-22ba30d0c0cb\', \'multiverseId\': 466546}, \'multiverseid\': 466546}]', "[{'name': 'Mondklingen-Shinobi', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U} ({2}{U}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Mondklingen-Shinobi einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Illusion-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464262&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c1970dc-f3fe-4811-9147-c3d2991a03c2', 'multiverseId': 464262}, 'multiverseid': 464262}, {'name': 'Shinobi hojalunar', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U}. ({2}{U}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que la Shinobi hojalunar haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de criatura Ilusión azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ninja humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464516&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2ee583f-584a-4b1d-a210-8e96b2c54d2c', 'multiverseId': 464516}, 'multiverseid': 464516}, {'name': 'Shinobi lamelune', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U} ({2}{U}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Shinobi lamelune inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Illusion avec le vol.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464770&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b19f450-ec5a-4543-8d5e-337faa4a95d8', 'multiverseId': 464770}, 'multiverseid': 464770}, {'name': 'Shinobi della Lama Lunare', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U} ({2}{U}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Shinobi della Lama Lunare infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea una pedina creatura Illusione 1/1 blu con volare.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ninja Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465024&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8b6f33c9-f06b-4445-8034-524e564f8d04', 'multiverseId': 465024}, 'multiverseid': 465024}, {'name': '月刃の忍び', 'text': '忍術{2}{U}（{2}{U}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\n月刃の忍びがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、飛行を持つ青の１/１のイリュージョン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465278&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33b8fb91-66a9-4646-b471-14fffb071d7e', 'multiverseId': 465278}, 'multiverseid': 465278}, {'name': '달빛검 시노비', 'text': '인술 {2}{U} ({2}{U}, 당신이 조종하는 공격 중인 생물 중 방어당하지 않은 생물 한 개를 손으로 되돌린다: 당신의 손에서 이 카드를 탭되어 공격 중인 상태로 전장에 놓는다.)\\n달빛검 시노비가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 비행을 가진 1/1 청색 환영 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 닌자', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465532&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4265e4b8-dcc4-4776-8ac7-d4989223efff', 'multiverseId': 465532}, 'multiverseid': 465532}, {'name': 'Shinobi da Lâmina Lunar', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U} ({2}{U}, devolva para a mão um atacante que você controla que não tenha sido bloqueado: Coloque este card no campo de batalha de sua mão, virado e atacando.)\\nToda vez que Shinobi da Lâmina Lunar causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha de criatura azul 1/1 do tipo Ilusão com voar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465786&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '025deb4f-ec58-448c-a083-90bb554b8837', 'multiverseId': 465786}, 'multiverseid': 465786}, {'name': 'Синоби Лунного Клинка', 'text': 'Ниндзюцу {2}{U} ({2}{U}, верните незаблокированного атакующего под вашим контролем в руку: положите эту карту на поле битвы из вашей руки повернутой и атакующей.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Синоби Лунного Клинка наносит боевые повреждения игроку, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 синяя Иллюзия с Полетом.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Ниндзя', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466040&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '094fafde-d74e-4cdb-9ec3-85289eefd553', 'multiverseId': 466040}, 'multiverseid': 466040}, {'name': '月刃忍者', 'text': '忍术{2}{U}（{2}{U}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物移回其拥有者手上：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n每当月刃忍者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个1/1蓝色，具飞行异能的虚影衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466294&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ef8a16f-707d-47d0-8d2b-783751735ed7', 'multiverseId': 466294}, 'multiverseid': 466294}, {'name': '月刃忍者', 'text': '忍術{2}{U}（{2}{U}，將一個由你操控且未受阻擋的攻擊生物移回其擁有者手上：將此牌從你手上橫置放進戰場，且正進行攻擊。）\\n每當月刃忍者對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出一個1/1藍色，具飛行異能的虛影衍生生物。', 'type': '生物 ～人類／忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466548&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59372040-c250-4ce8-a9b1-c5c77d5f188f', 'multiverseId': 466548}, 'multiverseid': 466548}]", '[{\'name\': \'Morophon, grenzenloses Etwas\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nSowie Morophon, grenzenloses Etwas, ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nZaubersprüche des bestimmten Typs, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} weniger. Dieser Effekt reduziert nur die Menge an farbigem Mana, die du bezahlen musst.\\nAndere Kreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464204&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ea5f16f-1368-4976-82d4-5b80a84c4dcf\', \'multiverseId\': 464204}, \'multiverseid\': 464204}, {\'name\': \'Morophon, el Ilimitado\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nEn cuanto Morophon, el Ilimitado entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nTe cuesta {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} menos lanzar los hechizos del tipo elegido. Este efecto reduce solo la cantidad de maná de color que pagas.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b449b84c-d85e-478a-8387-25bc303bcf59\', \'multiverseId\': 464458}, \'multiverseid\': 464458}, {\'name\': "Morophon, l\'Abondant", \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nAu moment où Morophon, l\'Abondant arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes sorts du type choisi que vous lancez coûtent {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} de moins à lancer. Cet effet réduit uniquement la quantité de mana coloré que vous payez.\\nLes autres créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a89cdfde-9f61-40fe-9293-ab827a50f6b8\', \'multiverseId\': 464712}, \'multiverseid\': 464712}, {\'name\': "Morophon, l\'Illimitato", \'text\': "Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nMentre Morophon, l\'Illimitato entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nLe magie del tipo scelto che lanci costano {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} in meno per essere lanciate. Questo effetto riduce solo l\'ammontare di mana colorato che paghi.\\nLe altre creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+1.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5eac27b-c646-4bea-a3f6-bbe783b74e4a\', \'multiverseId\': 464966}, \'multiverseid\': 464966}, {\'name\': \'限りないもの、モロフォン\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードは常にすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n限りないもの、モロフォンが戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがその選ばれたタイプの呪文を唱えるためのコストは{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}少なくなる。この効果は、あなたが支払う色マナの点数のみを減らす。\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプであるクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13916c10-0190-4146-944c-6f89740f1f5a\', \'multiverseId\': 465220}, \'multiverseid\': 465220}, {\'name\': \'무한한 자, 모로폰\', \'text\': \'체인질링 (이 카드는 모든 생물 유형이다.)\\n무한한 자, 모로폰이 전장에 들어오면서, 생물 유형 한 가지를 선택한다.\\n당신이 발동하는 선택된 유형을 가진 주문들은 발동하는 데 {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}가 덜 든다. 이 효과는 당신이 지불하는 유색 마나만 줄일 수 있다.\\n당신이 조종하는 선택한 유형의 다른 생물들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 변신괴물\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f4991e3-4488-477f-9adb-f43e725c94d4\', \'multiverseId\': 465474}, \'multiverseid\': 465474}, {\'name\': \'Morophon, o Irrestrito\', \'text\': \'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nConforme Morophon, o Irrestrito, entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAs mágicas do tipo escolhido que você conjura custam {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} a menos para serem conjuradas. Este efeito diminui apenas a quantidade de mana colorido que você paga.\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo escolhido que você controla recebem +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5f10dd5-a9dc-4805-b847-b643ba03b14b\', \'multiverseId\': 465728}, \'multiverseid\': 465728}, {\'name\': \'Морофон, Безграничный\', \'text\': \'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nПри выходе Морофона, Безграничного на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nРазыгрывание заклинаний выбранного типа стоит для вас на {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} меньше. Этот эффект снижает только количество оплачиваемой вами цветной маны.\\nДругие существа выбранного типа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'741a2b0f-820a-49c3-b838-b5ad5344b657\', \'multiverseId\': 465982}, \'multiverseid\': 465982}, {\'name\': \'无形莫洛丰\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n于无形莫洛丰进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n你施放的该类别咒语减少{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}来施放。此效应仅减少你支付的有色法术力数量。\\n由你操控的其他该类别生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ea582c-6742-4470-953e-02dd9f1694d6\', \'multiverseId\': 466236}, \'multiverseid\': 466236}, {\'name\': \'無形莫洛豐\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物類別。）\\n於無形莫洛豐進戰場時，選擇一種生物類別。\\n你施放的該類別咒語減少{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}來施放。此效應僅減少你支付的有色魔法力數量。\\n由你操控的其他該類別生物得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～變形獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f77e91-2004-47b3-babc-ed5d97ad4e9e\', \'multiverseId\': 466490}, \'multiverseid\': 466490}]', '[{\'name\': \'Munitionsexperte\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn der Munitionsexperte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ihn einer Kreatur oder einem Planeswalker deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen, wie du Goblins kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du es mit Goblins zu tun hast, kommt alles angeflogen, was nicht festgenagelt ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464412&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e42a460f-e741-4a29-9d22-c99200a29a61\', \'multiverseId\': 464412}, \'multiverseid\': 464412}, {\'name\': \'Experto en municiones\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando el Experto en municiones entre al campo de batalla, puedes hacer que le haga una cantidad de daño a la criatura o planeswalker objetivo igual a la cantidad de Trasgos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando tratas con trasgos, si algo no está anclado, seguro que se dirige hacia ti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee55b9b3-b788-4ac8-9640-cd204e0c0d97\', \'multiverseId\': 464666}, \'multiverseid\': 464666}, {\'name\': \'Expert en munitions\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand l\'Expert en munitions arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez faire qu\'il inflige à une cible, créature ou planeswalker, un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de gobelins que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': "Quand vous affrontez des gobelins, tout ce qui n\'est pas cloué au sol vole dans votre direction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464920&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49210d1d-fe72-4048-a7ef-885e77eab126\', \'multiverseId\': 464920}, \'multiverseid\': 464920}, {\'name\': \'Esperto di Munizioni\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando l\'Esperto di Munizioni entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi fargli infliggere a una creatura o a un planeswalker bersaglio danno pari al numero di Goblin che controlli.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Se hai a che fare con i goblin, tutto ciò che non è inchiodato a terra ti verrà scaraventato contro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab06de25-e137-4afc-a28a-46b39c1968b2\', \'multiverseId\': 465174}, \'multiverseid\': 465174}, {\'name\': \'飛び道具の達人\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛び道具の達人が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。あなたは「飛び道具の達人はそれに、あなたがコントロールしているゴブリンの総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'ゴブリンを相手にする際は、押さえつけておかないと、あなたに向かってくる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93efd006-23c8-49ce-a055-0345d20a6f6b\', \'multiverseId\': 465428}, \'multiverseid\': 465428}, {\'name\': \'군수품 전문가\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n군수품 전문가가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 군수품 전문가가 그 목표에게 당신이 조종하는 고블린의 수만큼의 피해를 입히게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린\', \'flavor\': \'고블린들을 상대할 때는, 확실하게 처리하지 않으면 계속해서 공격해 온다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c5ee055-e053-4ecb-8736-0b2fe869f972\', \'multiverseId\': 465682}, \'multiverseid\': 465682}, {\'name\': \'Especialista em Municiamento\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Especialista em Municiamento entra no campo de batalha, você pode fazer com que ele cause à criatura ou ao planeswalker alvo dano igual ao número de Goblins que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Quando se trata de Goblins, tudo o que não está cravado no chão está vindo pra cima de você.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64bd19e4-f118-47f0-a397-53483b4dade8\', \'multiverseId\': 465936}, \'multiverseid\': 465936}, {\'name\': \'Знаток Вооружений\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Знаток Вооружений выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заставить его нанести целевому существу или planeswalker-у повреждения, равные количеству Гоблинов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин\', \'flavor\': \'Когда имеешь дело с гоблинами, запомни: если это не приколочено гвоздями, то этим в тебя швырнут.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35100ba7-4225-4ace-bc41-b1c8e727ed29\', \'multiverseId\': 466190}, \'multiverseid\': 466190}, {\'name\': \'军火专家\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当军火专家进战场时，你可以令它对目标生物或鹏洛客造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的鬼怪数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'在处理鬼怪时，如果没能一举搞定，它们便会向你冲来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a36b5dca-763a-4fdb-a462-1f37cdd83bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 466444}, \'multiverseid\': 466444}, {\'name\': \'軍火專家\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當軍火專家進戰場時，你可以令它對目標生物或鵬洛客造成傷害，其數量等同於由你操控的鬼怪數量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'在處理鬼怪時，如果沒能一舉搞定，它們便會向你衝來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0713e142-50ba-43e3-95e5-787be32af1a6\', \'multiverseId\': 466698}, \'multiverseid\': 466698}]', '[{\'name\': \'Murasa-Behemoth\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nDer Murasa-Behemoth erhält +3/+3, solange sich eine Länderkarte in deinem Friedhof befindet.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Der Verlust seiner Jagdgründe hat ihn noch viel gefährlicher gemacht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464375&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'172136f3-5923-4a49-87f2-abdd397f8f4f\', \'multiverseId\': 464375}, \'multiverseid\': 464375}, {\'name\': \'Behemot de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nEl Behemot de Murasa obtiene +3/+3 mientras haya una carta de tierra en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'La pérdida de sus territorios de caza lo volvió aún más peligroso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c067aaf-7815-484b-afb7-6acaf60dbbb0\', \'multiverseId\': 464629}, \'multiverseid\': 464629}, {\'name\': \'Béhémoth de Murasa\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nLe Béhémoth de Murasa gagne +3/+3 tant qu\'il y a une carte de terrain dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': "Perdre son terrain de chasse l\'a rendu d\'autant plus dangereux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c17037b7-9711-4241-80fd-70ed5613f509\', \'multiverseId\': 464883}, \'multiverseid\': 464883}, {\'name\': \'Behemoth di Murasa\', \'text\': "Travolgere\\nIl Behemoth di Murasa prende +3/+3 fintanto che c\'è una carta terra nel tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'La perdita dei suoi terreni di caccia lo rese ancora più pericoloso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'510b545d-65af-48a5-8459-1a733b9754fc\', \'multiverseId\': 465137}, \'multiverseid\': 465137}, {\'name\': \'ムラーサのビヒモス\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたの墓地に土地・カードがあるかぎり、ムラーサのビヒモスは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'狩場を失って一層危険になっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44fc3d21-6391-42c9-822f-ae5cf02b0c1b\', \'multiverseId\': 465391}, \'multiverseid\': 465391}, {\'name\': \'무라사 거대괴수\', \'text\': \'돌진\\n무라사 거대괴수는 당신의 무덤에 대지 카드가 있는 한 +3/+3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'자신의 사냥터를 잃고 나서 더 난폭해졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bb83745-a564-449a-96fc-8f0b4e4eb57d\', \'multiverseId\': 465645}, \'multiverseid\': 465645}, {\'name\': \'Behemoth de Murasa\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nBehemoth de Murasa receberá +3/+3 enquanto houver um card de terreno em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'A perda de seus territórios de caça só o tornou mais perigoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'876ad8a9-c846-4f51-9caa-010bd5cadc2d\', \'multiverseId\': 465899}, \'multiverseid\': 465899}, {\'name\': \'Чудище из Мурасы\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nЧудище из Мурасы получает +3/+3, пока у вас на кладбище есть карта земли.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Когда оно лишилось привычной территории для охоты, то стало еще опаснее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58185c1e-9301-4efd-a572-851e9df253c3\', \'multiverseId\': 466153}, \'multiverseid\': 466153}, {\'name\': \'姆拉撒贝西摩斯\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n只要你坟墓场中有地牌，姆拉撒贝西摩斯便得+3/+3。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'自从失去自己的狩猎场后，它就变得愈发凶险。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6adc95f-f6dd-4aa0-94c5-135a7ad5bd72\', \'multiverseId\': 466407}, \'multiverseid\': 466407}, {\'name\': \'姆拉撒貝西摩斯\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n只要你墳墓場中有地牌，姆拉撒貝西摩斯便得+3/+3。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'自從失去自己的狩獵場後，牠就變得愈發凶險。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'742cb013-e32b-420f-8b25-96d48baee807\', \'multiverseId\': 466661}, \'multiverseid\': 466661}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nantuko-Landwirt\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Nantuko-Landwirt ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Länderkarten abwerfen. Lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf den Nantuko-Landwirt und ziehe entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder Samen beweist Stärke und lehrt Geduld."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464376&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205698c4-cb7c-4cd3-88e5-bd245b9f6e79\', \'multiverseId\': 464376}, \'multiverseid\': 464376}, {\'name\': \'Cultivador nantuko\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cultivador nantuko entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar cualquier cantidad de cartas de tierra. Pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Cultivador nantuko y roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Todas las semillas albergan fuerza y enseñan paciencia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cd2b2e2-7d99-497d-ba14-f5358669ffb2\', \'multiverseId\': 464630}, \'multiverseid\': 464630}, {\'name\': \'Cultivateur Nantuko\', \'text\': "Quand le Cultivateur Nantuko arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser de n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de terrain. Mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Cultivateur Nantuko et piochez autant de cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature : insecte et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque graine renferme de la force et enseigne la patience. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdaef6cb-8c58-4eae-b67c-d44f7684b1cb\', \'multiverseId\': 464884}, \'multiverseid\': 464884}, {\'name\': \'Cultore Nantuko\', \'text\': \'Quando il Cultore Nantuko entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi scartare un qualsiasi numero di carte terra. Metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 sul Cultore Nantuko e pesca altrettante carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni seme racchiude forza e insegna pazienza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'775a4aa5-b0d8-409d-bb19-dc72fbc1500b\', \'multiverseId\': 465138}, \'multiverseid\': 465138}, {\'name\': \'ナントゥーコの養成者\', \'text\': \'ナントゥーコの養成者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは土地・カード望む枚数を捨ててもよい。それに等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターをナントゥーコの養成者の上に置き、それに等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「どの種子にも強さがあり、我慢の大切さを教えてくれる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ccb205-1b92-41b4-a744-f5a5418d73cb\', \'multiverseId\': 465392}, \'multiverseid\': 465392}, {\'name\': \'난투코 재배자\', \'text\': \'난투코 재배자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 대지 카드를 원하는 만큼 버릴 수 있다. 난투코 재배자에 그 수만큼 +1/+1 카운터를 올려놓고 그 수만큼 카드를 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 곤충 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"씨앗은 하나하나가 힘을 간직한 채로 인내심을 가르쳐 주지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15d5635-9b8e-4726-921f-6c438a3c9de9\', \'multiverseId\': 465646}, \'multiverseid\': 465646}, {\'name\': \'Cultivador Nantuko\', \'text\': \'Quando Cultivador Nantuko entra no campo de batalha, você pode descartar qualquer número de cards de terreno. Coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 em Cultivador Nantuko e compre aquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Inseto Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Toda semente contém força e ensina a dar valor à paciência."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18318c40-9144-43c5-a279-a610ba9e159a\', \'multiverseId\': 465900}, \'multiverseid\': 465900}, {\'name\': \'Нантуко-Возделыватель\', \'text\': \'Когда Нантуко-Возделыватель выходит на поле битвы, вы можете сбросить любое количество карт земель. Положите столько же жетонов +1/+1 на Нантуко-Возделывателя и возьмите такое же количество карт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Насекомое Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Каждое семя скрывает силу и учит терпению».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77ff6360-bccf-4fb0-be2f-77cb54d61080\', \'multiverseId\': 466154}, \'multiverseid\': 466154}, {\'name\': \'耕耘螳人\', \'text\': \'当耕耘螳人进战场时，你可以弃掉任意数量的地牌。在耕耘螳人上放置等量的+1/+1指示物且抓等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆虫／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「每颗种子都蕴含力量，教导耐心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cbeb53c-04af-4f92-ac4c-021348de8146\', \'multiverseId\': 466408}, \'multiverseid\': 466408}, {\'name\': \'耕耘螳人\', \'text\': \'當耕耘螳人進戰場時，你可以棄掉任意數量的地牌。在耕耘螳人上放置等量的+1/+1指示物且抽等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～昆蟲／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「每顆種子都蘊含力量，教導耐心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09c180ab-4eea-4d26-a5fa-86d913ed6b97\', \'multiverseId\': 466662}, \'multiverseid\': 466662}]', '[{\'name\': \'Narrenfresser\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nFliegend\\nVerschlingen 2 (Sowie diese Karte ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen opfern. Diese Kreatur kommt mit doppelt so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464293&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f44241e-8f55-4d2b-9fe9-d4f51d448f55\', \'multiverseId\': 464293}, \'multiverseid\': 464293}, {\'name\': \'Devorador de necios\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nVuela.\\nDevorar 2. (En cuanto esta carta entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con el doble de esa cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12b535e6-cd70-48b6-bb8b-44cb8a06fabd\', \'multiverseId\': 464547}, \'multiverseid\': 464547}, {\'name\': "Festoyeur d\'imbéciles", \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nVol\\nDévorement 2 (Au moment où cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier n\'importe quel nombre de créatures. Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux fois ce nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464801&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37d7ff72-1afd-4fac-ab44-efec5300d485\', \'multiverseId\': 464801}, \'multiverseid\': 464801}, {\'name\': \'Divoratore di Stolti\', \'text\': \'Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nVolare\\nDivorare 2 (Mentre questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare un qualsiasi numero di creature. Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al doppio delle creature divorate.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c092d62-1aaf-4677-b879-72cc6b797334\', \'multiverseId\': 465055}, \'multiverseid\': 465055}, {\'name\': \'愚者の饗宴者\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\n飛行\\n貪食２（これが戦場に出るに際し、あなたは望む数のクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げてもよい。このクリーチャーは、その数の２倍に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0013763-8a68-47c7-82fa-f5328a7fc8d1\', \'multiverseId\': 465309}, \'multiverseid\': 465309}, {\'name\': \'바보들을 삼키는 자\', \'text\': \'집합 (당신의 생물들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 이 주문을 발동하는 동안 탭하는 각 생물은 이 주문의 비용 중 {1} 또는 그 생물의 색 마나 한 개를 지불한다.)\\n비행\\n포식 2 (이 생물이 전장에 들어오면서, 당신은 원하는 수만큼 생물을 희생할 수 있다. 이 생물은 포식한 생물 수의 두 배만큼 +1/+1 카운터를 가지고 전장에 들어온다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e351a95-671e-43b9-8bd8-2d7af48f1c81\', \'multiverseId\': 465563}, \'multiverseid\': 465563}, {\'name\': \'Devorador de Tolos\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nVoar\\nDevorar 2 (Conforme esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar um número qualquer de criaturas. Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com o dobro daquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b44b41e0-c7cd-42d3-8070-09105b6c379e\', \'multiverseId\': 465817}, \'multiverseid\': 465817}, {\'name\': \'Пожиратель Глупцов\', \'text\': \'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nПолет\\nПожирание 2 (При выходе этого существа на поле битвы вы можете пожертвовать любое количество существ. Это существо выходит на поле битвы с количеством жетонов +1/+1 на нем, в два раза превышающим это число.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a53b6e7f-9c5f-4a9d-b8fd-51ce17eceb30\', \'multiverseId\': 466071}, \'multiverseid\': 466071}, {\'name\': \'愚者饕客\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n飞行\\n吞噬2（于该生物进战场时，你可以牺牲任意数量的生物。此生物进战场时上面有两倍于该数量的+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad255897-b08d-41d6-95d1-63954d5db72f\', \'multiverseId\': 466325}, \'multiverseid\': 466325}, {\'name\': \'愚者饕客\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒語能用你的生物來協助施放。你於施放此咒語時每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力。）\\n飛行\\n吞噬2（於該生物進戰場時，你可以犧牲任意數量的生物。此生物進戰場時上面有兩倍於該數量的+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惡魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a786c2-658e-432a-83e8-da1ad2794be3\', \'multiverseId\': 466579}, \'multiverseid\': 466579}]', "[{'name': 'Nebelsyndikat-Naga', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U} ({2}{U}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Nebelsyndikat-Naga einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie des Nebelsyndikat-Nagas ist.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Naga, Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464261&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94fda32f-3ef0-42e2-ad36-c81469066821', 'multiverseId': 464261}, 'multiverseid': 464261}, {'name': 'Naga del Sindicato de Niebla', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U}. ({2}{U}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que el Naga del Sindicato de Niebla haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha que es una copia del Naga del Sindicato de Niebla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ninja naga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464515&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e799d95-b7db-4c43-baff-3579f9db345a', 'multiverseId': 464515}, 'multiverseid': 464515}, {'name': 'Naga du Syndicat des Brumes', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U} ({2}{U}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Naga du Syndicat des Brumes inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton qui est une copie du Naga du Syndicat des Brumes.', 'type': 'Créature : naga et ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464769&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e16c8ea2-ee8a-4a96-a98a-4c8036ab140c', 'multiverseId': 464769}, 'multiverseid': 464769}, {'name': 'Naga del Sindacato della Bruma', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U} ({2}{U}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Naga del Sindacato della Bruma infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea una pedina che è una copia del Naga del Sindacato della Bruma.', 'type': 'Creatura — Ninja Naga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465023&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16ee3dd4-84d4-4d58-9ce7-2acc402719ed', 'multiverseId': 465023}, 'multiverseid': 465023}, {'name': '霧組のナーガ', 'text': '忍術{2}{U}（{2}{U}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\n霧組のナーガがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、霧組のナーガのコピーであるトークンを１体生成する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ナーガ・忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465277&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74f415f0-d5aa-40cd-9b9c-e73c4ccf210a', 'multiverseId': 465277}, 'multiverseid': 465277}, {'name': '안개 조직 나가', 'text': '인술 {2}{U} ({2}{U}, 당신이 조종하는 공격 중인 생물 중 방어당하지 않은 생물 한 개를 손으로 되돌린다: 당신의 손에서 이 카드를 탭되어 공격 중인 상태로 전장에 놓는다.)\\n안개 조직 나가가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 안개 조직 나가의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 만든다.', 'type': '생물 — 나가 닌자', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465531&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce1ad3a7-b606-47fc-b176-c013685387ca', 'multiverseId': 465531}, 'multiverseid': 465531}, {'name': 'Naga do Sindicato das Brumas', 'text': 'Ninjutsu {2}{U} ({2}{U}, devolva para a mão um atacante que você controla que não tenha sido bloqueado: Coloque este card no campo de batalha de sua mão, virado e atacando.)\\nToda vez que Naga do Sindicato das Brumas causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia de Naga do Sindicato das Brumas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Naga Ninja', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465785&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96ac56ed-9166-46fe-9923-8531fe1d3b19', 'multiverseId': 465785}, 'multiverseid': 465785}, {'name': 'Нага из Картеля Тумана', 'text': 'Ниндзюцу {2}{U} ({2}{U}, верните незаблокированного атакующего под вашим контролем в руку: положите эту карту на поле битвы из вашей руки повернутой и атакующей.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Нага из Картеля Тумана наносит боевые повреждения игроку, создайте одну фишку, являющуюся копией Наги из Картеля Тумана.', 'type': 'Существо — Нага Ниндзя', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466039&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2730bd54-da39-4bd7-92bb-07aac5480e42', 'multiverseId': 466039}, 'multiverseid': 466039}, {'name': '潜雾帮那伽', 'text': '忍术{2}{U}（{2}{U}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物移回其拥有者手上：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n每当潜雾帮那伽对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个衍生物，此衍生物为潜雾帮那伽的复制品。', 'type': '生物 ～那伽／忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466293&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1c4d4b7-74e1-4b21-acec-05bbc1dad2a8', 'multiverseId': 466293}, 'multiverseid': 466293}, {'name': '潛霧幫那伽', 'text': '忍術{2}{U}（{2}{U}，將一個由你操控且未受阻擋的攻擊生物移回其擁有者手上：將此牌從你手上橫置放進戰場，且正進行攻擊。）\\n每當潛霧幫那伽對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出一個衍生物，此衍生物為潛霧幫那伽的複製品。', 'type': '生物 ～那伽／忍者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466547&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cae4b07-88fa-4b8b-ac76-1d82b37c1e53', 'multiverseId': 466547}, 'multiverseid': 466547}]", '[{\'name\': \'Negierungskraft\', \'text\': \'Falls es nicht dein Zug ist, kannst du eine blaue Karte aus deiner Hand ins Exil schicken, anstatt die Manakosten dieses Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen.\\nNeutralisiere einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Falls der Zauberspruch auf diese Weise neutralisiert wird, schicke ihn ins Exil, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Versuche es, wenn du unbedingt musst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464255&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3917699c-3136-4479-baf5-f5a9856f13e1\', \'multiverseId\': 464255}, \'multiverseid\': 464255}, {\'name\': \'Fuerza de la negación\', \'text\': \'Si no es tu turno, puedes exiliar una carta azul de tu mano en vez de pagar el coste de maná de este hechizo.\\nContrarresta el hechizo objetivo que no sea de criatura. Si ese hechizo es contrarrestado de esta manera, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Inténtalo si tanto lo deseas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86efe961-0a96-4634-8f94-576035bb01eb\', \'multiverseId\': 464509}, \'multiverseid\': 464509}, {\'name\': \'Force de négation\', \'text\': "Si ce n\'est pas votre tour, vous pouvez exiler une carte bleue de votre main à la place de payer le coût de mana de ce sort.\\nContrecarrez le sort non-créature ciblé. Si ce sort est contrecarré de cette manière, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Essayez, si vous insistez. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464763&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9695c16-0a04-435b-a545-a1ee6cee49c6\', \'multiverseId\': 464763}, \'multiverseid\': 464763}, {\'name\': \'Forza della Negazione\', \'text\': \'Se non è il tuo turno, puoi esiliare una carta blu dalla tua mano invece di pagare il costo di mana di questa magia.\\nNeutralizza una magia non creatura bersaglio. Se quella magia è neutralizzata in questo modo, esiliala invece di metterla nel cimitero del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Provaci, se proprio devi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f780187-531c-4a06-9525-0c579c109655\', \'multiverseId\': 465017}, \'multiverseid\': 465017}, {\'name\': \'否定の力\', \'text\': \'あなたのターンでないなら、あなたはこの呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、あなたの手札から青のカード１枚を追放してもよい。\\nクリーチャーでない呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。これによりその呪文が打ち消されたなら、それをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「是非にと言うなら試すがいい。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64263968-0ebb-4cb7-8e4d-2c397b591457\', \'multiverseId\': 465271}, \'multiverseid\': 465271}, {\'name\': \'부정의 힘\', \'text\': \'당신의 턴이 아니라면, 당신은 이 주문의 마나 비용을 지불하는 대신 당신의 손에서 청색 카드 한 장을 추방할 수 있다.\\n생물이 아닌 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 그 주문이 이런 식으로 무효화되면, 그 주문을 소유자의 무덤에 넣는 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"해 봐, 꼭 해야겠다면."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d3dcec2-3162-43cc-96dd-2a90c315189f\', \'multiverseId\': 465525}, \'multiverseid\': 465525}, {\'name\': \'Força da Negação\', \'text\': \'Se não for o seu turno, você pode exilar um card azul de sua mão em vez de pagar o custo de mana desta mágica.\\nAnule a mágica alvo que não seja de criatura. Se aquela mágica for anulada dessa maneira, exile-a em vez de colocá-la no cemitério de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Você pode até tentar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91ed852f-d7ac-4735-bfa0-be909cc4b3b1\', \'multiverseId\': 465779}, \'multiverseid\': 465779}, {\'name\': \'Сила Отрицания\', \'text\': \'Если это не ваш ход, вы можете изгнать синюю карту из вашей руки вместо уплаты мана-стоимости этого заклинания.\\nОтмените целевое заклинание, не являющееся заклинанием существа. Если то заклинание отменяется таким образом, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить его на кладбище его владельца.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Что ж, попробуй, если тебе так угодно».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'001e3b4e-2726-49c4-8e53-ae7e29f49c31\', \'multiverseId\': 466033}, \'multiverseid\': 466033}, {\'name\': \'否认之力\', \'text\': \'如果当前不是你的回合，则你可以从你手上放逐一张蓝色牌，而不支付此咒语的法术力费用。\\n反击目标非生物咒语。如果以此法反击该咒语，则改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「想试试看就来呀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c88b18-ed78-4f03-a946-bfc7a4ee9024\', \'multiverseId\': 466287}, \'multiverseid\': 466287}, {\'name\': \'否認之力\', \'text\': \'如果當前不是你的回合，則你可以從你手上放逐一張藍色牌，而不支付此咒語的魔法力費用。\\n反擊目標非生物咒語。如果以此法反擊該咒語，則改為將它放逐，而非置入其擁有者的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「想試試看就來呀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a75f43db-2fdb-4732-927d-6c887155b172\', \'multiverseId\': 466541}, \'multiverseid\': 466541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Netzwebender Wandelwicht\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nReichweite\\nWenn der Netzwebende Wandelwicht ins Spiel kommt und falls sich drei oder mehr Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof befinden, erhältst du 5 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Acht Beine tragen endlose Phobien.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464395&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33f7f235-4acc-4ce6-8ce7-c049f10197b3\', \'multiverseId\': 464395}, \'multiverseid\': 464395}, {\'name\': \'Cambiaformas tejetelas\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nAlcance.\\nCuando la Cambiaformas tejetelas entre al campo de batalla, si hay tres o más cartas de criatura en tu cementerio, ganas 5 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Ocho patas que sostienen un sinnúmero de fobias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'416c420e-9e7b-415d-aa29-e90b63c9e349\', \'multiverseId\': 464649}, \'multiverseid\': 464649}, {\'name\': \'Changelin tissetoile\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nPortée\\nQuand le Changelin tissetoile arrive sur le champ de bataille, s\'il y a au moins trois cartes de créature dans votre cimetière, vous gagnez 5 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': \'Huit pattes qui occasionnent une infinité de phobies.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464903&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f462a78-b571-409a-a7e3-910e1a420068\', \'multiverseId\': 464903}, \'multiverseid\': 464903}, {\'name\': \'Cangiante Tessitrama\', \'text\': \'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nRaggiungere\\nQuando il Cangiante Tessitrama entra nel campo di battaglia, se ci sono tre o più carte creatura nel tuo cimitero, guadagni 5 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Otto zampe che portano con sé infinite fobie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dbaabca-92c6-433d-817e-733f7da1e949\', \'multiverseId\': 465157}, \'multiverseid\': 465157}, {\'name\': \'巣網編みの変わり身\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードは常にすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n到達\\n巣網編みの変わり身が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にクリーチャー・カードが３枚以上ある場合、あなたは５点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'八本の足で限りない恐怖を運ぶ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4725db01-cb36-4546-94c4-c74138650734\', \'multiverseId\': 465411}, \'multiverseid\': 465411}, {\'name\': \'거미줄방직공 체인질링\', \'text\': \'체인질링 (이 카드는 모든 생물 유형이다.)\\n대공\\n거미줄방직공 체인질링이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 무덤에 생물 카드가 세 장 이상 있다면, 당신은 생명 5점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 변신괴물\', \'flavor\': \'여덟 개의 다리로 끝없는 공포를 몰고 다닌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'174ff746-e78b-48d5-8307-02784dfbfaec\', \'multiverseId\': 465665}, \'multiverseid\': 465665}, {\'name\': \'Morfoloide Teceteia\', \'text\': \'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nAlcance\\nQuando Morfoloide Teceteia entra no campo de batalha, se há três ou mais cards de criatura em seu cemitério, você ganha 5 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Oito pernas carregando intermináveis fobias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'112c2f5b-9967-4970-a60d-0bacaa6d3218\', \'multiverseId\': 465919}, \'multiverseid\': 465919}, {\'name\': \'Паутинный Перевертыш\', \'text\': \'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nЗахват\\nКогда Паутинный Перевертыш выходит на поле битвы, если на вашем кладбище есть не менее трех карт существ, вы получаете 5 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': \'Восемь ног несут бесчисленные фобии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffd9be1c-ddc3-4814-852c-bae8a4d33aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 466173}, \'multiverseid\': 466173}, {\'name\': \'织网化形\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n延势\\n当织网化形进战场时，若你坟墓场中有三张或更多生物牌，则你获得5点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'八条长肢满载无尽恐惧。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c6db4f1-4c21-4070-95fe-a5bc4f6528e3\', \'multiverseId\': 466427}, \'multiverseid\': 466427}, {\'name\': \'織網化形\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物類別。）\\n延勢\\n當織網化形進戰場時，若你墳墓場中有三張或更多生物牌，則你獲得5點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～變形獸\', \'flavor\': \'八條長肢滿載無盡恐懼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dce66095-2d9b-493d-b65f-dda26ffdba0d\', \'multiverseId\': 466681}, \'multiverseid\': 466681}]', '[{\'name\': \'Neues Leben\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Solange er Wurzeln hat, lebt der Baum weiter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464378&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80212a65-5cae-47c9-a733-9485aa20e1dd\', \'multiverseId\': 464378}, \'multiverseid\': 464378}, {\'name\': \'Reverdecer\', \'text\': \'Regresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El árbol vivirá mientras sigan ahí sus raíces.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49cc30a3-c036-446f-887c-ecf1032d5812\', \'multiverseId\': 464632}, \'multiverseid\': 464632}, {\'name\': \'Réapparition\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tant que la racine perdure, l\'arbre survit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464886&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78648134-58ea-41d7-ae53-d4465d8157b3\', \'multiverseId\': 464886}, \'multiverseid\': 464886}, {\'name\': \'Nuova Crescita\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Finché resta la radice, l\'albero sopravvive.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fbf832c-52b7-4f6b-9b6a-798ced8a6e27\', \'multiverseId\': 465140}, \'multiverseid\': 465140}, {\'name\': \'新たな芽吹き\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地からカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'根が残る限り、木は生き続ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'728594ba-87c4-47fe-a4ac-8b21f1e35acc\', \'multiverseId\': 465394}, \'multiverseid\': 465394}, {\'name\': \'재성장\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'뿌리가 남아 있다면, 나무는 아직 살아 있는 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47bb6cf5-aead-4eff-a22e-8364d5563f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 465648}, \'multiverseid\': 465648}, {\'name\': \'Recrescimento\', \'text\': \'Devolva o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto restarem raízes, a árvore viverá.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6374673-9e98-4882-865f-634dda83a18e\', \'multiverseId\': 465902}, \'multiverseid\': 465902}, {\'name\': \'Отрастание\', \'text\': \'Верните целевую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Пока остается корень, дерево живет.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9fdb9a8-e9c4-4347-83d2-7353e084a677\', \'multiverseId\': 466156}, \'multiverseid\': 466156}, {\'name\': \'再生新芽\', \'text\': \'将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'根若在，树便活。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6326d766-c31d-4810-95c7-45b79253c345\', \'multiverseId\': 466410}, \'multiverseid\': 466410}, {\'name\': \'再生新芽\', \'text\': \'將目標牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'根若在，樹便活。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a5900ac-5c2c-4d60-a239-33a660a42198\', \'multiverseId\': 466664}, \'multiverseid\': 466664}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ninja des Neumonds\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf deine Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Ninja\', \'flavor\': \'Die Nacht ist unser mächtigster Verbündeter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464302&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a853fcb1-25d2-458e-9663-5239b3932f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 464302}, \'multiverseid\': 464302}, {\'name\': \'Ninja de la luna nueva\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B}. ({3}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'La noche es la mejor aliada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9dccfc2-b9d3-477d-877a-e5fa515f30ac\', \'multiverseId\': 464556}, \'multiverseid\': 464556}, {\'name\': \'Ninja de la nouvelle lune\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et ninja\', \'flavor\': \'La nuit est sa plus grande alliée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464810&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeb022ca-b1dd-4412-88bb-d4b0b22cb6c1\', \'multiverseId\': 464810}, \'multiverseid\': 464810}, {\'name\': \'Ninja del Novilunio\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, Fai tornare in mano al suo proprietario una creatura attaccante non bloccata che controlli: Metti questa carta sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano TAPpata e attaccante.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Spirito\', \'flavor\': "La notte è l\'alleata migliore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c969e34c-9ea2-401c-8a63-6f7d36306d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 465064}, \'multiverseid\': 465064}, {\'name\': \'新月の忍者\', \'text\': \'忍術{3}{B}（{3}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされていない攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札からこのカードをタップ状態で攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・忍者\', \'flavor\': \'闇夜が何にも勝る同盟者である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f28bffd4-d607-4ed0-a668-887eeb3e7819\', \'multiverseId\': 465318}, \'multiverseid\': 465318}, {\'name\': \'새로운 달의 닌자\', \'text\': \'인술 {3}{B} ({3}{B}, 당신이 조종하는 공격 중인 생물 중 방어당하지 않은 생물 한 개를 손으로 되돌린다: 당신의 손에서 이 카드를 탭되어 공격 중인 상태로 전장에 놓는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령 닌자\', \'flavor\': \'밤이야말로 가장 강력한 아군이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8554a98-52cd-456c-9335-5c40e72ebed4\', \'multiverseId\': 465572}, \'multiverseid\': 465572}, {\'name\': \'Ninja da Lua Nova\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, devolva para a mão um atacante que você controla que não tenha sido bloqueado: Coloque este card no campo de batalha de sua mão, virado e atacando.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Ninja\', \'flavor\': \'A noite é a maior aliada de todas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a720b0d-cedf-4919-acb3-0e0624ec2e52\', \'multiverseId\': 465826}, \'multiverseid\': 465826}, {\'name\': \'Ниндзя Новолуния\', \'text\': \'Ниндзюцу {3}{B} ({3}{B}, верните незаблокированного атакующего под вашим контролем в руку: положите эту карту на поле битвы из вашей руки повернутой и атакующей.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух Ниндзя\', \'flavor\': \'Ночь — самый лучший союзник.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d245304-5610-4b4e-a92e-799e2dba8994\', \'multiverseId\': 466080}, \'multiverseid\': 466080}, {\'name\': \'新月忍者\', \'text\': \'忍术{3}{B}（{3}{B}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物移回其拥有者手上：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／忍者\', \'flavor\': \'夜色是最得力的战友。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e11cf31e-7f11-47d0-9d5c-56e6b1058a1b\', \'multiverseId\': 466334}, \'multiverseid\': 466334}, {\'name\': \'新月忍者\', \'text\': \'忍術{3}{B}（{3}{B}，將一個由你操控且未受阻擋的攻擊生物移回其擁有者手上：將此牌從你手上橫置放進戰場，且正進行攻擊。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈／忍者\', \'flavor\': \'夜色是最得力的戰友。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d49929a-c1e6-47f0-8b42-ac004146b2f5\', \'multiverseId\': 466588}, \'multiverseid\': 466588}]', "[{'name': 'Nährendes Torfmoor', 'text': '{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere das Nährende Torfmoor: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'In seinen Schatten wird neues Leben geboren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464446&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30152183-dbad-4d81-aae1-6fb0f5ddec83', 'multiverseId': 464446}, 'multiverseid': 464446}, {'name': 'Turbera fértil', 'text': '{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {B} o {G}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Turbera fértil: Roba una carta.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Entre sus sombras nace nueva vida.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464700&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61100c4f-a611-489d-b6d1-6d1eaec0faa9', 'multiverseId': 464700}, 'multiverseid': 464700}, {'name': 'Tourbière nourricière', 'text': '{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Tourbière nourricière : Piochez une carte.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Une nouvelle vie naît dans ces ombres.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464954&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0868695-b9fa-4531-ad34-40943664d7a0', 'multiverseId': 464954}, 'multiverseid': 464954}, {'name': 'Torbiera Nutritiva', 'text': '{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Torbiera Nutritiva: Pesca una carta.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Tra le sue ombre nasce nuova vita.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465208&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96986f46-1aed-4108-b068-2961fa8c413c', 'multiverseId': 465208}, 'multiverseid': 465208}, {'name': '育成泥炭地', 'text': '{T}, １点のライフを支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{G}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 育成泥炭地を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'この影から新しい命が生まれる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465462&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b6f093e-e0af-44c4-ad4a-aaa7f49eb83b', 'multiverseId': 465462}, 'multiverseid': 465462}, {'name': '비옥한 이탄지', 'text': '{T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: {B} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.\\n{1}, {T}, 비옥한 이탄지를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '그 그림자 속에서 새로운 생명이 태어난다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465716&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ba1c110-ac58-40f8-bc26-2768311fc3d1', 'multiverseId': 465716}, 'multiverseid': 465716}, {'name': 'Turfeira Nutriz', 'text': '{T}, pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione {B} ou {G}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Turfeira Nutriz: Compre um card.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Em suas sombras nasce vida nova.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465970&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f806d77-196e-4b2e-86ac-47f3ec01adec', 'multiverseId': 465970}, 'multiverseid': 465970}, {'name': 'Плодородный Торфяник', 'text': '{T}, заплатите 1 жизнь: добавьте {B} или {G}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Плодородный Торфяник: возьмите карту.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'В его тенях рождается новая жизнь.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466224&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2dd51a41-3fe4-4de3-8ae1-f8b63c95e7c2', 'multiverseId': 466224}, 'multiverseid': 466224}, {'name': '生机泥地', 'text': '{T}，支付1点生命：加{B}或{G}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲生机泥地：抓一张牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '阴影之处却在孕育新生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466478&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5a18664-9e78-42b1-8ae0-533084f59dde', 'multiverseId': 466478}, 'multiverseid': 466478}, {'name': '生機泥地', 'text': '{T}，支付1點生命：加{B}或{G}。\\n{1}，{T}，犧牲生機泥地：抽一張牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '陰影之處卻在孕育新生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466732&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '559c477c-1a2b-4d05-906b-e3b108ed406d', 'multiverseId': 466732}, 'multiverseid': 466732}]", '[{\'name\': \'Offenbarung der Gletscher\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an verschneiten bleibenden Karten auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die unwirtlichsten Umgebungen bieten die besten Gelegenheiten für Erkundungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464370&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a5a0b4-32a3-46a0-8167-d14be963dcbb\', \'multiverseId\': 464370}, \'multiverseid\': 464370}, {\'name\': \'Revelación glacial\', \'text\': \'Muestra las seis primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en tu mano cualquier cantidad de cartas de permanente nevado que se encuentren entre ellas. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los entornos más duros ofrecen las mayores oportunidades de exploración.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d05cab3-f048-4dc6-8423-1029500b4362\', \'multiverseId\': 464624}, \'multiverseid\': 464624}, {\'name\': \'Révélation glaciale\', \'text\': "Révélez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de permanent neigeux parmi elles dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les environnements les plus extrêmes offrent les meilleures chances d\'exploration.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464878&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc33bbc3-7f04-4e3e-a7a8-198514a7697d\', \'multiverseId\': 464878}, \'multiverseid\': 464878}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Glaciale\', \'text\': \'Rivela le prime sei carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi aggiungere alla tua mano un qualsiasi numero di carte permanente neve scelte tra esse. Metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli ambienti più ostili offrono le più grandi opportunità di esplorazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef43f416-cf24-401f-a4fe-a79543726458\', \'multiverseId\': 465132}, \'multiverseid\': 465132}, {\'name\': \'氷河の啓示\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを６枚公開する。あなたは、その中から望む枚数の氷雪パーマネント・カードをあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最も過酷な環境には、偉大な探検の機会がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'441bce9c-c21d-40ca-abe8-155ed04ce335\', \'multiverseId\': 465386}, \'multiverseid\': 465386}, {\'name\': \'빙하의 계시\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 여섯 장을 공개한다. 당신은 그중 눈 지속물 카드들을 원하는 만큼 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지는 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'가장 혹독한 환경이야말로 탐험을 위한 최고의 기회를 제공해 준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c12462ec-4b89-47d2-a9c5-000ccd56bfee\', \'multiverseId\': 465640}, \'multiverseid\': 465640}, {\'name\': \'Revelação Glacial\', \'text\': \'Revele os seis cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar qualquer número de cards de permanentes da neve dentre eles em sua mão. Coloque o restante em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os ambientes mais hostis oferecem as maiores oportunidades de exploração.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c91fb3-e525-496b-a759-7f9d9b81bb07\', \'multiverseId\': 465894}, \'multiverseid\': 465894}, {\'name\': \'Ледяное Откровение\', \'text\': \'Покажите шесть верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить любое количество находящихся среди них карт снежных перманентов в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В самых суровых краях исследователям зачастую открываются самые лучшие возможности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3196216-d665-4e18-a5dd-ea7930243bc4\', \'multiverseId\': 466148}, \'multiverseid\': 466148}, {\'name\': \'冰河启示\', \'text\': \'展示你牌库顶的六张牌。你可以将其中任意数量的雪境永久物牌置于你手上。将其余的牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'最严酷的环境便是探索的最好机会。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc676dbd-9f4d-4a24-8caa-6e78146c53fa\', \'multiverseId\': 466402}, \'multiverseid\': 466402}, {\'name\': \'冰河啟示\', \'text\': \'展示你牌庫頂的六張牌。你可以將其中任意數量的雪境永久物牌置於你手上。將其餘的牌置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'最嚴酷的環境便是探索的最好機會。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08eb4914-9a33-4706-a062-b8c10128057c\', \'multiverseId\': 466656}, \'multiverseid\': 466656}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oneirophage\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Oneirophagen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kalmar, Illusion\', \'flavor\': \'Er manifestiert sich in magischen Akademien, um die Inspiration junger Talente abzusaugen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4937ba92-a6d9-4332-98a8-e9caa11f7d83\', \'multiverseId\': 464263}, \'multiverseid\': 464263}, {\'name\': \'Onirófago\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Onirófago.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión calamar\', \'flavor\': \'Se manifiesta en las academias de hechicería para fagocitar la inspiración de los jóvenes prodigios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'226b1cd3-057f-486e-a28b-1cbba90b2f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 464517}, \'multiverseid\': 464517}, {\'name\': \'Onirophage\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur l\'Onirophage.", \'type\': \'Créature : calamar et illusion\', \'flavor\': "Il se manifeste dans les académies de sorciers pour siphonner l\'inspiration des jeunes prodiges.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464771&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d9d79d6-18ce-444b-8b3c-95d1f1ddb8d4\', \'multiverseId\': 464771}, \'multiverseid\': 464771}, {\'name\': \'Onirofago\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta peschi una carta, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Onirofago.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione Calamaro\', \'flavor\': "Si manifesta nelle accademie di maghi per assorbire l\'ispirazione dai giovani prodigi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13358c3f-1365-44d7-a0b5-142819b6bdba\', \'multiverseId\': 465025}, \'multiverseid\': 465025}, {\'name\': \'夢吸いイカ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがカードを１枚引くたび、夢吸いイカの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イカ・イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': \'魔法学院に現れて、若い天才から発想を吸い上げる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99be5f6c-34e2-4cd0-aaca-b56aff118a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 465279}, \'multiverseid\': 465279}, {\'name\': \'꿈을 먹어치우는 오징어\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 카드를 뽑을 때마다, 꿈을 먹어치우는 오징어에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 오징어 환영\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 마법사 학교에 나타나 젊은 천재들의 영감을 빨아들인다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd666163-cec8-43c3-b7d5-1c37d938085a\', \'multiverseId\': 465533}, \'multiverseid\': 465533}, {\'name\': \'Onirófago\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você comprar um card, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Onirófago.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lula Ilusão\', \'flavor\': \'Ele se manifesta em academias de magos para drenar a inspiração de jovens prodígios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd0b485-cd47-4968-ac2d-2152137eb034\', \'multiverseId\': 465787}, \'multiverseid\': 465787}, {\'name\': \'Онейрофаг\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы берете карту, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Онейрофага.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кальмар Иллюзия\', \'flavor\': \'Он появляется в академиях волшебства, чтобы вытягивать вдохновение из юных дарований.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'356407ad-f0bc-4a88-b521-b7f0b7f8caca\', \'multiverseId\': 466041}, \'multiverseid\': 466041}, {\'name\': \'噬梦蛸\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你抓一张牌时，在噬梦蛸上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～乌贼／虚影\', \'flavor\': \'它常常现身法师学院，汲取青年逸才脑中灵感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a0ba7b-beea-417f-958e-fdd7b8086b90\', \'multiverseId\': 466295}, \'multiverseid\': 466295}, {\'name\': \'噬夢蛸\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當你抽一張牌時，在噬夢蛸上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～烏賊／虛影\', \'flavor\': \'牠常常現身法師學院，汲取青年逸才腦中靈感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cbc00c2-e84e-424a-bd34-f4cbfb839c79\', \'multiverseId\': 466549}, \'multiverseid\': 466549}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ork-Radauschwester\', \'text\': \'Echo {R} (Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls diese bleibende Karte seit Beginn deines letzten Versorgungssegments unter deine Kontrolle gekommen ist, opfere sie, es sei denn, du bezahlst ihre Echokosten.)\\nWenn die Ork-Radauschwester stirbt, fügt sie einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464339&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f61403-148c-4435-9340-f48ff48420c2\', \'multiverseId\': 464339}, \'multiverseid\': 464339}, {\'name\': \'Camorrista orca\', \'text\': \'Eco {R}. (Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si esta carta entró bajo tu control desde el comienzo de tu último mantenimiento, sacrifícala a menos que pagues su coste de eco.)\\nCuando la Camorrista orca muera, hace 2 puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02bf98d3-0528-44c4-abc2-11bce2c35ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 464593}, \'multiverseid\': 464593}, {\'name\': \'Godailleuse orque\', \'text\': "Écho {R} (Au début de votre entretien, si ce permanent est passé sous votre contrôle depuis le début de votre dernier entretien, sacrifiez-le à moins que vous ne payiez son coût d\'écho.)\\nQuand la Godailleuse orque meurt, elle inflige 2 blessures à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464847&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6455b36e-427f-4c55-bd36-cf1ab08f0bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 464847}, \'multiverseid\': 464847}, {\'name\': \'Orchessa Rissosa\', \'text\': "Eco {R} (All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se questo permanente è entrato sotto il tuo controllo dall\'inizio del tuo ultimo mantenimento, sacrificalo a meno che non paghi il suo costo di eco.)\\nQuando l\'Orchessa Rissosa muore, infligge 2 danni a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99adc755-fdf9-4a66-af66-4c0187f7cf6d\', \'multiverseId\': 465101}, \'multiverseid\': 465101}, {\'name\': \'オークの厄介者\', \'text\': \'エコー{R}（あなたのアップキープの開始時に、これが直前のあなたのアップキープの開始時よりも後にあなたのコントロール下になっていた場合、これのエコー・コストを支払わないかぎりこれを生け贄に捧げる。）\\nオークの厄介者が死亡したとき、プレイヤー１人かプレインズウォーカー１体を対象とする。これはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba89de1-01ce-470c-b69a-41ea98152822\', \'multiverseId\': 465355}, \'multiverseid\': 465355}, {\'name\': \'오크 말썽꾼\', \'text\': \'에코 {R} (당신의 유지단 시작에, 이 생물이 당신의 지난 유지단 시작 이후로 당신의 조종하에 놓였다면, 당신이 에코 비용을 지불하지 않는 한 이 생물을 희생한다.)\\n오크 말썽꾼이 죽을 때, 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커를 목표로 정한다. 오크 말썽꾼은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 오크 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a92421d1-202e-41c6-893a-d3ea25e249f4\', \'multiverseId\': 465609}, \'multiverseid\': 465609}, {\'name\': \'Arruaceira Órquica\', \'text\': \'Eco {R} (No início de sua manutenção, se este card passou ao seu controle desde o início de sua última manutenção, sacrifique-o, a menos que você pague seu custo de eco.)\\nQuando Arruaceira Órquica morre, ela causa 2 pontos de dano ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Orc Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd0501e-e90e-42b8-8a64-5ff3e698950b\', \'multiverseId\': 465863}, \'multiverseid\': 465863}, {\'name\': \'Бесноватая Орчиха\', \'text\': \'Эхо {R} (В начале вашего шага поддержки, если этот объект попал под ваш контроль с момента начала вашего предыдущего шага поддержки, пожертвуйте его, если вы не заплатите его стоимость Эха.)\\nКогда Бесноватая Орчиха умирает, она наносит 2 повреждения целевому игроку или planeswalker-у.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Орк Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3447e5f-5479-4c20-affd-e07d7c72d70f\', \'multiverseId\': 466117}, \'multiverseid\': 466117}, {\'name\': \'半兽人恶煞\', \'text\': \'返响{R}（在你的维持开始时，若你在你前一个维持开始后才操控它，则除非你支付其返响费用，否则牺牲之。）\\n当半兽人恶煞死去时，它向目标牌手或鹏洛客造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半兽人／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33797a3a-109d-489c-90d4-6739363fcd50\', \'multiverseId\': 466371}, \'multiverseid\': 466371}, {\'name\': \'半獸人惡煞\', \'text\': \'返響{R}（在你的維持開始時，若你在你前一個維持開始後才操控它，則除非你支付其返響費用，否則犧牲之。）\\n當半獸人惡煞死去時，它向目標玩家或鵬洛客造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半獸人／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e840129-bb5c-4429-9090-8d8ec93ee63f\', \'multiverseId\': 466625}, \'multiverseid\': 466625}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pashalik Mons\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Pashalik Mons oder ein anderer Goblin, den du kontrollierst, stirbt, fügt Pashalik Mons einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\n{3}{R}, opfere einen Goblin: Erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Der Donnerkopf, der inmitten des Sturms die Richtung vorgibt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464341&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ff3c414-c70a-496e-a31f-62c47502c3ba\', \'multiverseId\': 464341}, \'multiverseid\': 464341}, {\'name\': \'Pashalik Mons\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Pashalik Mons u otro Trasgo que controlas muera, Pashalik Mons hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\n{3}{R}, sacrificar un Trasgo: Crea dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'El ojo que guía a la tormenta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65af60e2-06f7-47ee-943c-a6145fc392c5\', \'multiverseId\': 464595}, \'multiverseid\': 464595}, {\'name\': \'Pashalik Mons\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que Pashalik Mons ou un autre gobelin que vous contrôlez meurt, Pashalik Mons inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.\\n{3}{R}, sacrifiez un gobelin : Créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Sa tête des mauvais jours guide dans le mauvais temps.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464849&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a98ea7b-25df-432b-a04a-c96662a5ba99\', \'multiverseId\': 464849}, \'multiverseid\': 464849}, {\'name\': \'Pashalik Mons\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Pashalik Mons o un altro Goblin che controlli muoiono, Pashalik Mons infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\n{3}{R}, Sacrifica un Goblin: Crea due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Il rombo di tuono che precede la tempesta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0886e2c8-16f8-446c-a0a5-087b9e5c9116\', \'multiverseId\': 465103}, \'multiverseid\': 465103}, {\'name\': \'パシャリク・モンス\', \'text\': \'パシャリク・モンスか、他の、あなたがコントロールしているゴブリンが１体死亡するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１人かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。パシャリク・モンスはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\n{3}{R}, ゴブリン１体を生け贄に捧げる：赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'嵐を率いる積乱雲のごとく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4c20ebd-5ce7-436a-9165-b8fdb392fd55\', \'multiverseId\': 465357}, \'multiverseid\': 465357}, {\'name\': \'파샬릭 몬스\', \'text\': \'파샬릭 몬스 또는 당신이 조종하는 다른 고블린이 죽을 때마다, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 파샬릭 몬스는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다.\\n{3}{R}, 고블린 한 개를 희생한다: 1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 고블린 전사\', \'flavor\': \'폭풍을 부르는 소나기구름이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a96564d4-642b-476b-a200-f7d2fe0c533e\', \'multiverseId\': 465611}, \'multiverseid\': 465611}, {\'name\': \'Pashalik Mons\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Pashalik Mons ou outro Goblin que você controla morre, Pashalik Mons causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\\n{3}{R}, sacrifique um Goblin: Crie duas fichas de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'A nuvem negra que antecede a tempestade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b95a552e-3917-42c2-ade3-c2d18288a090\', \'multiverseId\': 465865}, \'multiverseid\': 465865}, {\'name\': \'Пашалик Монс\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Пашалик Монс или другой Гоблин под вашим контролем умирает, Пашалик Монс наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\\n{3}{R}, пожертвуйте Гоблина: создайте две фишки существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Удар грома, за которым следует буря.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9e889ff-cdc9-47bb-919b-6bacdf85abdf\', \'multiverseId\': 466119}, \'multiverseid\': 466119}, {\'name\': \'帕沙力克将军芒氏\', \'text\': \'每当帕沙力克将军芒氏或另一个由你操控的鬼怪死去时，帕沙力克将军芒氏对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\\n{3}{R}，牺牲一个鬼怪：派出两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'为风暴带队的雷电。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e76e47-5cac-4e68-a9f5-06dc7d12a4fe\', \'multiverseId\': 466373}, \'multiverseid\': 466373}, {\'name\': \'帕沙力克將軍芒氏\', \'text\': \'每當帕沙力克將軍芒氏或另一個由你操控的鬼怪死去時，帕沙力克將軍芒氏對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。\\n{3}{R}，犧牲一個鬼怪：派出兩個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～鬼怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'為風暴帶隊的雷電。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37986a5e-7f22-4784-a933-395decd8b9cc\', \'multiverseId\': 466627}, \'multiverseid\': 466627}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phantom-Ninja\', \'text\': \'Der Phantom-Ninja kann nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion, Ninja\', \'flavor\': \'„Ninjas können über Wasser laufen, Leitern aus ihren Taschen ziehen und mit einem Kuss töten. Dass manche sogar durch Mauern laufen können, halte ich für gelogen."\\n—Benden, Klatschmaul im Teehaus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464265&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9479b054-88f2-44ad-ad7c-e2fc20b20b03\', \'multiverseId\': 464265}, \'multiverseid\': 464265}, {\'name\': \'Ninja fantasma\', \'text\': \'El Ninja fantasma no puede ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja ilusión\', \'flavor\': \'"Dicen que los ninjas pueden correr sobre el agua, sacarse escaleras del bolsillo, matar con un beso y deslizarse entre ladrillos. Todo patrañas".\\n—Benden, charlatán de la tetería\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6b18ef9-9c13-4cd6-ac69-7c6ec5a78c17\', \'multiverseId\': 464519}, \'multiverseid\': 464519}, {\'name\': \'Ninja fantomatique\', \'text\': \'Le Ninja fantomatique ne peut pas être bloqué.\', \'type\': \'Créature : illusion et ninja\', \'flavor\': "« Les ninjas peuvent courir sur l\'eau, sortir des échelles de leur poche, tuer d\'un baiser et se faufiler entre des briques. À mon avis, ce n\'est qu\'un tissu de mensonges. »\\n—Berdenn, commère du salon de thé", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464773&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d60c3f2-5c44-400d-a423-7de1995fbe2e\', \'multiverseId\': 464773}, \'multiverseid\': 464773}, {\'name\': \'Ninja Fantasma\', \'text\': \'Il Ninja Fantasma non può essere bloccato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ninja Illusione\', \'flavor\': \'"I ninja possono correre sull\\\'acqua, estrarre scale dalle tasche, uccidere con un bacio e scivolare tra i mattoni. Per me sono una montagna di bugie."\\n—Benden, pettegolo della sala da tè\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'230bbc10-1348-46e9-859d-7e6eef6dc2c0\', \'multiverseId\': 465027}, \'multiverseid\': 465027}, {\'name\': \'幻影の忍者\', \'text\': \'幻影の忍者はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イリュージョン・忍者\', \'flavor\': \'「忍者は水上を走り、懐から梯子を出し、口づけで命を奪い、壁を抜けられるそうだ。全部でたらめだろうな。」\\n――茶店の噂好き、ベンデン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a6dc42a-4526-4b82-bf58-8ac1a72cee63\', \'multiverseId\': 465281}, \'multiverseid\': 465281}, {\'name\': \'환상 닌자\', \'text\': \'환상 닌자는 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 환영 닌자\', \'flavor\': \'"닌자들은 물을 가로지르고, 주머니에서 사다리를 꺼내고, 입맞춤으로 사람을 죽이고, 벽돌 틈 사이를 빠져나갈 수 있지. 내가 보기엔, 거짓말 덩어리야."\\n—찻집 수다쟁이, 벤덴\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d04d34e9-2459-4647-aecd-53e7bdc83dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 465535}, \'multiverseid\': 465535}, {\'name\': \'Ninja Fantasma\', \'text\': \'Ninja Fantasma não pode ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusão Ninja\', \'flavor\': \'"Os ninjas conseguem correr sobre a água, tirar escadas do bolso, matar com um beijo e passar entre tijolos. Na minha opinião é tudo mentira."\\n— Benden, fofoqueiro da casa de chá\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf8c173-0f9b-432d-b419-988ae4893db8\', \'multiverseId\': 465789}, \'multiverseid\': 465789}, {\'name\': \'Призрачный Ниндзя\', \'text\': \'Призрачный Ниндзя не может быть заблокирован.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Иллюзия Ниндзя\', \'flavor\': \'«Ниндзя могут бегать по воде, достать лестницу из кармана, убить поцелуем и проскользнуть меж кирпичей. Я лично думаю, что все это — просто выдумка».\\n— Бенден, болтун из чайного дома\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'916f47f3-dc05-404f-8399-928ff7918608\', \'multiverseId\': 466043}, \'multiverseid\': 466043}, {\'name\': \'幽魅忍者\', \'text\': \'幽魅忍者不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～虚影／忍者\', \'flavor\': \'「忍者能踏水而行，上天入地，一吻封喉，穿墙过隙。要我说，这些都是骗人的。」\\n～茶楼包打听本登\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dbb2bbf-45dd-4e5f-9412-852e905c629e\', \'multiverseId\': 466297}, \'multiverseid\': 466297}, {\'name\': \'幽魅忍者\', \'text\': \'幽魅忍者不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～虛影／忍者\', \'flavor\': \'「忍者能踏水而行，上天入地，一吻封喉，穿牆過隙。要我說，這些都是騙人的。」\\n～茶樓包打聽本登\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec6702d-469b-4257-b2cd-07fd021e5f65\', \'multiverseId\': 466551}, \'multiverseid\': 466551}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plünderung\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder ein Land deiner Wahl. Es kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Glut in der Asche unserer Häuser ist noch nicht erloschen, da stehen die Dörfer von Kjeldor schon in Flammen. Was sie angefangen haben, bringen wir zu Ende."\\n—Lovisa Coldeyes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464342&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a691ab12-ff34-4aef-a89c-1c7dfa021db7\', \'multiverseId\': 464342}, \'multiverseid\': 464342}, {\'name\': \'Saqueo\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto o tierra objetivo. No puede ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Las cenizas de nuestros hogares aún humean y los pueblos de Kjeldor ya arden en represalia. Terminaremos lo que ellos empezaron".\\n—Lovisa Ojosfríos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83d476af-d8ff-4322-aeec-58a689050b04\', \'multiverseId\': 464596}, \'multiverseid\': 464596}, {\'name\': \'Pillage\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé ou le terrain ciblé. Il ne peut pas être régénéré.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Les braises de nos demeures rougeoyaient encore que les villages de Kjeldor brûlaient déjà en représailles. Nous terminerons ce qu\'ils ont commencé. »\\n—Lovisa Froid Regard", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464850&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2911c465-b4ce-40bb-ba52-f89adb764925\', \'multiverseId\': 464850}, \'multiverseid\': 464850}, {\'name\': \'Saccheggio\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto o una terra bersaglio. Non possono essere rigenerati.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Le braci delle nostre case sono ancora roventi e i villaggi di Kjeldor bruciano già di vendetta. Ciò che hanno iniziato lo concluderemo noi."\\n—Lovisa Occhifreddi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e16a004-6bc4-443d-9143-e027cb9d2a1d\', \'multiverseId\': 465104}, \'multiverseid\': 465104}, {\'name\': \'略奪\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。それは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの家を焼いた火は未だくすぶり、キイェルドーの村々はすでに仕返しの炎で燃えている。向こうが始めたことだが、こちらが終わらせる。」\\n――冷眼のロヴィサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ac15090-d742-4018-a1c6-4a61ac4a5367\', \'multiverseId\': 465358}, \'multiverseid\': 465358}, {\'name\': \'약탈\', \'text\': \'마법물체 또는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다. 그 목표는 재생될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"고국의 전화는 아직도 꺼지지 않았고, 크옐도르의 마을들은 이미 보복을 당해 불타고 있다. 저자들이 시작한 것을, 우리가 끝맺으리라."\\n—차가운 시선의 로비사\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80899003-511f-4136-a2b7-2f766217869c\', \'multiverseId\': 465612}, \'multiverseid\': 465612}, {\'name\': \'Pilhagem\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato ou terreno alvo. Ele não pode ser regenerado.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"As brasas de nossos lares ainda ardem e as vilas de Kjeldor já queimam em retaliação. O que eles começaram nós vamos terminar."\\n— Lovisa Coldeyes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e4d5b5f-103b-4030-ba9f-33d200dc1ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 465866}, \'multiverseid\': 465866}, {\'name\': \'Разграбление\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или землю. Они не могут быть регенерированы.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Угли наших сгоревших домов еще тлеют, но в жителях Кьельдора уже горит огонь мести. То, что они начали, мы закончим».\\n— Ловиса Холодные Глаза\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd84bf16-061c-48bb-a227-9902b5da054c\', \'multiverseId\': 466120}, \'multiverseid\': 466120}, {\'name\': \'掠夺\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器或地。它不能重生。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们家园的余烬尚未熄灭，奇亚多的村庄就已燃起熊熊复仇烈火。他们挑起的祸端，定由我们来终结。」\\n～冷眼罗维莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aedbb0b1-7471-4944-a9ef-caec6ed71ca7\', \'multiverseId\': 466374}, \'multiverseid\': 466374}, {\'name\': \'掠奪\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器或地。它不能重生。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們家園的餘燼尚未熄滅，奇亞多的村莊就已燃起熊熊復仇烈火。他們挑起的禍端，定由我們來終結。」\\n～冷眼羅維莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'275b6801-ea2f-4a1e-9c86-7568b2a10c15\', \'multiverseId\': 466628}, \'multiverseid\': 466628}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prismatisches Panorama\', \'text\': \'{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt, opfere das Prismatische Panorama: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Schönheit liegt in der Ungewissheit des Potenzials.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464447&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a214206-fc6b-4beb-998c-0f1bccf8849d\', \'multiverseId\': 464447}, \'multiverseid\': 464447}, {\'name\': \'Vista prismática\', \'text\': \'{T}, pagar 1 vida, sacrificar la Vista prismática: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Hay belleza en la incertidumbre de lo potencial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0778f99d-c612-489b-9ff1-1bd25a4d8d87\', \'multiverseId\': 464701}, \'multiverseid\': 464701}, {\'name\': \'Vue prismatique\', \'text\': \'{T}, payez 1 point de vie, sacrifiez la Vue prismatique : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "L\'incertitude du potentiel recèle une certaine beauté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464955&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2736208-349e-4883-88c7-24720d81ccec\', \'multiverseId\': 464955}, \'multiverseid\': 464955}, {\'name\': \'Panorama Prismatico\', \'text\': \'{T}, Paga 1 punto vita, Sacrifica il Panorama Prismatico: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "C\'è bellezza nell\'incertezza del potenziale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'371d6a98-b386-434c-ac0f-2d4b91232c97\', \'multiverseId\': 465209}, \'multiverseid\': 465209}, {\'name\': \'虹色の眺望\', \'text\': \'{T}, １点のライフを支払う, 虹色の眺望を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探して戦場に出し、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'可能性の不透明感の中には美しさがある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6647f58f-0ddc-41c6-a58c-01209fb5180c\', \'multiverseId\': 465463}, \'multiverseid\': 465463}, {\'name\': \'무지개빛 풍경\', \'text\': \'{T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다, 무지개빛 풍경을 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아, 전장에 놓은 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'가능성의 불확실함에는 아름다움이 존재한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d81bee3a-31a8-4679-8eed-b8476d7273f1\', \'multiverseId\': 465717}, \'multiverseid\': 465717}, {\'name\': \'Vista Prismática\', \'text\': \'{T}, pague 1 ponto de vida, sacrifique Vista Prismática: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Há beleza na incerteza dos potenciais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59ebc7d3-cbed-4da9-a7bc-2e134babf7ba\', \'multiverseId\': 465971}, \'multiverseid\': 465971}, {\'name\': \'Радужная Теснина\', \'text\': \'{T}, заплатите 1 жизнь, пожертвуйте Радужную Теснину: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'В неопределенности потенциала есть своя красота.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31daf1c7-2875-4975-8c33-446d0a5badf7\', \'multiverseId\': 466225}, \'multiverseid\': 466225}, {\'name\': \'澈光远景\', \'text\': \'{T}，支付1点生命，牺牲澈光远景：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'未知的或然也是一种美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8712d7c7-20b1-47c9-94f2-6aac3745f068\', \'multiverseId\': 466479}, \'multiverseid\': 466479}, {\'name\': \'澈光遠景\', \'text\': \'{T}，支付1點生命，犧牲澈光遠景：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'未知的或然也是一種美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'874075f8-1149-4f90-89b7-7b11b5657d17\', \'multiverseId\': 466733}, \'multiverseid\': 466733}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prophezeiende Fee\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Prophezeiende Fee ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 2 an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Feenwesen, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Muster der brechenden Wellen offenbaren jenen die Zukunft, die sie zu lesen verstehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464254&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05b469b0-c717-4e8f-ac7a-e4a6e427bab0\', \'multiverseId\': 464254}, \'multiverseid\': 464254}, {\'name\': \'Vidente hada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Vidente hada entre al campo de batalla, adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero hada\', \'flavor\': \'"Los patrones de los círculos en el agua revelan el futuro a aquellos que saben leerlos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f380338f-5345-4db8-a8aa-f8810b3d9ebe\', \'multiverseId\': 464508}, \'multiverseid\': 464508}, {\'name\': \'Voyant faerie\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Voyant faerie arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 2.\', \'type\': \'Créature : peuple fée et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Le croisement des ondulations révèle l\'avenir à ceux qui savent comment les interpréter. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464762&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a19848-331a-4a07-89eb-df9694a64059\', \'multiverseId\': 464762}, \'multiverseid\': 464762}, {\'name\': \'Spiritello Veggente\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando lo Spiritello Veggente entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 2.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Spiritello\', \'flavor\': \'"I disegni tracciati dagli incroci delle increspature rivelano il futuro a chi sa come interpretarli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00696642-54ec-4dcc-a162-2d6ef6e9547e\', \'multiverseId\': 465016}, \'multiverseid\': 465016}, {\'name\': \'フェアリーの予見者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nフェアリーの予見者が戦場に出たとき、占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — フェアリー・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「交差する波紋の模様は、その読み方を知る者に未来を明かす。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7797bdb-0c3d-49dc-a018-d842abcdec60\', \'multiverseId\': 465270}, \'multiverseid\': 465270}, {\'name\': \'페어리 예언자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n페어리 예언자가 전장에 들어올 때, 점술 2를 한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 페어리 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"서로 겹치는 물결의 흔적은 그것들을 읽을 줄 아는 자들에게 미래를 보여 주지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a53b04f-d926-475e-8f21-1df822347497\', \'multiverseId\': 465524}, \'multiverseid\': 465524}, {\'name\': \'Vidente Fada\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Vidente Fada entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fada Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Os padrões das ondas entrecruzadas revelam o futuro aos que sabem lê-los."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa85dca-6e95-4ad0-8380-f2496be49402\', \'multiverseId\': 465778}, \'multiverseid\': 465778}, {\'name\': \'Фея-Провидец\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Фея-Провидец выходит на поле битвы, предскажите 2.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Фея Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Узоры ряби на воде открывают будущее тем, кто умеет их читать».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe5e5bb-b3d2-4c82-a679-fd4a3e8d3336\', \'multiverseId\': 466032}, \'multiverseid\': 466032}, {\'name\': \'仙灵预言师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当仙灵预言师进战场时，占卜2。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙灵／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「了解其中奥妙者，能够从涟漪交错的动向中读出未来。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1e6d910-9cc5-4fcd-b7a1-696c77285dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 466286}, \'multiverseid\': 466286}, {\'name\': \'仙靈預言師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當仙靈預言師進戰場時，占卜2。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～仙靈／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「瞭解其中奧妙者，能夠從漣漪交錯的動向中讀出未來。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'307b7533-edd8-4a34-9bf9-6b34124c6763\', \'multiverseId\': 466540}, \'multiverseid\': 466540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pyrophobie\', \'text\': \'Die Pyrophobie fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Feiglinge können in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich hasse das! Ich hasse Feuer! Ich hasse dich, weil du diese Route gewählt hast!"\\n—Norin der Vorsichtige\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464344&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd1e9a90-a776-442e-aaf3-cd714a9640c2\', \'multiverseId\': 464344}, \'multiverseid\': 464344}, {\'name\': \'Pirofobia\', \'text\': \'La Pirofobia hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Los Cobardes no pueden bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Odio todo esto! ¡Odio el fuego! ¡Te odio por llevarme por este camino!".\\n—Norin el Precavido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a56e25b-4d63-4ef2-95aa-8da10f8ff433\', \'multiverseId\': 464598}, \'multiverseid\': 464598}, {\'name\': \'Pyrophobie\', \'text\': \'La Pyrophobie inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée. Les couards ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Je déteste ça ! Je déteste le feu ! Je vous déteste pour m\'avoir fait prendre cette route ! »\\n—Norin le circonspect", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464852&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1f1dfe1-3c2b-4f39-a086-201f65f84048\', \'multiverseId\': 464852}, \'multiverseid\': 464852}, {\'name\': \'Pirofobia\', \'text\': \'La Pirofobia infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio. I Vigliacchi non possono bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Odio tutto questo! Odio il fuoco! E odio te per avermi portato su questo sentiero!"\\n—Norin il Diffidente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68e5af51-543f-4454-897f-6cd2d6ae3ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 465106}, \'multiverseid\': 465106}, {\'name\': \'炎恐怖症\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。炎恐怖症はそれに３点のダメージを与える。このターン、臆病者ではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ここは嫌だ！火は嫌だ！こんな所に連れてきやがって！」\\n――二の足踏みのノリン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f93caa7-2880-4873-9697-af598b257fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 465360}, \'multiverseid\': 465360}, {\'name\': \'불공포증\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 불공포증은 그 생물에게 피해 3점을 입힌다. 겁쟁이들은 이번 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"난 이게 싫어! 난 불이 싫어! 날 이리로 데리고 온 너도 싫어!"\\n—경계하는 노린\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a728f812-6347-4b0c-a826-a5dbedb9a444\', \'multiverseId\': 465614}, \'multiverseid\': 465614}, {\'name\': \'Pirofobia\', \'text\': \'Pirofobia causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Covardes não podem bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu odeio isso! Eu odeio fogo! Eu odeio você por me trazer por esse caminho!"\\n— Norin, o Cauteloso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e173c6cc-8077-4db0-a837-d680ba0d0c31\', \'multiverseId\': 465868}, \'multiverseid\': 465868}, {\'name\': \'Пирофобия\', \'text\': \'Пирофобия наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу. Трусы не могут блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ненавижу такое! Ненавижу огонь! И тебя ненавижу — зачем ты потащил меня этой дорогой?!»\\n— Норин Опасливый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d012c3da-f7de-4204-b0e9-f7fcfed50398\', \'multiverseId\': 466122}, \'multiverseid\': 466122}, {\'name\': \'惧焰症\', \'text\': \'惧焰症对目标生物造成3点伤害。懦夫本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我讨厌这样！我讨厌火！我讨厌你带我走这条路！」\\n～谨慎的诺林\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3eb683b-8934-432a-b400-5a6e8f919741\', \'multiverseId\': 466376}, \'multiverseid\': 466376}, {\'name\': \'懼焰症\', \'text\': \'懼焰症對目標生物造成3點傷害。懦夫本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我討厭這樣！我討厭火！我討厭你帶我走這條路！」\\n～謹慎的諾林\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e99cf51-f1ed-4802-84aa-6b63161099fe\', \'multiverseId\': 466630}, \'multiverseid\': 466630}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtiger Teufel\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nMorbide — {T}: Der Rachsüchtige Teufel fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls in diesem Zug eine Kreatur gestorben ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': \'Teufel lieben es, Salz in Wunden zu streuen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464355&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f5c3b7-363f-4d23-9966-8d820b81f5da\', \'multiverseId\': 464355}, \'multiverseid\': 464355}, {\'name\': \'Diablo vengativo\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nNecrario — {T}: El Diablo vengativo hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo. Activa esta habilidad solo si una criatura murió este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diablo\', \'flavor\': \'Los diablos creen que la venganza se sirve caliente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d3d8d4-4099-4ea7-af15-dc152283c739\', \'multiverseId\': 464609}, \'multiverseid\': 464609}, {\'name\': \'Diable vengeur\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nMorbidité — {T} : Le Diable vengeur inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible. N\'activez cette capacité que si une créature est morte ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : diable\', \'flavor\': \'Les diables adorent jeter du feu sur le feu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464863&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'908b1a7e-c6b3-4088-9633-97e90e12b06f\', \'multiverseId\': 464863}, \'multiverseid\': 464863}, {\'name\': \'Diavolo Vendicativo\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nMorboso — {T}: Il Diavolo Vendicativo infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio. Attiva questa abilità solo se è morta una creatura in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': \'I diavoli adorano il detto: "Oltre al danno, il danno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a71c5c-0f35-4510-a0b6-fce08e0da99f\', \'multiverseId\': 465117}, \'multiverseid\': 465117}, {\'name\': \'復讐に燃えた悪魔\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n陰鬱 ― {T}：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。復讐に燃えた悪魔はそれに１点のダメージを与える。この能力は、このターンにクリーチャーが死亡していたときにのみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': \'悪魔どもは傷に傷を重ねるのが大好きだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ef6fac-7a30-4007-999a-723f3c40acdf\', \'multiverseId\': 465371}, \'multiverseid\': 465371}, {\'name\': \'복수심에 불타는 악마\', \'text\': \'신속\\n사망 — {T}: 원하는 목표를 정한다. 복수심에 불타는 악마는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다. 이 턴에 생물이 죽었을 경우에만 이 능력을 활성화활 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악령\', \'flavor\': \'악마들은 상처에 상처를 더하는 일을 좋아한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6be2c83c-9632-4cbe-9517-302205dce6a6\', \'multiverseId\': 465625}, \'multiverseid\': 465625}, {\'name\': \'Diabo Vingativo\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nMórbido — {T}: Diabo Vingativo causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo. Ative esta habilidade somente se uma criatura tiver morrido neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Diabo\', \'flavor\': \'Diabos adoram adicionar injúria à injúria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b2e8064-3bf2-4c41-b69b-cb24e7308cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 465879}, \'multiverseid\': 465879}, {\'name\': \'Мстительный Дьявол\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nБолезненность — {T}: Мстительный Дьявол наносит 1 повреждение любой цели. Активируйте эту способность, только если в этом ходу умерло существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дьявол\', \'flavor\': \'Дьяволы любят подлить масла в огонь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f98f84c1-5337-483f-9bb3-608f99f4b7ac\', \'multiverseId\': 466133}, \'multiverseid\': 466133}, {\'name\': \'复仇魔鬼\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n丧心～{T}：复仇魔鬼对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。只能于有生物死去的回合中起动此异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'魔鬼喜欢在伤上加伤。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'145c219e-f9b5-4c57-9a61-e93671e1fa28\', \'multiverseId\': 466387}, \'multiverseid\': 466387}, {\'name\': \'復仇魔鬼\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n喪心～{T}：復仇魔鬼對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。只能於有生物死去的回合中起動此異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': \'魔鬼喜歡在傷上加傷。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94d674dc-fab7-457c-8d87-113f6ea8d2f9\', \'multiverseId\': 466641}, \'multiverseid\': 466641}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ranziger Offizier\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ranzige Offizier ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Jeder Gegner verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Er rekrutiert die Frischen und entledigt sich der Verfaulten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464305&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'584fc64f-7abd-47db-bf58-5f22ce875006\', \'multiverseId\': 464305}, \'multiverseid\': 464305}, {\'name\': \'Oficial de la ciénaga\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Oficial de la ciénaga entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio: Cada oponente pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Recluta lo fresco y descarta lo podrido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26721040-dd2e-4c5a-874f-4745ab658d55\', \'multiverseId\': 464559}, \'multiverseid\': 464559}, {\'name\': \'Officier pouacre\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Officier pouacre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Chaque adversaire perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Il recrute ceux qui sont frais et rejette les pourris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464813&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33bbec6d-30a6-4950-884f-eafce63b6199\', \'multiverseId\': 464813}, \'multiverseid\': 464813}, {\'name\': \'Ufficiale Fetido\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Ufficiale Fetido entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi scartare una carta. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, Esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero: Ogni avversario perde 2 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Recluta i freschi e scarta i putridi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a44ae9-fedc-48a1-99ab-8033594132f8\', \'multiverseId\': 465067}, \'multiverseid\': 465067}, {\'name\': \'生臭い士官\', \'text\': \'生臭い士官が戦場に出たとき、あなたはカード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{1}{B}, {T}, あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：各対戦相手はそれぞれ２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'新兵を集めては腐らせ捨てている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27c6447c-0bea-43e0-b0ec-fd2f5295d0a6\', \'multiverseId\': 465321}, \'multiverseid\': 465321}, {\'name\': \'악취 나는 지휘관\', \'text\': \'악취 나는 지휘관이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 카드 한 장을 버릴 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, 당신의 무덤에서 생물 카드 한 장을 추방한다: 각 상대는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 병사\', \'flavor\': \'신선한 시체는 모으고 썩은 시체는 집어던진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14a1cb4f-058c-490d-82ea-fe3018d0d667\', \'multiverseId\': 465575}, \'multiverseid\': 465575}, {\'name\': \'Oficial de Alta Pestilência\', \'text\': \'Quando Oficial de Alta Pestilência entra no campo de batalha, você pode descartar um card. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, exile um card de criatura de seu cemitério: Cada oponente perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Ele recruta a carne e joga fora o que está podre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae2bb8c5-0146-487e-9537-907225fe7859\', \'multiverseId\': 465829}, \'multiverseid\': 465829}, {\'name\': \'Зловонный Офицер\', \'text\': \'Когда Зловонный Офицер выходит на поле битвы, вы можете сбросить карту. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\\n{1}{B}, {T}, изгоните карту существа из вашего кладбища: каждый оппонент теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Он набирает свежих и выбрасывает прочь прогнивших.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc122a9f-0023-41f2-85ec-0b1bbbfb03fe\', \'multiverseId\': 466083}, \'multiverseid\': 466083}, {\'name\': \'朽气军官\', \'text\': \'当朽气军官进战场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\\n{1}{B}，{T}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌：每位对手各失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'它征召新尸，抛掷腐尸。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f133b57a-7df1-4c92-bb3e-607d4f0b4f50\', \'multiverseId\': 466337}, \'multiverseid\': 466337}, {\'name\': \'朽氣軍官\', \'text\': \'當朽氣軍官進戰場時，你可以棄一張牌。若你如此作，則派出一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\\n{1}{B}，{T}，從你的墳墓場放逐一張生物牌：每位對手各失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'它徵召新屍，拋擲腐屍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be738d85-51db-4652-9eac-c8bb3abfd7ee\', \'multiverseId\': 466591}, \'multiverseid\': 466591}]', "[{'name': 'Rauchschleier', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\\nWenn ein Ninja unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du den Rauchschleier aus deinem Friedhof an ihn angelegt ins Spiel zurückbringen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464272&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bebd5a26-e6e9-4a84-a6f6-dc197d16aba5', 'multiverseId': 464272}, 'multiverseid': 464272}, {'name': 'Velo de humo', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\\nCuando un Ninja entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes regresar el Velo de humo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla anexado a esa criatura.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464526&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c95562df-d2da-4b1b-b4f8-8f00d3583a08', 'multiverseId': 464526}, 'multiverseid': 464526}, {'name': 'Linceul de fumée', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a le vol.\\nQuand un ninja arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez renvoyer le Linceul de fumée sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière, attaché à cette créature.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464780&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97efd2d0-6f07-4b1c-b5b1-3fc3d856c772', 'multiverseId': 464780}, 'multiverseid': 464780}, {'name': 'Manto di Fumo', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha volare.\\nQuando un Ninja entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia il Manto di Fumo dal tuo cimitero assegnato a quella creatura.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465034&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6eb2b713-8224-4c59-9c4f-bcf7d562af73', 'multiverseId': 465034}, 'multiverseid': 465034}, {'name': '煙の覆い', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受け飛行を持つ。\\n忍者が１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出たとき、あなたはあなたの墓地から煙の覆いを、そのクリーチャーにつけられた状態で戦場に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465288&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc612733-f94c-4773-82bc-e7d0e7c80925', 'multiverseId': 465288}, 'multiverseid': 465288}, {'name': '연기 장막', 'text': '생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받고 비행을 가진다.\\n닌자가 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 당신의 무덤에 있는 연기 장막을 그 생물에 부착된 상태로 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465542&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbddb6e1-27b3-4730-8604-d77f7584d415', 'multiverseId': 465542}, 'multiverseid': 465542}, {'name': 'Manto de Fumaça', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem voar.\\nQuando um Ninja entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você pode devolver Manto de Fumaça de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha anexado àquela criatura.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465796&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aba4a8e3-3dcc-499b-abb3-6243bf41ecf0', 'multiverseId': 465796}, 'multiverseid': 465796}, {'name': 'Дымовая Завеса', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и имеет Полет.\\nКогда Ниндзя выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете вернуть Дымовую Завесу из вашего кладбища на поле битвы прикрепленной к тому существу.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466050&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1e8b456-6619-4cc4-92cc-475984a1db7e', 'multiverseId': 466050}, 'multiverseid': 466050}, {'name': '烟雾屏障', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有飞行异能。\\n当一个忍者在你的操控下进战场时，你可以将烟雾屏障从你的坟墓场移回战场并结附在该生物上。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466304&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60ed45e6-9f66-4672-9099-248704c39ddb', 'multiverseId': 466304}, 'multiverseid': 466304}, {'name': '煙霧屏障', 'text': '結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1且具有飛行異能。\\n當一個忍者在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以將煙霧屏障從你的墳墓場移回戰場並結附在該生物上。', 'type': '結界 ～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466558&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5658c511-fe32-4579-9a4f-1aac802c9e9c', 'multiverseId': 466558}, 'multiverseid': 466558}]", '[{\'name\': \'Regen der Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Als der Himmel sich auftat, rannten wir in Richtung Unterschlupf. Auf halber Strecke und schon klitschnass wurde mir klar, dass wir mehr davon haben, wenn wir ihn mit offenen Armen willkommen heißen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464268&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cba21561-a603-46c7-b372-8784a1ce6101\', \'multiverseId\': 464268}, \'multiverseid\': 464268}, {\'name\': \'Lluvia de la revelación\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"En cuanto el cielo se abrió, corrimos a buscar refugio. A medio camino me di cuenta de que, como ya estaba empapada, tenía más que ganar si dejaba que la lluvia cayera sobre mí que si huía de ella".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ec8f34-075b-4c49-9bae-09fd4bd587ed\', \'multiverseId\': 464522}, \'multiverseid\': 464522}, {\'name\': \'Pluie de révélation\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Lorsque la pluie a commencé à tomber, nous avons couru nous mettre à l\'abri. À mi-chemin, j\'ai soudain pris conscience qu\'étant déjà trempée, j\'avais peut-être plus à gagner à connaître la pluie qu\'à la fuir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464776&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'692f6263-9dc2-4305-bd96-10be59afd71c\', \'multiverseId\': 464776}, \'multiverseid\': 464776}, {\'name\': \'Pioggia di Rivelazione\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando il cielo si aprì, corremmo a cercare riparo. A metà strada, d\\\'improvviso mi resi conto che, essendo già inzuppata d\\\'acqua, potevo forse trarre maggior frutto accogliendo la pioggia invece di rifuggirla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4f0fcdc-3446-41fd-af91-678c29784cac\', \'multiverseId\': 465030}, \'multiverseid\': 465030}, {\'name\': \'啓示の雨\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「急な土砂降りに、屋根の下へと走りました。その途中、もうずぶ濡れでしたが、突然気付いたのです。雨から逃れるよりも、雨を体験した方が、多くを得られるのではないかと。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60a9d967-efd9-4ffc-969e-808ac3cc5ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 465284}, \'multiverseid\': 465284}, {\'name\': \'계시의 비\', \'text\': \'카드 세 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"하늘에서 비가 쏟아지자, 우리는 비를 피할 곳으로 달려갔다. 반쯤 도착했을 때쯤, 나는 이미 푹 젖은 채로 갑자기, 비에서 도망치는 것보다 비를 경험해 보는 것에서 얻는 것이 더 많을 지도 모른다는 것을 깨달았다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f264bcab-57ec-463b-a26f-29dbd9e7d6fb\', \'multiverseId\': 465538}, \'multiverseid\': 465538}, {\'name\': \'Chuva de Revelação\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando o céu se derramou, corremos em busca de abrigo. Na metade do caminho percebi que, já encharcado, poderia valer mais a pena aproveitar a chuva do que correr dela."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b6f246-70f8-4961-9292-a5779c2edb80\', \'multiverseId\': 465792}, \'multiverseid\': 465792}, {\'name\': \'Дождь Откровения\', \'text\': \'Возьмите три карты, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда разверзлось небо, мы побежали в укрытие. Но на полпути я внезапно поняла, что мы уже промокли — так что для нас будет полезнее остаться под дождем, а не убегать от него».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83de2df4-1805-43e9-a6ea-124e25f07a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 466046}, \'multiverseid\': 466046}, {\'name\': \'揭示之雨\', \'text\': \'抓三张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「天空突然暴雨倾盆，我们匆忙寻地躲避。但在找到半路时，我一时兴起：既然已全身湿透，为何不索性漫步雨中？这样或许能有更多收获。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ecd95c-9eab-4770-9c4e-99b822436ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 466300}, \'multiverseid\': 466300}, {\'name\': \'揭示之雨\', \'text\': \'抽三張牌，然後棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「天空突然暴雨傾盆，我們匆忙尋地躲避。但在找到半路時，我一時興起：既然已全身濕透，為何不索性漫步雨中？這樣或許能有更多收穫。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4498afd-597e-437f-9406-6c01c8c92284\', \'multiverseId\': 466554}, \'multiverseid\': 466554}]', "[{'name': 'Reihenweises Verschwinden', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Dann kann der Beherrscher der Kreatur {U}{U} bezahlen. Falls er dies tut, kann er diesen Zauberspruch kopieren und kann für die Kopie ein neues Ziel bestimmen.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464275&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20227e11-30c6-46ff-bd73-cf35487c279d', 'multiverseId': 464275}, 'multiverseid': 464275}, {'name': 'Desapariciones en cadena', 'text': 'Regresa la criatura objetivo a la mano de su propietario. Luego, el controlador de esa criatura puede pagar {U}{U}. Si lo hace, puede copiar este hechizo y puede elegir un objetivo nuevo para esa copia.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464529&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '12c8e8ec-67d5-4b9f-b51e-4b32db03cfd3', 'multiverseId': 464529}, 'multiverseid': 464529}, {'name': 'Chaîne de disparitions', 'text': 'Renvoyez une créature ciblée dans la main de son propriétaire. Ensuite, le contrôleur de cette créature peut payer {U}{U}. Si le joueur fait ainsi, il peut copier ce sort et peut choisir une nouvelle cible pour cette copie.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464783&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc01a0d4-2c21-4621-ae4a-ee8b075b5aa4', 'multiverseId': 464783}, 'multiverseid': 464783}, {'name': 'Sparizioni a Catena', 'text': 'Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario. Poi il controllore di quella creatura può pagare {U}{U}. Se il giocatore lo fa, può copiare questa magia e può scegliere un nuovo bersaglio per quella copia.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465037&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'def3fefd-5975-4038-bfcb-0628aa5b853f', 'multiverseId': 465037}, 'multiverseid': 465037}, {'name': '一連の消失', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。その後、そのクリーチャーのコントローラーは{U}{U}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、そのプレイヤーはこの呪文をコピーしてもよく、そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465291&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c9c35de-b0f6-4b6e-ba64-207a5c71d51e', 'multiverseId': 465291}, 'multiverseid': 465291}, {'name': '소실의 끈', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다. 그 후 그 생물의 조종자는 {U}{U}를 지불할 수 있다. 그 플레이어가 그렇게 한다면, 그 플레이어는 이 주문을 복사할 수 있고 그 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.', 'type': '순간마법', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465545&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a48cdb3d-e3fb-4bd0-aee1-75bc5aa6db5c', 'multiverseId': 465545}, 'multiverseid': 465545}, {'name': 'Sequência de Desaparecimentos', 'text': 'Devolva a criatura alvo para a mão de seu dono. Depois o controlador daquela criatura pode pagar {U}{U}. Se o jogador fizer isso, poderá copiar esta mágica e poderá escolher um novo alvo para a cópia.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465799&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f5dbfa3-bbac-4bed-840f-94a7289356db', 'multiverseId': 465799}, 'multiverseid': 465799}, {'name': 'Цепочка Исчезновений', 'text': 'Верните целевое существо в руку его владельца. Затем контролирующий то существо игрок может заплатить {U}{U}. Если тот игрок это делает, то он может скопировать это заклинание и может выбрать новую цель для той копии.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466053&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'faaa1dbe-9502-415e-8b51-441f475e97ef', 'multiverseId': 466053}, 'multiverseid': 466053}, {'name': '连环消失', 'text': '将目标生物移回其拥有者手上。然后该生物的操控者可以支付{U}{U}。如果该牌手如此作，则其可以复制此咒语，且可以为该复制品选择新的目标。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466307&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbd9b1b7-bcb8-4f8b-b37d-707898cbde1d', 'multiverseId': 466307}, 'multiverseid': 466307}, {'name': '連環消失', 'text': '將目標生物移回其擁有者手上。然後該生物的操控者可以支付{U}{U}。如果該玩家如此作，則其可以複製此咒語，且可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466561&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b434d70-ff99-43dd-bea1-f5f07bb3cfac', 'multiverseId': 466561}, 'multiverseid': 466561}]", '[{\'name\': \'Relief der Auserwählten\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Relief der Auserwählten ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{1}, opfere eine Kreatur des bestimmten Typs: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464401&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'148f9248-8b9c-4c04-b6f1-603a296440bd\', \'multiverseId\': 464401}, \'multiverseid\': 464401}, {\'name\': \'Grabados de los elegidos\', \'text\': \'En cuanto los Grabados de los elegidos entren al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del tipo elegido obtienen +1/+1.\\n{1}, sacrificar una criatura del tipo elegido: La criatura objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'820d1a9b-4a29-40b4-9ddf-47a3ec938959\', \'multiverseId\': 464655}, \'multiverseid\': 464655}, {\'name\': \'Gravures des Élus\', \'text\': "Au moment où les Gravures des Élus arrivent sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes créatures du type choisi que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{1}, sacrifiez une créature du type choisi : La créature ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464909&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc62cafe-77a0-437e-8062-7ff92b86e1e4\', \'multiverseId\': 464909}, \'multiverseid\': 464909}, {\'name\': \'Incisioni dei Prescelti\', \'text\': \'Mentre le Incisioni dei Prescelti entrano nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nLe creature che controlli del tipo scelto prendono +1/+1.\\n{1}, Sacrifica una creatura del tipo scelto: Una creatura bersaglio che controlli ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d008685a-eb24-477f-bb23-d29d2d1b0e7a\', \'multiverseId\': 465163}, \'multiverseid\': 465163}, {\'name\': \'選ばれしものの食刻\', \'text\': \'選ばれしものの食刻が戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプであるクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{1}, その選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2be9efa1-338b-4076-b562-030e55830f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 465417}, \'multiverseid\': 465417}, {\'name\': \'선택된 자의 동판화\', \'text\': \'선택된 자의 동판화가 전장에 들어오면서, 생물 유형 한 가지를 선택한다.\\n당신이 조종하는 선택된 유형의 생물은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n{1}, 선택된 유형의 생물 한 개를 희생한다: 당신이 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 무적을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e111707c-96bf-4b7b-88ff-7f21355a813c\', \'multiverseId\': 465671}, \'multiverseid\': 465671}, {\'name\': \'Entalhes dos Escolhidos\', \'text\': \'Conforme Entalhes dos Escolhidos entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAs criaturas que você controla do tipo escolhido recebem +1/+1.\\n{1}, sacrifique uma criatura do tipo escolhido: A criatura alvo que você controla ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e338cc87-13bc-4b3b-9b0d-0242360848f2\', \'multiverseId\': 465925}, \'multiverseid\': 465925}, {\'name\': \'Гравюры Избранных\', \'text\': \'При выходе Гравюр Избранных на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nНаходящиеся под вашим контролем существа выбранного типа получают +1/+1.\\n{1}, пожертвуйте существо выбранного типа: целевое существо под вашим контролем получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90d77973-99ea-4fe4-ac93-50922fae3c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 466179}, \'multiverseid\': 466179}, {\'name\': \'天命蚀刻\', \'text\': \'于天命蚀刻进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n由你操控的该类别生物得+1/+1。\\n{1}，牺牲一个该类别的生物：目标由你操控的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687edf92-3b99-4e24-9722-b6aee426a0b8\', \'multiverseId\': 466433}, \'multiverseid\': 466433}, {\'name\': \'天命蝕刻\', \'text\': \'於天命蝕刻進戰場時，選擇一種生物類別。\\n由你操控的該類別生物得+1/+1。\\n{1}，犧牲一個該類別的生物：目標由你操控的生物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5342a7dc-8465-49d6-a319-f6072e9b3d09\', \'multiverseId\': 466687}, \'multiverseid\': 466687}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rhox-Veteran\', \'text\': \'Schlachtruf (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhalten alle anderen angreifenden Kreaturen +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.)\\nImmer wenn der Rhox-Veteran angreift, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Nashorn, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„In der Schlacht ist es wichtig, wo du stehst. Steh mir niemals im Weg."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464227&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf776da4-3548-4209-a70b-bd83b4683eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 464227}, \'multiverseid\': 464227}, {\'name\': \'Veterano rhox\', \'text\': \'Grito de batalla. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, cada otra criatura atacante obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.)\\nSiempre que el Veterano rhox ataque, gira la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'"La batalla se decide por la posición. No te pongas nunca en mi camino".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'311e2974-faf7-4896-8776-68e6ca247c38\', \'multiverseId\': 464481}, \'multiverseid\': 464481}, {\'name\': \'Vétéran rhox\', \'text\': "Cri de guerre (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, chaque autre créature attaquante gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Vétéran rhox attaque, engagez une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : rhinocéros et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Au combat, tout est une question de position. Alors ne me barre jamais la route. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464735&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'352dc28b-fd83-4bca-9ce6-e4453876bdec\', \'multiverseId\': 464735}, \'multiverseid\': 464735}, {\'name\': \'Rhox Veterano\', \'text\': \'Grido di guerra (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, ogni altra creatura attaccante prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Rhox Veterano attacca, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Rinoceronte\', \'flavor\': \'"In battaglia, tutto dipende da che parte stai. Non starmi mai tra i piedi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d1881ec-f935-4f23-9132-f60e12c11577\', \'multiverseId\': 464989}, \'multiverseid\': 464989}, {\'name\': \'ロウクスの古参兵\', \'text\': \'喊声（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、他の各攻撃クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。）\\nロウクスの古参兵が攻撃するたび、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「戦いは立ち位置がすべてだ。絶対に俺の前には立つな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0658b0dd-84b9-446e-bed2-bed74dfb1054\', \'multiverseId\': 465243}, \'multiverseid\': 465243}, {\'name\': \'록스 숙련병\', \'text\': \'전투함성 (이 생물이 공격할 때마다, 다른 공격 중인 생물들은 각각 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.)\\n록스 숙련병이 공격할 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코뿔소 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"전투는 네가 어디에 서 있냐가 가장 중요하지. 절대로 내 앞을 가로막지 마라."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a89ccdeb-1554-4b0f-81d9-ecc61939f5f0\', \'multiverseId\': 465497}, \'multiverseid\': 465497}, {\'name\': \'Veterano Rhox\', \'text\': \'Grito de guerra (Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, cada outra criatura atacante recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.)\\nToda vez que Veterano Rhox atacar, vire a criatura alvo que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Rinoceronte Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"O mais importante na batalha é a sua posição. Nunca esteja no meu caminho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99a133ff-3619-4413-8b43-567b2131d475\', \'multiverseId\': 465751}, \'multiverseid\': 465751}, {\'name\': \'Рокс-Ветеран\', \'text\': \'Боевой клич (Каждый раз, когда это существо атакует, каждое другое атакующее существо получает +1/+0 до конца хода.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Рокс-Ветеран атакует, поверните целевое существо под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Носорог Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«В битве самое главное — занять позицию. Никогда не занимай позицию на моем пути».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c37da68f-3c16-4b62-be05-c12e797ce1a6\', \'multiverseId\': 466005}, \'multiverseid\': 466005}, {\'name\': \'罗克老兵\', \'text\': \'战嚎（每当此生物攻击时，每个进行攻击的其他生物各得+1/+0直到回合结束。）\\n每当罗克老兵攻击时，横置目标由对手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～犀牛／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「战斗的精髓就是要站对位置。千万不要挡在我面前。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b05b9a6-24af-409b-a101-d561b26b1281\', \'multiverseId\': 466259}, \'multiverseid\': 466259}, {\'name\': \'羅克老兵\', \'text\': \'戰嚎（每當此生物攻擊時，每個進行攻擊的其他生物各得+1/+0直到回合結束。）\\n每當羅克老兵攻擊時，橫置目標由對手操控的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～犀牛／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「戰鬥的精髓就是要站對位置。千萬不要擋在我面前。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69d11489-9bbc-4805-8f93-5cd8c66047bf\', \'multiverseId\': 466513}, \'multiverseid\': 466513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ritter von Alt-Benalia\', \'text\': \'Aussetzen 5 — {W} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, kannst du {W} bezahlen, sie ins Exil schicken und fünf Zeitmarken auf sie legen. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, wirke die Karte, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Sie hat Eile.)\\nWenn der Ritter von Alt-Benalia ins Spiel kommt, erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464220&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93977421-6df9-439f-8358-53037cf168a9\', \'multiverseId\': 464220}, \'multiverseid\': 464220}, {\'name\': \'Caballero de Vieja Benalia\', \'text\': \'Suspender 5 — {W}. (En lugar de lanzar esta carta de tu mano, puedes pagar {W} y exiliarla con cinco contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná. Tiene la habilidad de prisa.)\\nCuando el Caballero de Vieja Benalia entre al campo de batalla, las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4b5f61b-08c7-4dda-85ee-770b02e803d7\', \'multiverseId\': 464474}, \'multiverseid\': 464474}, {\'name\': "Chevalier de l\'Ancienne Bénalia", \'text\': "Suspension 5 — {W} (Plutôt que lancer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {W} et l\'exiler avec cinq marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, lancez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Elle a la célérité.)\\nQuand le Chevalier de l\'Ancienne Bénalia arrive sur le champ de bataille, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464728&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34ebb1b4-e93b-4a19-b3bf-aeb8908bb980\', \'multiverseId\': 464728}, \'multiverseid\': 464728}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliere di Antica Benalia\', \'text\': "Sospendere 5—{W} (Invece di lanciare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {W} ed esiliarla con cinque segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, lancia la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Ha rapidità.)\\nQuando il Cavaliere di Antica Benalia entra nel campo di battaglia, le altre creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7534aa5e-1b81-472a-9796-ec8c110e2c2a\', \'multiverseId\': 464982}, \'multiverseid\': 464982}, {\'name\': \'旧ベナリアの騎士\', \'text\': \'待機５―{W}（あなたの手札からこのカードを唱えるのではなく、あなたは{W}を支払い、時間カウンターを５個置いた状態でこれを追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンターを１個取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをこれのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。これは速攻を持つ。）\\n旧ベナリアの騎士が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'831ec17f-f2c6-4e9a-a37f-21b95bd21389\', \'multiverseId\': 465236}, \'multiverseid\': 465236}, {\'name\': \'구 베날리아의 기사\', \'text\': \'유예 5—{W} (이 카드를 당신의 손에서 발동하는 대신, 당신은 {W}를 지불하고 이 카드에 시간 카운터 다섯 개를 올려놓고 추방할 수 있다. 당신의 유지단 시작에, 시간 카운터 한 개를 제거한다. 마지막 카운터가 제거됐을 때, 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 이 카드를 발동한다. 이 카드는 신속을 가진다.)\\n구 베날리아의 기사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f928eb4b-1d64-4af5-8701-720b1dc4bd90\', \'multiverseId\': 465490}, \'multiverseid\': 465490}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro da Velha Benália\', \'text\': \'Suspender 5 — {W} (Em vez de conjurar este card da sua mão, você pode pagar {W} e exilá-lo com cinco marcadores temporais. No início de sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal. Quando o último for removido, conjure-o sem pagar seu custo de mana. Ele tem ímpeto.)\\nQuando Cavaleiro da Velha Benália entra no campo de batalha, as outras criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c473c8d-cec9-497b-96bd-39abb9d115f9\', \'multiverseId\': 465744}, \'multiverseid\': 465744}, {\'name\': \'Рыцарь Старой Беналии\', \'text\': \'Отсрочка 5 — {W} (Вместо того, чтобы разыграть эту карту из вашей руки, вы можете заплатить {W} и изгнать ее с пятью временными жетонами на ней. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите один временной жетон. Когда удален последний временной жетон, разыграйте эту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Она имеет Ускорение.)\\nКогда Рыцарь Старой Беналии выходит на поле битвы, другие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfbcbeac-6e59-4a13-aeba-44895f389324\', \'multiverseId\': 465998}, \'multiverseid\': 465998}, {\'name\': \'旧宾纳里亚骑士\', \'text\': \'延缓5～{W}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{W}并将它放逐，且上面有五个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，则施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。它具有敏捷。）\\n当旧宾纳里亚骑士进战场时，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15163e40-9dba-4000-b2b7-96b39155cdac\', \'multiverseId\': 466252}, \'multiverseid\': 466252}, {\'name\': \'舊賓納里亞騎士\', \'text\': \'延緩5～{W}（除了從你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{W}並將它放逐，且上面有五個計時指示物。在你的維持開始時，從其上移去一個計時指示物。當移去最後一個時，則施放它且不需支付其魔法力費用。它具有敏捷。）\\n當舊賓納里亞騎士進戰場時，由你操控的其他生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba3a1ba-21cf-437b-8412-c003bab34cf0\', \'multiverseId\': 466506}, \'multiverseid\': 466506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ruinierender Randalierer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ruinierende Randalierer stirbt, kannst du ihn einem Ziel deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zufügen lassen, wie sich Länderkarten in deinem Friedhof befinden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Stadt-Kakerlaken werden nicht wissen, was sie getroffen hat!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464416&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aa1dd6d-09e5-487c-bb22-cf29ea02b604\', \'multiverseId\': 464416}, \'multiverseid\': 464416}, {\'name\': \'Insurgente de las ruinas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Insurgente de las ruinas muera, puedes hacer que haga una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la cantidad de cartas de tierra en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Esas losarachas urbanitas no sabrán ni de dónde les vino el golpe!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bbaabfe-2bc6-47a2-a6d7-3cb697afc168\', \'multiverseId\': 464670}, \'multiverseid\': 464670}, {\'name\': \'Émeutier de ruine\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Émeutier de ruine meurt, vous pouvez faire qu\'il inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes de terrain dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et berserker\', \'flavor\': "« Ces cancrelats de pavé urbanistes n\'auront rien vu venir ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464924&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecc06419-597f-4079-92ba-47dc0c0a0753\', \'multiverseId\': 464924}, \'multiverseid\': 464924}, {\'name\': \'Rivoltoso della Distruzione\', \'text\': \'Quando il Rivoltoso della Distruzione muore, puoi fargli infliggere a un qualsiasi bersaglio danno pari al numero di carte terra nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Quegli scarafaggi di città non avranno nemmeno il tempo di capire cosa li ha colpiti!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09780c84-0dc5-4ab1-9b80-e321245c8ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 465178}, \'multiverseid\': 465178}, {\'name\': \'破滅の暴徒\', \'text\': \'破滅の暴徒が死亡したとき、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは「これはそれにあなたの墓地にある土地・カードの枚数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「都市の砂利ブリ虫どもは、何に打たれたかもわからないだろうよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31b3cbaf-b14f-4d06-affa-3ea7f9894dbb\', \'multiverseId\': 465432}, \'multiverseid\': 465432}, {\'name\': \'파멸의 폭도\', \'text\': \'파멸의 폭도가 죽을 때, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 당신은 파멸의 폭도가 그 목표에게 당신의 무덤에 있는 대지 카드의 수만큼 피해를 입히게 할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 광전사\', \'flavor\': \'"저 도시주의자 바퀴벌레들은 뭐에 맞았는지도 모르겠지!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5bff34c-f9e2-4a39-b7ee-d9285090d0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 465686}, \'multiverseid\': 465686}, {\'name\': \'Baderneiro da Ruína\', \'text\': \'Quando Baderneiro da Ruína morre, você pode fazer com que ele cause a qualquer alvo dano igual ao número de cards de terreno em seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Amoque\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquelas baratas urbanas não vão nem saber de onde veio o golpe!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcddc20a-8a38-41b9-be6a-7cf6021417a5\', \'multiverseId\': 465940}, \'multiverseid\': 465940}, {\'name\': \'Бунтарь Разрушений\', \'text\': \'Когда Бунтарь Разрушений умирает, вы можете заставить его нанести любой цели повреждения, равные количеству карт земель на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Берсерк\', \'flavor\': \'«Эти городские сточные тараканы даже не поймут, что с ними случилось!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a562eb81-c15c-4743-8173-84bfbe0d8e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 466194}, \'multiverseid\': 466194}, {\'name\': \'破垣喧闹人\', \'text\': \'当破垣喧闹人死去时，你可以令它对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于你坟墓场中的地牌数量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'「那些卵石游蟑一样的城里人根本料不到是什么打中了他们！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c75b816-52f7-4542-a000-956d5f803b4e\', \'multiverseId\': 466448}, \'multiverseid\': 466448}, {\'name\': \'破垣喧鬧人\', \'text\': \'當破垣喧鬧人死去時，你可以令它對任意一個目標造成傷害，其數量等同於你墳墓場中的地牌數量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／狂戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「那些卵石游蟑一樣的城裡人根本料不到是什麼打中了他們！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1397dd76-fa2a-4adf-ba8f-c0349c8763f4\', \'multiverseId\': 466702}, \'multiverseid\': 466702}]', '[{\'name\': \'Röhrender Elch\', \'text\': \'Solange in diesem Zug eine andere Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel gekommen ist, hat der Röhrende Elch Unzerstörbarkeit und verursacht Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'„Sie machen sich durch Pfeifen und Röhren bemerkbar. Beide Geräusche bedeuten, dass du das Weite suchen solltest."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464360&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1491c3-3da0-44dc-a763-778c800abf53\', \'multiverseId\': 464360}, \'multiverseid\': 464360}, {\'name\': \'Alce bramando\', \'text\': \'Mientras otra criatura haya entrado al campo de batalla bajo tu control este turno, el Alce bramando tiene las habilidades de arrollar e indestructible.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"Su vocalización incluye dos sonidos a la vez, un silbido y un rugido. Ambos quieren decir que te largues".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18de2bdf-425f-4850-9236-d12a96e4d52f\', \'multiverseId\': 464614}, \'multiverseid\': 464614}, {\'name\': \'Élan beuglard\', \'text\': "Tant que vous avez fait arriver une autre créature sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle ce tour-ci, l\'Élan beuglard a le piétinement et l\'indestructible.", \'type\': \'Créature : élan\', \'flavor\': "« Leur vocalisation à deux tons inclut un sifflement et un rugissement. Les deux signalent de s\'enfuir. »\\n—Vivien Reid", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464868&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2c54f7-295d-4fb6-9a23-92ed9b1b2d19\', \'multiverseId\': 464868}, \'multiverseid\': 464868}, {\'name\': \'Alce Urlante\', \'text\': "Se hai fatto entrare nel campo di battaglia un\'altra creatura sotto il tuo controllo in questo turno, l\'Alce Urlante ha travolgere e indistruttibile.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"La loro vocalizzazione bitonale comprende un fischio e un ruggito. Entrambi significano: \\\'Andatevene\\\'."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd65b7a0-0a9f-422e-b4ba-58e7b0bd01b6\', \'multiverseId\': 465122}, \'multiverseid\': 465122}, {\'name\': \'吼える大鹿\', \'text\': \'このターンにあなたが他のクリーチャーをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出していたかぎり、吼える大鹿はトランプルと破壊不能を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「大鹿が高い声と吼え声を同時に出すときは、『出ていけ』という意味ね。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e97917-7c52-42c3-a30a-bae3fe111b10\', \'multiverseId\': 465376}, \'multiverseid\': 465376}, {\'name\': \'포효하는 엘크\', \'text\': \'이번 턴에 다른 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어온 한, 포효하는 엘크는 돌진 및 무적을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘크\', \'flavor\': \'"저것들은 휘파람과 포효의 두 가지 음색으로 울어대지. 둘 다 물러나라는 뜻이야."\\n—비비안 레이드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b09b4c1-cafa-473e-916b-1d0350b6fb48\', \'multiverseId\': 465630}, \'multiverseid\': 465630}, {\'name\': \'Alce Urrador\', \'text\': \'Desde que outra criatura tenha entrado no campo de batalha sob o seu controle neste turno, Alce Urrador tem atropelar e indestrutível.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"A vocalização deles, em dois tons, contém um assovio e um rugido. Ambos querem dizer \\\'sai da frente\\\'."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f3c42a1-e096-447e-a83b-30ce2c7b5feb\', \'multiverseId\': 465884}, \'multiverseid\': 465884}, {\'name\': \'Ревущий Олень\', \'text\': \'Ревущий Олень имеет Пробивной удар и Неразрушимость при условии, что другое существо уже вышло на поле битвы под вашим контролем в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вапити\', \'flavor\': \'«Они издают своеобразный звук из двух частей: свист, а потом рев. Обе части означают, что тебе здесь не рады».\\n— Вивьен Рейд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'276a58c2-f179-41d3-a963-10f727ef5d1c\', \'multiverseId\': 466138}, \'multiverseid\': 466138}, {\'name\': \'嚎吼麋鹿\', \'text\': \'只要本回合中有另一个生物在你的操控下进战场，嚎吼麋鹿便具有践踏与不灭异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「它们的叫声包括了两种声调：呼啸和咆哮。但都表示滚开。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8abc858-e4a7-44ad-a4f1-e5a82f464c17\', \'multiverseId\': 466392}, \'multiverseid\': 466392}, {\'name\': \'嚎吼麋鹿\', \'text\': \'只要你本回合中有另一個生物在你的操控下進戰場，嚎吼麋鹿便具有踐踏與不滅異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「牠們的叫聲包括了兩種聲調：呼嘯和咆哮。但都表示滾開。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe9066f-5106-4eaf-9e5e-3d903508d5d2\', \'multiverseId\': 466646}, \'multiverseid\': 466646}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sadistische Obsession\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat „{B}, {T}: Lege eine -1/-1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht jeder sollte Spaß an der Arbeit haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464308&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc798540-2d06-459f-85a0-ec65597caa48\', \'multiverseId\': 464308}, \'multiverseid\': 464308}, {\'name\': \'Obsesión sádica\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene "{B}, {T}: Pon un contador -1/-1 sobre la criatura objetivo".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'No todo el mundo debería disfrutar de su trabajo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'444bbb64-d143-4652-ba25-8a9acde17bff\', \'multiverseId\': 464562}, \'multiverseid\': 464562}, {\'name\': \'Obsession sadique\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a « {B}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur la créature ciblée. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'Personne ne devrait éprouver de plaisir au travail.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464816&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2266c705-513c-43c4-8973-ece2017f9f82\', \'multiverseId\': 464816}, \'multiverseid\': 464816}, {\'name\': \'Ossessione Sadica\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha "{B}, {T}: Metti un segnalino -1/-1 su una creatura bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Non tutti dovrebbero trarre soddisfazione dal proprio lavoro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'543bc8aa-8e5e-4cd6-95f7-26d7d32292ce\', \'multiverseId\': 465070}, \'multiverseid\': 465070}, {\'name\': \'サディストの執着\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは「{B}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'仕事は楽しめばいいというものではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fad6ee1-777a-4f6e-b6f0-b50f1271c8c6\', \'multiverseId\': 465324}, \'multiverseid\': 465324}, {\'name\': \'가학적 집착\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 "{B}, {T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 -1/-1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다."를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'모두가 자기 일을 하면서 기뻐해야 하는 것은 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8ec459c-080a-428b-af43-50f76fc94f7e\', \'multiverseId\': 465578}, \'multiverseid\': 465578}, {\'name\': \'Obsessão Sádica\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada tem "{B}, {T}: Coloque um marcador -1/-1 na criatura alvo."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nem todos deveriam gostar do próprio trabalho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7e612ce-e085-4f1d-b48c-b2f261ad3e4f\', \'multiverseId\': 465832}, \'multiverseid\': 465832}, {\'name\': \'Жестокая Одержимость\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо имеет способность «{B}, {T}: положите один жетон -1/-1 на целевое существо».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Не в каждой работе стоило бы находить удовольствие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81d7d15d-63ed-494a-9946-f41e944660f3\', \'multiverseId\': 466086}, \'multiverseid\': 466086}, {\'name\': \'凌虐求索\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物具有「{B}，{T}：在目标生物上放置一个-1/-1指示物。」\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'并非人人都该享受工作的乐趣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03dbb06-a8f8-4e41-93aa-b8f2f93b40a3\', \'multiverseId\': 466340}, \'multiverseid\': 466340}, {\'name\': \'凌虐求索\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物具有「{B}，{T}：在目標生物上放置一個-1/-1指示物。」\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'並非人人都該享受工作的樂趣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e4fcaed-9859-4827-89b0-1fd27390d313\', \'multiverseId\': 466594}, \'multiverseid\': 466594}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sammelnder Buboh\', \'text\': \'Aktivierte Fähigkeiten von Artefakten können nicht aktiviert werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Buboh\', \'flavor\': \'„Er stiehlt die magische Kraft von einem Schatz nach dem anderen, und was hat der Buboh davon? Nichts."\\n—Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464361&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6841f5f0-b990-497e-bcd8-e6e9b4cd8f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 464361}, \'multiverseid\': 464361}, {\'name\': \'Oufé recolector\', \'text\': \'Las habilidades activadas de los artefactos no pueden ser activadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Oufé\', \'flavor\': \'"Roba el poder de un tesoro tras otro, ¿pero qué significa eso para los oufé? Nada".\\n—Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84554947-a03f-48d5-8c89-0adffef4b522\', \'multiverseId\': 464615}, \'multiverseid\': 464615}, {\'name\': \'Orphe collectionneur\', \'text\': \'Les capacités activées des artefacts ne peuvent pas être activées.\', \'type\': \'Créature : orphe\', \'flavor\': "« Il puise le pouvoir des trésors l\'un après l\'autre, et quel effet cela a-t-il sur l\'orphe ? Aucun. »\\n—Djoïra", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51e2989f-b216-4545-b340-f615b91758a0\', \'multiverseId\': 464869}, \'multiverseid\': 464869}, {\'name\': \'Ouphe Collezionista\', \'text\': \'Le abilità attivate degli artefatti non possono essere attivate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ouphe\', \'flavor\': \'"Sottrae potere da un tesoro dopo l\\\'altro, e cosa se ne fanno gli ouphe? Nulla."\\n—Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed3ed81f-e61e-411b-9cf4-f6dd186f49d9\', \'multiverseId\': 465123}, \'multiverseid\': 465123}, {\'name\': \'溜め込み屋のアウフ\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトの起動型能力は起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アウフ\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつは次々とお宝から魔力を盗んでいるけれど、それがアウフの何の役に立つのかって？何も。」\\n――ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1958424e-206c-4ea2-ae76-3c9bc6688ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 465377}, \'multiverseid\': 465377}, {\'name\': \'수집가 아우프\', \'text\': \'마법물체들의 활성화능력은 활성화될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 아우프\', \'flavor\': \'"보물들에서 힘을 훔치는 게 아우프에게 무슨 도움이 되냐고? 아무 도움도 안 돼."\\n—조이라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80078ae1-bbf8-4b90-960a-d55ae87d7cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 465631}, \'multiverseid\': 465631}, {\'name\': \'Trasgo Colecionador\', \'text\': \'As habilidades ativadas de artefatos não podem ser ativadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele rouba o poder de tesouro após tesouro, e o que os trasgos ganham com isso? Nada."\\n— Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67c2281f-52ab-4699-9b9d-0fb0be4c0bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 465885}, \'multiverseid\': 465885}, {\'name\': \'Уф-Коллекционер\', \'text\': \'Активируемые способности артефактов не могут быть активированы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Уф\', \'flavor\': \'«Он крадет могущество одной реликвии за другой, а какая ему самому от этого польза? Никакой».\\n— Джойра\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32acddfa-a229-46ec-b224-67147f8d6963\', \'multiverseId\': 466139}, \'multiverseid\': 466139}, {\'name\': \'集宝奥夫\', \'text\': \'神器的起动式异能都不能起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奥夫\', \'flavor\': \'「他从一个又一个的财宝中盗取力量，可这对于奥夫来说有什么用呢？一点用处都没有。」\\n～尤依拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a072d1b-87bc-4c89-81cb-cc6224137c8d\', \'multiverseId\': 466393}, \'multiverseid\': 466393}, {\'name\': \'集寶奧夫\', \'text\': \'神器的起動式異能都不能起動。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～奧夫\', \'flavor\': \'「他從一個又一個的財寶中盜取力量，可這對於奧夫來說有什麼用呢？一點用處都沒有。」\\n～尤依菈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'006d867b-80a2-4950-93bd-c166dd2434c5\', \'multiverseId\': 466647}, \'multiverseid\': 466647}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schabernack\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\nAusgraben 1 (Falls du eine Karte ziehen würdest, kannst du stattdessen genau eine Karte oben von deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof legen. Falls du dies tust, bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Ziehe sonst eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Teure Broschen fallen oft billigen Tricks zum Opfer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464349&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f818cfc-cb1c-470e-91c1-c34992115387\', \'multiverseId\': 464349}, \'multiverseid\': 464349}, {\'name\': \'Gamberradas\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\nDragar 1. (Si fueras a robar una carta, en vez de eso, puedes poner exactamente una carta de la parte superior de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio. Si lo haces, regresa esta carta de tu cementerio a tu mano. De lo contrario, roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las baratijas pomposas no son rival para los trucos sucios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c07fe8b3-941f-4d64-b036-15d18bc429ef\', \'multiverseId\': 464603}, \'multiverseid\': 464603}, {\'name\': \'Manigances\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'artefact ciblé.\\nDragage 1 (Si vous deviez piocher une carte, vous pouvez mettre exactement une carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière à la place. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez cette carte depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. Sinon, piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les babioles hors de prix ne font pas le poids face à des fourberies bas de gamme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464857&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'618936f5-0daf-4f30-80a1-78f1260223d7\', \'multiverseId\': 464857}, \'multiverseid\': 464857}, {\'name\': \'Bravate\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\nDragare 1 (Se stai per pescare una carta, puoi invece mettere nel tuo cimitero esattamente una carta dalla cima del tuo grimorio. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano questa carta dal tuo cimitero. Altrimenti, pesca una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I gingilli costosi non possono nulla contro i trucchi da quattro soldi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9564a443-a6fb-4f29-a12c-bbc3819c4f0f\', \'multiverseId\': 465111}, \'multiverseid\': 465111}, {\'name\': \'悪ふざけ\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\\n発掘１（あなたがカードを１枚引くなら、代わりにあなたのライブラリーの一番上からちょうど１枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地からこのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。そうしなかったなら、カードを１枚引く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'値の張る安物は、安っぽい小細工に敵わない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c972dc4-fb2f-4920-a351-d717a4d69851\', \'multiverseId\': 465365}, \'multiverseid\': 465365}, {\'name\': \'헛짓거리\', \'text\': \'마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 파괴한다.\\n준설 1 (당신이 카드를 뽑으려 한다면, 대신 당신은 당신의 서고 위에서 정확히 카드 한 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다. 그렇게 하지 않으면, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'비싼 장식품들은 싸구려 술수에 상대가 되지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e15eee-8e59-494a-9a3e-fadfec1b4158\', \'multiverseId\': 465619}, \'multiverseid\': 465619}, {\'name\': \'Travessuras\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato alvo.\\nEscavação 1(Se você for comprar um card, em vez disso, poderá colocar exatamente um card do topo do seu grimório em seu cemitério. Se fizer isso, devolva esse card de seu cemitério para sua mão. Caso contrário, compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Bugigangas caras não são páreo para truques baratos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a5c62e-8f2a-4c2d-8fe6-a42947e70999\', \'multiverseId\': 465873}, \'multiverseid\': 465873}, {\'name\': \'Проказы\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\\nПеретягивание 1 (Если вы должны взять карту, вместо этого вы можете положить ровно одну карту с верха вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище. Если вы это делаете, верните эту карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. В противном случае возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Дорогим безделушкам не выдержать дешевых фокусов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a350a7-5ae9-4b5e-a034-2b7140987c99\', \'multiverseId\': 466127}, \'multiverseid\': 466127}, {\'name\': \'恼人把戏\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器。\\n发掘1（若你将抓一张牌，则你可以改为将你牌库顶正好一张牌置入你的坟墓场。如果你如此作，则将此牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。若否，则抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'昂贵饰品敌不过廉价把戏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35298603-fc1a-4665-834b-e0776ca485b7\', \'multiverseId\': 466381}, \'multiverseid\': 466381}, {\'name\': \'惱人把戲\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器。\\n發掘1（若你將抽一張牌，則你可以改為將你牌庫頂正好一張牌置入你的墳墓場。如果你如此作，則將此牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。若否，則抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'昂貴飾品敵不過廉價把戲。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55818cc-6ed8-416f-91fb-fdf926880957\', \'multiverseId\': 466635}, \'multiverseid\': 466635}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafter Baumhirte\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +0/+2 und weist Kampfschaden in Höhe ihrer Widerstandskraft anstatt ihrer Stärke zu.\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464388&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37d1863f-d5a0-48e8-bb3b-e217bf9a391a\', \'multiverseId\': 464388}, \'multiverseid\': 464388}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de pueblo arbóreo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +0/+2 y asigna una cantidad de daño de combate igual a su resistencia en vez de su fuerza.\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df987b47-16c4-463a-b8aa-8f897692d990\', \'multiverseId\': 464642}, \'multiverseid\': 464642}, {\'name\': \'Ombre de sylvin\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +0/+2 et attribue un nombre de blessures de combat égal à son endurance à la place de sa force.\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464896&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f1e812a-ad56-46d0-8ffb-e0bda9b6885f\', \'multiverseId\': 464896}, \'multiverseid\': 464896}, {\'name\': \'Essenza del Silvantropo\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +0/+2 e assegna danno da combattimento pari alla sua costituzione invece che alla sua forza.\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\'Aura.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a985ae4a-aede-44f1-8e2f-424e77227610\', \'multiverseId\': 465150}, \'multiverseid\': 465150}, {\'name\': \'ツリーフォークの陰影\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋０/＋２の修整を受け、パワーではなくタフネスに等しい点数の戦闘ダメージを割り振る。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントしているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているすべてのダメージを取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6b209b0-0159-43cd-959f-c223bc88104c\', \'multiverseId\': 465404}, \'multiverseid\': 465404}, {\'name\': \'인목의 그림자\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +0/+2를 받고 자신의 공격력 대신 방어력만큼 전투피해를 입힌다.\\n토템 갑옷 (부여된 생물이 파괴되려 하면, 대신 그 생물이 입은 피해를 모두 제거하고 이 마법진을 파괴한다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ddcd44b-23f3-4289-af82-79f2489c53db\', \'multiverseId\': 465658}, \'multiverseid\': 465658}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de Ent\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +0/+2 e atribui dano de combate igual à própria resistência em vez do próprio poder.\\nArmadura de totem (Se a criatura encantada seria destruída, em vez disso, remova todo o dano dela e destrua esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07842e6f-d85e-4535-947a-cf4afb30b349\', \'multiverseId\': 465912}, \'multiverseid\': 465912}, {\'name\': \'Дух Лесовика\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +0/+2 и распределяет боевые повреждения, равные своей выносливости, а не силе.\\nТотемная броня (Если зачарованное существо должно быть уничтожено, вместо этого снимите с него все повреждения и уничтожьте эту Ауру.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a80f2f0f-0d3f-436f-90ce-5df7619a071c\', \'multiverseId\': 466166}, \'multiverseid\': 466166}, {\'name\': \'树妖本影\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+0/+2，且依照其防御力来分配战斗伤害，而不是依照力量。\\n替身甲（如果所结附的生物将被消灭，则改为移除它受到的所有伤害，并消灭此灵气。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b0d994-f538-463d-ad2a-357ec2bb993e\', \'multiverseId\': 466420}, \'multiverseid\': 466420}, {\'name\': \'樹妖本影\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+0/+2，且依照其防禦力來分配戰鬥傷害，而不是依照力量。\\n替身甲（如果所結附的生物將被消滅，則改為移除它受到的所有傷害，並消滅此靈氣。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f42e7d2-8fa4-452c-bc46-676865f2741d\', \'multiverseId\': 466674}, \'multiverseid\': 466674}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleudertrupp-Leutnant\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Schleudertrupp-Leutnant ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote Goblin-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nOpfere einen Goblin: Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Gerade zum „Weichgeschoss" befördert, brannte Zaz darauf, richtig Eindruck zu hinterlassen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464311&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b396c713-19fa-484a-a931-6f8d9eca42f1\', \'multiverseId\': 464311}, \'multiverseid\': 464311}, {\'name\': \'Teniente del lanzatrasgos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Teniente del lanzatrasgos entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de criatura Trasgo rojas 1/1.\\nSacrificar un Trasgo: El jugador objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Con su reciente ascenso a "primera roca", Zaz estaba deseando causar impacto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'379f842d-1a78-421c-84f3-c7b16843df8b\', \'multiverseId\': 464565}, \'multiverseid\': 464565}, {\'name\': \'Lieutenant des catapultants\', \'text\': \'Quand le Lieutenant des catapultants arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge Gobelin.\\nSacrifiez un gobelin : Le joueur ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': "Récemment promu « première pierre », Zaz était impatient d\'avoir un impact sur les combats.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464819&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e22af773-3ef7-4cb5-a345-aa4d035a745c\', \'multiverseId\': 464819}, \'multiverseid\': 464819}, {\'name\': \'Tenente della Squadra della Fionda\', \'text\': \'Quando il Tenente della Squadra della Fionda entra nel campo di battaglia, crea due pedine creatura Goblin 1/1 rosse.\\nSacrifica un Goblin: Un giocatore bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Appena promosso a "prima pietra", Zaz era ansioso di fare colpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4c4b6ce-8e28-488c-9d55-c76b8281f858\', \'multiverseId\': 465073}, \'multiverseid\': 465073}, {\'name\': \'投石攻撃の副官\', \'text\': \'投石攻撃の副官が戦場に出たとき、赤の１/１のゴブリン・クリーチャー・トークンを２体生成する。\\nゴブリン１体を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'「一等石」に昇進したばかりのザズは、ぶつかりたくてたまらなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86e1a6f4-e2ff-4a05-a500-846c91f59b87\', \'multiverseId\': 465327}, \'multiverseid\': 465327}, {\'name\': \'투석기 무리 장교\', \'text\': \'투석기 무리 장교가 전장에 들어올 때, 1/1 적색 고블린 생물 토큰 두 개를 만든다.\\n고블린 한 개를 희생한다: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린\', \'flavor\': \'"첫 바위"로 막 승진한 재즈는 뭔가 충격적인 것을 보여주고 싶어 안달이 나 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c076b343-e68c-4a63-8290-ac5cd4481c1e\', \'multiverseId\': 465581}, \'multiverseid\': 465581}, {\'name\': \'Tenente da Gangue Atiradeira\', \'text\': \'Quando Tenente da Gangue Atiradeira entrar no campo de batalha, crie duas fichas de criatura vermelha 1/1 do tipo Goblin.\\nSacrifique um Goblin: O jogador alvo perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Recém-promovido a "primeira pedra", Zaz estava ansioso para causar impacto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b3c825d-bcd4-4021-a69c-07f9a61690fc\', \'multiverseId\': 465835}, \'multiverseid\': 465835}, {\'name\': \'Лейтенант Рогаточников\', \'text\': \'Когда Лейтенант Рогаточников выходит на поле битвы, создайте две фишки существа 1/1 красный Гоблин.\\nПожертвуйте Гоблина: целевой игрок теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин\', \'flavor\': \'Заз, совсем недавно получивший повышение до звания «первого камня», страстно желал нанести удар.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c004934-bc97-4660-986c-bdacaddf9a73\', \'multiverseId\': 466089}, \'multiverseid\': 466089}, {\'name\': \'掷弹指战官\', \'text\': \'当掷弹指战官进战场时，派出两个1/1红色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n牺牲一个鬼怪：目标牌手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'刚晋升为「尖石」的查仔等不及要有冲击性的表现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aa14540-8809-451d-9b32-e5449f869487\', \'multiverseId\': 466343}, \'multiverseid\': 466343}, {\'name\': \'擲彈指戰官\', \'text\': \'當擲彈指戰官進戰場時，派出兩個1/1紅色鬼怪衍生生物。\\n犧牲一個鬼怪：目標玩家失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪\', \'flavor\': \'剛晉陞為「尖石」的查仔等不及要有衝擊性的表現。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb4977a-3b8a-4498-a530-e1f33d7a043e\', \'multiverseId\': 466597}, \'multiverseid\': 466597}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schmetterhelix\', \'text\': \'Die Schmetterhelix fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu und du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\\nRückblende {R}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Boshaftigkeit löscht den Rachedurst am besten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464312&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54bd801f-b20d-443c-b079-00bd4f81f78e\', \'multiverseId\': 464312}, \'multiverseid\': 464312}, {\'name\': \'Hélice aniquiladora\', \'text\': \'La Hélice aniquiladora hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo y tú ganas 3 vidas.\\nRetrospectiva {R}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La maldad es apropiada cuando la venganza es necesaria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61cddc1-aa03-4248-a383-f6c43c958b70\', \'multiverseId\': 464566}, \'multiverseid\': 464566}, {\'name\': \'Hélice de châtiment\', \'text\': "L\'Hélice de châtiment inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\\nFlashback {R}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La malveillance est de mise en cas de vengeance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464820&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba1307b8-bf41-417e-949a-39eaeea92433\', \'multiverseId\': 464820}, \'multiverseid\': 464820}, {\'name\': \'Spirale Sgominante\', \'text\': \'La Spirale Sgominante infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio e tu guadagni 3 punti vita.\\nFlashback {R}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La malvagità è opportuna quando si tratta di vendetta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79db4ec1-5dd8-44dd-88ae-a1e6eb7a700b\', \'multiverseId\': 465074}, \'multiverseid\': 465074}, {\'name\': \'強打のらせん\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。強打のらせんはそれに３点のダメージを与え、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\\nフラッシュバック{R}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地から、このカードをこれのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'復讐を求めるなら恨みは妥当である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0a7191a-439d-4654-8036-30e5c5e3887b\', \'multiverseId\': 465328}, \'multiverseid\': 465328}, {\'name\': \'후려치는 나선\', \'text\': \'원하는 목표를 정한다. 후려치는 나선은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입히고 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\\n회상 {R}{W} (당신은 이 카드의 회상 비용을 지불해 이 카드를 당신의 무덤에서 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이 카드를 추방한다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'복수에는 적의가 섞여 있기 마련이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550efc65-4d1c-4c77-a1e8-3fea96e5407b\', \'multiverseId\': 465582}, \'multiverseid\': 465582}, {\'name\': \'Hélice Fulminante\', \'text\': \'Hélice Fulminante causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo e você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\\nRecapitular {R}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A maldade é uma coisa adequada quando a vingança se faz necessária.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd6f67d-72c9-48ca-ac39-48cb2296ef89\', \'multiverseId\': 465836}, \'multiverseid\': 465836}, {\'name\': \'Разящая Спираль\', \'text\': \'Разящая Спираль наносит 3 повреждения любой цели, а вы получаете 3 жизни.\\nВоспоминание {R}{W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Злоба — уместное чувство, когда вершится месть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b2dfa27-5868-47fe-bc9e-0f32574a6a05\', \'multiverseId\': 466090}, \'multiverseid\': 466090}, {\'name\': \'重击螺旋\', \'text\': \'重击螺旋对任意一个目标造成3点伤害，且你获得3点生命。\\n返照{R}{W}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'复仇之举最适怀抱恶意。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e638a9-9fb7-4233-922e-adb2e662dbdc\', \'multiverseId\': 466344}, \'multiverseid\': 466344}, {\'name\': \'重擊螺旋\', \'text\': \'重擊螺旋對任意一個目標造成3點傷害，且你獲得3點生命。\\n返照{R}{W}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'復仇之舉最適懷抱惡意。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4749a0d-1ee5-426c-9d25-c736c0a176b9\', \'multiverseId\': 466598}, \'multiverseid\': 466598}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schneeraupe\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: Monstrum 2. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs. {S} kann mit einem Mana von einer verschneiten bleibenden Karte bezahlt werden.)\\nSolange die Schneeraupe monströs ist, hat sie Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'Aus ihrem Kokon erhebt sich ein Schneegestöber.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464246&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee130af6-f070-4820-9b9d-db62ef7366e0\', \'multiverseId\': 464246}, \'multiverseid\': 464246}, {\'name\': \'Orugártica\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: Monstruosidad 2. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa. {S} puede pagarse con un maná de un permanente nevado.)\\nMientras la Orugártica sea monstruosa, tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'Desde la crisálida, una nevisca levanta el vuelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8446010-918d-4218-849d-603ffbea83cc\', \'multiverseId\': 464500}, \'multiverseid\': 464500}, {\'name\': \'Chenille des neiges\', \'text\': "{4}{S}{S} : Monstruosité 2. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse. {S} peut être payé avec un mana d\'un permanent neigeux.)\\nTant que la Chenille des neiges est monstrueuse, elle a le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse : insecte\', \'flavor\': \'De son cocon émerge une bourrasque.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464754&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc1d0f3-54e8-4c80-ba8b-b833d000b9b6\', \'multiverseId\': 464754}, \'multiverseid\': 464754}, {\'name\': \'Gelobruco\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: Mostruosità 2. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa. {S} può essere pagato con un mana da un permanente neve.)\\nFintanto che il Gelobruco è mostruoso, ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Neve — Insetto\', \'flavor\': \'Dal suo bozzolo prende il volo un turbine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ada0e7c2-de37-4387-958e-387a3999b43e\', \'multiverseId\': 465008}, \'multiverseid\': 465008}, {\'name\': \'凍て虫\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}：怪物化２を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。これは怪物的になる。{S}は氷雪パーマネントからのマナ１点で支払える。）\\n凍て虫が怪物的であるかぎり、これは飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'その繭からは雪が飛んでいく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53dfc7a1-8ef1-41ec-9c2a-2fbe4fefe48d\', \'multiverseId\': 465262}, \'multiverseid\': 465262}, {\'name\': \'냉기애벌레\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: 괴수화 2를 한다. (이 생물이 괴수화하지 않았다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓고 이 생물은 괴수화한다. {S}는 눈 지속물에서 나온 마나 한 개로 지불할 수 있다.)\\n냉기애벌레가 괴수화한 한, 냉기애벌레는 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'눈 생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': \'고치 속에서, 돌풍이 날아올랐다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d98e0c84-69d1-471f-bace-0c6b7ab49803\', \'multiverseId\': 465516}, \'multiverseid\': 465516}, {\'name\': \'Gelagarta\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: Monstruosidade 2. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa. {S} pode ser pago com um mana de uma permanente da neve.)\\nEnquanto Gelagarta for monstruosa, ela terá voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura da Neve — Inseto\', \'flavor\': \'De seu casulo uma nevasca alça voo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba2408c-e53c-4d85-ad52-a9df0a83c151\', \'multiverseId\': 465770}, \'multiverseid\': 465770}, {\'name\': \'Снегусеница\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}: Чудовищность 2. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него два жетона +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным. {S} можно оплатить одной маной от снежного перманента.)\\nПока Снегусеница является чудовищной, она имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Снежное Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': \'Из ее кокона рождается на свет буран.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90239f8-1d39-40ca-a281-035573a1e248\', \'multiverseId\': 466024}, \'multiverseid\': 466024}, {\'name\': \'冰寒毛虫\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}：蛮化2。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物且它已蛮化。{S}能以产自雪境永久物的一点法术力来支付。）\\n只要冰寒毛虫已蛮化，它便具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'破茧而出，扑翼扬寒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41989a7e-96ac-45a6-81a2-65be18b644f9\', \'multiverseId\': 466278}, \'multiverseid\': 466278}, {\'name\': \'冰寒毛蟲\', \'text\': \'{4}{S}{S}：蠻化2。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置兩個+1/+1指示物且它已蠻化。{S}能以產自雪境永久物的一點魔法力來支付。）\\n只要冰寒毛蟲已蠻化，它便具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 ～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': \'破繭而出，撲翼揚寒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f15ba304-0278-4d57-8eb4-de1e7cdea66b\', \'multiverseId\': 466532}, \'multiverseid\': 466532}]', "[{'name': 'Schrottplatz-Rekombinator', 'text': 'Bausteine 2 (Diese Kreatur kommt mit zwei +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel. Wenn sie stirbt, kannst du ihre +1/+1-Marken auf eine Artefaktkreatur deiner Wahl legen.)\\n{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Konstrukt-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464430&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cca9f03-24df-415f-a76b-d97326f4cd4f', 'multiverseId': 464430}, 'multiverseid': 464430}, {'name': 'Reensamblador del desguace', 'text': 'Modular 2. (Esta criatura entra al campo de batalla con dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. Cuando muera, puedes poner sus contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura artefacto objetivo.)\\n{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Constructo, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464684&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0608cd17-deef-480d-b095-091b586421d7', 'multiverseId': 464684}, 'multiverseid': 464684}, {'name': 'Recombineur de ferraillerie', 'text': 'Modularité 2 (Cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille avec deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. Quand elle meurt, vous pouvez placer ses marqueurs +1/+1 sur la créature-artefact ciblée.)\\n{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de construction, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : construction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464938&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24025a40-5338-43c5-87e6-bd888048326f', 'multiverseId': 464938}, 'multiverseid': 464938}, {'name': 'Ricombinatore del Rottamaio', 'text': 'Modulare 2 (Questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia con due segnalini +1/+1. Quando muore, puoi mettere i suoi segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura artefatto bersaglio.)\\n{T}, Sacrifica un artefatto: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Costrutto, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465192&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '359fec29-460c-431b-8128-48aa51d3c8b5', 'multiverseId': 465192}, 'multiverseid': 465192}, {'name': '屑鉄場の再構成機', 'text': '接合２（このクリーチャーは＋１/＋１カウンターが２個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。これが死亡したとき、アーティファクト・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはこれの＋１/＋１カウンターをすべてそれの上に置いてもよい。）\\n{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから構築物・カード１枚を探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465446&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ccc1c0a-7c37-4b1f-97ea-ca62744d0e51', 'multiverseId': 465446}, 'multiverseid': 465446}, {'name': '폐품처리장 재결합기', 'text': '모듈 2 (이 생물은 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 가지고 전장에 들어온다. 이 생물이 죽을 때, 마법물체 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 이 생물의 +1/+1 카운터를 목표에 올려놓을 수 있다.)\\n{T}, 마법물체 한 개를 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 자동기계 카드 한 장을 찾아, 공개하고, 당신의 손으로 가져간 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '마법물체 생물 — 자동기계', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465700&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '636aca8d-bb7b-402d-88f3-93a30327f59c', 'multiverseId': 465700}, 'multiverseid': 465700}, {'name': 'Recombinador do Ferro-velho', 'text': 'Modular 2 (Esta criatura entra no campo de batalha com dois marcadores +1/+1. Quando ela morre, você pode colocar seus marcadores +1/+1 na criatura artefato alvo.)\\n{T}, sacrifique um artefato: Procure um card de Constructo em seu grimório, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Constructo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465954&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20a14f56-b948-43d7-b377-a1373ff21297', 'multiverseId': 465954}, 'multiverseid': 465954}, {'name': 'Мусорный Перекомпоновщик', 'text': 'Модульность 2 (Это существо выходит на поле битвы с двумя жетонами +1/+1 на нем. Когда оно умирает, вы можете положить его жетоны +1/+1 на целевой артефакт существо.)\\n{T}, пожертвуйте артефакт: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Конструкции, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466208&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a72d9497-c3a2-445e-81b7-1cf1e9288a23', 'multiverseId': 466208}, 'multiverseid': 466208}, {'name': '废品场拼合械', 'text': '套件2（此生物进战场时上面有两个+1/+1指示物。当它死去时，你可以将它的+1/+1指示物置于目标神器生物上。）\\n{T}，牺牲一个神器：从你的牌库中搜寻一张组构体牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～组构体', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466462&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25a92cab-c34f-463e-8a43-6a3f798593ce', 'multiverseId': 466462}, 'multiverseid': 466462}, {'name': '廢品場拼合械', 'text': '套件2（此生物進戰場時上面有兩個+1/+1指示物。當它死去時，你可以將它的+1/+1指示物置於目標神器生物上。）\\n{T}，犧牲一個神器：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張組構體牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～組構體', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466716&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ac83c507-50b8-47e8-89f0-ebebe98d6e50', 'multiverseId': 466716}, 'multiverseid': 466716}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schwert aus Sehnen und Stahl\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Schutz vor Schwarz und vor Rot.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, zerstöre bis zu einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl und bis zu ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464431&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cde2737-6f3a-4888-89a3-27c92eeb7a3c\', \'multiverseId\': 464431}, \'multiverseid\': 464431}, {\'name\': \'Espada de nervio y acero\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene protección contra negro y contra rojo.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, destruye hasta un planeswalker objetivo y hasta un artefacto objetivo.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81a96833-ef3e-4d73-9c0c-53b3b55bd2b4\', \'multiverseId\': 464685}, \'multiverseid\': 464685}, {\'name\': "Épée de Nerf et d\'Acier", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+2 et a la protection contre le noir et le rouge.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, détruisez jusqu\'à un planeswalker ciblé et jusqu\'à un artefact ciblé.\\nÉquipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464939&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7470d41d-2568-4dc0-b75a-9cfdf6494c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 464939}, \'multiverseid\': 464939}, {\'name\': \'Spada di Tendini e Acciaio\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+2 e ha protezione dal nero e dal rosso.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, distruggi fino a un planeswalker bersaglio e fino a un artefatto bersaglio.\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a33342-68bb-4b68-9c01-61895abe5088\', \'multiverseId\': 465193}, \'multiverseid\': 465193}, {\'name\': \'筋腱と鋼鉄の剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋２の修整を受け、プロテクション（黒）とプロテクション（赤）を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、プレインズウォーカー最大１体とアーティファクト最大１つを対象とし、それらを破壊する。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f71bda2-e906-4939-854c-3e16086c497b\', \'multiverseId\': 465447}, \'multiverseid\': 465447}, {\'name\': \'힘줄과 강철의 검\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+2를 받고 흑색과 적색으로부터 보호를 가진다.\\n장착된 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 플레인즈워커 최대 한 개와 마법물체 최대 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표들을 파괴한다.\\n장착 {2}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f2685f-70d9-45c9-9b8d-6b444da7f698\', \'multiverseId\': 465701}, \'multiverseid\': 465701}, {\'name\': \'Espada de Aço e Tendão\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+2 e tem proteção contra o preto e contra o vermelho.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada causar dano de combate a um jogador, destrua até um planeswalker alvo e até um artefato alvo.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07216a06-0212-4275-acd6-3f1bcb39afc3\', \'multiverseId\': 465955}, \'multiverseid\': 465955}, {\'name\': \'Меч Жил и Стали\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+2 и имеет Защиту от черного и от красного.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, уничтожьте не более одного целевого planeswalker-а и не более одного целевого артефакта.\\nСнарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2598363-f00c-49cf-8efa-8080eadc407c\', \'multiverseId\': 466209}, \'multiverseid\': 466209}, {\'name\': \'宏钢剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2且具有反黑保护与反红保护。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，消灭至多一个目标鹏洛客和至多一个目标神器。\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fbcaa03-247e-4aec-b23c-f49427a63be1\', \'multiverseId\': 466463}, \'multiverseid\': 466463}, {\'name\': \'宏鋼劍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+2且具有反黑保護與反紅保護。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，消滅至多一個目標鵬洛客和至多一個目標神器。\\n佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b078271-bbf9-46c2-9e48-df7d2c363394\', \'multiverseId\': 466717}, \'multiverseid\': 466717}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwert aus Wahrheit und Recht\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und hat Schutz vor Weiß und vor Blau.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, und führe dann Wucherung durch. (Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an bleibenden Karten und/oder Spielern und gib ihnen dann von jeder Sorte Marke, die dort bereits liegt, eine weitere Marke.)\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464432&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456c23c3-9e1f-4871-b6d2-3124709c014c\', \'multiverseId\': 464432}, \'multiverseid\': 464432}, {\'name\': \'Espada de verdad y justicia\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene protección contra blanco y contra azul.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas. Luego, prolifera. (Elige cualquier cantidad de permanentes y/o jugadores, luego pon sobre cada uno un contador de cada tipo que ya tenga.)\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a96ba0c-19d7-49a3-b5af-1b72779acd6c\', \'multiverseId\': 464686}, \'multiverseid\': 464686}, {\'name\': \'Épée de Vérité et de Justice\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+2 et a la protection contre le blanc et le bleu.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur une créature que vous contrôlez, puis proliférez. (Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de permanents et/ou de joueurs, puis donnez-leur à chacun un autre marqueur de chaque sorte déjà présente.)\\nÉquipement {2}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464940&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41cf6164-8cae-4b3f-831b-0e07bb22cd43\', \'multiverseId\': 464940}, \'multiverseid\': 464940}, {\'name\': \'Spada di Verità e Giustizia\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+2 e ha protezione dal bianco e dal blu.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura che controlli, poi prolifera. (Scegli un qualsiasi numero di permanenti e/o giocatori, poi metti su ognuno un altro segnalino di ogni tipo già presente.)\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061c6c28-4520-4350-88c3-660db6a1a755\', \'multiverseId\': 465194}, \'multiverseid\': 465194}, {\'name\': \'真理と正義の剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋２の修整を受け、プロテクション（白）とプロテクション（青）を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置き、その後増殖を行う。（望む数のパーマネントやプレイヤーを選び、その後すでにそこにあるカウンター１種類につき、そのカウンターをもう１個与える。）\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4ebb53a-4b13-4e13-a432-f5bfb86f0001\', \'multiverseId\': 465448}, \'multiverseid\': 465448}, {\'name\': \'진실과 정의의 검\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+2를 받고 백색과 청색으로부터 보호를 가진다.\\n장착된 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓은 후, 증식한다. (지속물 및/또는 플레이어를 원하는 수만큼 선택한 후, 그 대상들이 이미 가지고 있는 카운터들과 같은 종류의 카운터를 한 개씩 추가한다.)\\n장착 {2}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56fdd0c9-a77b-4385-b498-8098e1489d35\', \'multiverseId\': 465702}, \'multiverseid\': 465702}, {\'name\': \'Espada de Verdade e Justiça\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+2 e tem proteção contra o branco e contra o azul.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada causar dano de combate a um jogador, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em uma criatura que você controla e depois prolifere. (Escolha qualquer número de permanentes e/ou jogadores. Em seguida, dê a cada um deles outro marcador de cada tipo que eles já tenham.)\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08636f0e-feb1-4988-8c6b-220a35936554\', \'multiverseId\': 465956}, \'multiverseid\': 465956}, {\'name\': \'Меч Истины и Правосудия\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+2 и имеет Защиту от белого и от синего.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, положите один жетон +1/+1 на существо под вашим контролем, затем используйте Распространение. (Выберите любое количество перманентов и (или) игроков, затем дайте каждому из них еще по одному жетону тех типов, которые у него уже имеются.)\\nСнарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39b89afa-d29e-4a64-8a36-f00f710130d4\', \'multiverseId\': 466210}, \'multiverseid\': 466210}, {\'name\': \'诚理剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2且具有反白保护与反蓝保护。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，在一个由你操控的生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物，然后增殖。（选择任意数量的永久物和／或牌手，然后为其已有之每种指示物各多放置一个同类的指示物。）\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac18827-caf4-4008-a206-c060f3007b86\', \'multiverseId\': 466464}, \'multiverseid\': 466464}, {\'name\': \'誠理劍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+2且具有反白保護與反藍保護。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，在一個由你操控的生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物，然後增殖。（選擇任意數量的永久物和／或玩家，然後為其已有之每種指示物各多放置一個同類的指示物。）\\n佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d1b79af-4a70-4717-8562-1d55283d7849\', \'multiverseId\': 466718}, \'multiverseid\': 466718}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schänden\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges -1/-1 für jeden Sumpf, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die einzige Abkürzung in einem Moor führt direkt auf den Grund.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464289&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb7c2913-df83-43eb-ade1-a67e731dbe05\', \'multiverseId\': 464289}, \'multiverseid\': 464289}, {\'name\': \'Empantanar\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno por cada Pantano que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El único atajo en una ciénaga es el camino hacia abajo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3700b20-bea0-4327-ab60-40b58fcf1ec9\', \'multiverseId\': 464543}, \'multiverseid\': 464543}, {\'name\': \'Souiller\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque marais que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Dans une tourbière, le seul raccourci se trouve vers le bas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464797&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cc32ba4-7abe-4b20-a7ca-1dc59b7b6516\', \'multiverseId\': 464797}, \'multiverseid\': 464797}, {\'name\': \'Profanare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni Palude che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'unica scorciatoia in una palude conduce al fondo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b016f163-f533-4c15-95f6-fc24ea17bbb4\', \'multiverseId\': 465051}, \'multiverseid\': 465051}, {\'name\': \'汚涜\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それはあなたがコントロールしている沼１つにつき－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'泥沼にある近道は底に通じるもののみ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71520c0b-cccf-4ea8-af21-57bc2d1d855e\', \'multiverseId\': 465305}, \'multiverseid\': 465305}, {\'name\': \'더럽히기\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 당신이 조종하는 늪 한 개당 -1/-1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'수렁에 있는 지름길은 그 밑바닥으로 향하는 것뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a5e6c8-bb15-44f2-bbb0-4ce8182e36dd\', \'multiverseId\': 465559}, \'multiverseid\': 465559}, {\'name\': \'Macular\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -1/-1 até o final do turno para cada Pântano que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O único atalho em um pântano é para o fundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e1a404-d18d-46ac-aa3a-916ce53d33f1\', \'multiverseId\': 465813}, \'multiverseid\': 465813}, {\'name\': \'Осквернение\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -1/-1 до конца хода за каждое Болото под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Единственный короткий путь через болото — вниз ко дну.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b101b27-2b06-4bf2-adc0-f1ef13f4bcb9\', \'multiverseId\': 466067}, \'multiverseid\': 466067}, {\'name\': \'染污\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个沼泽，目标生物便得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'穿越腐沼，向下最快。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a50c60c-26db-4c7c-9e64-38ca21487a09\', \'multiverseId\': 466321}, \'multiverseid\': 466321}, {\'name\': \'染污\', \'text\': \'你每操控一個沼澤，目標生物便得-1/-1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'穿越腐沼，向下最快。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'520c2d4f-87d3-4d29-8c22-8499fecf2f36\', \'multiverseId\': 466575}, \'multiverseid\': 466575}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seele des Märtyrers\', \'text\': \'Einberufen (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana der Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nWenn die Seele des Märtyrers ins Spiel kommt und falls du keine getappten Länder kontrollierst, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464222&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ef82d3-2653-46a8-a5c5-d1804c015c85\', \'multiverseId\': 464222}, \'multiverseid\': 464222}, {\'name\': \'Alma de mártir\', \'text\': \'Convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar este hechizo. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nCuando el Alma de mártir entre al campo de batalla, si no controlas ninguna tierra girada, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7238b856-ca6d-4053-82ed-d234d36b7bed\', \'multiverseId\': 464476}, \'multiverseid\': 464476}, {\'name\': \'Âme du martyr\', \'text\': "Convocation (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ce sort. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant ce sort paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nQuand l\'Âme du martyr arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous ne contrôlez pas de terrain engagé, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464730&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03076e42-4776-4163-86fe-272ec8c573b2\', \'multiverseId\': 464730}, \'multiverseid\': 464730}, {\'name\': \'Anima del Martire\', \'text\': "Convocazione (Le tue creature possono aiutarti a lanciare questa magia. Ogni creatura che TAPpi mentre lanci questa magia corrisponde al pagamento di {1} o di un mana del colore di quella creatura.)\\nQuando l\'Anima del Martire entra nel campo di battaglia, se non controlli terre TAPpate, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'892e963f-5e44-494e-a0fa-2712b7a9435d\', \'multiverseId\': 464984}, \'multiverseid\': 464984}, {\'name\': \'殉教者の魂\', \'text\': \'召集（あなたのクリーチャーが、この呪文を唱える助けとなる。この呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\n殉教者の魂が戦場に出たとき、あなたがタップ状態の土地をコントロールしていない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae86424b-1d02-4c75-b090-2113fdc99855\', \'multiverseId\': 465238}, \'multiverseid\': 465238}, {\'name\': \'순교자의 영혼\', \'text\': \'집합 (당신의 생물들은 이 주문을 발동하는 것을 도울 수 있다. 이 주문을 발동하는 동안 탭하는 각 생물은 이 주문의 비용 중 {1} 또는 그 생물의 색 마나 한 개를 지불한다.)\\n순교자의 영혼이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 탭된 대지를 조종하고 있지 않다면, 순교자의 영혼에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령 병사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0941215-d2e4-44c5-bccc-cf1335910976\', \'multiverseId\': 465492}, \'multiverseid\': 465492}, {\'name\': \'Alma do Mártir\', \'text\': \'Convocar (Suas criaturas podem ajudar a conjurar esta mágica. Cada criatura que você vira ao conjurar esta mágica paga {1} ou um mana da cor daquela criatura.)\\nQuando Alma do Mártir entrar no campo de batalha, se você não controlar nenhum terreno virado, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 nele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c8c0ee5-46b6-4bc0-b5f8-a149fccccf1c\', \'multiverseId\': 465746}, \'multiverseid\': 465746}, {\'name\': \'Душа Мученика\', \'text\': \'Созыв (Ваши существа могут помочь разыграть это заклинание. Каждое существо, которое вы поворачиваете при разыгрывании этого заклинания, считается оплатой {1} или одной маны цвета того существа.)\\nКогда Душа Мученика выходит на поле битвы, если под вашим контролем нет повернутых земель, положите на нее два жетона +1/+1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e166da9c-b4ae-47a3-96e3-05bf8a42d406\', \'multiverseId\': 466000}, \'multiverseid\': 466000}, {\'name\': \'烈士英魂\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放此咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为此咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n当烈士英魂进战场时，若你未操控已横置的地，则在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a88a6b6b-d831-45d7-aa3f-aa40522c5919\', \'multiverseId\': 466254}, \'multiverseid\': 466254}, {\'name\': \'烈士英魂\', \'text\': \'召集（此咒語能用你的生物來協助施放。你於施放此咒語時每橫置一個生物，就能為此咒語支付{1}或一點該生物顏色之魔法力。）\\n當烈士英魂進戰場時，若你未操控已橫置的地，則在其上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'087d83d8-e7b0-4564-831e-3a35d1d442a0\', \'multiverseId\': 466508}, \'multiverseid\': 466508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenfaust-Technik\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Wachsamkeit.\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464233&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33af79eb-b70e-4615-a3cb-df0250de46fd\', \'multiverseId\': 464233}, \'multiverseid\': 464233}, {\'name\': \'Técnica del golpe de alma\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de vigilancia.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca. (Ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e6babd2-d9f6-45df-9d78-203796c6013f\', \'multiverseId\': 464487}, \'multiverseid\': 464487}, {\'name\': \'Technique de la frappe animique\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a la vigilance.\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464741&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0637a3db-5fc6-4e37-a873-d592801f5344\', \'multiverseId\': 464741}, \'multiverseid\': 464741}, {\'name\': \'Tecnica del Colpo Spirituale\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha cautela.\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16c4d496-a976-41ab-bdd1-2afd5066daf1\', \'multiverseId\': 464995}, \'multiverseid\': 464995}, {\'name\': \'魂拳の技\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け警戒を持つ。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示する。（それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1875c048-091a-4bbd-94e6-f42e102f938a\', \'multiverseId\': 465249}, \'multiverseid\': 465249}, {\'name\': \'영혼타격 권법\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받고 경계를 가진다.\\n부여된 생물이 죽을 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 구현화한다. (해당 카드를 뒷면 상태인 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cbad934-184f-4caf-9e6c-1166fb1f2eac\', \'multiverseId\': 465503}, \'multiverseid\': 465503}, {\'name\': "Técnica do Golpe d\'Alma", \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem vigilância.\\nQuando a criatura encantada morrer, manifeste o card do topo de seu grimório. (Coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db836122-a7a5-4726-b763-fba983031234\', \'multiverseId\': 465757}, \'multiverseid\': 465757}, {\'name\': \'Техника Удара Духа\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и имеет Бдительность.\\nКогда зачарованное существо умирает, воплотите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. (Положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a24d55f-9eec-41b9-b791-f497a46fbdb6\', \'multiverseId\': 466011}, \'multiverseid\': 466011}, {\'name\': \'凝魂刚拳\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有警戒异能。\\n当所结附的生物死去时，显化你的牌库顶牌。（将它面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c413f0f8-fec7-4e33-84b8-fd6befff10d9\', \'multiverseId\': 466265}, \'multiverseid\': 466265}, {\'name\': \'凝魂剛拳\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1且具有警戒異能。\\n當所結附的生物死去時，顯化你的牌庫頂牌。（將它面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3bf64b4-0096-4b78-8110-7c61a0ea6ef7\', \'multiverseId\': 466519}, \'multiverseid\': 466519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelentreiber\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur aus dem Spiel ins Exil geschickt wird, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Seelentreiber.\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments kannst du eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken und sie dann unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Er wacht über jedes Fortgehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464417&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5bd729e-3bb1-491c-ab51-c76780eadc96\', \'multiverseId\': 464417}, \'multiverseid\': 464417}, {\'name\': \'Arriero de almas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura sea exiliada del campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Arriero de almas.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, puedes exiliar otra criatura objetivo que controlas, luego regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Él cuida de todas las ausencias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f500baaf-ba22-4902-8926-8894b3903154\', \'multiverseId\': 464671}, \'multiverseid\': 464671}, {\'name\': \'Berger des âmes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature est exilée du champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Berger des âmes.\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, vous pouvez exiler une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez, puis renvoyer cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Il veille sur chaque absence.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464925&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5171b48-1c0c-44a3-a443-adc4b87ba03c\', \'multiverseId\': 464925}, \'multiverseid\': 464925}, {\'name\': "Radunatore d\'Anime", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura viene esiliata dal campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Radunatore d\'Anime.\\nAll\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, puoi esiliare un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli, poi rimettere quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Sorveglia ogni assenza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe4ac8f0-dacd-4139-b685-febefca82d5a\', \'multiverseId\': 465179}, \'multiverseid\': 465179}, {\'name\': \'魂寄せ\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体戦場から追放されるたび、魂寄せの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、他の、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは「それを追放し、その後そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'すべての不在を見張っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a2d816-06ed-4a94-aa78-15c631092a44\', \'multiverseId\': 465433}, \'multiverseid\': 465433}, {\'name\': \'영혼목동\', \'text\': \'생물이 전장에서 추방될 때마다, 영혼목동에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n당신의 종료단 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 추방한 후, 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 되돌릴 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 모든 빈 자리를 지켜본다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34308dbe-f0d9-43d6-ba72-540fd371d7d4\', \'multiverseId\': 465687}, \'multiverseid\': 465687}, {\'name\': "Pastor d\'Almas", \'text\': "Toda vez que uma criatura for exilada do campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Pastor d\'Almas.\\nNo início de sua etapa final, você pode exilar outra criatura alvo que você controla. Depois, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono.", \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Ele vela cada ausência.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15afdc15-c4b7-4afe-ae2a-8160ded6ef87\', \'multiverseId\': 465941}, \'multiverseid\': 465941}, {\'name\': \'Пастырь Душ\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо изгоняется с поля битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Пастыря Душ.\\nВ начале вашего заключительного шага вы можете изгнать другое целевое существо под вашим контролем, затем вернуть ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Он присматривает за каждым небытием.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a330be9a-6767-4774-b587-c86ae5d2644e\', \'multiverseId\': 466195}, \'multiverseid\': 466195}, {\'name\': \'灵魂牧者\', \'text\': \'每当从战场放逐一个生物时，在灵魂牧者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，你可以放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物，然后将所放逐的牌在其操控者的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'每一次消失皆由其照管。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe54d31a-641a-4014-88a2-163c0c78924c\', \'multiverseId\': 466449}, \'multiverseid\': 466449}, {\'name\': \'靈魂牧者\', \'text\': \'每當從戰場放逐一個生物時，在靈魂牧者上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n在你的結束步驟開始時，你可以放逐另一個目標由你操控的生物，然後將所放逐的牌在其操控者的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'每一次消失皆由其照管。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9625edc-6831-4bb8-911c-59bc3fda4f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 466703}, \'multiverseid\': 466703}]', '[{\'name\': \'Segovianischer Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Als Worzel segovianische Engel beschwor, um Thomils gargantikarische Mücken zu bekämpfen, entbrannte eine Schlacht, die zu den am wenigsten zerstörerischen Schlachten des Multiversums zählt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464228&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba10a41-c9fc-4f80-bdb7-007b6949bd92\', \'multiverseId\': 464228}, \'multiverseid\': 464228}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de Segovia\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando Worzel invocó a los ángeles de Segovia para luchar contra los mosquitos de Gargantikari de Thomil, la batalla que sucedió se cuenta entre las menos destructivas del Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b92f28e-7e40-49be-9025-e61a3da4939d\', \'multiverseId\': 464482}, \'multiverseid\': 464482}, {\'name\': \'Ange ségovois\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance\', \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Quand Worzel appela les anges ségovois à combattre les moucherons gargantikari de Thomil, la bataille qui s\'ensuivit fut l\'une des moins destructrices du Multivers.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464736&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9f81957-a344-4067-8f04-399af61823a2\', \'multiverseId\': 464736}, \'multiverseid\': 464736}, {\'name\': \'Angelo Segoviano\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Worzel evocò gli angeli segoviani per combattere i moscerini di Gargantikar inviati da Thomil, la battaglia che seguì risultò tra le meno distruttive del Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd77d33-a2d7-4baf-a27e-8ccfa43cf132\', \'multiverseId\': 464990}, \'multiverseid\': 464990}, {\'name\': \'セゴビアの天使\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'トミルのガルガンティカリ羽虫に対抗してウォーゼルがセゴビアの天使を召喚したとき、その後に起こった戦闘は、多元宇宙で最も破壊的でない戦いの記録を樹立した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40a40a65-dcdf-447a-9579-62a6ef3b337e\', \'multiverseId\': 465244}, \'multiverseid\': 465244}, {\'name\': \'세고비아의 천사\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': \'워젤이 세고비아의 천사를 소환해 토밀의 가르간티카르 각다귀와 싸우게 했을 때, 그 뒤로 이어진 전투는 다우주에서 가장 파괴적이지 않은 전투 중 하나로 손에 꼽히게 되었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b910b54-4d46-42bc-ad40-3912254a6ff4\', \'multiverseId\': 465498}, \'multiverseid\': 465498}, {\'name\': \'Anjo Segoviano\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando Worzel convocou os anjos de Segóvia para enfrentar os mosquitos Gigantikari de Thomil, a batalha que se seguiu foi uma das menos destrutivas do Multiverso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e5b2258-510e-407e-a433-962f36a75300\', \'multiverseId\': 465752}, \'multiverseid\': 465752}, {\'name\': \'Ангел из Сеговии\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Когда Ворцель бросила сеговийских ангелов в бой с комарами из Гаргантикари, которых призвал Томил, разразилось одно из наименее разрушительных в Мультивселенной сражений.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da85cd60-a190-4b60-b1c3-dd1a0d4c1a76\', \'multiverseId\': 466006}, \'multiverseid\': 466006}, {\'name\': \'塞哥维亚天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'面对托米尔的庞巨地蚋虫，沃泽尔召唤塞哥维亚天使相抗～多重宇宙间破坏性最小的一场战事由此爆发。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28f994a1-be7e-4481-9719-dcd2663302c4\', \'multiverseId\': 466260}, \'multiverseid\': 466260}, {\'name\': \'塞哥維亞天使\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'面對托米爾的龐巨地蚋蟲，沃澤爾召喚塞哥維亞天使相抗～多重宇宙間破壞性最小的一場戰事由此爆發。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4640322-2493-4ef8-a5e4-e127f9ffc830\', \'multiverseId\': 466514}, \'multiverseid\': 466514}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sekretbrunnen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{3}: Der Sekretbrunnen wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/3 Dinosaurier-Artefaktkreatur.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Priester des Imperiums der Sonne glaubten, sie würden einen Brunnen graben. Doch sie stießen nicht auf Wasser.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464426&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7075eef1-0b6a-4c84-ac39-1e7c4e694de1\', \'multiverseId\': 464426}, \'multiverseid\': 464426}, {\'name\': \'Fuente de icor\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{3}: La Fuente de icor se convierte en una criatura artefacto Dinosaurio 3/3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los sacerdotes del Imperio del Sol creían que estaban cavando un pozo. Lo que encontraron en las profundidades fue algo muy diferente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2be65dd-9029-4a60-8e37-d449859bb47c\', \'multiverseId\': 464680}, \'multiverseid\': 464680}, {\'name\': \'Fontaine de sanie\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{3} : La Fontaine de sanie devient une créature-artefact 3/3 Dinosaure jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les prêtres de l\'Empire du Soleil croyaient creuser un simple puits. Ce qu\'ils finirent par extraire était entièrement différent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464934&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff49fef7-11b9-4dfb-9475-7b450937313a\', \'multiverseId\': 464934}, \'multiverseid\': 464934}, {\'name\': "Fontana d\'Icore", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{3}: La Fontana d\'Icore diventa una creatura artefatto Dinosauro 3/3 fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "I sacerdoti dell\'Impero del Sole credevano di scavare un pozzo. Ciò che attinsero fu ben altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa1568b-2ede-402f-adc1-6a27e669da01\', \'multiverseId\': 465188}, \'multiverseid\': 465188}, {\'name\': \'胆液の泉\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{3}：ターン終了時まで、胆液の泉は３/３の恐竜・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'太陽帝国の神官は、井戸を掘っているつもりだった。掘り当ててみると、それはまったく別の何かだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c03ef97b-a497-4dac-a3de-88c4ee885b70\', \'multiverseId\': 465442}, \'multiverseid\': 465442}, {\'name\': \'영액의 분수대\', \'text\': \'{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\\n{3}: 영액의 분수대는 턴종료까지 3/3 공룡 마법물체 생물이 된다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'태양 제국의 사제들은 자신들이 우물을 파고 있다고 생각했다. 파내려간 곳에서 그들이 마주한 것은 완전히 다른 무언가였다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1b9b35-7034-4cf1-a974-16b26e6303e2\', \'multiverseId\': 465696}, \'multiverseid\': 465696}, {\'name\': \'Chafariz de Icor\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{3}: Chafariz de Icor torna-se uma criatura artefato 3/3 do tipo Dinossauro até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os sacerdotes do Império do Sol achavam que estavam escavando um poço. O que eles acharam foi algo inteiramente diferente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d379509d-fee1-412d-824b-9aa0886525d2\', \'multiverseId\': 465950}, \'multiverseid\': 465950}, {\'name\': \'Фонтан Сукровицы\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{3}: Фонтан Сукровицы становится артефактом существом 3/3 Динозавр до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Священники Империи Солнца думали, что копают колодец. Но наткнулись они на совсем другое.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f55d87c2-0e83-480a-82e7-d05097994e55\', \'multiverseId\': 466204}, \'multiverseid\': 466204}, {\'name\': \'脓水泉脉\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{3}：脓水泉脉成为3/3恐龙神器生物直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'烈阳帝国的僧侣自以为他们挖的是一口井。他们打出的却完全是另一种东西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b080ada-436f-4893-85a4-76b8cc2041c5\', \'multiverseId\': 466458}, \'multiverseid\': 466458}, {\'name\': \'膿水泉脈\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\\n{3}：膿水泉脈成為3/3恐龍神器生物直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'烈陽帝國的僧侶自以為他們挖的是一口井。他們打出的卻完全是另一種東西。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45ed6803-8210-4f86-8e06-de3993ed96df\', \'multiverseId\': 466712}, \'multiverseid\': 466712}]', '[{\'name\': \'Serra die Gütige\', \'text\': \'+2: Fliegende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−3: Erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Wachsamkeit.\\n−6: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Falls du eine Kreatur kontrollierst, reduziert Schaden, der deinen Lebenspunktestand auf weniger als 1 reduzieren würde, stattdessen deinen Lebenspunktestand auf 1."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Serra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464229&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43d2c015-ab9b-4b0b-bb93-a4b3245a64b0\', \'multiverseId\': 464229}, \'multiverseid\': 464229}, {\'name\': \'Serra, la Benévola\', \'text\': \'+2: Las criaturas que controlas con la habilidad de volar obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\\n−3: Crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con las habilidades de volar y vigilancia.\\n−6: Obtienes un emblema con "Si controlas una criatura, el daño que fuera a reducir tu total de vidas a menos de 1, en vez de eso, lo reduce a 1".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Serra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55972451-373d-4e81-9c31-54aa8d55a5cf\', \'multiverseId\': 464483}, \'multiverseid\': 464483}, {\'name\': \'Serra la bienveillante\', \'text\': "+2 : Les créatures avec le vol que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-3 : Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol et la vigilance.\\n-6 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Si vous contrôlez une créature, les blessures qui devraient réduire votre total de points de vie à moins de 1 le réduisent à 1 à la place. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Serra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464737&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15bd7675-6e37-4cf6-ad00-2ff336e7d985\', \'multiverseId\': 464737}, \'multiverseid\': 464737}, {\'name\': \'Serra la Benevola\', \'text\': \'+2: Le creature con volare che controlli prendono +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\\n-3: Crea una pedina creatura Angelo 4/4 bianca con volare e cautela.\\n-6: Ottieni un emblema con "Se controlli una creatura, qualsiasi danno che ridurrebbe i tuoi punti vita a meno di 1 li riduce invece a 1".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Serra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79d6623a-5b71-417c-843b-01b1de0e5bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 464991}, \'multiverseid\': 464991}, {\'name\': \'慈悲深きセラ\', \'text\': \'+2：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていて飛行を持つクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n-3：飛行と警戒を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n-6：あなたは「あなたがクリーチャーをコントロールしているなら、あなたのライフ総量を１点未満に減少させるダメージは、代わりにあなたのライフ総量を１点になるまで減少させる。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — セラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4445611-2079-40fd-a60c-35fbf5f68b38\', \'multiverseId\': 465245}, \'multiverseid\': 465245}, {\'name\': \'자애로운 세라\', \'text\': \'+2: 당신이 조종하는 비행을 가진 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n−3: 비행 및 경계를 가진 4/4 백색 천사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n−6: 당신은 "당신이 생물을 조종한다면, 당신의 생명 총점을 1점 미만으로 낮추려는 피해는 대신 당신의 생명 총점을 1로 낮춘다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 세라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3850374c-19ad-4e78-8219-8377a53a7d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 465499}, \'multiverseid\': 465499}, {\'name\': \'Serra, a Benevolente\', \'text\': \'+2: As criaturas que você controla com voar recebem +1/+1 até o final do turno.\\n−3: Crie uma ficha de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Anjo com voar e vigilância.\\n−6: Você recebe um emblema com "Se você controlar uma criatura, o dano que reduziria seu total de pontos de vida a menos de 1, em vez disso, o reduzirá a 1."\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Serra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8b151c-03d4-47fc-942f-b428d210c0a3\', \'multiverseId\': 465753}, \'multiverseid\': 465753}, {\'name\': \'Всеблагая Серра\', \'text\': \'+2: существа с Полетом под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\\n—3: создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 белый Ангел с Полетом и Бдительностью.\\n—6: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «Если вы контролируете существо, то повреждения, которые должны снизить ваше количество жизней до значения менее 1, снижают его до 1 вместо этого».\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Серра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16b313f6-5cab-4886-a825-d225edc39114\', \'multiverseId\': 466007}, \'multiverseid\': 466007}, {\'name\': \'善心撒拉\', \'text\': \'+2：由你操控且具飞行异能的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\\n−3：派出一个4/4白色，具飞行与警戒异能的天使衍生生物。\\n−6：你获得具有「如果你操控生物，则将使你的总生命减少至1以下的伤害，改为减少你的总生命至1」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～撒拉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1defe9c-118b-4840-9d86-eabba74ec98e\', \'multiverseId\': 466261}, \'multiverseid\': 466261}, {\'name\': \'善心撒拉\', \'text\': \'+2：由你操控且具飛行異能的生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\\n−3：派出一個4/4白色，具飛行與警戒異能的天使衍生生物。\\n−6：你獲得具有「如果你操控生物，則將使你的總生命減少至1以下的傷害，改為減少你的總生命至1」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～撒拉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c0a7da6-c19f-4fc2-9266-9e5306285e87\', \'multiverseId\': 466515}, \'multiverseid\': 466515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seuchenzüchter\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nSowie der Seuchenzüchter ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Kreaturentyp.\\nKreaturen des bestimmten Typs, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, erhalten -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Überträger\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Langzeiteffekte sind unweigerlich tödlich."\\n—Phyrexianisches Versuchsprotokoll\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464303&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e379f10d-982c-4122-adaf-e919c5d50390\', \'multiverseId\': 464303}, \'multiverseid\': 464303}, {\'name\': \'Diseñador de pestes\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nEn cuanto el Diseñador de pestes entre al campo de batalla, elige un tipo de criatura.\\nLas criaturas del tipo elegido que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador\', \'flavor\': \'"Los efectos duraderos siempre son letales".\\n—Notas de progreso pirexianas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d189b81c-0ced-4086-a286-362061a6df7a\', \'multiverseId\': 464557}, \'multiverseid\': 464557}, {\'name\': \'Ingénieur de peste\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nAu moment où l\'Ingénieur de peste arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un type de créature.\\nLes créatures du type choisi que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -1/-1.", \'type\': \'Créature : propagateur\', \'flavor\': \'« Les effets durables sont toujours mortels. »\\n—Notes médicales phyrexianes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464811&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c1af54c-df27-4ba9-b3d3-76037676ad54\', \'multiverseId\': 464811}, \'multiverseid\': 464811}, {\'name\': \'Artefice della Peste\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nMentre l\'Artefice della Peste entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un tipo di creatura.\\nLe creature del tipo scelto controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -1/-1.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Latore\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli effetti duraturi sono inevitabilmente fatali."\\n—Appunti di sviluppo di Phyrexia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c7827a4-65c6-4db6-91e2-eb3420e1bc73\', \'multiverseId\': 465065}, \'multiverseid\': 465065}, {\'name\': \'疫病を仕組むもの\', \'text\': \'接死\\n疫病を仕組むものが戦場に出るに際し、クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしていてその選ばれたタイプであるクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キャリアー\', \'flavor\': \'「その持続的な効果は常に致死的である。」\\n――ファイレクシア病の進行記録\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f0fc1a-ee78-44f2-9060-4dd467e92fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 465319}, \'multiverseid\': 465319}, {\'name\': \'역병 기술자\', \'text\': \'치명타\\n역병 기술자가 전장에 들어오면서, 생물 유형 한 가지를 선택한다.\\n당신의 상대들이 조종하는 선택된 유형의 생물들은 -1/-1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 매개체\', \'flavor\': \'"지속 효과는 예외 없이 치명적이다."\\n—피렉시아 전염병 진행기록\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aea2ff89-e68f-410b-84c0-b7a03a737bee\', \'multiverseId\': 465573}, \'multiverseid\': 465573}, {\'name\': \'Engenheiro da Pestilência\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nConforme Engenheiro da Pestilência entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um tipo de criatura.\\nAs criaturas do tipo escolhido que seus oponentes controlam recebem -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Portador\', \'flavor\': \'"Os efeitos permanentes são invariavelmente fatais."\\n— Anotações phyrexianas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4071bc-572f-40b8-ab5b-504961b44b40\', \'multiverseId\': 465827}, \'multiverseid\': 465827}, {\'name\': \'Чумной Инженер\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nПри выходе Чумного Инженера на поле битвы выберите тип существа.\\nСущества выбранного типа под контролем ваших оппонентов получают -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Переносчик\', \'flavor\': \'«Долговременные эффекты неизменно заканчиваются смертью».\\n— Фирексийский лабораторный журнал\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff579bfd-45c7-48d7-8e1e-2507be7e2c62\', \'multiverseId\': 466081}, \'multiverseid\': 466081}, {\'name\': \'病害计划怪\', \'text\': \'死触\\n于病害计划怪进战场时，选择一种生物类别。\\n由对手操控的该类别生物得-1/-1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～病媒\', \'flavor\': \'「毒性持续定有致命之效。」\\n～非瑞克西亚进展纪录\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3caafe37-8588-45a1-93e2-c2a7087daaaa\', \'multiverseId\': 466335}, \'multiverseid\': 466335}, {\'name\': \'病害計劃怪\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n於病害計劃怪進戰場時，選擇一種生物類別。\\n由對手操控的該類別生物得-1/-1。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～病媒\', \'flavor\': \'「毒性持續定有致命之效。」\\n～非瑞克西亞進展紀錄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee351651-54f4-4b7f-9eb2-0110e88087e5\', \'multiverseId\': 466589}, \'multiverseid\': 466589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sichelremasuri\', \'text\': \'Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Als er sich näher an die anderen Remasuris heranschlängelte, härteten sich ihre Klauen und glitzerten metallisch in der Sonne. Einer schlug verspielt nach einem Baumstamm und die neue Klinge schnitt sauber hindurch.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464324&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f2dcc7a-ee40-4777-b121-27a7dc6d91cd\', \'multiverseId\': 464324}, \'multiverseid\': 464324}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado serrador\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas Fragmentado que controlas obtienen +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se acercó a un grupo de fragmentados, sus garras se endurecieron y relucieron bajo el sol. Rozó juguetonamente el tronco de un árbol con su nuevo filo y lo rebanó por completo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a10daf51-ee43-44ae-a700-67b951a40214\', \'multiverseId\': 464578}, \'multiverseid\': 464578}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde tranchant\', \'text\': \'Les créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Lorsqu\'il s\'approcha en frétillant d\'un thrum de slivoïdes, leurs serres se durcirent, brillant au soleil. L\'un d\'entre eux griffa un tronc d\'arbre, et sa lame toute neuve le trancha net.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464832&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09dce1e7-aced-47d3-9898-20e9a5b8c8f2\', \'multiverseId\': 464832}, \'multiverseid\': 464832}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Fendente\', \'text\': \'Le creature Tramutante che controlli prendono +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': "Quando si avvicinò a un branco di tramutanti, i loro artigli si irrigidirono, brillando al sole. Uno di loro sferrò un colpo giocoso a un tronco d\'albero e la sua nuova lama lo tagliò nettamente in due.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2eadb357-64c7-4e90-b52d-0eb51a4c335c\', \'multiverseId\': 465086}, \'multiverseid\': 465086}, {\'name\': \'肉裂きスリヴァー\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'それがスリヴァーの群れに近付くと、鉤爪が硬化して陽光に輝いた。一匹がふと腕を振ると、そのできたばかりの刃は簡単に幹を切断した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'752a55e1-7b8a-49f1-b2cf-8cc9186a1d3f\', \'multiverseId\': 465340}, \'multiverseid\': 465340}, {\'name\': \'반으로 가르는 슬리버\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 슬리버 생물들은 +2/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'그것이 슬리버 무리에 다가가며 움찔거리자, 그것들의 발톱이 단단해졌고 햇빛을 반사하며 반짝였다. 한 마리가 장난스럽게 나무 그루터기를 휙 베었고, 새로운 칼날은 깨끗하게 나무를 베어넘겼다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c7220a-7350-43dd-825e-facddceca2c3\', \'multiverseId\': 465594}, \'multiverseid\': 465594}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Decepador\', \'text\': \'As criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla recebem +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ele se aproximou do thrum de fractius, as garras deles se endureceram e reluziram ao sol. Um deles golpeou descontraidamente um tronco de árvore, e a nova lâmina o decepou num corte limpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5d45a71-6af3-45e0-adba-ab33f849e80f\', \'multiverseId\': 465848}, \'multiverseid\': 465848}, {\'name\': \'Рубящая Щепка\', \'text\': \'Существа-Щепки под вашим контролем получают +2/+0.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'Когда она подползла ближе к стае щепок, их когти затвердели и заблестели на солнце. Разыгравшись, одна из стаи ударила по древесному стволу, — и ее новый клинок пробил дерево насквозь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70400da1-8f96-41e0-9233-a3b7d6120cdd\', \'multiverseId\': 466102}, \'multiverseid\': 466102}, {\'name\': \'劈击裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'只见它甫一靠近裂片妖群，后者的前爪就逐渐锋利成型，甚至能够反射太阳辉光。其中一个仅是朝着树干比划一下，其新生利刃就已将其连根切落。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5b5751f-18f7-473e-84a2-3f5f32167b1f\', \'multiverseId\': 466356}, \'multiverseid\': 466356}, {\'name\': \'劈擊裂片妖\', \'text\': \'由你操控的裂片妖生物得+2/+0。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'只見它甫一靠近裂片妖群，後者的前爪就逐漸鋒利成型，甚至能夠反射太陽輝光。其中一個僅是朝著樹幹比劃一下，其新生利刃就已將其連根切落。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60f6a30d-f3ca-4d11-b8a3-45ce9e41e451\', \'multiverseId\': 466610}, \'multiverseid\': 466610}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silumgar-Aasfresser\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nAusschlachten (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreatur opfern.)\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Silumgar-Aasfresser. Er erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges, falls er die Kreatur ausgeschlachtet hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Vogel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04a24665-1124-4825-bbcf-bab628588d38\', \'multiverseId\': 464310}, \'multiverseid\': 464310}, {\'name\': \'Carroñera de Sílumgar\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAprovechar. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar una criatura.)\\nSiempre que otra criatura que controlas muera, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Carroñera de Sílumgar. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno si aprovechó esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f5b0672-686d-4283-85ea-b01891cf53be\', \'multiverseId\': 464564}, \'multiverseid\': 464564}, {\'name\': \'Charognard de Silumgar\', \'text\': "Vol\\nExploitation (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier une créature.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous contrôlez meurt, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Charognard de Silumgar. Il acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour s\'il a exploité cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et oiseau\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464818&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a649bde7-3aca-4362-a897-45b7c1f7ae05\', \'multiverseId\': 464818}, \'multiverseid\': 464818}, {\'name\': \'Saprofago Silumgar\', \'text\': "Volare\\nSfruttare (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi sacrificare una creatura.)\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che controlli muore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Saprofago Silumgar. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno se ha sfruttato quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1275e4e4-d99e-4725-bea7-906a0ecf7c93\', \'multiverseId\': 465072}, \'multiverseid\': 465072}, {\'name\': \'シルムガルの腐肉あさり\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n濫用（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、あなたはクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げてもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、シルムガルの腐肉あさりの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。これがそのクリーチャーを濫用したなら、ターン終了時まで、これは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba9e11a-4974-48fe-99fa-3d3cb7e80f41\', \'multiverseId\': 465326}, \'multiverseid\': 465326}, {\'name\': \'실룸가르 청소부\', \'text\': \'비행\\n수탈 (이 생물이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 생물 한 개를 희생할 수 있다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 실룸가르 청소부에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 실룸가르 청소부가 그 생물을 수탈했다면 실룸가르 청소부는 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 조류\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a58659d-6728-483e-ad38-453abd52efbb\', \'multiverseId\': 465580}, \'multiverseid\': 465580}, {\'name\': \'Carniceiro Silumgar\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nAproveitar (Quando esta criatura entra no campo de batalha, você pode sacrificar uma criatura.)\\nToda vez que outra criatura que você controla morrer, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Carniceiro Silumgar. Ele ganha ímpeto até o final do turno se ele aproveitou aquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d31c60f6-2212-40e4-a30a-374675f34b36\', \'multiverseId\': 465834}, \'multiverseid\': 465834}, {\'name\': \'Силумгарский Падальщик\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nУгнетение (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, вы можете пожертвовать существо.)\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо под вашим контролем умирает, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Силумгарского Падальщика. Он получает Ускорение до конца хода, если угнетал то существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Птица\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3238094-3d4a-4349-887f-067275b2be89\', \'multiverseId\': 466088}, \'multiverseid\': 466088}, {\'name\': \'席穆嘉族食腐鸟\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n榨取（当此生物进战场时，你可以牺牲一个生物。）\\n每当另一个由你操控的生物死去时，在席穆嘉族食腐鸟上放置一个+1/+1指示物。如果它曾榨取该生物，则席穆嘉族食腐鸟获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／鸟\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da3d6f98-6cf7-4026-bf6b-ae79e6e72371\', \'multiverseId\': 466342}, \'multiverseid\': 466342}, {\'name\': \'席穆嘉族食腐鳥\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n搾取（當此生物進戰場時，你可以犧牲一個生物。）\\n每當另一個由你操控的生物死去時，在席穆嘉族食腐鳥上放置一個+1/+1指示物。如果它曾搾取該生物，則席穆嘉族食腐鳥獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／鳥\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22db63af-54e3-4286-912c-45254c8052f6\', \'multiverseId\': 466596}, \'multiverseid\': 466596}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sisay, Kapitänin der Wetterlicht\', \'text\': \'Sisay, Kapitänin der Wetterlicht, erhält +1/+1 für jede Farbe unter den anderen legendären bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer legendären bleibenden Karte mit umgewandelten Manakosten kleiner als Sisays Stärke, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464232&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f7bccf1-94aa-48e5-82ae-349b40c1dbf6\', \'multiverseId\': 464232}, \'multiverseid\': 464232}, {\'name\': \'Sisay, capitana del Vientoligero\', \'text\': \'Sisay, capitana del Vientoligero obtiene +1/+1 por cada color entre los otros permanentes legendarios que controlas.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de permanente legendario con coste de maná convertido menor que la fuerza de Sisay, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4581b85-2770-4ad7-a9e2-4a2656c6149f\', \'multiverseId\': 464486}, \'multiverseid\': 464486}, {\'name\': "Sissay, capitaine de l\'Aquilon", \'text\': "Sissay, capitaine de l\'Aquilon gagne +1/+1 pour chaque couleur parmi les autres permanents légendaires que vous contrôlez.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de permanent légendaire avec un coût converti de mana inférieur à la force de Sissay, mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464740&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4afd43e6-92a6-422b-98d3-eb3f93ff3299\', \'multiverseId\': 464740}, \'multiverseid\': 464740}, {\'name\': \'Sisay, Capitana della Cavalcavento\', \'text\': \'Sisay, Capitana della Cavalcavento prende +1/+1 per ogni colore tra gli altri permanenti leggendari che controlli.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta permanente leggendario con costo di mana convertito inferiore alla forza di Sisay, metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12e3fab9-fd1f-4473-8b66-cd8c658b6e6a\', \'multiverseId\': 464994}, \'multiverseid\': 464994}, {\'name\': \'ウェザーライトの艦長、シッセイ\', \'text\': \'ウェザーライトの艦長、シッセイは、他の、あなたがコントロールしている伝説のパーマネントの中の色１色につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}：あなたのライブラリーから、点数で見たマナ・コストがウェザーライトの艦長、シッセイのパワーより小さい伝説のパーマネント・カード１枚を探し、それを戦場に出す。その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c5aa803-19e0-4589-b730-f3247661c0ce\', \'multiverseId\': 465248}, \'multiverseid\': 465248}, {\'name\': \'웨더라이트 선장, 시세이\', \'text\': \'웨더라이트 선장, 시세이는 당신이 조종하는 다른 전설적 지속물들이 가진 각 색깔마다 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: 당신의 서고에서 전환마나비용이 시세이의 공격력 미만인 전설적 지속물 카드 한 장을 찾아, 전장에 놓은 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d249bda8-800d-403e-a074-2afac7d2541a\', \'multiverseId\': 465502}, \'multiverseid\': 465502}, {\'name\': \'Sisay, Capitã do Bons Ventos\', \'text\': \'Sisay, Capitã do Bons Ventos, recebe +1/+1 para cada cor entre as outras permanentes lendárias que você controla.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Procure em seu grimório um card de permanente lendária com custo de mana convertido inferior ao poder de Sisay, coloque aquele card no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a617191-5f72-412e-855a-adac75173d0c\', \'multiverseId\': 465756}, \'multiverseid\': 465756}, {\'name\': \'Сисэй, Капитан «Везерлайта»\', \'text\': \'Сисэй, Капитан «Везерлайта» получает +1/+1 за каждый цвет среди других легендарных перманентов под вашим контролем.\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту легендарного перманента с конвертированной мана-стоимостью меньше, чем значение силы Сисэй, положите ту карту на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3435c68-aacf-45f9-a567-f129d7a9fe9b\', \'multiverseId\': 466010}, \'multiverseid\': 466010}, {\'name\': \'晴空号船长西赛\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他传奇永久物每包括一种颜色，晴空号船长西赛便得+1/+1。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}：从你的牌库中搜寻一张总法术力费用小于西赛力量的传奇永久物牌，将该牌放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d8e64d9-b32a-4ed4-8ef5-d19972352f5c\', \'multiverseId\': 466264}, \'multiverseid\': 466264}, {\'name\': \'晴空號船長西賽\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他傳奇永久物每包括一種顏色，晴空號船長西賽便得+1/+1。\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張總魔法力費用小於西賽力量的傳奇永久物牌，將該牌放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e6d7658-3003-4909-8879-8a27cba3a583\', \'multiverseId\': 466518}, \'multiverseid\': 466518}]', "[{'name': 'Sporenfrosch', 'text': 'Opfere den Sporenfrosch: Verhindere allen Kampfschaden, der in diesem Zug zugefügt würde.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Frosch', 'flavor': 'Ein Ahnherr von Kaulquappen und Allergien gleichermaßen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464383&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0b3619c-8b36-47fe-a094-094ba8253b6b', 'multiverseId': 464383}, 'multiverseid': 464383}, {'name': 'Rana de esporas', 'text': 'Sacrificar la Rana de esporas: Prevén todo el daño de combate que se fuera a hacer este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Rana', 'flavor': 'Un progenitor tanto de renacuajos como de alergias.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464637&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f29dec64-982a-453e-b689-05d7b4e10138', 'multiverseId': 464637}, 'multiverseid': 464637}, {'name': 'Grenouille à spores', 'text': 'Sacrifiez la Grenouille à spores : Prévenez toutes les blessures de combat qui devraient être infligées ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : grenouille', 'flavor': 'Elle engendre aussi bien les têtards que les allergies.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464891&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aeee130d-22c0-4324-ab24-2f5de9c71923', 'multiverseId': 464891}, 'multiverseid': 464891}, {'name': 'Rana Spora', 'text': 'Sacrifica la Rana Spora: Previeni tutto il danno da combattimento che verrebbe inflitto in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura — Rana', 'flavor': 'Progenitrice di girini e allergie in egual misura.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465145&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65a65567-af37-43cf-99be-477c6215642a', 'multiverseId': 465145}, 'multiverseid': 465145}, {'name': '胞子カエル', 'text': '胞子カエルを生け贄に捧げる：このターン、与えられる戦闘ダメージをすべて軽減する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — カエル', 'flavor': 'オタマジャクシとアレルギー両方の先祖。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465399&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49a69da5-9fc9-453e-9464-4cf5c1a3f9b4', 'multiverseId': 465399}, 'multiverseid': 465399}, {'name': '포자 개구리', 'text': '포자 개구리를 희생한다: 이번 턴에 입혀지려 하는 모든 전투피해를 방지한다.', 'type': '생물 — 개구리', 'flavor': '동일한 비율로, 올챙이들와 알레르기들의 선조이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465653&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42f72a0a-2be6-4da0-8519-bcd874f66899', 'multiverseId': 465653}, 'multiverseid': 465653}, {'name': 'Rã dos Esporos', 'text': 'Sacrifique Rã dos Esporos: Previna todo dano de combate que seria causado neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura — Sapo', 'flavor': 'Igualmente progenitora de girinos e alergias.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465907&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1699115c-83f3-4d9c-b4b8-b70729c7575a', 'multiverseId': 465907}, 'multiverseid': 465907}, {'name': 'Спороносная Лягушка', 'text': 'Пожертвуйте Спороносную Лягушку: предотвратите все боевые повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Существо — Лягушка', 'flavor': 'Она в равной мере порождает головастиков и аллергию.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466161&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '864b7cc7-e041-4f97-a6a2-56497f90baa0', 'multiverseId': 466161}, 'multiverseid': 466161}, {'name': '芽胞蛙', 'text': '牺牲芽胞蛙：于本回合中，防止将造成的所有战斗伤害。', 'type': '生物 ～蛙', 'flavor': '既是蝌蚪的缘起，也是过敏的元凶。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466415&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53c94761-dd40-4591-bf2a-df462abd1984', 'multiverseId': 466415}, 'multiverseid': 466415}, {'name': '芽胞蛙', 'text': '犧牲芽胞蛙：於本回合中，防止將造成的所有戰鬥傷害。', 'type': '生物 ～蛙', 'flavor': '既是蝌蚪的緣起，也是過敏的元兇。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466669&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff3bc0f6-2806-49ea-97c1-381570613832', 'multiverseId': 466669}, 'multiverseid': 466669}]", '[{\'name\': \'Stachelhorn-Minotaurus\', \'text\': \'Solange du in diesem Zug zwei oder mehr Karten gezogen hast, hat der Stachelhorn-Minotaurus Doppelschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'„Während du zögerst, schlag ich zweimal zu."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464350&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbc80bac-5068-4831-a08e-6dcc91e4fb84\', \'multiverseId\': 464350}, \'multiverseid\': 464350}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro cuernoespinazo\', \'text\': \'Mientras hayas robado dos o más cartas este turno, el Minotauro cuernoespinazo tiene la habilidad de dañar dos veces.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Si piensas dos veces, te cortaré dos veces".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a43227bf-63df-4c1b-be63-6ee45ce72d50\', \'multiverseId\': 464604}, \'multiverseid\': 464604}, {\'name\': \'Minotaure cornépic\', \'text\': \'Tant que vous avez pioché au moins deux cartes ce tour-ci, le Minotaure cornépic a la double initiative.\', \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et berserker\', \'flavor\': \'« Si vous y réfléchissez à deux fois, je frapperai deux fois. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464858&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bfa076d-d15e-4462-9b49-e63bc23893be\', \'multiverseId\': 464858}, \'multiverseid\': 464858}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro Spinocorno\', \'text\': \'Se hai pescato due o più carte in questo turno, il Minotauro Spinocorno ha doppio attacco.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ci pensi due volte, taglierò due volte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'652d2c6c-5273-4834-b014-38b148a8033c\', \'multiverseId\': 465112}, \'multiverseid\': 465112}, {\'name\': \'多角ミノタウルス\', \'text\': \'このターンにあなたがカードを２枚以上引いているかぎり、多角ミノタウルスは二段攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「お前が二の足を踏むなら、俺は二度斬り付けるぜ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8acdf69d-19ae-4d64-8bac-6ee33f3dc267\', \'multiverseId\': 465366}, \'multiverseid\': 465366}, {\'name\': \'척추뿔 미노타우로스\', \'text\': \'당신이 이번 턴에 카드를 두 장 이상 뽑은 한, 척추뿔 미노타우로스는 이단공격을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스 광전사\', \'flavor\': \'"네가 생각을 두 번 하면, 나는 공격을 두 번 하겠어."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'871bb12d-677c-4ea4-9c31-5c7ee39e876b\', \'multiverseId\': 465620}, \'multiverseid\': 465620}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro Cornespíneo\', \'text\': \'Desde que você tenha comprado dois ou mais cards neste turno, Minotauro Cornespíneo tem golpe duplo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Amoque\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você pensar duas vezes, vou cortar duas vezes."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dae90fc-fe83-4f62-b0d8-f81fe4067014\', \'multiverseId\': 465874}, \'multiverseid\': 465874}, {\'name\': \'Шипорогий Минотавр\', \'text\': \'Шипорогий Минотавр имеет Двойной удар при условии, что в этом ходу вы уже взяли не менее двух карт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Берсерк\', \'flavor\': \'«Пока ты будешь думать, мне хватит времени на два удара».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa592d6b-6e11-4747-a315-0c84efb875e2\', \'multiverseId\': 466128}, \'multiverseid\': 466128}, {\'name\': \'脊角牛头怪\', \'text\': \'只要你本回合中已抓两张或更多牌，脊角牛头怪便具有连击异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牛头怪／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你多想一次，我就再砍一次。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83f9f14f-c5a6-428c-bc06-984f1665bd11\', \'multiverseId\': 466382}, \'multiverseid\': 466382}, {\'name\': \'脊角牛頭怪\', \'text\': \'只要你本回合中已抽兩張或更多牌，脊角牛頭怪便具有連擊異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牛頭怪／狂戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你多想一次，我就再砍一次。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6d6d7b5-4a2a-42ba-8ff9-dbfd5f35b6f1\', \'multiverseId\': 466636}, \'multiverseid\': 466636}]', '[{\'name\': \'Standarte der Goblins\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es war schwer zu sagen, ob die Berge von Leichenresten in ihren Baracken bloße Abfälle, heilige Altäre oder Warnungen waren."\\n—*Sarpadische Reiche, Band IV*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464333&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f8b491-72c7-4a9a-9aeb-6d7599dcf285\', \'multiverseId\': 464333}, \'multiverseid\': 464333}, {\'name\': \'Oriflama trasga\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas atacantes que controlas obtienen +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"No se sabía si los restos despedazados en sus túneles eran montones de desperdicios, altares sagrados o advertencias".\\n—*Imperios sarpadianos, Vol. IV*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fce60b70-81e0-4c4f-a3fa-e74c56d2ce1c\', \'multiverseId\': 464587}, \'multiverseid\': 464587}, {\'name\': \'Oriflamme gobeline\', \'text\': \'Les créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Difficile de dire si les amoncellements d\'entrailles qui parsemaient leurs terriers étaient des amas de déchets, des autels sacrés ou des avertissements. »\\n—*Les Empires sarpadiens, Vol. IV*", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464841&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35507f64-a505-43eb-9f35-7552a7cebdea\', \'multiverseId\': 464841}, \'multiverseid\': 464841}, {\'name\': \'Orifiamma dei Goblin\', \'text\': \'Le creature attaccanti che controlli prendono +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Era difficile dire se le pile di resti nei loro cunicoli fossero semplici cumuli di immondizia, altari sacri o avvertimenti."\\n—*Imperi di Sarpadia, Vol. IV*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01330a9d-4795-4ec1-887c-5c9624ade0c4\', \'multiverseId\': 465095}, \'multiverseid\': 465095}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの軍旗\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている攻撃クリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「巣穴に作られる血まみれの山が、単なるごみ置き場なのか、聖なる祭壇なのか、一種の警告なのか、断言は難しい。」\\n――*サーペイディア諸帝国史、第四巻*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e32f8778-553b-4e10-b64f-5495ecec8203\', \'multiverseId\': 465349}, \'multiverseid\': 465349}, {\'name\': \'고블린 군기\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 공격 중인 생물들은 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"그들의 사육장 안에 있는 핏덩이 무더기가 그냥 쓰레기 더미인지, 신성한 제단인지, 아니면 경고장인지는 분간하기가 힘들다."\\n—*사르파디아 제국사, vol. IV*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5625125-920a-466f-950d-f91451784a64\', \'multiverseId\': 465603}, \'multiverseid\': 465603}, {\'name\': \'Auriflama Goblin\', \'text\': \'As criaturas atacantes que você controla recebem +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Era difícil dizer se as pilhas de entranhas em suas tocas eram meros montes de lixo, altares sagrados ou advertências."\\n— *Impérios Sarpadianos, Vol. IV*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb8c4c4b-8a78-4bb9-b017-cf7b03268178\', \'multiverseId\': 465857}, \'multiverseid\': 465857}, {\'name\': \'Гоблинская Хоругвь\', \'text\': \'Атакующие существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+0.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Было сложно понять, чем служат груды падали у них в жилищах — мусорными кучами, священными алтарями или предупреждением незваным гостям».\\n— *«Сарпадианские Империи, том IV*\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4582f253-2228-4791-9272-148478c6aad7\', \'multiverseId\': 466111}, \'multiverseid\': 466111}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪的军旗\', \'text\': \'由你操控且进行攻击的生物得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「很难说它们繁殖地中成堆的血块是破败弃物，神圣祭坛还是警示用具。」\\n～《撒尔帕汀帝国》，卷**四\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abe39ec5-957c-4ddb-be54-137192f6dee3\', \'multiverseId\': 466365}, \'multiverseid\': 466365}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪的軍旗\', \'text\': \'由你操控且進行攻擊的生物得+1/+0。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「很難說它們繁殖地中成堆的血塊是破敗棄物，神聖祭壇還是警示用具。」\\n～《撒爾帕汀帝國》，卷**四\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ff0ae9-53c6-4a64-b92a-25adaa60e99e\', \'multiverseId\': 466619}, \'multiverseid\': 466619}]', '[{\'name\': \'Standhafter Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Standhaft {2} ({2}, {T}: Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf diese Kreatur. Spiele Standhaft wie eine Hexerei.)\\nAndere Remasuri-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Standhaft {2}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zeit hat Berge abgetragen und in Staub verwandelt, doch Remasuris wird es immer geben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464209&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a910dec6-ae06-4ab0-b72f-c3f44044c10b\', \'multiverseId\': 464209}, \'multiverseid\': 464209}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado resistente\', \'text\': \'Supervivencia {2}. ({2}, {T}: Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre esta criatura. Activa la habilidad de supervivencia solo como un conjuro.)\\nLas otras criaturas Fragmentado que controlas tienen la habilidad de supervivencia {2}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'El tiempo reduce a polvo las montañas de roca, pero los fragmentados siempre perviven.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eafea09-486c-442b-82ef-7290da5e6971\', \'multiverseId\': 464463}, \'multiverseid\': 464463}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde perpétuel\', \'text\': "Résilience {2} ({2}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur cette créature. N\'utilisez la résilience que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)\\nLes autres créatures Slivoïde que vous contrôlez ont résilience {2}.", \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': \'Le temps a changé les montagnes en sable, mais les slivoïdes sont toujours là.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17ee1c39-9ef5-48d0-a640-d6a82b2ebe1f\', \'multiverseId\': 464717}, \'multiverseid\': 464717}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Resistente\', \'text\': \'Perdurare {2} ({2}, {T}: Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su questa creatura. Perdura solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\\nLe altre creature Tramutante che controlli hanno perdurare {2}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'Il tempo ha ridotto le montagne in sabbia, ma i tramutanti persistono intatti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6adefd1-b71d-4765-a1ca-748994c82c09\', \'multiverseId\': 464971}, \'multiverseid\': 464971}, {\'name\': \'持久スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'長久{2}（{2}, {T}：このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。長久はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\\n他の、あなたがコントロールしているスリヴァー・クリーチャーは長久{2}を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'時が山岳地帯を削り砂漠になったが、スリヴァーは変わっていない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e74a6bd-dc68-4f39-94ba-4c566a3a909d\', \'multiverseId\': 465225}, \'multiverseid\': 465225}, {\'name\': \'견뎌내는 슬리버\', \'text\': \'버티기 {2} ({2}, {T}: 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 당신은 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 버티기를 활성화할 수 있다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 슬리버 생물들은 버티기 {2}를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 슬리버\', \'flavor\': \'시간은 산을 모래로 만들었지만, 슬리버들은 여전히 살아남았다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5279ed-3023-4689-b859-5c023d5e92e3\', \'multiverseId\': 465479}, \'multiverseid\': 465479}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Resistente\', \'text\': \'Sobreviver {2} ({2}, {T}: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 nesta criatura. Use sobreviver somente como um feitiço.)\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo Fractius que você controla têm sobreviver {2}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'O tempo esfacelou as montanhas e as fez areia, mas os fractius perduram.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7217dde2-7b64-4174-adca-158ae0df8ef5\', \'multiverseId\': 465733}, \'multiverseid\': 465733}, {\'name\': \'Выносливая Щепка\', \'text\': \'Стойкость {2} ({2}, {T}: положите один жетон +1/+1 на это существо. Используйте Стойкость только как волшебство.)\\nДругие существа-Щепки под вашим контролем имеют Стойкость {2}.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'Время стерло горы в песок, но даже оно не властно над щепками.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=465987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70bbf2d3-fbcb-4c16-a895-80638fae27d3\', \'multiverseId\': 465987}, \'multiverseid\': 465987}, {\'name\': \'长生裂片妖\', \'text\': \'延生{2}（{2}，{T}：在此生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。延生的时机视同法术。）\\n由你操控的其他裂片妖生物具有延生{2}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'累月经年，纵高山亦化作砂土，然裂片妖依然留存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49bae13a-79b6-44f3-80a4-fe6c00cfb9e8\', \'multiverseId\': 466241}, \'multiverseid\': 466241}, {\'name\': \'長生裂片妖\', \'text\': \'延生{2}（{2}，{T}：在此生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。延生的時機視同巫術。）\\n由你操控的其他裂片妖生物具有延生{2}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'累月經年，縱高山亦化作砂土，然裂片妖依然留存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=466495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83bdf0f9-8590-4f4e-ba6e-9cbe8c1cdccd\', \'multiverseId\': 466495}, \'multiverseid\': 466495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stille Lichtung\', \'text\': \'{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere die Stille Lichtung: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Mit dem Ende der Expedition begann die Geschichte des Marschlands.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464449&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2774d333-0251-46f5-af8a-c5edfbf2bf24\', \'multiverseId\': 464449}, \'multiverseid\': 464449}, {\'name\': \'Claro silencioso\', \'text\': \'{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {W} o {B}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Claro silencioso: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El fin de la expedición fue el comienzo de la historia del cenagal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4424d92-7e58-42c5-8f2c-4f8b8eacc2cc\', \'multiverseId\': 464703}, \'multiverseid\': 464703}, {\'name\': \'Clairière silencieuse\', \'text\': \'{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Clairière silencieuse : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La fin de l\'expédition marqua le début de l\'histoire du marécage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=464957&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c315d269-573b-49ec-bceb-9284eca4b554\', \'multiverseId\': 464957}, \'multiverseid\': 464957}, {\'name\': \'Radura Silente\', \'text\': \'{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi {W} o {B}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Radura Silente: Pesca un